{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "1",
 "name": "The Crossing",
 "file": "Map1_Crossing.xml",
 "includes": [
  "Map1j_Market_Plaza.xml",
  "Map1l_Crossing_Amusement_Pier.xml",
  "Map1m_Crossing_Jadewater.xml",
  "Map2a_Temple.xml"
 ],
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":300,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Magen Road","descriptions":["The whitewashed building before you is stark and functional.  A sign mounted on it is hand painted and carved with cunning skill.  White-robed figures and all manner of injured and infirm people stream in and out of a double door, leaving thin trails of blood on the spotless pavement."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":335,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":7,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":432,"exit":"go","move":"go wide arch"},{"to":307,"exit":"go","move":"go double door"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":330,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Magen Road","descriptions":["Not far off you spot the town walls, which meet at a right angle in this northeast corner of town.  This road is kept busy by the traffic to and from the popular haunts crowded into this sector - the Barbarians' Guild, the Champions' Arena, the Empaths' Guild, Martyr Saedelthorp's Healing Hospital, and the convivial Gaethrend's Court Inn.  In addition, the Paladins' Guild farther north, and the gate leading out of town to the Warrior Mages' Guild and the wilds all are accessed through this street."],"exits":[{"to":141,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":3,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":3,"x":370,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Magen Road","descriptions":["This bustling junction presents a cross section of the world's inhabitants in various states of health and disrepair.  Bloodied adventurers, impaired healers, overextended spellsingers, and other members of the walking wounded lurch their way towards the Healing Hospital to the west.  Litters, carts and horses carry those too badly hurt to move under their own power.  In striking contrast are the strapping barbarians who swagger by, towards the Arena and Barbarians' Guild southwest."],"exits":[{"to":144,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":4,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":2,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":370,"y":-328,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Trothfang Street","descriptions":["You stand at the southeast corner of the Champions' Arena, its thick, solid walls and dome rising above you.  You can barely make out on its surface scrawled inscriptions and graffiti with names and titles of barbarians of yore.  Some of the engravings have dates and numbers next to them.  A gust of wind blows the scent of incense offered in the flames on the Temple towers to mix with the odors of sweated bodies.","You stand at the southeast corner of the Champions' Arena, its thick, solid walls and dome rising high into the night sky.  Scrawled inscriptions and graffiti with names and titles of barbarians of yore are barely visible on the wall's surface.  Some of the engravings have dates and numbers next to them.  Jutting up over the top of the wall in the distance to the east is a thin spire that appears to be shrouded in mist."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":149,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":320,"y":-328,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Trothfang Street","descriptions":["The cries of scalpers and touts from the street mix with those from within the thick-walled, domed structure here -- shouts calling for blood and demanding that honor be satisfied, as well as less shrill exhortations to local favorites or up-and-coming gladiators and knights.  Several daunting-looking centurions clad in full ceremonial armor scrutinize you stoically from under the scarlet canopy that shades the entrance to the Champions' Arena."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":300,"y":-328,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Trothfang Street","descriptions":["Due north you see the square that marks the entrance to the Barbarians' Guild, with its arcade of caryatides and telamones, life-size and lifelike sculptures of former female and male Arena Champions.  The covered entryway to the Arena is dead ahead to the east, while beyond that rise the town walls."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":5,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":865,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":200,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Flamethorn Way","descriptions":["Trellises woven of strips of wicker and cane cover the front of the Herbalist's Shop here.  Vines cling gratefully to the walls, their tendrils seeking ever-tighter grips around the crosspieces of the trellises.  Ivy, morning glory, honeysuckle, jasmine and leafy green creepers all compete in the upward race for light and moisture, making the facade of the shop look more like an ancient ruin than the thriving and busy trade it is."],"exits":[{"to":136,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":219,"exit":"go","move":"go herbalist's shop"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":240,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard","descriptions":["Intimidatingly large passersby crowd around you, and you gulp as you notice most of the men and women here of all races tower above their average counterparts.  They also tend to dress differently - fully equipped, even in the midst of the city - in leathers, hide and armor, weapons drawn or at the ready over shoulders or at their sides.  Carefully you make your way through the throng, since something tells you this would not be a good spot to step on anyone's toes."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":9,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":11,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":975,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting hall"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":240,"y":-318,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Cheopman Lane","descriptions":["Large clay urns and willow baskets spill out onto the footpath here, filled with riotous displays of bright flowers in full bloom, sprigs of emerald green foliage, and ornamental reeds, boughs and branches.  A young girl leans nonchalantly against the entrance to the Florist's Shop, watching over the wares.  Smiling shyly, she beckons enticingly to potential customers."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":10,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":655,"exit":"go","move":"go florist's shop"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":240,"y":-298,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Cheopman Lane","descriptions":["Ragtag merchants and vendors lug heavily-laden sacks and bundles south, while others leave, heading north with empty pushcarts and baskets.  The town's less well-off citizenry stroll by, looking for good deals in the impromptu flea market of Mongers' Bazaar.  Others proudly show off their new purchases and hard-won bargains."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go bazaar"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":170,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard","descriptions":["The cobblestones here are grey and flecked with crystals that sparkle as you move along the boulevard.  High walls over which loom still higher structures with shuttered, mute windows that face the street and baked tile roofs, indicate you are passing through one of the wealthier residential sections of the Crossing."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":12,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":18,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":899,"exit":"go","move":"go small hut"}],"aliases":["Apostle Headquarters","Apostle HQ"]},
  {"id":12,"x":170,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Via Iltesh","descriptions":["This small lane off of Clanthew Boulevard narrows to the south and grows wider as it leads north into the main road, giving it a shape reminiscent of the blade of a huge greatsword.  Due south you can see the verdant border of the Town Green and the shops of the Weaponsmith and Armorer.  To the northeast is the dome of the Champions' Arena and to the west, the three-story colonnades of the Academy dominate the skyline."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":13,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":170,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Via Iltesh","descriptions":["The lane is quite narrow here, with the sides of the Armorer's and Weaponsmith's shops encroaching on the path itself.  Their huddling structures and the shady hedges and lunats that form this northern boundary of the Town Green cause slippery moss to grow upon the cobblestones and cast a cool, damp pall over this end of the street."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":170,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green North","descriptions":["A small path of bent grass leads to a narrow stretch of cobblestones between the grass and the privet hedge that stands before Milgrym the Weaponsmith's.  The town's main source of serviceable arms, Milgrym does a good trade and has a solid reputation.  The stream of customers, though steady, seems careful not to disturb the usual tranquility of the facing greensward."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":17,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":15,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":23,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":225,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":191,"exit":"go","move":"go weaponsmith's"},{"to":467,"exit":"go","move":"go green pond"}],"aliases":["Town Green","TGN","Wanted Board"]},
  {"id":15,"x":210,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green Southeast","descriptions":["This tranquil corner of the Green has a small bower of entwined modwyn vines, laden with tempting, grape-like clusters.  A limestone bench and some sawed-off sections of trees that serve as rustic stools make up an open-air performance space, where bards, musicians and poets can demonstrate their talents."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":16,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":14,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":371,"exit":"go","move":"go grass path"},{"to":377,"exit":"go","move":"go amphitheater gate"}],"aliases":["TGSE"]},
  {"id":16,"x":170,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green South","descriptions":["A gap in the stand of lunat trees leads south into Lunat Shade Road.  In that general direction lie Berolt's Dry Goods, the Town Hall, the soaring presence of the Temple, the Provincial Bank and other key structures.  A few loafers loll on the grass, watching those entering and leaving the Green.  Sparrows, jays and other birds call to one another from the treetops, flitting back and forth between their nests and roosts in the dense hedges bordering the park.","A gap in the stand of lunat trees leads south into Lunat Shade Road.  In that general direction the lights shining from Berolt's Dry Goods, the Town Hall, the soaring presence of the Temple, the Provincial Bank and other key structures can be seen.  A few loafers loll on the grass, watching those entering and leaving the green, or laying back to gaze at the night sky.  A lone nightingale serenades from the hedges bordering the park, unaware of its appreciative audience."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":17,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":40,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":23,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":225,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["TGS"]},
  {"id":17,"x":210,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green Northeast","descriptions":["The cool, welcome expanse of the Town Green is a pleasant place to gather and exchange news, gossip and adventuring pointers with all the folk and races of Elanthia who are drawn to town.  A soft, spongy carpet of well-manicured grass underfoot affords a comfortable cushion for sitting or sprawling out to enjoy a rare moment of rest in the warm sun.  An ancient oak tree provides shelter for those so inclined.","The cool, welcome expanse of the Town Green is a pleasant place to gather and exchange news, gossip and adventuring pointers with all the folk and races of Elanthia who are drawn to town.  A soft, spongy carpet of well-manicured grass underfoot affords a comfortable cushion for sitting or sprawling beneath the star-studded night sky.  An ancient oak tree provides shelter for those so inclined."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":16,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":14,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":264,"exit":"go","move":"go cobblestone walkway"},{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"},{"to":853,"exit":"none","move":"go shadowed gap"}],"aliases":["TGNE"]},
  {"id":18,"x":60,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard","descriptions":["You pause a moment at one of the busiest crossroads of town.  Through this intersection must pass most of those traveling from the wilderness of the Western Tier into the heart of the Crossing, and those departing as well.  To the east lie the gates to the Eastern Tier, affording access to the Warrior Mages' Guild and the Observatory, and other, more perilous, destinations."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":31,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":60,"y":-282,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, S'zella Plaza","descriptions":["This small piazza stands between the Academy Asemath and the shops and residences clustered around the Town Green to the east.  Its granite pavement has been well-worn, since it forms the north-south connection between the major artery of the Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard, and Lorethew Street.  Several stone benches, roughly hewn out of the same material as the pavement, form a semi-circle around a polychrome plaster statue in a quiet corner of the square."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":234,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["S'zella Plaza"]},
  {"id":20,"x":60,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Asemath Walk","descriptions":["You stand before a sign in the shape of a giant lute, painted in red and gilt and inlaid with ivory and jet, with florid script proclaiming the virtues of the True Bard d'Or, the Crossing's finest purveyor of high-quality instruments for\r\n, aesthetes and amateurs alike.  Dashing, gaily-clad figures stream in and out of the shop, lutes slung over shoulders or pipes clasped under arms.  A haunting tune, at once both exhilarating and melancholic, emanates from the doorway.","You stand before a sign in the shape of a giant lute, painted in red and gilt and inlaid with ivory and jet, with florid script proclaiming the virtues of the True Bard d'Or, the Crossing's finest purveyor of high-quality instruments for bards, aesthetes and amateurs alike.  Dashing, gaily-clad figures stream in and out of the shop, lutes slung over shoulders or pipes clasped under arms.  A haunting tune, at once both exhilarating and melancholic, emanates from the doorway."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":22,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":21,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":25,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":401,"exit":"go","move":"go bards shop"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":60,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Asemath Walk","descriptions":["The crowd here is boisterous, composed of students, teachers, and seekers of all kinds.  Some head south to the famed taproom of the Half Pint Inn, others appear to have already enjoyed the libations there to the dregs and are heading back for study.  The inn to the south and the visitors to the High Temple to the southeast contribute to the brisk flow of people to and from the Academy.","Small groups of students walk by talking in animated fashion, some excitedly about the night's feature show at the famed taproom of the Half Pint Inn, others laughing themselves wearily home after a too many few rounds of liquid libation.  The well-lit inn to the south as well as the blazing flames on the towers of the High Temple to the southeast add to the cheery street atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":37,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":90,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Manciple Cobble","descriptions":["This cobbled street connects the Town Green with the streets leading to Academy Asemath and the shops, inns and eateries that cluster around it.  Old stone residences line the walkway, making it more like a court than a through street.  Your footsteps echo off their unyielding, secretive facades."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":20,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":130,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green Southwest","descriptions":["The hedgerow to the west meets the row of tall lunat trees that separates the Town Green from the commercial traffic on Lunat Shade Road due south.  The growth is especially dense here, with no way to slip past either of the living fences.  The small thorns on the hedges, to keep out stray livestock in search of prime pasture, look daunting in any case."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":14,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":22,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["TGSW","Pillory"]},
  {"id":24,"x":90,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Puddle Path","descriptions":["The packed dirt path between bustling Town Green and the quieter confines of Smithy Lane has been worn to a smooth, deep hollow over the years.  A perennial pool of murky brown water now sits obstinately in the center of the path, requiring passers-by to gather up their hems or risk a muddying.  From time to time, small boys have been known to hide in the bushes bordering the path, hoping for a tantalizing glimpse of a lady's ankle."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":607,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":10,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Trollferry Approach","descriptions":["The street here is a bit neglected, as though it once carried constant foot and cart traffic, but now is somewhat forlorn and forgotten.  Little draws your attention, only the red brick back of the bathhouse along the south side of the path, and the clapboard back of the Bards' Shop directly north.  The smells of steam, water, varnish and rosin escape through small windows facing the street, as the path curves northeast to intersect with Asemath Walk."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":26,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":-40,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Trollferry Approach","descriptions":["This intersection leads north to Lorethew and Clanthew Streets, which provide access to the river crossing and to the guild headquarters to the north and to the east.  The embankment of the river is built up slightly ahead, providing a small measure of protection against flooding, while also serving as the base for a crumbling, old pier."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":25,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":32,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":873,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":-40,"y":-242,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lorethew Street","descriptions":["The path here follows the curves of the Oxenwaithe, bringing you nearer to the swirling, dark currents.  Along the bank, to the southwest, you make out several dinghies bobbing and straining at their moorings, in a doomed dance of freedom they can never win, except at the behest of some greedy ferryman or in the wake of a storm."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":36,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":26,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":-40,"y":-282,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Sirenberry Row","descriptions":["The daunting, austere structure of Academy Asemath, directly east, blocks out the light, and leaves the humble facade on the other side of the path in intermittent shade.  Scholars and singers, teachers and troubadours, mimes and masters all saunter past, content in their mutual feelings of superiority.  Round the corner, you can just spy a gaudy sign on a shop to the east."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":27,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":-40,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard","descriptions":["From the west comes the sound of currents rushing through a narrow river bend, while in the distance, just barely evident to the northwest, is a corner of the outer town wall, over which the calls of birds can be heard.  Mingled among the sublime sounds of nature, are the equally sweet sounds reaching your ears from a small, unpretentious building set unobtrusively off to the south side of the road."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":28,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":30,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":468,"exit":"go","move":"go small building"},{"to":1029,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought gate"}],"aliases":["Bard"]},
  {"id":30,"x":-70,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard","descriptions":["The meandering course of the River Oxenwaithe lies dead ahead.  Wooden carts, powered by all manner of two- and four-legged beasts, rumble past, headed west towards the broad, well-worn planks of the Oxenwaithe Bridge and east into the heart of the Crossing.  Groups of armed adventurers, mystics, merchants and rogues weave in and out of the wheeled and hoofed mobs."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":94,"exit":"go","move":"go oxenwaithe bridge"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":10,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Clanthew Boulevard","descriptions":["A side entrance to the Academy, in the form of a low, bronze gate, stands here.  Students and faculty come and go through it, since it provides convenient access to the inns and eateries clustered to the north and east of Elanthia's most renowned seat of learning and research.  Several blocks to the east looms the dome of the Champions' Arena, which also houses the Barbarians' Guild and farther north, both within and without the sheltering walls of town, lie various other Guilds."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":18,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":29,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":196,"exit":"go","move":"go low gate"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":-60,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Trollferry Quay","descriptions":["A dilapidated wooden pier juts out into the steel-grey waters of the Oxenwaithe River here.  Several battered dinghies bounce up and down in time to the currents.  In olden days this was a major ferry crossing, presided over by a loathsome and capricious troll.  Now it is naught but a rotting ruin, as is no doubt the corpse of its former owner."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":33,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":855,"exit":"none","move":"go rotting ruin"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":-60,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Embankment","descriptions":["Dark, swirling currents of the river rush by, headed southward toward ultimate merger with the mighty Segoltha River.  Still darker, shadowy and inexplicably sinister figures hustle by you, noiselessly, passing in and out of a black, recessed doorway set almost invisibly into a nondescript wall along the curb."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":34,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":218,"exit":"go","move":"go black doorway"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":-60,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Embankment","descriptions":["The embankment here is high and crude, just a mound of packed mud, earth and marl that seems unlikely to be capable of doing more than providing the neighborhood residents with a false sense of security.  Still, there are a few houses and shops along the riverbank.  Those establishments that have been built hard by the river must take great pains to propitiate the elemental gods since the structures still remain standing."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":35,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":-60,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Full Moons Crescent","descriptions":["The street curves here to match a bend in the river.  A freshly whitewashed house, two stories high, stands just off the path.  Craning your neck, you see the second floor is actually some sort of glass-enclosed solarium, the light streaming through its panes and refracted into a halo of prismatic auras."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":95,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":657,"exit":"go","move":"go seeress' house"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":10,"y":-242,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lorethew Street","descriptions":["This narrow road runs east-west between the Academy and many of the town's shops.  To the east you can see the low shops and hedges that surround the Town Green, while west looms the tributary river, flowing on its winding course south into the mighty Segoltha River."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":27,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":60,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Asemath Walk","descriptions":["Clerics, academics and carousers all are apparent here, headed throughout town on different courses.  The windows and terraces from the back of the two-storied Half Pint Inn face the street from the south, while to the east is the side of the cleric's shop.  Smooth paving stones, pale grey with dark grey borders, have been laid to coordinate with the approaches to the High Temple.","Normally filled with bustling Clerics, academics and carousers of all types and ages, this area is peaceful as most people have retired for the night, excepting the occasional joyous song that escapes an open window from the back of the two-storied Half Pint Inn to the south.  The side of the Cleric's shop is to the east, bordering the smooth paving stones that have been laid to coordinate with the approaches of the High Temple."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":38,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":96,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":130,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Alamhif Trace","descriptions":["A constant stream of townsfolk and outlanders file past you but the mix is not your usual pastiche of rag-tag traders, bare-chested barbarians, indolent bards and assorted laborers.  Here most people speak in serene tones or peer at you benevolently from behind cowls of the cleric's calling.  Many cluster around Brother Durantine's Cleric Shop, which hugs the north side of the road.  A monk pauses in the shadows cast by the High Temple tower to the southwest before continuing his journey.","This normally sedate area is nearly still in the night hours, the occasional late-night shopper heading to or from Brother Durantine's Cleric Shop, which hugs the north side of the road.  A hooded monk exits the shop into the shadows and fingers his prayer beads with unconscious familiarity as he glances up at the bright flame on the High Temple tower to the southwest, pausing a moment before continuing his journey."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":44,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":37,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":407,"exit":"go","move":"go cleric shop"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":170,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Alamhif Trace","descriptions":["This pivotal junction connects many of the Crossing's key locations.  Proudly located to the south you see the translucent dome of the Temple flanked by its three guard towers, while the Town Green and the Town Hall can be seen off toward the north and northeast.  The babble of many languages, of clan and guild and folk, fill the air here.  Travelers dressed in all manner of costume, garb and battle gear amble past, admiring the view of the buildings here, or looking about to get their bearings.","This pivotal junction connects many of the Crossing's key locations.  Blazing to the south in the night sky are the flames on the Temple's three towers, while the lights of Town Green and Town Hall can be seen off towards the north and northeast.  The babble of many languages, clan and guild and folk fill the air here, busy at every hour.  Travelers dressed in all manner of costume, garb and battle gear amble past, admiring the darkened outlines of the buildings, or looking about to get their bearings."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":184,"exit":"go","move":"go carousel square"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":170,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lunat Shade Road","descriptions":["Majestic lunat trees line this byway, donated by the town's prosperous traders, a reminder of how their Guild delights in improving the quality of life for beings all over Elanthia.  One such wealthy merchant, though not as ostentatious as most, is Berolt, the dry goods dealer.  His venerable general store here outfits adventurers with all the basic necessities.  The row of trees on the north side of the street also serves to shade the south half of Town Green."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":39,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":189,"exit":"go","move":"go general store"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":210,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lunat Shade Road","descriptions":["A modest two-story building with a slate roof and large windows dominates this section of town.  This is the Town Hall, the place to pay fines and taxes, obtain permits and licenses, and attend the occasional town meeting.  On the other side of this tree-lined street is the Plaza.  Looking east from here you can barely make out the ramparts of the Eastern Wall over the low roofs of the houses and shops."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":40,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":311,"exit":"go","move":"go town hall"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":210,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Hodierna Way","descriptions":["The hustle of crowds making their way between the secular and religious centers of town that converge here carries you along with its momentum.  The granite and marble facade of the First Provincial Bank catches your eye, standing before you as solid as its name.  A Gor'Tog guard armed with pike and crossbow is posted at the door, while a few well-dressed merchants congregate outside."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":43,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":39,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":231,"exit":"go","move":"go provincial bank"}],"color":"#808000","aliases":["Kraelyst start point","travel start point"]},
  {"id":43,"x":170,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Approach","descriptions":["This stretch of road is wide and paved with smooth stone blocks.  Cherry trees in carved stone planters border the sweeping approach while softening the exterior walls surrounding the Temple grounds.  Flames flicker from the tops of three tall towers standing guard over the orb of the Main Temple.  Fragile walkways lash the towers to each other high above the orb.","This stretch of road is wide and paved with smooth stone blocks.  Cherry trees in carved stone planters border the sweeping approach while softening the exterior walls surrounding the Temple grounds.  Flames brightly visible in the dark flare from the tops of three tall towers standing guard over the orb of the Main Temple.  Fragile walkways lash the towers to each other high above the orb."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":44,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":46,"exit":"go","move":"go longbow bridge"},{"to":1048,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany gate"}],"aliases":["almsbox","tithe"]},
  {"id":44,"x":130,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Approach","descriptions":["This cobblestone walk is heavily trafficked with guests leaving the Half Pint Inn to the west and monks and pilgrims traveling to and from the temple to the southeast.  Next to this path looms one of the walls of the High Temple enclosing the fire topped towers and walkways soaring far above.  Although life bustles on around you, you pause to contemplate deeper issues for a brief moment.  Emerging from your reverie, you resume your journey.","The night hours bring revelers traveling to and from the many amusements to be found in the Half Pint Inn to the west, with the occasional monk or pilgrim making a quiet trek to the Temple to the southeast.  A wall enclosing the fire-topped towers of the High Temple looms closely to the path, the soaring walkways connecting one tower to another looming as shadows high above."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":43,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":45,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":967,"exit":"go","move":"go hedged archway"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":90,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Werfnen's Strole","descriptions":["Werfnen's Strole, the Path of Dreamers, leads from the glories of the High Temple to the renowned hospitality of Skalliweg Barrelthumper's Half Pint Inn.  The jocular Halfling is known throughout all Elanthia as the consummate innkeeper.  Mouthwatering aromas and heart-gladdening songs waft out of the inn, while the soothing gurgling of the tributary to the south creates a poignant counterpoint to the uproar within.","Werfnen's Strole, the Path of Dreamers, leads from the glories of the High Temple to the renowned hospitality of Skalliweg Barrelthumper's Half Pint Inn, brightly lit to welcome any late traveler.  The jocular Halfling is known throughout all Elanthia as the consummate innkeeper.  Mouthwatering aromas and heart-gladdening songs waft out of the inn, while the soothing gurgling of the tributary to the south creates a poignant counterpoint to the uproar within."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":659,"exit":"go","move":"go half inn"},{"to":860,"exit":"none","move":"go alley"}],"aliases":["Werfnen's Strole"]},
  {"id":46,"x":90,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Chieftain Walk","descriptions":["This busy threeway is a vital link.  The Longbow Bridge feeds into it from the northeast, and the warehouse and dock district which stand to the south and west bustle with activity.  The commercial district to the northwest, and the pleasant and populous beach resort are to the southeast, just at the mouth of the River Oxenwaithe, where it empties into the Segoltha."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":49,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go longbow bridge"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":90,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, 3 Retainers' Crescent","descriptions":["The Longbow Bridge is due east, as the river flows beneath it, just at the edge of your vision.  To the south is the Shipyard and The Strand, a pleasant beach where the two rivers that define the life of the Crossing meet.  To the west are the commercial institutions that are the centers of trade and finance."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":46,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":79,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":90,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, 3 Retainers' Crescent","descriptions":["There seems to be great confusion along this narrow stretch of road, as folk of all races and professions pass by and overflow the curbs.  They spill into the street to better make their way, crisscrossing at no particular corner, and running in front of lumbering wagons, darting handcarts or mounted travelers."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":80,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":437,"exit":"go","move":"go old warehouse"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":130,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Sandy Path","descriptions":["Light filters through a line of trees as you make your way down this cheerful dirt path.  A narrow clearing affords you a view of sandy embankments and the lapis-colored waters of the Oxenwaithe River.  A number of townsfolk and itinerant merchants greet you as you press along this thoroughfare. ","The wind rustles through a stand of trees which line the path, their tops rising like dark shadows against the night sky.  Occasionally you encounter a lone traveller, but for the most part it is quiet here."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":653,"exit":"go","move":"go rickety wagon"},{"to":1034,"exit":"go","move":"go whitewashed gate"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":155,"y":205,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Sandy Path","descriptions":["Following the roadside along the Oxenwaithe's bank, you are struck by the quiet beauty of the place.  Taking pause to breathe in the crisp, clean air, you reflect on your surroundings.  Sand, sparkling as if mixed with diamond dust, pours into deep blue undulating waters.  A lush copse of trees spreads to the north, while to the southeast, a series of delightful small buildings is set back from the river's edge.","You can hear the Oxenwaithe lapping gently at its bank, creating a soothing sound not unlike a lullaby.  The light reflected from the moons provide shimmery paths along the sandy embankments at water's edge."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":49,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":652,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting portal"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Premium Portal","Portal","banyan tree"]},
  {"id":51,"x":230,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Crystalline Beach","descriptions":["Several bungalows surround a large communal center sporting a long, wide veranda.  These form the heart of The Strand's resort area, providing respite from day-to-day concerns.  Each bungalow is a simple, single-story unit, positioned to afford an uninterrupted view of the delta where the Oxenwaithe and Segoltha meet.  Beyond the bungalows, sparkling sand stretches from a grassy knoll down a gentle incline, ending in a low ledge of rock pocked with tidal pools.","Several bungalows surround a large communal center sporting a long, wide veranda.  With the exception of a lighted window on the top floor of the center, all is silent and dark against the night sky.  The constant crash of waves upon a ledge of rocks at river's edge is the only sound you hear, save for the occasional bustle of a resort worker on the communal center's veranda."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":50,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go veranda"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":50,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Chieftain Walk","descriptions":["The warehouses and low buildings to the northwest resolve into a flat, open stretch of turf to the south, where the two rivers that shape the Crossing begin to come together.  This level alluvial delta is home to the Crossing's main shipyard, where many of the barges, ferries, frigates, merchant ships, and corsairs that ply the rivers and seas of Elanthia are built.  The weathered shipyard gate leads southeast."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":53,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":237,"exit":"go","move":"go shipyard gate"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":10,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["The promenade here is a pleasant place to stroll along the riverbank and watch the activities on the broad and swift Segoltha River.  The walkway is broad and clean, paved with bright red bricks forming whimsical patterns and abstract designs.  The breeze off the river is invigorating.  Several young hawkers try to peddle snacks and flowers to families or couples out taking the air, while merchants and seamen rush by."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":56,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":215,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Crystalline Beach","descriptions":["Sand continues to stretch from east to west.  Children of all races can often be found at the water's edge, playing games or building ephemeral castles.  To one side, a grove of spreading Wyndwood trees provides the perfect spot for quiet meditation, while further off, several braziers set on piles of rock indicate that this is a favorite picnic location.","The gently rushing waters of the Segoltha fill the air with a pleasant drone.  Traveling along the riverbank, you chance upon a large picnic area dotted with iron braziers set neatly on low rock pillars."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":55,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":856,"exit":"go","move":"go grill"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":200,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Crystalline Beach","descriptions":["Short grasses and flowering dirdel provide a carpet in the sand along this part of the Segoltha.  A jagged rock juts out of the water just beyond the river bank, its dark surface streaked with deep green moss.  A group of Nadira turn lazy circles just off shore, no doubt hunting for their next meal.  In the distance, lovers walk arm in arm along the river, while a lone beach-goer scours the sand for unique shells.","Short grasses and flowering dirdel provide a carpet in the sand along this part of the Segoltha.  A jagged rock breaks the surface of the water just off shore, obscuring part of the starry sky.  The intermittent chatter of a family of nesting Nadira birds reaches your ear."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":602,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone tower"},{"to":606,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy pier"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":-30,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["Hustling businessmen mingle with grimy dockworkers and indolent strollers here, all proceeding at very different paces.  Handcarts filled with baskets and burlap bundles are pushed by stout, young lads past ladies decked in their finery.  Most of the well-heeled leisure set seems to be headed to and from the freshly painted dock here.  Some private boats and pleasure craft are moored to it."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":57,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":169,"exit":"go","move":"go freshly dock"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":-70,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["The path here runs right along the river bank, as the shore curves into the land to form a small protected inlet.  Directly south, a few small craft are beached, anchored by heavy rocks.  One has oars but no rudder, another has a rudder but no bottom, and yet another has a bottom riddled with holes.  Several tattered nets are hung on driftwood frames to dry, and alongside them, a few gutted fish."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":56,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":58,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":-150,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["An apparent contradiction, the toney esplanade here is right in the midst of a group of warehouses to the north and the customs and storage house of Riverfront Portage to the west.  The strollers and workers mingle, with most of the leisure traffic centering around the noisy amusement pier to the south."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":60,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":61,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":59,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1237,"exit":"go","move":"go amusement pier"},{"to":671,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany building"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":-190,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Stevedore's Wend","descriptions":["The scene is monotonous - warehouses to the west, warehouses to the east, and the hulking shell of the customs clearing house and main warehouse, Riverfront Portage.  Its back wall looms due south, as you skirt around this corner.  Few but the bedraggled longshoremen trudging by have business along this byway and they eye you listlessly."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":58,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":673,"exit":"go","move":"go old warehouse"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":-190,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lemicus Square","descriptions":["This corner of Lemicus Square is dotted with litter and looks a bit neglected.  The hulk of Riverfront Portage looms along the north edge of the square and extends for several blocks west.  To the south is a wooden pier with a painted sign arched over the entrance."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":66,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":64,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden pier"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":-205,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["The road winds among narrow, aged apartments built from brown sandstone.  Their elaborate vine traceries and gargoyle reliefs have been dusted nearly smooth with the passage of years.  Rows of large, unpaned windows stare out upon the world like dozens of sightless eyes."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":62,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":685,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone apartment"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":-215,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["Light blue sandstone apartments rise from the roadside, their color in stark contrast to the brown of the surrounding buildings.  A small patch of ground near one entrance has been made into a small desert garden, and contains dozens of kronar-sized holes, from which small, black lizards with long, green-tipped whiptails occasionally streak forth."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":63,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":691,"exit":"go","move":"go brick building"},{"to":688,"exit":"go","move":"go sandstone apartment"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":-310,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Esplanade Eluned","descriptions":["A large oak tree stands in a wide cul-de-sac at the end of the road, its arms arching high above the surrounding buildings as if straining to best them in a contest of size.  Behind its gnarled, massive trunk stands a weathered three-story apartment building formed of white sandstone."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":692,"exit":"go","move":"go thatched cottage"},{"to":693,"exit":"go","move":"go apartment building"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":-230,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lemicus Square","descriptions":["A wide square here opens up to the town's main river freight, storage and customs house, Riverfront Portage.  Crowds of dockworkers, wharf rats and riffraff mingle with the customs brokers, agents and emissaries of the wealthy merchants and trading houses of the town."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":66,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":65,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":696,"exit":"go","move":"go portage"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":-310,"y":126,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["Kertigen Road cuts a broad diagonal swath through the neighborhood here, separating the working class residences and old crofts on the west side of the road, from the storage facilities and trading houses to the east."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":64,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":-230,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lemicus Square","descriptions":["The east side of the Sand Spit Tavern is here, its dilapidated and weathered clapboard attesting its owner's neglect.  Still, the rowdy laughter and shouts from within make it a somewhat homey and attractive roost, a haven for sailors and seamen, dockworkers and locals who seek some relief from their toil and travels."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":60,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":67,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go dock"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":-270,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Haven's End","descriptions":["The word to describe the building in front of you would be \"ramshackle\", a tavern to judge from the sign hanging loose from a rod jutting out over the door.  Apparently built from a medley of materials, including what looks like part of the hull of an old trading galleon, the place seems to fit well into the general neighborhood.","The word to describe the building in front of you would be ramshackle, a tavern to judge from the sign hanging loose from a rod jutting out over the door.  Apparently built from a medley of materials, including what looks like part of the hull of an old trading galleon, the place seems to fit well into the general neighborhood."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":68,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":699,"exit":"go","move":"go sand tavern"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":-310,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Haven's End","descriptions":["This is the end of the road - literally.  All to the north and west, this dead end is surrounded by a weed-choked vacant lot, a remnant of some ancient farmer's croft or field that was incorporated into the Crossing early on in its evolution.  The dark, rich bank of the Segoltha River rises to the south, too steep here to attempt to climb.","This is the end of the road - literally.  All to the north and west, this dead end is surrounded by a weed-choked vacant lot, a remnant of some ancient farmer's croft or field that was incorporated into the Crossing early on in its evolution.  The dark, rich bank of the Segoltha River rises steeply to the south, a difficult climb due to the slick and precipitous slope."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":476,"exit":"climb","move":"climb bank"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":-310,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["A spacious, clean facade of Ulven's Warehouse fronts the east side of the road here.  To the west, Elmod Close forms the southernmost boundary of a rather downbeat neighborhood that is home to rickety rowhouses, dilapidated crofts and the infamous Drelstead Prison."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":65,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":106,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":702,"exit":"go","move":"go warehouse"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":-310,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["An overloaded flatbed wagon races past, its driver pushing the horses to their limits.  A small child emerging from the lane to the west is knocked to the ground by its passing, while a group of older lads gather up some boxes that have fallen off the wagon in its hasty flight north to the gates."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":73,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":69,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":103,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":71,"x":-310,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["The streets conform to a right angle in the town walls here.  The back of the Guard House, with a narrow barred window in it, stands on the east curb.  A uniformed deputy, surrounded by heavily armed guards, conducts a lawbreaker in irons from the Guard House for a very long vacation in Drelstead Prison, which lies several blocks west."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":70,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":100,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":-190,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Ustial Road","descriptions":["This stretch of Ustial Road is a strange mixture of people and buildings.  Several prosperous-looking townhouses line the north side of the street.  Their windowless exteriors rise above thick town walls decorated with glazed ceramic tiles.  Through the iron gates that lead within, you spy well-appointed rooms clustered around shady courtyards.  On the south side of the street, the houses are more modest, as though some invisible boundary had been drawn straight down the middle of the road."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":74,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":59,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":73,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":525,"exit":"go","move":"go large building"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":-241,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Ustial Road","descriptions":["The two-story dwellings on the north side of the street are sequestered by high town walls.  Shade trees from the inner yards of the houses hang over into the street.  Surrounding one well-kept gate, a colorful wall mural relieves the dun-colored monotony of the protective ramparts.  To the south, the equally humdrum back wall of a warehouse looms."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":70,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":937,"exit":"go","move":"go limestone building"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":-108,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Mercantile Street","descriptions":["This is a quiet section of Mercantile Street, leading behind the Traders' Guild and between sundry warehouses holding goods awaiting shipment or sale.  Just against the back wall of the whitewashed Guildhall is what appears to be a small rock garden.  On closer inspection, you see by the offerings in the midst of the rocks that it is a shrine of some kind."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":72,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":703,"exit":"go","move":"go shrine"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":-70,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Mercantile Street","descriptions":["The road here is partially blocked by an overturned oxcart.  Large, burlap-wrapped bales are scattered over the cobbles and the sidewalk, making you detour around them.  Other wagons and barrows wait rather impatiently for the harried driver to right his cart, rehitch his team and clear the way."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":77,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":74,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":-28,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Mercantile Street","descriptions":["On the north side of the street is the back of the tall bank building, looking daunting and impregnable with its thick, windowless walls.  Just opposite, a secure, expansive warehouse has a gang of uniformed Gor'Togs surrounding it on all sides.  Armed to the teeth, they glower at you, as a S'Kra Mur foreman hisses some order to them."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":75,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":-70,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Scullion Way","descriptions":["Squeezed between overpoweringly solid warehouses on two sides, Scullion Way leads north-south between Mercantile Street and the waterside concourse, Esplanade Eluned.  Servants, humble working folk, laborers, artisans, shopkeepers and other stalwarts on whose backs rest the commerce, defense and very life of the Crossing itself flow past you.  A few gull calls and a light riverine scent drift up from the south."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":57,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":10,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Drayhorse Trace","descriptions":["A long, fortified warehouse here extends to the west into Mercantile Street.  It looks more like some kind of military storehouse or armory.  Guards dressed in some kind of private uniforms discourage you from further satisfying your curiosity about the structure.  You turn your attention to the waters of the River Oxenwaithe, which from this spot is visible both to the north and the east, as it snakes its way southwards around this promontory."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":79,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":44,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Drayhorse Trace","descriptions":["The constant clamor of hooves on cobblestones echoes off the walls of the distribution centers, granaries, magazines, and storehouses that border the street in this part of town.  Horse-drawn flatbed wagons, mounted merchants on fine steeds, and carriages bearing regal ladies all clatter by, raising whorls of dust."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":78,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":30,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, 3 Retainers' Crescent","descriptions":["Here the way diverges from the riverbank and is set off as it connects between major arteries leading to the commercial heart of the Crossing, the water transport hub, and Longbow Bridge."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":81,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":10,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gold Barque Quay","descriptions":["Several swank-looking private boats, gondolas and a few sleek, flat-bottomed river boats are tied up here.  A large log raft stands in dry dock on some stone pilings, ready to be put into service on those occasions when the floods of demonic weather cause the River Oxenwaithe to o'erflow its banks and wash out the town's two bridges or if invaders breach the town's defenses and set torch to them."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":78,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":-30,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Bank Street","descriptions":["The Moneylender's commands a breathtaking view of the River Oxenwaithe and its aquatic commerce flowing south towards the mighty Segoltha River and thence eastward to the sea.  From its top-floor windows the bankers can keep watch over the Traders' Guild to the west, and can view the low sprawling warehouses and docks to the south.  Directly across the river is a curious dwelling with a glass gazebo atop it."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":83,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":874,"exit":"go","move":"go well-used road"},{"to":898,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":83,"x":-70,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Bank Street","descriptions":["A lovely view of the river bend is afforded to the northeast, but the vast majority of the pedestrians here hurry by oblivious, as they make their way to the various commercial, financial and trade establishments located in this part of town.  Wealthy merchants, determined traders, intent-looking shopkeepers and wholesalers, and their hangers-on, pass you by.  You could swear you also see a crafty cutpurse or two among the jostling throng."],"exits":[{"to":82,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":84,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":851,"exit":"go","move":"go society building"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":-110,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Bank Street","descriptions":["You stand at the entrance to the Traders' Guildhall, an understated, elegant structure with carved wooden doors, stout brick chimneys, tiled gables, pargetted decorations and leaded glass windows.  The door that leads inside is guarded by an officious concierge.  Due west along this busy street is the Crossing's Guard House, and east is the Moneylender, a financial institution for merchants great and small all over Elanthia."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":83,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":85,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":339,"exit":"go","move":"go traders' guildhall"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":-190,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Commerce Avenue","descriptions":["The congested junction of Commerce Avenue, Bank Street and Ustial Road is here.  One block east is the Traders' Guildhall, and to the south lie the giant warehouses and customs clearing houses that serve the river trade.  Farther east lies the Mercantile Union, and farther south lie the docks and the roaring currents of the great Segoltha River itself.  The wealthy traders in the immediate vicinity deemed this the perfect spot for the Guard House."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":84,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":72,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":404,"exit":"go","move":"go guard house"}]},
  {"id":86,"x":-190,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Commerce Avenue","descriptions":["This is a transitional block of busy Commerce Avenue, leading between the mercantile, financial and dock districts to the south, and the somewhat shabby, older and less savory neighborhood to the north."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":88,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":85,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":357,"exit":"go","move":"go iron doors"}]},
  {"id":87,"x":-190,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Scorpion Lane","descriptions":["Though no sinister dead-end or perilous cul-de-sac, you feel wary as you make your way along this lane.  The shadowy rear wall of a large nondescript building bounds the north side of the street here, instilling an irrational but unshakable sensation of countless unseen departures and arrivals through secret doors at your back and hidden tunnels beneath your feet.  Glimmers of light east toward Water Sprite Way provide some comfort, as do the busy sounds from Kertigen Road to the west."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":89,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":86,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":97,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":223,"exit":"go","move":"go artificer's shop"}]},
  {"id":88,"x":-110,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Water Sprite Way","descriptions":["The road curves slightly in concert with the river here, gradually merging with Bank Street.  Rising to the south you see the wood and white plaster facade of the Traders' Guildhall.  From this vantage point, it is more modest looking than you would have expected but still impeccably designed and executed."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":84,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":86,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":385,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go cottage"},{"to":704,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go haberdashery"}]},
  {"id":89,"x":-110,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Water Sprite Way","descriptions":["Water Sprite Way intersects here with Scorpion Lane to the west.  Although this riverside walk is pleasant and refreshing, you cannot help but notice a large proportion of rather seedy-looking characters coming and going from the various side streets to the west and northwest.  Prosperous, beefy-faced traders stroll north and south, destined for the various commercial areas down by the river and in the eastern half of town."],"exits":[{"to":90,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":88,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":87,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":90,"x":-110,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Water Sprite Way","descriptions":["The currents of the River Oxenwaithe undulate past, almost hypnotically.  Tiny points of light reflect and dance on the water's surface like a congregation of fey folks and water sprites playing amongst the waves.  Directly across the river, you see the low profiles of the locksmith's and other shops and residences of the east bank of town.  The embankment on the opposite shore rises a few feet high."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":89,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":91,"x":-110,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Damaris Lane","descriptions":["The river bends slightly west here, and your path verges on the low embankment.  The blue currents carry a wide range of river traffic southwards downstream.  Barges straining their way upstream, urged on by polemen or dragged by teams of oxen along the shore.  The glistening surface of the water and the bright view of the town on the eastern shore is a welcome sight, compared to the murky shadows looming farther west down the street."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":90,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":117,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":92,"x":-70,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Nightrunner's Quay","descriptions":["In one of the most unsavory parts of the Crossing, this little spit of land juts out into the Oxenwaithe just far enough to take advantage of its swift currents.  A small pier, barely more than a few crude planks, is buoyed up by some empty barrels.  Tied to a rusty nail in one of the planks is a low-floating barge."],"exits":[{"to":91,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":93,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":93,"x":-110,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Varlet's Run","descriptions":["You happen upon a shadowy street corner, within leaping distance of the riverbank for a quick getaway via the River Oxenwaithe or a fast dart into the murky underpinnings of Oxenwaithe Bridge.  The lack of illumination also serves to protect the identities of the customers of the small, dimly-lit shop by the side of the road."],"exits":[{"to":94,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":92,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":115,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go dimly-lit shop"}]},
  {"id":94,"x":-110,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Oxenwaithe Bridge","descriptions":["This bridge is wide and sturdy, its strong oaken planks weathered but in good repair.  Across this span must stream all the traffic directly proceeding to or coming from the Northern and Western Tiers.  Oxcarts laden with imports and exports rumble past."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":93,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":114,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Oxenwaithe Bridge"]},
  {"id":95,"x":-40,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Water Street","descriptions":["A fascinating mix of townsfolk and adventurers pass by, frequenting the taverns, shops and bathhouse in this part of town, or taking the scenic path along the east bend in the Oxenwaithe on their way to or from far-off destinations."],"exits":[{"to":96,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":35,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":96,"x":10,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Water Street","descriptions":["The low, long Orem's Bathhouse building squats along the north side of Water Street.  Its reddish-brown walls feel warm and moist to the touch.  People emerge all relaxed and rosy-cheeked while clients entering look sorely in need of a good, hot bath.  Orem is famed for his clean establishment and for the lack of problems the place generates for the local guard house."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":95,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":325,"exit":"go","move":"go bathhouse"}]},
  {"id":97,"x":-230,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Scorpion Lane","descriptions":["The east end of the lane here seems dark and shabby, with cloaked figures striding by, strangely silent.  A few wealthy traders, surrounded by private mercenaries, hurry by, glancing to and fro nervously.  A lone town deputy patrols the cobbled road, conspicuously avoiding the shadowy areas around the characterless buildings."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":98,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":98,"x":-310,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["Kertigen Road intersects Scorpion Lane to the east.  Due west rise the town walls, which the road here follows, straight north to the gate leading to the Northern Tier, and almost all the way south to the banks of the Segoltha.  The crowds jostling you on all sides bear eloquent, if annoying, testament to this street's crucial position."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":97,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":99,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":99,"x":-310,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["The calls of a few creatures, some bird and other wild beings, reach your ears from just over the town wall here.  Though the walls are high enough to protect the Crossing, the scents of hill and forest cannot be kept out, nor can the winds from the mountains and plateaus to the west."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":71,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":100,"x":-330,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Swithen's Court","descriptions":["A thatched house with a cruck frame sits on a small plot of land here.  Its archaic, rustic design reminds you that this part of town used to be crofts and farmland, until the walls were extended in the quest for more living space and protection."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":101,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Swithen's Court"]},
  {"id":101,"x":-350,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Swithen's Court","descriptions":["Gaunt hounds root around in the rubbish that lines the street and the sewage ditches here.  Their forlorn yelps echo off the closely-spaced housing blocks of the town's working poor.  Built of humble mud bricks and flammable wood, they lean out across the narrow street.  Across the narrow gap, standing on rickety landings or balconies, neighbors call to each other with the latest gossip, or quarrel or trade bawdy stories."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":102,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":102,"x":-370,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Swithen's Court","descriptions":["The ruins of the old prison stand here, due north of the newly built Drelstead Prison.  It is nothing but a charred pile of rubble, mute testament to some old uprising or invasion to free ransom prisoners or those of conscience.  The local elders may still recall, most though have forgotten."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":439,"exit":"go","move":"go prison ruins"}]},
  {"id":103,"x":-330,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Inkhorne Street","descriptions":["The cobblestones are uneven and crumbling here, and a view to the west down the narrow street indicates ramshackle single story huts long inured to neglect.  The bustling traffic and commerce that is carried by Kertigen Road due east does not seem to stray down this path."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":104,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Inkhorne Street"]},
  {"id":104,"x":-350,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Inkhorne Street","descriptions":["A beggar hobbles by you, swathed in rags.  As you try to ignore his pleas, you cannot help notice that through one of his torn sleeves is visible a purple, raised scar -- the brand of justice which marks him as a former long-term inhabitant of the town's infamous Drelstead Prison, which lies at the end of this street."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":105,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":105,"x":-370,"y":66,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Inkhorne Street","descriptions":["A three-story brick building, with slits for windows, covered by iron bars, abruptly blocks your way.  The path is strewn with garbage, and an open ditch brimming with filth runs around the structure and out under the town wall which stands directly behind it.  Before the grim building, some workmen are mending a raised wooden platform on which stands a gallows."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Drelstead Prison"]},
  {"id":106,"x":-330,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Elmod Close","descriptions":["Elmod Close, a quiet dead end, merges to the east with bustling Kertigen Road.  The shouts of workmen and merchants can be heard from that direction, and the clattering of wagons and barrows laden with trade goods.  A few locals rest under the shady elmod trees that line the street and engage in idle banter about the affairs of the neighborhood."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":107,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Elmod Close"]},
  {"id":107,"x":-350,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Elmod Close","descriptions":["Some modest, single-story residences line the street here, long buildings with a single door in the middle, and hoary thatched roofs.  You notice both people and livestock crossing the thresholds of some of the homes, which apparently serve as living quarters, hearth and manger.  The cobbled streets of the lane are strewn with straw."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":108,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":108,"x":-370,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Elmod Close","descriptions":["The street ends here and the pavement gives way to rich, damp earth.  A small garden plot extends west, the apparent pride and joy of the dwellers at this end of the lane.  It is carefully tended, with piles of fertilizer lovingly heaped around green, tender seedlings.  A scarecrow done up like a raggedy Gor'Tog keeps the winged neighborhood riffraff away."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":109,"x":-310,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["Although there is a varied mix of adventurers and townsfolk around you, the section of the Crossing just east strikes you as somewhat disreputable.  The walls that parallel Kertigen Road on its western edge offer security from the evils that dwell without, but do little to protect against those miscreants who choose to make the city streets their hunting grounds."],"exits":[{"to":110,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":98,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":-310,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["Your journey brings you hard in the shadow of the town walls here, that separate the Crossing from the wilds of the Western Tier.  The northwest corner of the barricades lies a few hundred paces north, where the gates are guarded throughout all watches of the day and night."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":109,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":111,"x":-310,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Kertigen Road","descriptions":["The rather unsavory side of the Viper's Nest Inn borders the east side of the curb.  Its windows are dirty and opaque, except where panes of glass have been shattered here and there.  The sounds and smells that emanate from it are rank and unappetizing, but you figure it must appeal to a certain clientele.  Draft animals, carts, soldiers, and traders stream by, in between ragamuffin urchins and stray dogs picking at the rubbish heaps around the inn."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":110,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":112,"x":-310,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Goodwhate Pike","descriptions":["Old woodframe buildings that appear to be vacant border the wide pike here.  Heavy traffic has taken its toll, leaving deep ruts and almost demolishing the curb, so that the already decrepit mud-and-twig structures almost seem to spill out upon the road.  You have no doubt that, during the height of the rainy season, they literally do.  Directly west lies the Western Gate."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":111,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":121,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":113,"x":-230,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Goodwhate Pike","descriptions":["A long, barn-like structure hunkers just by the road here, wedged between the cobbled way and the high outer walls of town that lie just north.  A very high, very wide double door leads in and from it you hear the lowing of oxen, the whinnying of steeds and the braying of obstinate pack animals.  An exotic-looking trader in a silk robe forcibly leads a recalcitrant camel from the building, almost knocking you over.","A long, barn-like structure hunkers just by the road here, wedged between the cobbled way and the high outer walls of town that lie just north.  A very high, very wide double door leads in and from it the lowing of oxen, the whinnying of steeds and the braying of obstinate pack animals can be heard.  An exotic-looking trader in a silk robe forcibly leads a recalcitrant camel from the building, almost knocking a nearby attendant to the ground."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":119,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":112,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":568,"exit":"go","move":"go barnlike structure"}]},
  {"id":114,"x":-190,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Goodwhate Pike","descriptions":["The gates to the west, the river and Oxenwaithe Bridge to the east, the town walls and dense forests and scrub just beyond to the north - all serve to remind you of the dichotomy between the untamed forces of nature and the works of mortals that life in Elanthia constantly confronts you with.  Such cosmic musings are soon cut short, however, as a foul-smelling Dwarf barbarian shoves you aside rudely and lumbers past.","The gates to the west, the river and Oxenwaithe Bridge to the east, the town walls and dense forests and scrub just beyond to the north - all serve as a reminder of the dichotomy between the untamed forces of nature and the works of mortals that life in Elanthia constantly confronts its inhabitants with.  Such cosmic musings are soon cut short, however, as a foul-smelling Dwarf barbarian shoves aside a few passersby rudely and lumbers past."],"exits":[{"to":94,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":115,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":113,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":115,"x":-190,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Varlet's Run","descriptions":["This murky lane connects the Viper's Nest Inn, whose entrance is to the southwest, and the Pawnshop, whose doors are just east, around the corner.  Anonymous but brisk traffic between the two establishments makes you wonder whether the patrons are pawning their goods to buy more drink or are relieving themselves of slightly hot merchandise acquired in some ill-lit nook of the tavern."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":93,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":116,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":119,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":338,"exit":"go","move":"go scruffy doorway"}]},
  {"id":116,"x":-190,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Cutpurse Alley","descriptions":["Cutpurse Alley runs between the Pawn Shop on the east side of the way, and the notorious Viper's Nest Inn on the west.  You feel a mob of shadowy figures skulking past you, although you can discern no one clearly.  The hot breath of a covetous scoundrel on the nape of your neck reminds you of how this byway got its name and causes you to quicken your step."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":117,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":117,"x":-190,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Damaris Lane","descriptions":["Unlike most of the Crossing's broad and expansive intersections, the corners where Damaris Lane meets Cutpurse Alley are shadowy and sinister.  Though the junction makes for a small plaza of sorts, there is a claustrophobic feel here that does not bode well."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"north","move":"script crossingtrainerfix north"},{"to":91,"exit":"east","move":"script crossingtrainerfix east"},{"to":118,"exit":"south","move":"script crossingtrainerfix south"},{"to":120,"exit":"west","move":"script crossingtrainerfix west"},{"to":367,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go academy"}]},
  {"id":118,"x":-190,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Dodgers' Row","descriptions":["Feet tread the cobbled streets here, booted feet, sandaled feet, armored feet, rag-wrapped feet, all thumping against the pavement and reverberating off the closely-spaced, rundown buildings.  In the slimy gutter, along the west curb, a pile of dry straw has been heaped up against a sewer grating."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":87,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":295,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sewer grating"}]},
  {"id":119,"x":-230,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Varlet's Run","descriptions":["This is a small, foul-smelling byway that most civilized folks would flee through as quickly as their feet would carry them.  And yet, this lane seems to exert a perverse fascination, a hint of things unseen, sinister or forbidden always just about to transpire."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":115,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":707,"exit":"go","move":"go dark shrine"}]},
  {"id":120,"x":-210,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Damaris Lane","descriptions":["Broken bottles, filthy rags, rotting food and less identifiable rubbish litter the road just in front of the unsavory Viper's Nest Inn.  There seems to be no usable sidewalks, or else the curbs and cobblestones are in such disrepair that there is no way to tell where one ends and the other begins.  Trying to avoid either stumbling or stepping in something awful, you pick your way along, with evident distaste and distrust."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":708,"exit":"go","move":"go viper's inn"}]},
  {"id":121,"x":-341,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Western Gate","descriptions":["Camels, oxen, and mules compete with Elves, Gor'Togs, and Humans to pass through the narrow gate which breaches the stone wall between town and the western reaches.  The lowing of animals, and the bellowing of irate travelers become almost indistinguishable the more you listen.  After a few minutes, so do the unmistakable odors of unwashed sojourners and domestic beasts of burden.  It begins to dawn on you why folks are anxious to pass through customs, whatever the cost, as quickly as possible."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":172,"exit":"go","move":"go western gate"},{"to":398,"exit":"go","move":"go stone stairs"},{"to":712,"exit":"go","move":"go guard house"}]},
  {"id":122,"x":10,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Truffenyi Place","descriptions":["Truffenyi Place runs straight along the north-south axis of the Crossing and leads to the Guilds and Academy, vital institutions of town life.  A quiet but constant buzz of citizens and adventurers engaged in missions, commerce, debate and worship fills the street.  More pronounced are the peals of amiable laughter and snippets of modest songs that come from Taelbert's Inn, perched proudly on the west curb."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":128,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":31,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":465,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":713,"exit":"go","move":"go inn"}]},
  {"id":123,"x":10,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Truffenyi Place","descriptions":["Stands of sicle trees shade the intersection here, and continue to line the lane leading west.  Your path follows the town wall, which takes a 90-degree turn here from east to north.  Over the wall, to the west, beyond the low fruit trees, you see taller, darker vegetation, as though the forest itself is gathering its forces to lay siege to this outpost of civilization set among the wilderness."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":122,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":126,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":124,"x":10,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Truffenyi Place","descriptions":["The road here is smooth and clear of debris, the cobblestones underfoot flawlessly dressed.  To the north, the way opens into a wide plaza, paved in bright mosaics depicting the gods of Elanthia in their benevolent and terrifying aspects.  To the south and west, lie the Tannery and the way to the Rangers' Guild."],"exits":[{"to":125,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":123,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":125,"x":10,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Fostra Square","descriptions":["Truffenyi Place ends in a broad plaza here, a pleasant river- and pine-scented breeze greeting you in the open space.  Several tall, sculpted columns flank a heavily-carved rosewood door that serves as the entryway to the Clerics' Guild.  The sounds of muttered chants, invocations and lessons are audible from the building's stained-glass windows."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"south","move":"script crossingtrainerfix south"},{"to":344,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go guild"},{"to":366,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go hovel"},{"to":725,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go portico gate"}],"aliases":["Fostra Square"]},
  {"id":126,"x":-30,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Sicle Grove Lane","descriptions":["A low, shed-like building stands beneath the trees along the road here.  It has a gabled roof that dips off to the side, covering a smaller annex from which a vent disgorges noxious vapors into the street.  Various antlers, skulls, and tusks decorate the outside of the shed."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":127,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":220,"exit":"go","move":"go tanner's shed"}]},
  {"id":127,"x":-70,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Sicle Grove Lane","descriptions":["The town wall here is overgrown with flowering vines and herbs, making it appear to be a barrier of intertwining branches and blossoms.  A small path leads north through an ivy-covered gateway in the wall.  Though the trail may have been a temporary one at first, long years of use by visitors to and from the Rangers' Guild at its end have assured its permanent existence."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":336,"exit":"go","move":"go ivy-covered gateway"}]},
  {"id":128,"x":50,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Covered Alleyway","descriptions":["This alleyway runs between Gildleaf Circle and Truffenyi Place.  It is covered with a makeshift tin canopy supported by iron nails in the closely-spaced buildings.  Although narrow and unpaved, it is free of debris and appears to be frequented for deliveries and shortcuts.  An archway on one side leads between the buildings."],"exits":[{"to":129,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":122,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":463,"exit":"go","move":"go side door"}]},
  {"id":129,"x":90,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gildleaf Circle","descriptions":["Mouthwatering aromas, gentle laughter and refined conversation emanating from the quaint twin cottages here make this corner of the Crossing a popular destination.  The famed shop of the town's leading purveyor of fine victuals, Barsabe the Halfling, snuggles next to the bakery of Saranna, his wife of many years.  Rotund boys scurry between both shops and dart out with baskets and trays laden with fresh delicacies.  A narrow alley runs between the two shops and leads west."],"exits":[{"to":132,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":130,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":128,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":870,"exit":"go","move":"go grocer"},{"to":464,"exit":"go","move":"go baker"}]},
  {"id":130,"x":130,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gildleaf Circle","descriptions":["The wide path curves here, its borders marked in high, straight marble curbstones.  Beds of flowers and foliage separate the street from the sidewalk, and still more trees and shrubs separate the walkways from the residences.  Around the bend to the west are the busy shops of the Grocer and Baker, while north is the quirky storefront of Elanthia's most adept and eccentric Alchemist, Chizili."],"exits":[{"to":131,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":129,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":131,"x":130,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gildleaf Circle","descriptions":["Pungent, noxious fumes waft out of the open door of the Alchemist's Shop on the west side of the street here.  Vapors of sulfur, formaldehyde, alcohol and methane are just a few of the odors you can identify, among myriad more you'd rather not hazard a guess at.  Serious, stooped figures with long, grey locks or beards go and come through the door, oblivious to the choking miasma."],"exits":[{"to":135,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":136,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":130,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":226,"exit":"go","move":"go alchemist's shop"}]},
  {"id":132,"x":90,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gildleaf Circle","descriptions":["Well-heeled folk stroll past on their way south for a bite to eat or to errands in the heart of the Crossing.  Draped in rich fur cloaks, velvets and brocades, sporting rings and brooches of rare gems and precious metals, these prosperous burghers seem a far cry from the veteran, hardened adventurers encountered elsewhere within the city limits.  They are even more remote from the shanty dwellers of the Middens, who subsist on the outskirts of society."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":129,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":133,"x":90,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Eylhaar Bane Road","descriptions":["Eylhaar Bane Road curves sharply here to become the expansive arc of Gildleaf Circle, a broad, clean road with gravel shoulders and terrazzo sidewalks.  The footpaths are lined with cultivated beds of azaleas and marigolds between rows of ornamental dwarf fruit trees and dazzling gildleaf shrubs.  Ornate gingerbread cottages and elegant townhouses with wrought-iron balconies and grillwork are set back from the curb, behind sturdy gates or thickets of topiary."],"exits":[{"to":135,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":132,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":134,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go almhara arch"},{"to":735,"exit":"go","move":"go stone building"}]},
  {"id":134,"x":50,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"North Gate, Gate","descriptions":["Nearly forgotten and in disrepair, the North Gate sits untended among a cluster of weeds.  Thorny vines grow unheeded against its crumbling archway, and the decorative carvings along the sides of the arch have long since eroded to impressionistic ridges and gashes.  Deep ruts slicing through the road's surface waylay unwary travelers even in the daylight.","Nearly forgotten and in disrepair, the North Gate sits untended among a cluster of weeds.  Night's dim light casts shadows among the impressionistic ridges and gashes covering the sides of the arches:  all that erosion has left of once magnificent decorative carvings.  Loose stones scattered across the broken pavement threaten to send unwary travelers sprawling."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":173,"exit":"go","move":"go crumbling archway"}]},
  {"id":135,"x":130,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Eylhaar Bane Road","descriptions":["Looking north, scanning from east to west, you can see the profiles of the Paladins' and Clerics' Guilds rising above the shops and homes that dot the neighborhood like patches of a crazy quilt.  To the south, you can barely discern the top story of Academy Asemath, with its white marble friezes in high relief.  A row of prickly privet hedges, their intertwining branches creating a formidable fence, line both sides of the way."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":131,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":133,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1336,"exit":"go","move":"go lattice-work gate"}]},
  {"id":136,"x":200,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Flamethorn Way","descriptions":["Tapering flamethorn trees line the road, their scarlet leaves swaying vividly against the sky in a slight breeze.  A red-crested woodpecker, invisible among the branches until it reveals itself with a sharp *RAT-TAT-TAT* in search of food, harshly chides you for interrupting its meal and flits away, over the rooftops of the Healing Hospital and Empaths' Guild to the east.  To the south, the tree-lined path continues."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":131,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":248,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate"}]},
  {"id":137,"x":170,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Eylhaar Bane Road","descriptions":["Low, long houses border the south side of the road here, simple, one-room affairs with doors in the center, and chimney holes cut through the thatched roofs.  The lowing of cattle from within also bespeaks of the humbleness of the inhabitants."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":135,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":822,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"},{"to":736,"exit":"go","move":"go thatched cottage"}]},
  {"id":138,"x":210,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Herald Street","descriptions":["Herald Street leads west here into Eylhaar Bane Road.  A few modest residences hug the curb, and you swerve to avoid a group of children hard at play.  They are wielding whittled sticks and trash can covers as they engage each other in mock battles and jousts."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":139,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":137,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":139,"x":210,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Firulf Vista","descriptions":["The roads here follow the inner perimeter of the town walls, meeting at a right angle.  Sparse, colorful wildflowers have taken root in the crevices where the walls abut here.  Several blocks north rises the building that houses the Paladins' Guild.  Light glints off its crystal-paned skylight and circular stained-glass windows, surrounding the edifice with an aura of power and purity."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":140,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":994,"exit":"go","move":"go society hall"}]},
  {"id":140,"x":330,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Firulf Vista","descriptions":["Firulf Vista is a broad thoroughfare leading to the northeastern town gate.  Farther to the east, beyond the crenellated tops of the town walls, is the tall, thin spire of the Warrior Mages' Guild, and the dark, swelling hills of the wilderness that lies outside the safety of the confines of civilization."],"exits":[{"to":143,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":141,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":139,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":141,"x":330,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Via Mandroga","descriptions":["This narrow alley leads between the northern angle of the town wall and the Arena.  The backdoor to the Healing Hospital and to the Empaths' Guild is here, and burlap bags filled with soiled gauze, empty vials and the remains of herbs and potions litter the gutter.  A few bold mice nibble at the heaps of debris."],"exits":[{"to":140,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":2,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":737,"exit":"go","move":"go hospital backdoor"}]},
  {"id":142,"x":210,"y":-568,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Herald Street","descriptions":["The town wall is close to the side of the road here, affording a roost for the wrens and crows that make their more permanent homes in the woods beyond the ramparts to the east."],"exits":[{"to":788,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":138,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":143,"x":370,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Firulf Vista","descriptions":["The stone town walls seal off the city from the wilds beyond to the north.  Still, the scents of damp earth and leaf mold, pine and cedar, and feral creatures drift over the barricade.  Directly to the east, within spitting distance, is the Northeast town gate.  Through the gap in the wall, you can make out the low rise of the slate hills to the northwest and the lone, aloof tower of the Warrior Mages' Guild to the east."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":144,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":140,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":144,"x":370,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Boar Alley","descriptions":["This quaint alley connects Magen Road to the south and Firulf Vista to the north.  An ornately carved building with an ancient wooden door is set back from the curb.  You would hardly stop and give it a second glance, except that the windows on the second story all seem to glow with soft, pulsating hues that cycle through the colors of the spectrum."],"exits":[{"to":143,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":147,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":3,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":738,"exit":"go","move":"go ancient door"}]},
  {"id":145,"x":410,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Firulf Vista","descriptions":["Utter bedlam confronts you as you step out into this street.  This is the point where anyone and everyone who passes through the Northeast Gate either leaving town or arriving must cross paths.  You quickly conclude this is no spot to stop and admire the scenery of the regions of the Eastern Tier beyond, nor to study the local architecture around you, since the momentum of the crowd carries you along, almost without your realizing it."],"exits":[{"to":146,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":147,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":143,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":386,"exit":"go","move":"go stone stairway"}]},
  {"id":146,"x":440,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Northeast Customs","descriptions":["Here stands the Northeast Gate, two massive doors of steel-banded ironwood securely attached to the masonry of the town walls.  The traffic here is thick with travelers, and the Customs Officers are alert to any sign of trouble."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":171,"exit":"go","move":"go northeast gate"},{"to":806,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"}],"aliases":["NE Customs"]},
  {"id":147,"x":410,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Oralana Ramble","descriptions":["Oralana Ramble runs along the east wall of town, leading between the Northeast and the Eastern Gates.  Somehow, it is relatively calm compared to those roads that lead to the Town Green, Town Hall, the Bank and the other nerve centers of the Crossing.  The three towers guarding the temple thrust into the sky to the southwest, their flames a beacon for miles.  A bluejay lands on a ledge atop the wall, chasing a pair of mudwrens from their comfy perch into a clump of weeds along the side of the path.","Oralana Ramble runs along the east wall of town, leading between the Northeast and the Eastern Gates.  Somehow, it is relatively calm and empty compared to those roads that lead west and southwest to the Town Green, Town Hall, the Bank and the other vital nerve centers of the Crossing.  The three towers guarding the temple thrust into the sky to the southwest, their flames a beacon for miles.  The shadowy images of nightingales swoop high in the sky, their gentle lullabies decorating the cool night air."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":148,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":144,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":148,"x":410,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Oralana Ramble","descriptions":["A great deal of traffic passes through here, as travelers, merchants, rogues, adventurers, ne'er-do-wells and savants make their way to and from the Eastern Tier.  The Ramble continues south, leading into the heart of the Crossing, while a stone's throw away are the northeast gates.  All these pedestrians make this the ideal location for the shop of Talmai the Cobbler, whose business in new footwear and repairs prospers despite his lack of shrewdness."],"exits":[{"to":147,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":149,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":436,"exit":"go","move":"go cobbler's shop"}]},
  {"id":149,"x":410,"y":-328,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Oralana Ramble","descriptions":["The road continues north and south, and merges on the west with Trothfang Street.  In that direction, you see the turquoise- and crimson-tiled dome of the Champions' Arena.  Your proximity to the town wall blocks out any view of the Eastern Tier which lies beyond it.  Lowering your gaze to the path beneath your feet, you notice a spotted beetle wriggle into a chink in the wall and disappear."],"exits":[{"to":148,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":150,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":4,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":854,"exit":"none","move":"go sewer grate"}]},
  {"id":150,"x":410,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Oralana Ramble","descriptions":["You are traveling just inside the eastern town wall.  Mosses, grasses, and weeds blooming with brilliant wildflowers grow between the road and the wall, climbing right up to the edge of the rampart itself.  The way bends to the southwest, and continues straight north toward the northeastern gate."],"exits":[{"to":149,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":151,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":151,"x":370,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Betany Street","descriptions":["Someone has taken the time and care to attach flowerpots to the stone wall here, and plant cheerful flowers and fragrant herbs in them.  It provides a lovely contrast to the fact that it was built to keep out marauders bringing death and destruction.  The wall curves gently northeast, and off in the distance to the west, on either side of the street, you see the Seamstress and the Jeweler's shop, both about a block away."],"exits":[{"to":150,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":154,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":152,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":152,"x":290,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Betany Street","descriptions":["Potted plants and verdant window boxes decorate the front of Marcipur's Stitchery here.  Climbing vines of maiden tress plants poke their tendrils into any nook or cranny afforded by the clean, white stucco walls, including windows and the door.  Rather plainly dressed women file into the Stitchery, while stunningly garbed ones, attired in the latest adventuring fashions, emerge, all smiles."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":153,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":435,"exit":"go","move":"go stitchery"}]},
  {"id":153,"x":250,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Betany Street","descriptions":["Adventurers jostle you in a hurry to reach their guilds for training, while those engaged in commerce or town affairs stride by with less urgent gaits.  You seem to come into full body contact with every pedestrian, and a few stray dogs to boot, since the road narrows here as Albreda Boulevard flows into Betany Street.  A low hedgerow due west divides this corner from the wide swath of Town Green while high above an iron Temple walkway hovers over the low outline of Town Hall to the southwest.","Adventurers stroll through the night air, some retiring to their guilds while others still intent on training stride purposefully in those directions.  The normally bustling area is peaceful, the twittering of a few nightingales interspersing with the quiet conversations of people just passing through.  Albreda Boulevard flows into Betany Street here, while a low hedgerow due west divides this corner from Town Green.  An iron Temple walkway hovers over the outline of Town Hall to the southwest."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":155,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":154,"x":370,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Dafora Row","descriptions":["The town wall marking the Eastern Tier continues north-south along here.  A back door with a thick iron padlock is opposite the wall.  You notice that there are marks and scratches around the padlock, as though it had been a target for thieves."],"exits":[{"to":151,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":157,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":155,"x":250,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Albreda Boulevard","descriptions":["This broad junction links Albreda Boulevard with the pleasant, tree-lined street to the west and the flower-dappled lane to the north.  Such a refreshing vista invites you to stop and soak in the town's atmosphere.  To the west you see the gabled slate roof of Town Hall.  From the northwest comes the hue and cry of itinerant merchants, peddlers and soothsayers, vying for the attention of the adventurers gathered there in the Town's Green."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":156,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":41,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":369,"exit":"go","move":"go jewelry shop"}]},
  {"id":156,"x":250,"y":-13,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Albreda Boulevard","descriptions":["The blank side of the Town Hall building stands to the west, its modest construction evident from this oblique angle.  Upscale emporiums and services line the east side of the broad boulevard here, with shoppers casually glancing in the windows and doors to see the latest in trade goods from the outlying lands of Elanthia."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":160,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":161,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":157,"x":370,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Dafora Row","descriptions":["Dafora Row runs along the easternmost path inside the town walls.  The backs of shops line the quiet byway, and travelers seeking to bypass the traffic on the main streets bound past, headed north and south on matters of great commercial or personal import."],"exits":[{"to":154,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":158,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":751,"exit":"go","move":"go oak tower"}]},
  {"id":158,"x":370,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Hodierna Way","descriptions":["The wall surrounding the town snakes from north to south directly to the east.  The towers of the Temple to the west cast a shadow that at times reaches clear to the pointed roof of the structure that guards the Eastern Gate.  To the north, a narrow, cheerful street opens up.","The wall surrounding the town snakes from north to south directly to the east.  The towers of the Temple to the west are barely seen in the dark, its merry lights minutely visible in the distance, twinkling through stained-glass windows.  To the north, a narrow, cheerful street opens up."],"exits":[{"to":157,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":162,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":159,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":159,"x":290,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Hodierna Way","descriptions":["Much of the heavy traffic that passes along Hodierna Way bespeaks of its place as a vital link through town to the shops, public institutions and the guilds, as well as to the observatory and rocky coast eastward beyond the wall.  Part of the rush here, no doubt, is generated by Catrox's Forge, where the repair and refurbishing of arms, armor and shields draws a constant clientele of ardent adventurers."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":160,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":228,"exit":"go","move":"go catrox's forge"}]},
  {"id":160,"x":250,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Hodierna Way","descriptions":["This busy intersection is a conduit for travelers -- wheeled, mounted or on foot -- moving in and out of the Eastern Gate or northwest to the heart of the city.  The Orders headquarters stands here, its doors open.  Due west is a granite structure, and to the southwest the skyline is dominated by the magnificent High Temple of Zoluren.","When no straggling pedestrian heads home for the night and no squeaking caravan wheels break the silence, sometimes a nightingale can be heard.  Lamps in the windows of the Orders headquarters show someone is working late, and light shines to the southwest, where the Temple illuminates the dark sky."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":159,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":163,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":42,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":382,"exit":"go","move":"go walkway ramp"},{"to":833,"exit":"go","move":"go order headquarters"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["First Land Herald","Herald","newspaper","news stand"]},
  {"id":161,"x":210,"y":-13,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Albreda Alley","descriptions":["Just behind the Town Hall, this short and obviously recent alley dead-ends at a new wooden building with a large sign over the door.  Toolbelted Dwarven builders and a variety of customers, many tanned and dressed in weathered buckskin, pass in and out."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":571,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":162,"x":410,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Eastern Gate","descriptions":["Camels, oxen and mules compete with Elves, Gor'Togs and Humans to pass through the Eastern Gate which leads to the Middens, and the Observatory beyond.  The lowing of animals and the bellowing of travelers become almost indistinguishable the more you listen.  After a few minutes, so do the mingled odors of unwashed sojourners and beasts of burden.  It begins to dawn on you why folks are anxious to pass through customs, whatever the cost, as quickly as possible."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":170,"exit":"go","move":"go eastern gate"},{"to":395,"exit":"go","move":"go stone stairs"},{"to":756,"exit":"go","move":"go guard house"}]},
  {"id":163,"x":250,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gull's View Lane","descriptions":["Off in the northern distance the solid granite side of the bank building overshadows the west side of the street with small, barred windows and an impressive length of spiked fence around the narrow service alley that runs along the curb.  The wide vista of Hodierna Way, one of the major routes through town and towards the Eastern Tier, lies to the north.  You can catch a glimpse of the Segoltha River to the south."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":164,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":164,"x":250,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gull's View Lane","descriptions":["Small shops and a few sparsely-stocked pushcarts line this street.  One elderly street vendor is selling small clay cups of steaming hot tea which he hawks with a hearty smile.  The clapboard buildings are weathered but well maintained, giving a shabbily genteel impression.  Shrill cries and the sound of rushing water drift up from the south, plaintive and forlorn, causing you to shake off a clammy chill.  Civilization, and the town's center, beckon to the north."],"exits":[{"to":163,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":165,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":757,"exit":"go","move":"go outdoor shrine"}]},
  {"id":165,"x":250,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Gull's View Terrace","descriptions":["Shrill calls of shorebirds sound overhead, while the scent of mingled river and sea water fills the air on this terraced overlook.  Multihued blue currents form swirling patterns just off the riverbank, the inexorable forces of Elanthia's three major moons holding the tide's ebb and flow in their sway.  Gulls, terns and stilt-legged fishers hover near the choppy surface, some seeking man's leftovers, others pursuing nature's aquatic bounty.  To the east grows a stand of tall pine and cedar trees."],"exits":[{"to":164,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":174,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":166,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"}]},
  {"id":166,"x":250,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Winding Wooden Stairs","descriptions":["You are on some winding wooden stairs, with a strong, sea-tinged breeze tugging at your clothes.  The steps lead up to Gull's View Terrace and into the heart of town, and down to Landfall Jetty where the ships bringing travelers, merchants, adventurers and cargo to the Crossing pull into the dock."],"exits":[{"to":165,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":167,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":167,"x":250,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Landfall Jetty","descriptions":["Swarms of seafarers crowd the jetty here, some waiting to embark.  Others, looking a bit befuddled, have just disembarked.  On Landfall Dock just to the south, cargo from far ports is being off loaded at the same time that the varied commodities of the Crossing's crafty traders is being hoisted off carts and handtrucks."],"exits":[{"to":168,"exit":"go","move":"go dock"},{"to":166,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stair"},{"to":1017,"exit":"go","move":"go tidal cave"}]},
  {"id":168,"x":250,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Landfall Dock","descriptions":["The dock here is teeming with travelers, stevedores and bales and bales of goods.  The waves of the Segoltha River mingle with the darker blue, salty water of the ocean to the east, marking this as a deep water estuary.  Ships from all corners of Elanthia put into port here, bringing all the races and professions together in this waterfront town."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Landfall Dock"]},
  {"id":169,"x":-30,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Docks, South End","descriptions":["A cacophony of smells erupt from this bustling area, most notably those of ripe fish and new wood.  Created especially for handling passengers arriving from or departing to outlying towns and provinces, the dock is often lined with ships of varying types and sizes."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":368,"exit":"go","move":"go skirr'lolasu"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Docks","First Land Herald","Herald","newspaper","news stand"]},
  {"id":170,"x":439,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Tier, Outside Gate","descriptions":["The eastern gate of the Crossing stands before you, an incomplete, but serviceable stone structure.  To the north are grey slate hills rising out of dense clumps of deobar trees and groves of tall almur poplars.  The land to the east is flat, and dips and rises almost imperceptibly into the distance.  A single, wide path winds through it, surrounded by ruins, debris and small huts."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":162,"exit":"go","move":"go eastern gate"},{"to":170,"exit":"go","move":"go stunted bushes"},{"to":395,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}],"aliases":["E Gate","East","egate"],"linksTo":"Map8_Crossing_East_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":171,"x":480,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"Northeast Wilds, Outside Northeast Gate","descriptions":["You are before the Northeast Gate of the Crossing, surrounded by wayfarers and adventurers also in mid-journey.  Above, guardsmen stare down from the thick stone wall that encloses the city, wary for hostile visitors.  Whether they travel to destinations in town or farther west, or to the north and east, they all appear to be seeking something beyond themselves."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":386,"exit":"climb","move":"climb battlement wall"}],"aliases":["NE Gate","NTR","NEGATE"],"linksTo":"Map7_NTR.xml"},
  {"id":172,"x":-401,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"Mycthengelde, Flatlands","descriptions":["Well-worn paths lead through a grove of trees to a gate in The Crossing's western wall.  Now and again you hear birds calling to one another in the branches, or the bustling of a merchant's cart as it makes its way past.  A handful of adventurers nod at you in greeting as they make their way into town.  An aromatic mix of wildflowers mingles with wyndwood, oak and juniper trees as the grove stretches north and south, while to the west, you can see grassy flatlands through a small clearing."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":121,"exit":"go","move":"go western gate"},{"to":398,"exit":"climb","move":"climb town wall"}],"aliases":["W Gate","West","wgate"],"linksTo":"Map4_Crossing_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":173,"x":80,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"North Turnpike, Forest","descriptions":["Plunging into the woods, the road deteriorates still further into a track of loose stones and cobbles.  Brambles, spike bushes, and poison fern line the edges of the turnpike, forming an impassable barrier to anyone who wished to explore the depths of the forest."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":134,"exit":"go","move":"go crumbling arch"}],"aliases":["N Gate","North","ngate"],"linksTo":"Map6_Crossing_North_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":174,"x":290,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Way","descriptions":["Fragrant cedars and majestic pine trees line a narrow dirt path that ambles eastward along the north bank of the Segoltha, its swift waters churning with the silt and bustle of nearby Landfall Dock.  Small cabins and fishermens' crofts dot the landscape between the trees, the peaceful riverside community blending seamlessly into its idyllic setting."],"exits":[{"to":175,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":165,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":175,"x":330,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Way","descriptions":["The thick girths of tall pines form a living colonnade either side of the path, before branching ever upward to meet high overhead in a canopy of perfumed evergreen.  A thick layer of drying needles and kernel-laden cones carpets the ground, muting all sound save for the eternal whisper of the wind."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":174,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":176,"x":370,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Way","descriptions":["The path dips slightly as it meanders around a small hollow close to the riverbank, the black soil of the forest floor occasionally broken by smooth river rocks spread with a thin layer of wind-scattered needles.  Mud stains on the bark of nearby trees demonstrate the high-water mark achieved by the river during periods of heavy rainfall."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":175,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":177,"x":390,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["A platoon of tall cedars encircles and shelters a flat clearing of packed dark earth, their branches casting spindly shadows across the oft-trodden ground.  A huge firepit dominates the center of the clearing, its soot-blacked red clay lining dug from the shore of the Segoltha.  The tantalizing aroma of roasting meat lingers perpetually in the air."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":178,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":180,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":181,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":176,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":182,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":183,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Riverpine Circle"]},
  {"id":178,"x":410,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["A thickly wooded path slopes down gently to the southwest from this grassy clearing perched atop a rotund hillock.  Cabins stand beneath the trees, hazy curls of sweet-smelling woodsmoke drifting from their chimneys and floating up to the branches above.  The town walls of the Crossing rise silently in the distance to the west, visible through occasional gaps in the dense foliage."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":179,"x":390,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["Lush branches mesh overhead to drape this clearing in cool, deep shadow.  Cabins nestle beneath the leafy ceiling, sleepy and half-hidden by rambling berry bushes, their foundations firmly seated in the spongy bed of dark green mosses that thrives on the moist, loamy soil of the forest floor."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":180,"x":410,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["Even the most robust trees on this rocky stretch of the riverbank offer little resistance to the brisk breeze that blusters up from the water, their trunks and boughs swept into uniform angular shapes by years of exposure.  A huddle of low-lying bothies braves the rugged location, the boldness of their occupants in the face of nature's whim rewarded by an enviable view of the river."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":181,"x":390,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["A gathering of tidy log cabins enjoys a slightly elevated location overlooking the choppy waters of the Segoltha, where the swift brown flow plunges like an arrow toward the distant ocean.  Patches of wildflowers grow between the homes, their colorful splashes of pink and yellow contrasting pleasantly with the muted, earthy tones of the woodland."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":182,"x":370,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["Thick banks of ferns flourish between the evergreens, their dappled fronds laden with deep green seed pods.  Despite the vigorous growth of trees and underbrush, a small clearing emerges from the verdant riot, revealing neat cabins set among the trunks and grasses.  A faint salt breeze mingles with the cool scents of the forest."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":183,"x":370,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Riverpine Circle","descriptions":["Streaks of daylight filter through the thick canopy of branches, picking out the busy wings of tiny birds and glinting softly on a mist of spores that drifts on the still air.  Tangled brambles flourish in hearty clumps around the trunks of surrounding trees, their thorny fingers twisting across the paths that lead to the homes sitting within the clearing.","Moonlight filters through the thick canopy of branches, occasionally flickering with the erratic flight of bats and glinting off the delicate wings of the insects they hunt.  Tangled brambles flourish in hearty clumps around the trunks of surrounding trees, their thorny fingers twisting across the paths that lead to homes sitting within the clearing."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":184,"x":155,"y":-35,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Carousel Square","descriptions":["A massive conical building rises from the cobbles at the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly against the drab backdrop of the surrounding stone and wood.  A bejeweled mosaic set above an oval doorway reads THE CAROUSEL.","A massive conical building rises from the cobbles at the square's center, its snowy alabaster surfaces gleaming brilliantly against the drab backdrop of the surrounding stone and wood.  Rows of torches encircle the structure's girth, their flames wavering lightly with the surrounding commotion and casting the building in sconces of shifting red tint.  A bejeweled mosaic set above an oval doorway reads \"THE CAROUSEL.\"  "],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":185,"exit":"go","move":"go oval doorway"},{"to":1023,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":185,"x":130,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, The Carousel","descriptions":["Exotic tapestries of every possible description drape the wall ringing the Carousel's core.  A circular roof supports a vast framework of iron and timbers rising to the building's apex.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights within the structure form the strikingly complex and beautiful mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":186,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":188,"exit":"go","move":"go registration desk"},{"to":993,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Carousel","Vault"]},
  {"id":186,"x":120,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Carousel Booth","descriptions":["A polished steel lever protrudes from the eastern wall of the small, ebony-panelled room, flanking a steel door to the north."],"exits":[{"to":187,"exit":"go","move":"pull lev;go door"},{"to":185,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":187,"x":120,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Carousel Chamber","descriptions":["A sturdy vault, set in the back wall, stands ready for your use.  The floor is covered by a soft thick carpet of deep red, and the walls are paneled in polished gold pine.  Looking at the back wall, you notice a tiny gap between it and the rest of the room.   Resting on a polished bronze stand is a tiny porcelain figure."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"none","move":"close vault;go door"}]},
  {"id":188,"x":130,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Carousel Desk","descriptions":["A long wooden desk spans the width of the western wall.  Brass lanterns hang from the ceiling, and the floor behind the desk is covered in spotless red tile."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":973,"exit":"go","move":"go registrar's office"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Lost and Found"]},
  {"id":189,"x":159,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Berolt's Dry Goods, Showroom","descriptions":["Rough walls and floors covered with a gritty layer of dirt attest to the constant traffic in what must be one of the more popular establishments in town.  Shelves and counters crowd together, displaying all manner of equipment for a rugged lifestyle in an orderly, if dustridden manner.  Berolt, the proprietor, keeps a close eye on business, but still manages a quick, hearty laugh at a rather bawdy joke from a coarse-looking character who is obviously a regular visitor here."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":190,"exit":"go","move":"go scarred doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Berolt's Dry Goods","General"]},
  {"id":190,"x":159,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Berolt's Dry Goods, Storage","descriptions":["Except for a few dusty old crates and splintering barrels shoved up against one wall, this small, close room is bare.  On top of one barrel, someone's lunch of cheese and bread is awaiting their return, provided it survives the obvious interest of a tiny mouse, who is now snuffling among some of the larger crumbs."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"go","move":"go scarred doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Dry Goods Storage","weapon strap"]},
  {"id":191,"x":150,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Milgrym's Weapons, Showroom","descriptions":["This is a plain and businesslike shop carrying a wide variety of weapons.  A fair assortment of the wide range of methods to cut, bash, crush, eviscerate and otherwise discomfit your enemies can be had here.  Traders with exotic or unusual weapons are welcome to come in and dicker as Milgrym has an eye for bargains and an appreciation of good weapons."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Milgrym's Weapons","Weapons"]},
  {"id":192,"x":130,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Tembeg's Armory, Salesroom","descriptions":["This shop is filled with a goodly array of armor of all the more popular types.  Tembeg himself, a Gor'Tog of some skill at ironwork and smithing, believes in plain but serviceable goods.  Simple of speech, he prefers direct deals to bargaining and haggling.  Good armor at good prices is Tembeg's motto.  You may not find the latest fashions in engraved jousting plate, but you will find good, honest metal and sturdy workmanship."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"out","move":"script crossingtrainerfix out"},{"to":193,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tembeg's Armory","Armor"]},
  {"id":193,"x":130,"y":-210,"z":0,"title":"Tembeg's Armory, Workroom","descriptions":["This room, dark and crowded with iron-working tools, is where Tembeg and his assistants perform repairs and simple manufacturing of the armors and weapons sold here.  A massive set of bellows in the next room awaits the sweat and labor of someone sturdy enough to waken the forge fire into life.  A massive anvil takes up much of the rest of the floor space."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":194,"exit":"go","move":"go bellows room"}]},
  {"id":194,"x":130,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Tembeg's Armory, Bellows Room","descriptions":["A sweating Dwarf grunts at you and gestures towards a line of equally perspiring beings laboring to haul an enormous set of bellows up and down.  Somewhere nearby, a forge fire roars and hisses in time to the rush of air from the effort and someone beats a deep-voiced drum to call the cadence of work.  You keep muttering to yourself the old mantra \"That which does not kill you, makes you stronger\" as you grimly ready yourself."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Strength"]},
  {"id":195,"x":47,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Entrance","descriptions":["The magnificent and renowned grey granite edifice of the Asemath Academy stands here before you.  Solid and impressive, the buildings surround a wooded courtyard.  Though severe in decor, there is no denying the high Elvish heritage in the design and execution of this learned establishment.  Famed far and wide for its scholarship and teaching, many come here but few are allowed to enroll in its varied courses."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":196,"exit":"go","move":"go memorial arch"}],"aliases":["Asemath Academy"]},
  {"id":196,"x":37,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Porte-cochere","descriptions":["A flagstone pavement and a covered porte-cochere lead into the grounds of the Academy.  West of you the campus opens out into a series of lovely wooded gardens with the buildings arranged in a quadrangle all around it.  Students and professors stroll about, engaged in deep discussions or forming small study groups under the trees.  To either side of the entrance are the administration offices and the admissions center."],"exits":[{"to":197,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":198,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":199,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":195,"exit":"go","move":"go memorial arch"},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go low gate"}]},
  {"id":197,"x":37,"y":-296,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Administration Office","descriptions":["The administration office is staffed mostly with students working off their rather steep tuition fees.  Rows of plain desks covered with stacks of papers and untidy piles of scrolls are crammed in everywhere.  The elegant stonework of the walls still delights the eye, but the necessity of paperwork and the burden of success make the atmosphere a trifle less than stimulating here.  A senior clerk perches on a high stool with a desk to match and oversees the chaos."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":198,"x":37,"y":-276,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Admissions Center","descriptions":["This large room is busy at all hours of the day with hopeful people wishing to be admitted to this prestigious academy.  Harried clerks hand out application packets and explain rules and procedures to applicants.  Promising students are interviewed quietly at one side of the room and those who pass will be brought back for testing and more interviews.  The air is full of the smell of fresh parchment and nervous people."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Admissions Center"]},
  {"id":199,"x":27,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Eastern Walkway","descriptions":["A walkway paved with crushed stone in a soft blue-green hue runs between tastefully arranged copses of trees in a large central open area.  The trees show signs of Elvish life-sculpting and form harmonious groupings that display their dense foliage to perfect advantage.  Here and there, groups of flowering bushes or plantings of bright blossoms lend a serene touch of color to the scene.  Groups of students wander about or study quietly."],"exits":[{"to":207,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":196,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":206,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":200,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Ozursus"]},
  {"id":200,"x":7,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Central Fountain","descriptions":["Here in the center, at the very heart of the Academy, a fountain stands.  Carved with cunning and skill, it represents Knowledge pouring out her wisdom to a thirsty world and the academy's founder stooping to drink deeply of her gift.  Coins glitter in the pool, tossed there by superstitious students hoping for luck on an exam.  Walkways lead from here in several directions to other parts of the institution.","A fountain gurgles cheerfully somewhere nearby and the scent of plants and flowers fills the night air.  You stand in a large open space but you can sense the presence of buildings nearby."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":199,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":214,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":201,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":201,"x":-3,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Western Walkway","descriptions":["This walkway, shaded by trees, leads back to the kitchen and dining areas for the students and staff.  Believing that a full stomach aids the mind in learning, the founder provided that every student shall be well fed.  The cooks take this dictum to heart and there is always the smell of fresh pies or a good roast drifting on the breeze.  Several students sit nearby, working their way through their lessons and a large pile of fresh lemon cream tarts.","Trees block even the starlight and you see almost nothing.  Somewhere, someone is baking something wonderful to judge by the scent."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":202,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":202,"x":-13,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Western Hallway","descriptions":["This hallway divides the refectories from the kitchens.  There is a bustling of servants as they clear out the remains of the last meal and prepare for the next.  Students everywhere are perpetually hungry it seems. "],"exits":[{"to":217,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":201,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":216,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":203,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":203,"x":-23,"y":-286,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Western Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway ends here with the school kitchen's pantries and staff dining area."],"exits":[{"to":204,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":202,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":205,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":204,"x":-23,"y":-296,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Pantries","descriptions":["This room is crowded with barrels and crates and sacks of food of all kinds.  Bins full of flour, ice-boxes with cold meats and perishables and all the other things needed to keep a large assembly of very hungry people fed are in here."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":205,"x":-23,"y":-276,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Staff Refectory","descriptions":["This compact and elegant room serves the teaching staff as their dining room.  Small tables seat either two or four and softly padded chairs covered with fine leather are placed at each.  Crystal globes hold candles on each table that shed a soft golden light.  Crisp white cloths cover the tables.  The walls are painted with scenes of legend with themes of education and learning predominating."],"exits":[{"to":203,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":206,"x":27,"y":-276,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Path of Wisdom","descriptions":["The path here goes from the library entrance out to the quadrangle.  Low bushes line the walk and the path is smooth and well-paved.  The doors of the library gleam almost mystically here in the shaded light."],"exits":[{"to":199,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":759,"exit":"go","move":"go polished doors"}]},
  {"id":207,"x":27,"y":-306,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Freshman Walk","descriptions":["This path leads to the classroom used by the beginning students and has come by tradition to be called 'Freshman Walk'.  Scrupulously avoided by upperclassmen, it is an item of humor if a senior student has to go this way.  The path itself is laid out in soft green paving stones and the border is lined with benches for outdoor studying."],"exits":[{"to":208,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":209,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":199,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":208,"x":27,"y":-316,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Freshman Classroom","descriptions":["Long tables in neat rows face a lectern made of ebony wood.  Straight-backed chairs with no padding sit closely together at the tables.  The walls are a dusty rose colored marble and high windows allow a pure light in for clarity of seeing.  A large sign hangs on the wall above the lectern."],"exits":[{"to":207,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Freshman Classroom"]},
  {"id":209,"x":37,"y":-306,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Freshman Library","descriptions":["Books lie piled, sometimes waist high, in irregular stacks along the walls, in corners, and on a few cluttered desks.  Multicolored pillows scattered across the floor provide students with a comfortable seat and add to the tiny library's casual atmosphere.  A shelf along the wall houses dozens of volumes, the works of the Crossing's own talented writers."],"exits":[{"to":207,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Freshman Library"]},
  {"id":210,"x":7,"y":-296,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Northern Walkway","descriptions":["This walkway leads to some of the classrooms of the Academy.  Lined with sweet-scented flowers, it is a pleasant place to be almost any day of the year.","You stand on some sort of stone walkway.  There are pleasantly scented flowers nearby and in the distance, you can hear a fountain splashing."],"exits":[{"to":212,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":213,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":200,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":211,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":211,"x":-3,"y":-306,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Auditorium","descriptions":["This hall, used for lectures and other presentations, can hold the entire student body and faculty of the Academy.  Rows of benches for the students and chairs for the professors are arranged before a low platform for the speakers or guests.  The room is done in polished rosewood walls enlivened with woven hangings in abstract patterns.  Brass and crystal lightglobes hold candles for evening presentations."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Auditorium"]},
  {"id":212,"x":7,"y":-306,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Classroom","descriptions":["This large classroom is used at various times for general instruction and the more specialized classes.  Worktables with chairs sit in rows facing a larger table and lectern.  The walls are painted a cheerful powder blue with cream accents, and the tables are painted a soft grey.  In one corner, a group of anatomical skeletons are grouped for comparison.  The students have nicknamed them The Board of Regents."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Wisdom"]},
  {"id":213,"x":17,"y":-306,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Classroom","descriptions":["This classroom is done in tones of golden yellow and a gentle aqua.  Brightly varnished desks and chairs form neat rows facing the instructor's desk.  A large map of the world is hung from the front wall and a smaller map of some region unknown to you hangs next to it."],"exits":[{"to":210,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Intelligence"]},
  {"id":214,"x":7,"y":-276,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Southern Walkway","descriptions":["This path leads to the Performance and Arts wing.  Lined with low shrubs, alternating with small statues showing actors and other performers, the path is set with crushed white stone.  Many performances are held here to which the public is welcome and the art gallery is often open to the public for a small fee.","Dim humanoid shapes seem to rise up on both sides.  You tense for attack but realize with a start that they are but statues arrayed along a walkway."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":215,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":215,"x":7,"y":-266,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Artists' Hallway","descriptions":["This hallway is wide and high-ceilinged.  Often crowded before a performance, it is heavily carpeted, with upholstered benches scattered about."],"exits":[{"to":214,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":760,"exit":"go","move":"go stone door"},{"to":761,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":216,"x":-13,"y":-276,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Student Dining Hall","descriptions":["This is the dining room for the students.  Plain trestle tables and long benches are racked up against the wall so the staff can scrub the flagstone flooring.  At meal times this place gets very crowded and noisy as the students relax from their studies and fill themselves with the fine food served here.  The walls are an off-white, scrubbed till it gleams and the tables are made from a light-colored wood, bleached almost white as part of their cleaning."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":217,"x":-13,"y":-296,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Kitchens","descriptions":["These are the kitchens of the Academy.  Full of hustle and bustle most days, the cooks and scullery maids work long hours keeping the students and staff well-fed as the rules of the Founder dictate.  There is a large fireplace with several roasting spits and a huge cauldron for making soups and stews.  Heavy tables hold trays of fresh fruits and vegetables.  Racks of trays stand ready to hold their loads of breakfasts, lunches and dinners."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":218,"x":-40,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Ragge's Locksmithing, Salesroom","descriptions":["Through the mingled gloom of shadows and tobacco smoke, you can barely make out the vague outlines of some rather sinister looking figures as they skulk in and out of a room to the east.  On the heavily scarred counter, a single oil burning lamp provides the only pool of light in the room, which radiates only a few feet outward before being swallowed by the shadows."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":762,"exit":"go","move":"go shadows"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Ragge's Locksmithing","Locksmith"]},
  {"id":219,"x":190,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Mauriga's Botanicals, Salesroom","descriptions":["The clean, pungent scents of herbs, medicinal plants and dried flowers envelop you in the cheerful, soothing salesroom.  Mauriga the Botanist beams at you as she arranges bunches of stalks, leaves, roots and seeds hanging from cedar racks overhead in order to dry or concentrate their potent properties.  She sniffs at a vase filled with fragrant jadice flowers, picks the freshest one, and offers it to you.  You are sure her potions, salves and herbs must be of the highest quality."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":764,"exit":"climb","move":"climb carpeted stair"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mauriga's Botanicals","Herbs"]},
  {"id":220,"x":-30,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Falken's Tannery, Workshop","descriptions":["The Tannery, presided over by the ever-alert Falken, reeks of dead things, chemicals, and unwashed adventurers who rush in to sell or appraise their latest haul of skins and furs.  On the rough, deobar-paneled walls are mounted stuffed heads of animals, and specimens of birds and fish.  You are struck by the absence of stuffed reptiles, however.  On the counter lies a bundle of assorted furs and hides."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":126,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":570,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Bundles"]},
  {"id":221,"x":-40,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Falken's Tannery, Fitting Room","descriptions":["Here Falken personally fits you for your new hide, skin, fur or leather accoutrements.  A full-length sheet of metal, polished to a mirror-like finish, on the far wall reflects your image.  In the mirror's reflection, you also notice that the walls of the fitting room are hung with rare furs and exotic pelts, some of creatures you have only heard or dreamt about, but never seen.  On a cluttered worktable in the corner, awls, leather thongs and other tools of the trade are scattered about."],"exits":[{"to":220,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":222,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":222,"x":-50,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Falken's Tannery, Supply Room","descriptions":["Jars and bottles are neatly arranged on a number of well-made pine shelves affixed to the walls.  Several bins overflow with small tools and crude scrapers.  A bored clerk lounges on a stout chair behind a wide counter."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Falken's Tannery","Tannery"]},
  {"id":223,"x":-170,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Herilo's Artifacts, Showroom","descriptions":["Herilo the Artificer Exemplar squints over the marble counter muttering over a tattered manuscript.  You feel powerful forces at work all around you in this atelier of arcana.  A low cabinet of satiny shaal wood holds scrolls and parchments, as well as a small carved statue.  On hooks and trays around the room are beads, talismans, amulets, crystals and odd ornaments fashioned from animal parts of assorted and disgusting nature, for use as catalysts in the practice of magical arts and divination."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":224,"exit":"go","move":"go mother-of-pearl screen"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Herilo's Artifacts","Artificer's Shop","Magic"]},
  {"id":224,"x":-160,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Herilo's Artifacts, Consulting","descriptions":["High wooden chests, with row upon row of small, painstakingly labeled drawers, line the walls of this tiny room.  The only light seems to come from the mother-of-pearl screen that serves as the far wall.  A table, with a brass balance scale and small envelopes, vials and cloth pouches, is crammed between the chests.  It is here that Herilo prepares his charms, powders, potions and artifacts, as he holds forth on their various virtues, uses and cautions."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"go","move":"go mother-of-pearl screen"}]},
  {"id":225,"x":130,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green Northwest","descriptions":["The entrance to Tembeg's Armory is through a hacked-out breach in the thick hedges that border the Green here.  Tembeg, being a humble sort, has laid down a few planks leading into his establishment to serve as a walkway.  Samples of his work are hung on hooks on the exterior of the unpainted wood structure but no sign or other eye-catching gimmicks are noticeable."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":16,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":24,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":192,"exit":"go","move":"go armory"}],"aliases":["TGNW"]},
  {"id":226,"x":110,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Chizili's Alchemical Goods, Salesroom","descriptions":["An almost overwhelming array of scents attacks your nose the moment you enter this place.  While strikingly clean, the room is also filled with jars and barrels and pots and carboys of every size and description.  Bundles of dried herbs hang from racks overhead and glass amphorae are filled with strange animal parts being pickled.  Lore and Science, superstition and practicality meet in this place where alchemists can re-stock almost all their bizarre needs in one place."],"exits":[{"to":131,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":227,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Chizili's Alchemical Goods","Alchemy"]},
  {"id":227,"x":110,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Chizili's Alchemical Goods, Workroom","descriptions":["This small and cramped room is full of odds and ends not sold in the main store.  A long worktable holds a number of peculiar things and several varieties of philosopher's stone, none of which seem to work or else Chizili would not need to be in business."],"exits":[{"to":226,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":228,"x":290,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Catrox's Forge, Entryway","descriptions":["The forge of Catrox the Dwarf is known throughout the lands.  Here mundane metal is transformed into tools, and weapons, damaged armor and shields are made whole again.  This entryway is covered by a tin roof, with no walls, in the hope of letting some air into the smoky, noisy and sweltering compound.  The ringing of metal on metal, the sputtering of cinders and slag, the hissing of steel meeting water, all are audible from within."],"exits":[{"to":159,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":229,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Catrox's Forge","Repair Metal","repair leather","repair armor","repair weapons"]},
  {"id":229,"x":290,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Catrox's Forge, Work Room","descriptions":["Catrox has frugally combined his hearth and forge with a sales area, which must make perfect sense to him but tends to cause the customers to get a bit overheated.  Fortunately Catrox's affable manner and solid craftsmanship wins them over.  At the glowing forge, gathered around a huge bellows, are his two Dwarven apprentices.  The soot and smoke in the air, and the shimmering heat do not faze them."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":228,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging door"}]},
  {"id":230,"x":280,"y":50,"z":0,"title":"Catrox's Forge, Repairs","descriptions":["You shoulder your way through the crowd, some awaiting their armor, some wanting to get weapons sharpened or repaired, others with broken or badly battered shields in need of attention.  It is clear that the competent Catrox has all the business he can handle.  An apprentice dashes in with an overflowing armful of weapons, armor and shields, all affixed with tags, and tries to sort them out for the gathered customers."],"exits":[{"to":229,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":231,"x":170,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"First Provincial Bank, Lobby","descriptions":["Marble tiled floors covered with heavy rugs and walls of polished jasper that gleam a cool blue mark this bank as solid and secure (and expensive).  An official money-changing booth is to one side and a row of tellers windows faces you.  Several guards, armed and armored, stand ready for trouble of any sort.  Near the tellers stands a table of fine wood for those who need to do some writing."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":232,"exit":"go","move":"go money-changer's booth"},{"to":233,"exit":"go","move":"go tellers' windows"}],"aliases":["Bank"]},
  {"id":232,"x":170,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Provincial Bank, Money-changer","descriptions":["This small booth holds the official money-changing office for the town.  The clerk works behind a thickly barred window and you pass your money in and out via a small drawer that can only be worked by the clerk.  A well-padded chair is placed for your comfort while waiting for your money to be processed."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Exchange"]},
  {"id":233,"x":160,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Provincial Bank, Teller","descriptions":["A neat row of barred windows faces you along a marble counter.  Several patrons are already busy but there seems to be one window available.  The clerk smiles at you and beckons you over."],"exits":[{"to":231,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Teller"]},
  {"id":234,"x":60,"y":-242,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Lorethew Street","descriptions":["Here figures clad in black flowing robes, trimmed with white piping, wander past in a continuous parade.  The focus of the throng is the impressive structure to the northwest, the town's main seat of learning and scholarship, Academy Asemath.  It encompasses libraries, dormitories, convocations and lectures by the most respected thinkers of Elanthia.  Some of the facilities are open to the public, while others are restricted to faculty, students and alumni."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":20,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":36,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":235,"x":-230,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Riverfront Portage, Dock","descriptions":["The planks of this river dock float directly on the water's surface.  Tied together with thick ropes, they pitch and yaw as though you were already aboard a vessel.  Cold, greenish water sloshes up through the gaps and soaks your feet.  A group of Gor'Tog bargemen, garish tattoos on their bulging arms, scowl at you and laugh derisively.  A very discomfited dwarf stands at the water's edge of the dock, most anxious to return upriver to his mountain fastness by the swiftest means possible."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Riverfront Portage"]},
  {"id":236,"x":-190,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Alfren's Ferry","descriptions":["Alfren's Ferry is a privately owned and operated ferry that carries folks over the broad and swift Segoltha River.  The ferry does a brisk business, since the trade route to the Elven forest reaches lies south across the river.  In the face of hostile assaults, the river serves as a formidable barrier."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"go","move":"go lemicus square"},{"to":935,"exit":"go","move":"go ferry"},{"to":936,"exit":"go","move":"go ferry"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Alfren's Ferry","Ferry","First Land Herald","Herald","newspaper","news stand"]},
  {"id":237,"x":50,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Receiving Yard","descriptions":["The receiving yard of Barana's Shipyard and Boat Repair is a cluttered and hectic place.  Huge piles of lumber wait to be formed into the ships this yard is known for.  They vie for space with barrels of tar and kegs of nails.  Piled neatly by the main office, a stack of ruler-straight ash poles, each the thickness of a stout Dwarf, await conversion into the proud masts of some ocean-going lady."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":52,"exit":"go","move":"go streetside gate"},{"to":454,"exit":"go","move":"go shipyard office"}],"aliases":["Rats"]},
  {"id":238,"x":50,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["Raw lumber, cut into various lengths and sorted by type of wood, is stacked in loose piles to cure.  Narrow pathways wind among the stacks.  You can hear small skittering noises from inside the nearest woodpile.  The ground is thick with splinters and curled shavings."],"exits":[{"to":237,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":245,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":239,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":239,"x":30,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["The sweet smell of hickory blends with the tang of pine resin as you pass among many stacks of wood in dozens of varieties.  Several long poles of ash stand upright, braced and trussed together, so they will dry ramrod straight, to be used as masts and spars."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":240,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":240,"x":50,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["Huge piles of wood teeter uneasily all about you.  The smell of sawdust and the fresh green scent of raw wood is everywhere.  A layer of wood shavings, scattered on the ground, shows numerous tiny tracks running in all directions. Nearby, a rickety old dock sags, a shabby barge tied up to it.  At the opposite end of the wood-lot, a large kiln stands alone."],"exits":[{"to":245,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":244,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":243,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":241,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":239,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":241,"x":30,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["Piles of sawdust are scattered everywhere but there are only fragments and splinters of wood here.  Heavy ruts worn into the ground indicate the path taken by loads of wood from the dock to the south.  The smell of the nearby river and its mudflats wars with the clean fresh scent of new-cut wood to make your nose twitch."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":243,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":242,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":242,"x":30,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["Old stone pilings support a sagging dock.  Like the shoemaker's children who go barefoot, this place, with wood aplenty, has let its delivery pier half rot away.  The wood is sagging and some planks are gone.  The stone footings in the river are cracked and tilted.  One good tidal surge and the entire dock may head for Riverhaven.  An equally squalid barge sits at the dock, looking as if it might collapse from overwork, and the decay of age, at any moment."],"exits":[{"to":241,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":246,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":243,"x":50,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["Massive lengths of wood, destined to become tillers and rudder-posts, lie in staggered rows.  Each one has been cut and sanded to a fine smoothness that gives each the soft sheen of satin.  A portable block and tackle mounted on wheels stands nearby, as each post easily weighs as much as several Gor'Tog."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":244,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":241,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Shipyard"]},
  {"id":244,"x":70,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["Various lengths of green wood are stacked up before the low entrance to a large kiln.  The wood will be lugged inside, to be dried over slow fires for several weeks.  The resulting timbers will be strong and straight, suitable for the ribs and keel of a mighty sea-going warship."],"exits":[{"to":243,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":240,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":441,"exit":"go","move":"go stacks lumber"},{"to":765,"exit":"go","move":"go low entrance"}]},
  {"id":245,"x":70,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Storage","descriptions":["A heavy, two-man bandsaw leans against a huge pile of rough logs.  They seem to be oak, to judge by the grain.  They are in the process of being split into planks.  Someday, once crafted together by the master wrights here, they will carry freight or passengers to and from exotic lands.  For now, a nest of rats somewhere within is making good use of their sturdy nature, to judge by bits of chewed straw and tiny droppings."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":238,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":246,"x":30,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Delivery Pier","descriptions":["The dock tilts and groans underfoot with each passing wave.  Water-logged timbers sag perilously close to the muddy river.  A barge is tied to the decaying pier, looking equally as worn and run-down.  A dispirited sea-gull sits on the short stump of a mast and surveys the scene, croaking some avian word of disgust for the conditions."],"exits":[{"to":242,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":247,"exit":"go","move":"go decrepit barge"}]},
  {"id":247,"x":30,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Sail Barge","descriptions":["At any moment, you are convinced your feet are going to break right through the rotting bilges of this craft and plunge you into the chill river below.  A few broken oarlocks line the sagging gunwales and a stump mast that once stood much higher holds a dispirited square sail.  Ropes and chains for tying off the cargo lie in untidy heaps all about.  The stink of mildew and wood rot is everywhere.  Even the rats, so common hereabouts, appear too fastidious for this floating junk pile."],"exits":[{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go rickety dock"}],"aliases":["Sail Barge"]},
  {"id":248,"x":230,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Gate","descriptions":["Towering flamethorn trees line the path to the west.  Their scarlet leaves contrast with the pale green of small weeping willows that stand on either side of a wrought-iron gate, sentinels keeping the bustle of the city streets away from the quiet peace of the gardens.  The whitewashed stones of the Empaths' Guild rise to the south, with lacy ivy tendrils tracing patterns across their shaded surface.","Towering flamethorn trees line the path to the west.  Even in the dim light, their dark leaves contrast with the pale green of small weeping willows that stand on either side of a wrought-iron gate, sentinels keeping the bustle of the city streets away from the quiet peace of the gardens.  The whitewashed stones of the Empaths' Guild rise to the south, gleaming faintly through the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":249,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":259,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":249,"x":230,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["A high stone wall to the west closes off this area from the traffic, noise, and smells of the city, providing a quiet oasis that protects and encourages many delicate flowers and herbs to flourish.  Small cottages seem to blend into the lush growth, becoming an integral part of a living whole rather than an intrusion upon it."],"exits":[{"to":250,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":261,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":248,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":250,"x":230,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["Centered in the path of tiny white quartz pebbles, an ancient sugar maple has been lifesculpted to suggest the figure of a dark unicorn emerging from its trunk.  So subtle was the work of the ancient Elven masters that the image sometimes seems visible only from the corner of the eye, disappearing into bark, branches and leaves when looked at directly."],"exits":[{"to":251,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":249,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":251,"x":240,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["Overlooking several wooden chaises that have been polished to a smooth shine by years of use, a row of cherry trees lines the space between the white gravel path and the garden wall.  An oddly shaped porcelain bird feeder hangs from the branches of one tree, and the area is usually filled with chirps and birdsong."],"exits":[{"to":252,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":260,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":250,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":252,"x":250,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["A towering linden tree rises high over the garden, a remnant of the forest rising over the city walls to the northeast.  The spreading branches have become a home for squirrels and birds, who have learned that the visitors beneath them frequently leave edible treats behind."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":260,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":251,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":766,"exit":"climb","move":"climb linden tree"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":253,"x":260,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["The high grey limestone garden wall to the north provides protection from storms, sheltering the plantings at its base from harsh winds and rains.  Flowers normally found in more tropical climes flourish in this little enclave, their exotic and tantalizing scents filling the air even when winter holds the rest of the world in its icy fangs."],"exits":[{"to":254,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":260,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":252,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":254,"x":270,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["Visible over the top of the garden wall rises the far higher wall guarding the perimeter of the city.  The southwest-facing stones trap all available sunlight, and this area is normally several degrees warmer than the rest of the garden.  Brilliant flame-colored tiger lilies flourish year-round under the clement conditions, and in front of them, a tangle of lepradria orchids sends up delicate vivid yellow blooms."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":253,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":255,"x":270,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["A sense of peace, of bustling and burgeoning life, pervades the gardens.  In all seasons, plants and creatures grow and bloom when it is their time to flourish, and die only when it is their time to make way.  With care and attention, the living things inhabiting this area thrive and multiply, with each having a valued and necessary place and purpose."],"exits":[{"to":254,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":256,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":262,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":256,"x":270,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["The whitewashed walls of the Empaths' Guild and Hospital rise to the south, with a neat row of taffelberry bushes planted at their base.  To one side, surrounded by a well-tended bed of flowers, is an alabaster figurine of an Elven woman holding a human child."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":257,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":257,"x":260,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["A tangle of cloudberry bushes has grown so lush and tall that those seeking to walk by must move to the edge of the path, pushing past their sturdy stems.  In season, the berries are gathered and made into both tasty foodstuffs, and a particularly sweet and intoxicating wine."],"exits":[{"to":256,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":258,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":260,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":258,"x":250,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Willow Tree","descriptions":["The massive weeping willow tree for which the garden is named spreads its trailing branches toward the ground, veiling the area and swaying with every breath of passing breeze to both reveal and conceal.  Occasionally, the leaves part enough to allow a glimpse to the south of the Sorrow Garden in which the Empath Guild Leader stands, and the tall wrought-iron fence running between there and here."],"exits":[{"to":260,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":257,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":259,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":259,"x":240,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["Bounded on the south by the whitewashed stones of the Empaths' Guild, the white-graveled path wanders past small, neat cottages surrounded by well-tended plantings.  To the east, an ancient weeping willow tree looms protectively over the area, providing dappled shade and shelter.  A bronze sundial has been placed in the center of the white gravel path."],"exits":[{"to":260,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":258,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":248,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":260,"x":250,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Fountain","descriptions":["Randomly shaped leaves of verdigrised copper form a tall fountain in the middle of a large pool filled with water lilies, which is surrounded by a low garden of flowers and herbs that shifts in color with the seasons.  Benches shaped of polished copperwood are scattered about, inviting the weary passerby to sit and be soothed by the music of the water trickling its random way down from one copper leaf to another into the surrounding pond."],"exits":[{"to":252,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":253,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":262,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":257,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":258,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":259,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":261,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":251,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":767,"exit":"go","move":"go pool"}],"aliases":["Willow Walk"]},
  {"id":261,"x":240,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["A small grove of silverwillow trees shelters the homes clustered around it, and someone has slung a mesh hammock in between two well-spaced trunks.  An industrious colony of ants works away at building its anthill higher, well away from the homes in the area."],"exits":[{"to":260,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":249,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":262,"x":260,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Garden Path","descriptions":["Several of those living in this area have created a small but thriving vegetable garden.  All who pass by here help in caring for the plants, and are free to share in the bounty that it produces as the seasons turn."],"exits":[{"to":255,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":260,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":263,"x":250,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Emmiline's Cottage, Path","descriptions":["A white gravel path, speckled lightly with grey stone, winds leisurely to the painted steps of a moderately sized cottage.  Wrapped around the front of the cheery yellow building is a pillared porch with a small seating area, and the steps are flanked by flower beds and small shrubs.  Lace curtains shroud the windows at the front of the home, and a third window, etched and frosted, is mounted into the polished wooden door.","A path of white gravel winds through the darkness to the steps of a moderately sized cottage.  Dark shapes hunch on either side of the steps, outlined dimly by the lantern shining through white lace in one window.  The white porch rails and pillars are muted by the night, the porch furniture crouched like slumbering beasts.  A greyish oval glows from the center of the door."],"exits":[{"to":478,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden steps"},{"to":252,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":264,"x":230,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["Neatly clipped hedgerows line both sides of a cobblestone path leading into a quiet neighborhood of modest homes and well-tended gardens.  A profusion of mature oak and maple trees spread throughout the neighborhood, their thickly leaved branches providing a natural screen of privacy for the homes that shelter beneath their boughs."],"exits":[{"to":265,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":17,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":265,"x":210,"y":-210,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["The cobblestone path underfoot splits to the east and west and spreads out to circle around an open plaza to the north.  Tufts of tall grasses intermingled with fragrant herbs line the outer edges of the path, where well-kept homes peep from behind the trunks of several venerable oaks.  The sound of running water provides a pleasant backdrop to the domestic scene, the source nearby but not immediately visible."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":270,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":264,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":271,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":266,"x":210,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["An apple tree spreads its branches over the open lawn in the center of the neighborhood.  Stepping stones radiate across the grass in several directions, leading to a cobblestone path that circles past an assortment of thatch-roofed cottages and other homes constructed of brick and hand-worked stone.  A pebble-lined creek of sparkling water cuts across the plaza, flowing east to west in a merry rush of ripples and waves."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":268,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":269,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":270,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":265,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":271,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":272,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":273,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":768,"exit":"climb","move":"climb apple tree"}],"aliases":["Midton Circle"]},
  {"id":267,"x":210,"y":-230,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["A windswept fall of leaves creates a soft cushion over the cobblestone path that winds its way around the open plaza to the south.  The curved limbs of oak trees form a leafy canopy over the path, casting sun-dappled shadows across the ground.  To the north the trailing blossoms of a bramble rose soften the edges of the stacked stone wall that separates the neighborhood from the outer street.","A windswept fall of leaves creates a soft cushion over the cobblestone path that winds its way around the open plaza to the south.  The curved boughs of oak trees form a leafy canopy over the path, casting dark shadows across the ground.  To the north the trailing blossoms of a bramble rose soften the edges of the stacked stone wall that separates the neighborhood from the outer street."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":266,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":273,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":268,"x":220,"y":-230,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["A stretch of paving bricks trails off towards the homes on the southwest side of the path.  The occasional Rat-Tat-Tat! of a woodpecker drilling the trunk of one of the ubiquitous oaks provides a rhythmic counterpoint to the throaty warbling of a songbird perched high on another nearby tree.","A stretch of paving bricks trails off towards the homes on the southwest side of the path.  The twittering coo of sleeping birds perched among the ubiquitous oaks provides a melodic counterpoint to the chirping drone of crickets going about their nighttime business."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":266,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":267,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":269,"x":220,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["A wide trail of closely-spaced stepping stones provides passage across the shallow creek that ripples across this portion of the cobblestone path.  The tangled roots of several maple trees have been exposed by the water running beneath their branches, causing several to lean across the streambed into a protective arch.  The homes lining either side of the creek are slightly stained around their stone foundations, evidence of seasons when heavy rains caused the little creek to overflow its customary bed."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":270,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":266,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":270,"x":220,"y":-210,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["Grapes growing in a small front yard garden spread fruit-laden branches over a low-lying wall to the southwest.  A few wayward green tendrils have crept onto the cobblestone path, their vines mingling with the purple stains of grapes crushed underfoot by passing pedestrians.  The faint smell of fermenting fruit drifts out of the little garden, mingling with the scent of woodsmoke rising from the hearth of a nearby home."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":265,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":266,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":271,"x":200,"y":-210,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["The sound of bees buzzing about a crack in the trunk of an ancient maple blends with the gentle murmur of running water a little to the north.  Clumps of low-growing herbs line the cobblestone path, their blooms imparting a pleasant scent to the air.","The sound of chirping crickets and croaking frogs blends with the gentle murmur of running water a little to the north.  Clumps of low-growing herbs line the cobblestone path, their blooms imparting a pleasant scent to the crisp night air."],"exits":[{"to":272,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":266,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":265,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":272,"x":200,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["A gradual slope carries the water of a shallow creek over the cobblestone path to an opening beneath the honey-colored stones of a high wall to the west.  Moss creeps from the water's edge towards the surrounding homes, where its stealthy advance is brought to a halt by sturdy growths of berry bushes planted in a long line between the creek and the nearby dwellings."],"exits":[{"to":273,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":266,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":271,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":273,"x":200,"y":-230,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Midton Circle","descriptions":["Low hedges of lavender form a divider between the cobblestone path and the front gardens of the homes on the northwest side of the plaza.  A crisp, sweet fragrance rises from the silvery foliage, providing a floral counterpoint to the woody scents of oak and maple and the nose-tickling smell of fresh-cut grass."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":266,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":272,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":274,"x":70,"y":-508,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Almhara Arch","descriptions":["Curiously quiet despite its metropolitan location, Fayl'Shar Court occupies a prime plot in the city's most affluent quarter.  A broad tree-lined boulevard of imposing estates sweeps southwest toward a quadrangle of grand residences, offering a vista of outstanding architectural beauty.  Fronted by flawless lawns and exquisite specimens of rare Elanthian flora, the boulevard provides a pleasant promenade for residents and a living monument to the skills of the master gardeners they employ."],"exits":[{"to":275,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":133,"exit":"go","move":"go almhara arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Fayl'Shar Court","Almhara Arch"]},
  {"id":275,"x":60,"y":-498,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Baluster Boulevard","descriptions":["Perfectly uniform regiments of mature copperleaf trees border the expanse of warm sandstone and form a whispering canopy above the boulevard as it parades between mansions and sprawling villas.  Most of the residences on this stretch of the boulevard boast a magnificent portico resplendent with the marble pillars which give the thoroughfare both its name and the imposing dignity of its appearance."],"exits":[{"to":274,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":276,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":276,"x":50,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Baluster Boulevard","descriptions":["Several of the homes on Baluster Boulevard possess grand gates and driveways wide enough to accommodate an entire collection of opulent carriages, and even properties on the smaller lots are served by lengthy stretches of immaculate gravel or goldstone.  Those residents who prefer privacy surround their homes with seamless banks of thick privet and poplar, while others offer a clear view of their magnificent abodes through smart black iron railings."],"exits":[{"to":275,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":277,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":277,"x":50,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Baluster Boulevard","descriptions":["Baluster Boulevard closes sedately in an elegant crescent, the gentle curve of the pavement punctuated by carved marble stepping stones placed to allow visitors a dignified descent from their carriages.  A group of elegant white-painted ironwork benches sits around the base of a large oak tree, providing a pleasant place to sit beneath the spreading boughs and watch the world go by in all its finery."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":288,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":278,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":619,"exit":"go","move":"go white building"}]},
  {"id":278,"x":30,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["A smooth walkway of lustrous goldstone encloses the edge of the Square, passing by the elegant facades of the rich homes that occupy this desireable address.  Stunning arrays of seasonal flowers and shrubs in polished acanth tubs decorate the promenade, contributing a colorful and leafy display to the park-like atmosphere of the Square."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":279,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":289,"exit":"go","move":"go anli arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Anli Arch"]},
  {"id":279,"x":30,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["The homes on this side of the Square are set back from the promenade, their own private gardens offered as frontage to the quadrangle.  Each lawn is a perfectly uniform deep, lush green, surrounded by elegant trees and eye-catching beds of unusual blooming shrubbery.  Private pathways lead away from the Square toward each front door, curving gently through the gardens."],"exits":[{"to":278,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":280,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":280,"x":30,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["A bronze statue of two elegant men dressed in lavish robes stands at the side of the promenade, the foot of one of the figures polished to a bright sheen as if frequently rubbed for luck.  Two splendid fir trees flank the statue, the piquant fragrance of their evergreen foliage filling the air with a lush, cool scent reminiscent of trade routes leading through distant forests."],"exits":[{"to":279,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":281,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":281,"x":30,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["Most of Goldstone Square's lofty edifices boast luxurious leaded windows paned with high quality glass, the better to admire the Arboretum and neighboring buildings.  Those windows overlooking the Square are polished to a radiant shine, causing them to glint warmly in sunshine or lamplight.  From a distance, the sparkling windows might be rich gems embedded into every facade."],"exits":[{"to":280,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":282,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":282,"x":30,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["Two spreading tulvora trees form a living arch leading onto the southwest lawn of the Arboretum.  The sweet and spicy fragrance of their palm-sized leaves fills the air with a heady perfume that drifts gently around this corner of the Square, mingling with the fresh scent of a bank of mimosa climbing elegantly around the porch of a large residence in the corner of the quadrangle."],"exits":[{"to":281,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":283,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":292,"exit":"go","move":"go tulvora arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Tulvora Arch"]},
  {"id":283,"x":50,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["One particularly impressive mansion dominates the southernmost end of the Square, its extensive frontage commanding an unparalleled view of the Arboretum.  The palatial residence is set back from the promenade, putting a dignified distance between itself and the public in the Square.  Its vast plot of land is surrounded by tall poplars which bend gracefully in the scented breeze."],"exits":[{"to":284,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":282,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":284,"x":70,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["Two large homes overlook the Southeast Lawn of the Arboretum, the broad balconies under their upper windows suggesting they were designed with a view of the park and passers-by in mind.  A pair of mature ban-minahle trees provides a slender arched entrance to the Arboretum, their branches forming a silvery canopy overhead."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":283,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":291,"exit":"go","move":"go ban-minahle arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Ban-Minahle Arch"]},
  {"id":285,"x":70,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["Perched atop the ornate iron railings outside a magnificent villa, two carved obsidian ravens stand sentry over the activity in the Square.  Each has glittering sapphire stones for eyes, and the deep sheen of their midnight plumage is carved with an expert hand, such that the symbols are a fitting tribute to the god they represent."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":284,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":286,"x":70,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["Glossy black railings run along the side of the promenade between the elegant residences and the goldstone pavement, supporting elegant glass streetlamps on ornate poles at regular intervals.  Well-scrubbed steps lead from the walkway up to the front door of each home, where a liveried butler can be expected to greet visitors to the monied families who occupy the Square."],"exits":[{"to":287,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":285,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":287,"x":70,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["The homes on the east side of the Square present dramatic facades, each frontage carefully designed to demonstrate both the wealth and the good taste of its owner.  Every front door is polished to a deep gleam, each doorknob handled only by white-gloved servants.  Tradesmen never see this side of the homes they serve, since functional entrances and kitchen gardens have their own place out of sight behind the buildings."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":286,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":618,"exit":"go","move":"go black building"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":288,"x":70,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Fayl'Shar Court, Goldstone Square","descriptions":["The splendid architecture of Goldstone Square may be viewed in a pleasurable stroll along the broad walkway which leads around the edge of the quadrangle.  Each home here is a magnificent example of prime Elanthian architecture, using only the finest materials and ornaments transported across the lands by discerning merchants."],"exits":[{"to":287,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":277,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":290,"exit":"go","move":"go peregan arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Peregan Arch"]},
  {"id":289,"x":40,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Goldstone Arboretum, Northwest Lawn","descriptions":["The Northwest Lawn of the Arboretum demonstrates formal gardening at its best.  Impressive examples of cunning topiary surround the uniform green of the lawn, each perfect privet fashioned into a lifelike representation of animal or bird.  A pair of polished oak benches sits beside the lawn, allowing visitors to inspect the horticultural artworks at leisure."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":293,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":292,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go anli arch"}]},
  {"id":290,"x":60,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Goldstone Arboretum, Northeast Lawn","descriptions":["Inside the Peregan Arch, the Northeast Lawn of the Arboretum is surrounded by groves of trees arranged in such a way as to give the impression they grow wild, untouched by human hands.  Large nuts falling from the peregans have been allowed to take root around their parents, and banks of carefree wildflowers grow with elegant abandon in this unconstrained corner of the park."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":293,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":289,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":288,"exit":"go","move":"go peregan arch"}]},
  {"id":291,"x":60,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Goldstone Arboretum, Southeast Lawn","descriptions":["An impressive collection of boulders from every corner of Elanthia forms the rock garden, each crack and crevice providing an unlikely new terrain for a selection of flowers and shrubs drawn from remote, mountainous regions.  The air remains cool here at all times of year, as if the Gardeners have employed some clever means to duplicate the freshness of the mountain air."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":292,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":293,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":284,"exit":"go","move":"go ban-minahle arch"}]},
  {"id":292,"x":40,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Goldstone Arboretum, Southwest Lawn","descriptions":["The elegant Water Garden takes pride of place on the Southwest Lawn.  Elegant white wooden bridges traverse tiny brooks which flow gently from some unseen water source into a sparkling pond.  Fat, colorful fish swim lazily in the clear waters, their spectacular hues flaming dramatically with every flash of light on their scales."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":293,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":291,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":282,"exit":"go","move":"go tulvora arch"}]},
  {"id":293,"x":50,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Goldstone Arboretum, Crystal Fountain","descriptions":["A circular area paved with glittering goldstone surrounds the Crystal Fountain, its countless spouts providing a fascinating display of dancing waters.  Elegant wrought iron benches surround the fountain, allowing visitors to the park a place to sit and relax while observing the aquatic spectacle.  Carefully-tended willows surround the area, hushing all but the restful splash of water on crystal and the occasional snippet of quiet conversation."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":291,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":292,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":289,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Goldstone Arboretum"]},
  {"id":295,"x":-210,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A swift draft sweeps in from above, whispering crisply as it whooshes through the slats of an iron grate set into the ceiling.  The air streams across your body, tingling your senses as it slices through the stagnant stench all around you."],"exits":[{"to":296,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":118,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":296,"x":-220,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The floor slants in from the northeast, converging to a shallow gray-brown pool at the alcove's center.  The water eddies, swirling stagnantly, and sinks slowly into sludge."],"exits":[{"to":295,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":300,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":297,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":297,"x":-220,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The packed dirt tunnel leads north and south through soggy piles of refuse."],"exits":[{"to":296,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":298,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":298,"x":-220,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A thick coating of dingy scum clings to a wrought-iron gate fixed into the wall, preventing further passage west.  The low hiss of moving water echoes in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":297,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":299,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":408,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron gate"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":299,"x":-210,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The packed dirt tunnel leads east and west through soggy piles of refuse."],"exits":[{"to":621,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":298,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":300,"x":-210,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The tunnel ends, its rounded terminus piled high with pungent mildewed rubbish."],"exits":[{"to":296,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":301,"x":280,"y":-338,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Stamina Training Room","descriptions":["A circular cage set vertically awaits you.  The axis runs across the room and is attached to a set of gears and lead weights.  The entire apparatus seems designed to wear a person out.  A Gor'Tog steps out of the wheel with a heavy sheen of sweat on his massive body.  He glances at you and snorts What makes YOU think you can handle this sort of workout?  You grit your teeth as you realize the test of endurance you will soon undergo."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Stamina"]},
  {"id":302,"x":320,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Main Hall","descriptions":["The austere granite walls of this immense great hall tower upward to the full height of the building.  A banner hangs from the ceiling far above.  Intricately woven carpets soften the polished mahogany floor and provide traction in the event of a fight.  Even in his home, a Barbarian remains ever-vigilant and ready for battle.  An enormous jeweled steel greatsword glints above a raised podium at the far end of the hall, from which the Barbarian Guild Leader performs his duties."],"exits":[{"to":303,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":304,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":335,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":777,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding stairway"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Barbarian","Agonar","RS Barbarian"]},
  {"id":303,"x":330,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Hall of Fame","descriptions":["Framed by four colossal statues that serve to bear the weight of the ceiling, this area houses artifacts of the guild.  Preserved for eternity, pelts of vanquished creatures alternate with beastial trophy heads, framing a large steel sheet embossed with the maker's marks of guild weaponsmiths.  On one wall, portraits of leading guild members hang beneath mounted weapons.  A round padded leather bench provides a place to sit while examining the exhibits."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}]},
  {"id":304,"x":320,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Armory","descriptions":["Dark and solemn, the confines of this expansive chamber are lit only by several lone wicker torches.  Their dim glow flickers and dances along the lengths of wood and steel, a destructive arsenal of weaponry that has been amassed over many ages into the guild Armory.  Row upon row of devastating armaments crowds the area, evoking images of brutal conflicts and violent battles of the past."],"exits":[{"to":302,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":305,"x":320,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Stadium Pits","descriptions":["Dark and dank, the musty pits are set into the ground and offer little room for comfort.  The acrid tang of sweat drifts through the hot and humid air, assaulting the senses.  Narrow shafts of light from the well-lit arena pierce through the steel prongs of a massive portcullis, fracturing the gloom like glowing spears.  Through the foreboding gate, the imposing battle arena takes shape, beckoning all who dare."],"exits":[{"to":306,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":303,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"},{"to":769,"exit":"go","move":"go steel portcullis"},{"to":770,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase"}],"aliases":["Stadium Pits","Pits"]},
  {"id":306,"x":330,"y":-388,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Recovery Room","descriptions":["The moans of the recently fallen would echo against the stark stone walls of this room.  Several iron cots line the walls, ready to bear the weight of the next bloodied combatant.  An enameled steel cabinet in the corner holds herbs and salves, while on the cold, hard floor, a braided red-brown rug provides a matching accent to the random splatters of dried blood."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":307,"x":300,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Courtyard Garden","descriptions":["Open to the sky, this spot is sheltered from the worst of the weather and elements by a rich cedar arbor.  In the center of the courtyard, a small fountain, filled with the darting forms of tiny fish, babbles to itself.  Several elaborately-carved cedar benches are placed at one edge of the garden, directly across from a cushioned swing hanging from the arbor by wrought iron chains.  A riot of seasonal plants compete for the attention of those who pass here, and a whispering willow tree looms overhead as if creating a protective mantle."],"exits":[{"to":308,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":310,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":309,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":426,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":1,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Empaths' Guild","vela'tohr plant","RS Empath"]},
  {"id":308,"x":310,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Guildleader's Office","descriptions":["Paneled in dark mahogany, this richly appointed office is redolent with the scent of amber and leather.  A massive mahogany desk dominates the space, its glossy lacquered surface scattered with papers and writing implements.  Behind the desk is an enormous tufted leather wing chair, its rich brown leather complementing the lustrous mahogany.  A decanter of ruby port sits atop a mahogany liquor cabinet, numerous bottles of various colors and sizes visible behind the closed glass doors.  The open-skied courtyard garden of the guild proper is visible to the southwest, through a short stone-lined antechamber."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Empath","Salvur"]},
  {"id":309,"x":290,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Infirmary","descriptions":["The walls enclosing this spacious room are adorned with thousands of tiny tiles in various shades of white, pearl, cream, and ivory, reminiscent of sun-touched summer clouds.  Underfoot, the massive white marble tiles are grooved slightly to provide a surer surface for booted and slippered feet.  The large windows are cracked open to let in fresh air, and a massive skylight above contributes to this spot's feeling of healthful openness.  A row of white-draped cots occupies one side of the room, while several large examination tables are arrayed neatly along the opposite wall."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":966,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"aliases":["Infirmary"]},
  {"id":310,"x":310,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Library","descriptions":["A simple folding table and some canvas chairs make the Empaths' Guild library quickly transformable into an emergency room in case the wounded overflow from the hospital's facilities.  In this spartan and spotless chamber, oft-read works on healing, herbs, medicinals, and other empathic arts fill a long shelf against the wall."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Empath library"]},
  {"id":311,"x":210,"y":-70,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Lobby","descriptions":["Surrounded by the nerve centers of the administrative arm of the local government, the lobby is an area open to the second floor with skylights in the roof overhead.  Various offices open off the main floor, and a flight of stairs leads upward.  An attempt at a cheerful paint scheme has become worn and faded with time until it is now a dusty grey and anemic beige, dull and unremarkable."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":312,"exit":"go","move":"go registration office"},{"to":314,"exit":"go","move":"go collection office"},{"to":316,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":1022,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"}],"aliases":["Town Hall"]},
  {"id":312,"x":200,"y":-70,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Citizenship Registration Office","descriptions":["Several oval paintings line the off-white walls of this office, and a faint scent of old paper fills the air.  A bored clerk sits behind a semi-polished desk occasionally glancing at a book entitled, Rules and Regulations.  A couple of plush wine velvet couches provide seating for those waiting, while a colorful fringed rug entertains a kitten that seems to have found its way through the doors."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Citizenship Registration Office"]},
  {"id":313,"x":220,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Permits Office","descriptions":["This is a large office with a well-worn counter, several windows each with a Use Next Window, Please sign and apparently one clerk actually working.  Every town in the land seems cursed with lines and waiting and fees.  This office is for the obtaining of permits, licenses and similar matters."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":311,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Permits Office"]},
  {"id":314,"x":200,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Debtors' Office","descriptions":["This large room is full of clerks processing citizens' and travellers' payments for the various debts, fines and taxes any town needs to operate.  A well-worn and scuffed counter keeps the public at bay from the harried civil servants and the tile floor is badly in need of waxing from the countless feet that have shuffled in and out during the day.  The room has that somewhat grim and cheerless feel common to most places where people are forced to hand over money."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Debt"]},
  {"id":315,"x":230,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Home Exchange Office","descriptions":["Tiny, stuffed with old, dusty furniture, and smelling like yesterday's laundry, this office is anything but a testimony to bureaucratic efficiency.  Large piles of yellowing papers spill from cracked file cabinets and lie scattered upon the floor, fallen from large, ungainly stacks on what little desk space is not taken up by piles of mouldering food."],"exits":[{"to":313,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Home Exchange Office"]},
  {"id":316,"x":210,"y":-56,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Second Floor Landing","descriptions":["A large but scraggly palm tree in a pot sits at the top of the stairs in an effort to liven the dull civic atmosphere.  This floor contains the Mayor's Office and meeting rooms."],"exits":[{"to":317,"exit":"go","move":"go short hall"},{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"go mayor's office"},{"to":321,"exit":"go","move":"go council doors"},{"to":311,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":317,"x":200,"y":-56,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Short Hallway","descriptions":["This short hallway leads from the second floor landing to the public Meeting Hall.  Cream-colored walls are hung with portraits of various famous citizens and a series of engravings, copies actually, of the famed Elothean artist Hoa Kiu-Sawa's series called 7 River Views."],"exits":[{"to":316,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":318,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":322,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":318,"x":190,"y":-56,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Short Hallway","descriptions":["Austere and formal, this section of the hallway is bare of plants and clutter.  An archway framed by ivy-carved molding opens in the south wall, its size and shape implying that a door should be housed within the arch's confines.  An unsigned portrait of a woman hangs directly across from the archway."],"exits":[{"to":317,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":319,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":323,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":848,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}]},
  {"id":319,"x":180,"y":-56,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Short Hallway","descriptions":["Continuing the austere style of this section of the Town Hall, the space is bare of decoration.  The walls are an unadorned pale yellow and the sole furnishing is an uncomfortable-looking bench opposite the oak door.  A rectangular patch of slightly lighter paint above the bench hints that there was once something more here."],"exits":[{"to":318,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":324,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":320,"x":220,"y":-56,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Mayor's Office","descriptions":["A large office, reasonably well-appointed with comfortable furnishings.  Portraits of past mayors line the walls and you notice they all smile in the same way, a bit too wide and a bit too sincerely to make you trust them.  An old but well-kept desk dominates the center of the room and a leather couch for guests sits along one wall.  A window looks out over the town."],"exits":[{"to":316,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":321,"x":210,"y":-46,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Council Chamber","descriptions":["This spacious chamber, elegantly decorated, is where the Town Council meets in formal session.  One of the most notable features here is the domed ceiling painted to resemble the night sky spangled with stars and moons.  A very realistic and lovely work of art, this is a surprising find in this stuffy bureaucratic environment.  A large horseshoe-shaped table for the members is the main furniture."],"exits":[{"to":316,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":322,"x":200,"y":-46,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Public Meeting Room","descriptions":["The largest room in the Town Hall, this is used for public meetings.  Both official meetings and ones held at the behest of townsfolk will be had here.  Sometimes visiting scholars will lecture for the edification of the populace as well.  Dark oak panelled walls and polished floor are surprisingly clean and in good repair.  Padded benches for the public's use are arrayed about a small stage and podium."],"exits":[{"to":317,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"aliases":["Public Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":323,"x":190,"y":-46,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Lottery Office","descriptions":["The expansive area is divided by a rosewood counter.  On the public side of the counter, there is a carpet with a threadbare path paced into it and a wilted plant.  Except for the smudged handprints smeared on the paint, the walls match the cream color of the hallway outside.  The work side of the counter is considerably less cheery, with desks centered in small partitioned squares.  Two dusty chandeliers attempting to compensate for the lack of windows cast a dreary glow on patron and civil servant alike."],"exits":[{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Lottery Office"]},
  {"id":324,"x":180,"y":-46,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Genealogy Office","descriptions":["Motes of dust drifting gracefully through muted shafts of light intertwine with the smell of old parchment.  A barrier of desks, dull with age and use, straddles the room to create a counter between the public and the clerk whose job it is to maintain the records of the province and handle citizens' requests.  Elegantly illuminated genealogical charts framed in rosewood hang behind the clerk's counter."],"exits":[{"to":319,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Genealogy Office"]},
  {"id":325,"x":10,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Lobby","descriptions":["White marble floors and clean white tile walls without a speck of dirt show the extreme care taken with cleanliness here.  A counter sits to one side where patrons may purchase bathing tickets, towels, soap, scrapers and other necessities for personal hygiene."],"exits":[{"to":96,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":326,"exit":"go","move":"go men's room"},{"to":327,"exit":"go","move":"go main area"},{"to":897,"exit":"go","move":"go women's room"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Orem's Bathhouse","Bathhouse"]},
  {"id":326,"x":20,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Men's Locker Room","descriptions":["Stone benches, kept spotlessly clean, line the otherwise empty room.  A gentleman attendant keeps an eye on things so nothing improper goes on.  Though a large sign warns he is not responsible for anything left here.  The stone floor is kept warm by piping heated air underneath it, a pleasant luxury on cold days."],"exits":[{"to":325,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":327,"x":0,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Main Bathing Hall","descriptions":["This large room is comfortably warm.  Men and women mingle here sociably, most differences in class shed with their clothes.  Bathing pools of different temperatures lead off in several directions and a married couple are undergoing a vigorous massage therapy session from a winsome but apparently strong pair of twin Elven lasses."],"exits":[{"to":325,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":328,"exit":"go","move":"go cold pool"},{"to":329,"exit":"go","move":"go tepid pool"},{"to":330,"exit":"go","move":"go hot pool"},{"to":331,"exit":"go","move":"go blue-tiled hallway"}]},
  {"id":328,"x":0,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Cold Water Pool","descriptions":["This large pool is filled with very cold water.  It provides a jolt to the system and invigorates your heart and circulation.  Or so you have been told.  Maybe it does, but right now you feel your lips are turning blue and large goosebumps cover your overly exposed skin.  Others nearby seem to be enjoying it, and you wonder which polar region they are from."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":329,"x":-10,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Warm Water Pool","descriptions":["This pool is filled with water, warm but not overly so.  Comfortable to swim or relax in, it is enjoyed by the elderly and infirm of the town who cannot tolerate the hot and cold baths as well as anyone just wishing a comfortable soak.  You laze about, enjoying the feeling of the dust and dirt washing off you and you feel cleaner and greatly refreshed."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":330,"x":-10,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Hot Water Pool","descriptions":["Hot, hot, hot, all you can think of for a moment is how oatmeal must feel when being cooked.  As you get used to the temperature, you begin to relax and mellow out.  The heat loosens stiff joints and relaxes tired muscles.  You lean back against the tiled side of the pool and let the waters hold you as your cares and aches drift away."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":331,"x":10,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Blue Hallway","descriptions":["This hallway is tiled in pleasing shades of blue that resemble flowing water rushing past you.  The hallway leads to the shower-bath room and the steam room and sauna."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":332,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"},{"to":333,"exit":"go","move":"go shower room"},{"to":334,"exit":"go","move":"go frosted door"}]},
  {"id":332,"x":0,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Sauna","descriptions":["This room is fully lined in slatted pine wood, unpainted and sanded smooth.  The temperature is staggering, the air is bone dry and you break into an intense sweat just standing.  Breathing is an interesting exercise as it feels a bit like leaning over a forge fire and inhaling.  After you sweat for a bit, it begins to feel good.  The dirt of city dwelling and of the road is washing itself from your pores and cleansing you."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}]},
  {"id":333,"x":10,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Shower Room","descriptions":["A row of brass nozzles along one wall gush forth a spray of warm water.  White tile floor and tiled sea-foam green walls echo the sound of the water until it roars like a mighty river.  The water is comfortably warm and bars of a refreshingly scented soap are at hand.  An attendant with a long-handled brush offers to scrub backs for a small fee.  The water feels good on you and you consider an urge to sing out loud and let the resonant chamber make even you sound good."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":334,"x":20,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Steambath","descriptions":["Clouds of hot steam obscure your vision and things are hard to see in here.  A tiled floor is somewhat slick with condensed water and you can make out several tiers of stone benches rising up through the mist.  Steam rushes forth from gratings in the walls and floor keeping the rooms hot and moist.  Several figures shrouded by steam and towels lounge on the seats and seem to be relaxed and languid."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"go","move":"go fros door"}]},
  {"id":335,"x":300,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Champions' Square","descriptions":["Statues of famous barbarians and arena champions form an arcade leading to the arched steel-clad door of the Barbarians' Guild.  The building itself is high and massive, and the roof rises into a dome towards the east, covering the Champions' Arena.  Through narrow, slit windows you can hear the clang of weapon on shield, and the voice of the trainers barking out instructions to the would-be fighters, gladiators, knights and mercenaries within."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"north","move":"script crossingtrainerfix north"},{"to":6,"exit":"south","move":"script crossingtrainerfix south"},{"to":8,"exit":"west","move":"script crossingtrainerfix west"},{"to":301,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go stone structure"},{"to":302,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go barbarian guild"}]},
  {"id":336,"x":-110,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Wilds, Pine Needle Path","descriptions":["A well-trod path leads from a small open gateway in the town wall and heads into a grove of whispering pine.  Lean, muscular figures stride by briskly, some carrying longbows, others staves, and all garbed in muted tones of earth and forest."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":127,"exit":"go","move":"go open gateway"}]},
  {"id":337,"x":-110,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Wilds, Pine Needle Path","descriptions":["Birds dart in and out of the dense shrubbery here, calling to one another in cadences that are almost comprehendible.  Responses seem to emanate from the wooden structure ahead, a timber building with ornately carved double doors, and seemingly without a roof."],"exits":[{"to":336,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":585,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":1005,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow tunnel"}],"aliases":["Rangers","Pine Needle Path"]},
  {"id":338,"x":-170,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Exterior Motives","descriptions":["This poky shop houses a motley assortment of building supplies.  The quality of the materials stacked against the walls is questionable -- the wood is pocked and scarred with large knots and mildew, and the clay bricks have a crude, uneven appearance.  The presence of Mebblec Gumsroe behind the battered deobar counter indicates him to be the salesman, although his utter lack of interest in the customers seems a concerted effort to appear otherwise."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":772,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Exterior Motives","Mebblec Gumsroe"]},
  {"id":339,"x":-130,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Main Hall","descriptions":["Not a hint of opulence is betrayed by the modest facade of the Traders' Guild Hall.  Yet opulence indeed there is within, to what some might call an excessive degree.  Displays of prosperity surround you, from the marble columns to the frescoed ceiling depicting the god Kertigen."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":342,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"},{"to":352,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding stair"},{"to":340,"exit":"go","move":"go auction foyer"}],"aliases":["Trader"]},
  {"id":340,"x":-120,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Auction Foyer","descriptions":["This newly constructed room is devoid of any furnishing.  The breadth of the room is easily large enough to accommodate many potential buyers, while allowing them to converse freely without disrupting any auctions that may be underway."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":343,"exit":"go","move":"go auction hall"},{"to":343,"exit":"go","move":"go auction hall"}]},
  {"id":341,"x":-130,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Mercantile Library","descriptions":["Square, leather-covered tables with brightly burning lamps line this domed-covered chamber.  A stained glass skylight at the dome's center filters the light to a soothing softness.  A shelf of books and manuscripts describing theories of trade and economics, cabinets full of scrolls, and racks replete with detailed maps of all known trade routes of Elanthia form the Mercantile Library's collection."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":342,"x":-120,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Banquet Room","descriptions":["A large seven-tiered crystal chandelier is poised high above and casts warm light throughout the room.  The dining tables are draped with pure white tablecloths and adorned with centerpieces of freshly cut flowers.  Carved mahogany chairs are pulled to the tables, an elegant place setting before each one.  Plush gold-flecked deep green carpeting borders the inlaid wood floor that bears the image of a gilded yak and looks well-suited to dancing."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}]},
  {"id":343,"x":-120,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Auction Hall","descriptions":["This room is in the process of being finished.  The polished mahogany walls and ceiling are angled in such a way that would project the Auctioneer's voice clearly to the rear of the hall as well as to those listening in the front.  In the emptiness of the room one can imagine the many items and Kronars that will one day exchange hands here."],"exits":[{"to":340,"exit":"go","move":"go foyer"},{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go side door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Auction Hall"]},
  {"id":344,"x":10,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Sanctorum","descriptions":["Dark brown walls paneled with a coarse flowing grain mark this circular chamber.  Curved, comfortable-looking sofas are set about some potted acanth trees and you notice a few clerics sitting quietly while reading tomes from the guild's private library.  The guild's record keeper sits behind his desk in the corner next to some bins used for storage."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":125,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":345,"exit":"go","move":"go guildleader's study"},{"to":348,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}],"aliases":["Sanctorum","RS Cleric"]},
  {"id":345,"x":10,"y":-568,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Esuin's Study","descriptions":["The plaster walls of this small chamber are smooth and white as shadowy snow.  A high circular window on the western wall filters light to softly illumine the sparsely furnished room.  Heavy drapes over the door mute the noise from the sanctorum outside, and a dark wooden desk and two primitively-made chairs provide a place for those who have business with Esuin to contemplate his words and advice.","The plaster walls of this small chamber are smooth and white as shadowy snow.  A high circular window on the western wall provides a glimpse of night sky beyond.  A dark wooden desk and two primitively-made chairs furnish the otherwise bare room.  Heavy drapes over the door mute the sounds from the sanctorum beyond, providing those with business with Esuin a quiet room to contemplate his words and advice."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Cleric","Esuin"]},
  {"id":346,"x":20,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Library","descriptions":["The shelf that lines the walls of this small private library holds many worn volumes and tomes devoted to scriptures, records, and religious lore.  Several robed clerics recline on cushioned seats near the windows, straining over thick texts in the dim light."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":347,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained doorway"}]},
  {"id":347,"x":20,"y":-568,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Contemplation Cloister","descriptions":["A slanting ceiling of timber and plaster shelters this small room in the interior section of the guild.  The stone floor is covered with thick tapestry rugs to create a cozy niche apart from the rest of the library.  An arching window looks out on an interior courtyard garden, and a heavy round table with numerous chairs sits in the center of the area.  A fireplace warms the room on chilly days, and though not a place of luxury, this is a comfortable site for self-reflection."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained doorway"}]},
  {"id":348,"x":0,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Courtyard","descriptions":["Several wooden benches face the center area of this large courtyard.  An older monk is demonstrating the art of the mace to a young acolyte, reminding you of the lesson of diligence from your youth.  At the far end of the courtyard, a sicle tree grove is being tended by a withered old monk with a serene look on his face.  Opposite the grove, a row of large lunat vats lend an unusual scent to the air."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go low building"},{"to":351,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar archway"},{"to":344,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"},{"to":773,"exit":"go","move":"go recessed cellar"}],"aliases":["Cleric"]},
  {"id":349,"x":0,"y":-568,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Gathering Hall","descriptions":["Pallets of clean rush-filled linens lie about the perimeter of the long hall, available for the bodies of fallen souls in need of healing or new spirit.  The open beam ceiling admits light from frosted glass gable windows -- a soothing light spills over the dark stone floor.  Although bloodstains upon the floor attest to both death defeated and souls lost, this is a place of gathering to celebrate life and respect death, where clerics come together to work and to exchange information and inspiration.","Pallets of clean rush-filled linens lie about the perimeter of the long hall, available for the bodies of fallen souls in need of healing or new spirit.  Lamps holding lit beeswax candles hang from the open beam ceiling, shadows spilling over the dark stone floor.  Although bloodstains upon the floor attest to both death defeated and souls lost, this is a place of gathering to celebrate life and respect death, where clerics come together to work and to exchange information and inspiration."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":348,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Gathering Hall"]},
  {"id":350,"x":-10,"y":-568,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Refectory","descriptions":["Benches and a long, rectangular table, big enough to seat fifty at a time, fill most of the room.  Nearby, a massive stone fireplace bakes the bread and simmers the meals to serve the members of the guild.  A bronze bell hangs from the ceiling with a rope tied off near the fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Refectory"]},
  {"id":351,"x":-10,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Chapel","descriptions":["The roof of this small, quaint chapel reaches a steep peak overhead, its beams of blond ash polished to a loving glow.  The floor is simply covered with a thin length of burgundy carpet that leads up to a square altar, located against the western wall.  A shining window of multi-colored stained glass rises up behind the altar, catching the light to transmute it into a cascading glory of rainbowed light that spills over everything in its path like a gift from the heavens.","The roof of this small, quaint chapel reaches a steep peak above, its end eventually lost in the shadows.  Candles help to lift the veil of darkness, their silent flames sustaining the tranquility that engulfs the snug chamber.  A square altar, located against the western wall, is fitted in front of a window of multi-colored stained glass.  Although its colors are dimmed by night, the images fitted into it are illuminated by the burning tapers, rendering them clear enough for viewing."],"exits":[{"to":348,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine1-04","Chapel"]},
  {"id":352,"x":-140,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, South Hallway","descriptions":["The faint outline of your image is blurred on the sheen of the highly polished mahogany walls.  Short red carpeting, maintained in pristine condition, cushions the hardwood floors.  Hand-carved cherrywood cuts horizontally across the paneling halfway from the ceiling in a decorative trim."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":353,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":339,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":364,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":353,"x":-160,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Gathering Room","descriptions":["This room serves as a social hub for the cherished members of the guild to gather and share their adventures and exploits with one another.  Highly polished mahogany walls open up to a large bay window overlooking the River Oxenwaithe.  The guild staff keeps fresh treats available on the serving cart."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":352,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":354,"x":-140,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Reception","descriptions":["The reception desk is stacked with letters, invoices, purchase requests, and a general stream of bizarre visitors, yet still maintains a sense of orderliness, due mainly to the young Prydaen man behind it.  He seems the sort who can keep control of even the most stressful of situations without blinking."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":355,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":365,"exit":"go","move":"go guildleader's office"}]},
  {"id":355,"x":-150,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, West Hallway","descriptions":["The faint outline of your image is blurred on the sheen of the highly polished mahogany walls.  Short red carpeting, maintained in pristine condition, cushions the hardwood floors.  Hand-carved cherrywood cuts horizontally across the paneling halfway from the ceiling in a decorative trim."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":356,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":565,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":356,"x":-150,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Hall of Records","descriptions":["This is the nerve center of the Traders' Guild, a long narrow hall plunged into a state of utter chaos.  While harried clerks run to and fro collecting paperwork to assist the guild's members, others are busily calculating the ever-fluctuating exchange rates of nearby towns.  As your senses assimilate the free-flying information, you begin to notice a kind of method to this room's insatiable madness."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":357,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":355,"exit":"go","move":"go winding stair"},{"to":567,"exit":"go","move":"go brass-edged doorway"}],"aliases":["Trade Minister"]},
  {"id":357,"x":-160,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Shipment Center","descriptions":["A sense of chaos mingled with urgency pervades the scene before you.  Harried stock clerks rush about, gathering orders and directing sweating laborers in assembling the contents of endless caravans.  The cavernous room echoes with grunts and banging and voices all shouting conflicting commands, each trying to drown the other out to be heard first.  Impatient traders try to catch the fleeting attention of the clerks and give vent to a varied array of oaths in many tongues when ignored."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":356,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":359,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":86,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Shipment Clerk"]},
  {"id":358,"x":-160,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Foreign Trade Office","descriptions":["This cramped office, a former broom closet, is a close definition of chaos.  An old desk, cluttered with orders awaiting delivery to other provinces, occupies most of this room.  A mottled carpet covers the floor except in the few spots it is burned through from carelessly dropped cigars butts.  What wall space is available is covered with hastily drawn charts tracking the movement of goods between provinces."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Interprovincial Broker"]},
  {"id":359,"x":-160,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, The Pit","descriptions":["Several short steps lead to a sunken floor, where a handful of frazzled clerks scramble about in an attempt to deal with a constant flow of tiny parchments.  Traders from all parts of the province are gathered here, awaiting word on trade opportunities or seeking information on purchasing goods."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":563,"exit":"go","move":"go storage cellars"},{"to":564,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"}],"aliases":["Pit"]},
  {"id":360,"x":-140,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Narrow Corridor","descriptions":["This seldom used corridor has become a favorite temporary storage room for excessive stock.  Stacks of various wares make quick passage through here difficult.  You notice a thick, steel door just peeking out from behind some wooden pallets.  A Gor'Tog guard leans against it, nonchalant and vigilant at the same time."],"exits":[{"to":356,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":343,"exit":"go","move":"go side door"},{"to":566,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}]},
  {"id":361,"x":-160,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Gold Key Club","descriptions":["The smoke in this room is thicker and more cloying than any encountered at Catrox's Forge, but its source is entirely different.  The finest cigars, the most expensive pipeweed, and imported maugwort weed are being puffed on by the prosperous merchants gathered in this inner sanctum of commerce.  Rotund Halflings in fancy vests, grey-bearded Humans in elegant, fur-trimmed jerkins, Elves in shimmering raiment, all are among the land's elite traders who form the heart of the Guild."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":362,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Gold Key Club"]},
  {"id":362,"x":-170,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Gallery","descriptions":["Immaculate partitions with carefully hung works of art are interspersed throughout the stark gallery.  Crushed velvet roping imposes several feet of distance from these treasured pieces.  Hand-carved sconces are discreetly positioned to cast soft ambient light to accentuate each masterpiece."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow hallway"}]},
  {"id":363,"x":-170,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Hall of Awards","descriptions":["The sheen of polished mahogany floors vanishes into dimness at the far end of the long hall.  As your eyes follow the length of the flooring, you notice a series of niches set into the walls.  Nearby, a delicate rope of fine silk stretches across the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["RS Trader2"]},
  {"id":364,"x":-140,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Conference Room","descriptions":["An air of formality can be felt throughout this stately room where conclaves are welcome to gather and collaborate on various guild matters.  The Crossing Traders' Guild crest is proudly displayed on the rear wall and next to it, in the corner, is a superbly stitched flag bearing the emblem of the Traders' Guild.  A large oval mahogany conference table dominates the room and is surrounded on all sides by finely crafted leather wingback chairs."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":365,"x":-140,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Office of the Guildleader","descriptions":["Long imported silk drapes extend from ceiling to floor and are gathered on either side of a large area window that spans several paces in length.  From this vantage point the bank, gates and various guilds and merchants can be seen throughout Crossing.  An exceptional hand-spun silk carpet nearly covers the entire floor.  Positioned directly opposite the guildleader's desk is a large map of the province mounted high up on the wall."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Trader","Ansprahv","RS Trader1"]},
  {"id":366,"x":-10,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"A Mud Hovel","descriptions":["The tiny windowless hovel feels cramped despite its minimal furnishings.  A coarsely woven blanket is folded neatly in the corner.  One lone shelf on the wall holds the occupant's only food supplies -- a sack of rice, a pitcher of water and a few wilted mustard stalks are arranged next to a single wooden bowl and spoon.  A wizened old Dwarf sits cross-legged in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":125,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Discipline"]},
  {"id":367,"x":-170,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"The Academy of Agility","descriptions":["Many people stand about, watching others engaged in a bizarre ritual.  Four hold pairs of staves on the ground, the fifth stands in the center.  At a signal, the stave holders begin to sweep them across the floor in a rhythmic pattern of dazzling complexity.  The person in the middle begins to leap and caper, avoiding the impact of the heavy rods as they slap together.  You notice that you are being watched and you realize you must soon put your own agility to the test or leave untrained and unproven."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Agility"]},
  {"id":368,"x":-50,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Skirr'lolasu, Main Deck","descriptions":["In anticipation of the sudden influx of passengers, makeshift benches have been hastily constructed from kegs, driftwood, and nets stretched tight between boards, then have been cleverly placed so that they are as out of the way as possible.  Some coiled ropes and other rigging lie scattered around, pushed out of the way so no one will trip over them."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":169,"exit":"go","move":"go dock"}],"aliases":["Skirr'lolasu"],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":369,"x":280,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Grisgonda's Gems and Jewels","descriptions":["As you step into the room, your feet sink into plush carpets.  The walls are set with numerous locked display cases.  A well-dressed guard gives you a polite visual once over and steps aside so you may enter.  Gems of every sort and size, from slivers of plain looking crystal to a massive heart-shaped gem the size of a Gor'Tog's fist are displayed.  Grisgonda herself sits at a plain black marble desk with a bright lamp upon it inspecting gems that have been brought in for sale by other adventurers."],"exits":[{"to":155,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":370,"exit":"go","move":"go side room"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Grisgonda's Gems and Jewels","Jewelry"]},
  {"id":370,"x":290,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Grisgonda's, Appraisal Room","descriptions":["This small room is filled with the subdued glimmer of many gems.  Locked cases of heavy crystal line the walls, each containing a staggering array of precious stones and gems of endless variety, cut, color and shape.  A soft white light falls upon a small table covered with black velvet.  It radiates from a curious lamp set in the center of the table."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Gems"]},
  {"id":371,"x":210,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Behind the Amphitheater, Supply Stand","descriptions":["Trampled grass and a pair of lingering mud puddles mar the once lush lawn surrounding the amphitheater.  Pickaxes and shovels lean against tables full of supplies, behind which sits a surly-looking Dwarf."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":"go grass path"}]},
  {"id":372,"x":220,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Behind the Amphitheater, Excavation Site","descriptions":["This section of the site has had the top layer of soil removed.  Several shallow trenches have been roped off to preserve the integrity of the dig."],"exits":[{"to":373,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":376,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":375,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":371,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":373,"x":230,"y":-130,"z":0,"title":"Behind the Amphitheater, Excavation Site","descriptions":["This section of the site has had the top layer of soil removed.  Several shallow trenches have been roped off to preserve the integrity of the dig."],"exits":[{"to":374,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":376,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":372,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":374,"x":240,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Behind the Amphitheater, Excavation Site","descriptions":["This section of the site has had the top layer of soil removed.  Several shallow trenches have been roped off to preserve the integrity of the dig."],"exits":[{"to":375,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":376,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":373,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":375,"x":230,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Behind the Amphitheater, Excavation Site","descriptions":["This section of the site has had the top layer of soil removed.  Several shallow trenches have been roped off to preserve the integrity of the dig."],"exits":[{"to":376,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":374,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":372,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":376,"x":230,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Behind the Amphitheater, Center of the Dig","descriptions":["This section of the site has had the top layer of soil removed.  Several shallow trenches have been roped off to preserve the integrity of the dig."],"exits":[{"to":373,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":374,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":375,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":372,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Excavation Site"]},
  {"id":377,"x":230,"y":-150,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Amphitheater, The Back Lawn","descriptions":["A sprawling lawn provides seating for those individuals wishing to listen to the discussion in the amphitheater while not wanting to be limited to the restrictions of the seating area."],"exits":[{"to":378,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":378,"x":230,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Amphitheater, The Seating Area","descriptions":["Stone benches and wooden seats form a semi-circle around a stage at the north end of this theater.  Designed so even a whisper can be heard by all, this area is used for everything from town meetings to staged performances."],"exits":[{"to":377,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"aliases":["Amphitheater"]},
  {"id":379,"x":240,"y":-230,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Mongers' Bazaar","descriptions":["Some ramshackle stalls and tattered tents comprise the informal flea market known as Mongers' Bazaar.  The springy grass of the Green has been trampled into foot-sucking muck by folk seeking bargains, black-market goods, or unusual trinkets.  Exotic items of rare power and value are sometimes sold here by the itinerant vendors who flock to The Crossing from all corners of Elanthia."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"north","move":"script crossingtrainerfix north"},{"to":380,"exit":"southeast","move":"script crossingtrainerfix southeast"},{"to":381,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go collegium"},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":"script crossingtrainerfix go path"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Mags","Firewood Peddler"]},
  {"id":380,"x":280,"y":-190,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Mongers' Square","descriptions":["Set into the center of the bazaar's main square is a bronzed fountain depicting the fatherly figure of Divyaush, his long chiseled beard covering the top of his robes and his painted azure eyes gazing into the water below.  Children and shoppers stop on their way past, often wetting their hands or their faces in the cool clear water.  To the southwest, brightly covered pennants sail above the sea of canvas that is the Traders' Market tent."],"exits":[{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go stone arch"},{"to":384,"exit":"go","move":"go walkway ramp"},{"to":391,"exit":"go","move":"go market tent"},{"to":1295,"exit":"go","move":"go market plaza"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Gnomish workman","workman"]},
  {"id":381,"x":260,"y":-230,"z":0,"title":"Rartan's Collegium of Inner Juggling and Reflexology","descriptions":["This room is filled with what at first seems to be a group of demented jugglers and acrobats.  Each person is engaged in various feats of balancing and reflexive behavior, such as dancing on a row of knife blades or balancing a lit torch upon one's nose.   There is a sense of intense concentration in the air.  The room is mostly silent, save for the occasional muttered curse or muffled scream as someone fails in their efforts.  Several professors gaze your way, waiting to begin your training."],"exits":[{"to":379,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Reflex"]},
  {"id":382,"x":320,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Bazaar Walkway","descriptions":["Gently sloping above the shops along the eastern side of town, this elegant acanth walkway connects the bustling bazaar to the Hodierna Way, providing merchants and shoppers a quick and guarded way to reach the local bank.  Gilded rails and posts protect the pedestrians from misstepping off the bridge, while adding an element of beauty that complements the rich acanth wood."],"exits":[{"to":383,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":160,"exit":"go","move":"go hodierna ramp"}]},
  {"id":383,"x":320,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Bazaar Walkway","descriptions":["Bowing gracefully above the Town Green and the shops along Albreda Boulevard, the raised walkway leaps across the skyline, connecting the bazaar to Hodierna Way.  Merchants heavy with coin bustle quickly towards the bank, while more leisurely shoppers wander across the gilded walkway, pausing sometimes to admire the view of Crossing -- the spherical shape of the Temple majestically rising above the city proper."],"exits":[{"to":384,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":382,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":384,"x":320,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Bazaar Walkway","descriptions":["Rising over the Mongers' Bazaar and Crossing's Town Green, this acanth walkway is expertly built with sturdy, thick planks and gold rails and posts.  Stretching north to south across the rooftops of the city, the walkway allows an excellent view of the surrounding area."],"exits":[{"to":383,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":852,"exit":"go","move":"go bazaar ramp"}]},
  {"id":385,"x":-90,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Woodruff's Recitation Room","descriptions":["A smattering of applause greets you when you enter the cottage.  Several seated youths are listening attentively to an Elothean lad at a podium who is addressing them.  He speaks animatedly with eloquent gestures, and his audience leans forward in their seats, captivated by his speech.  A Halfling instructress studies him carefully, occasionally jotting down a notation in her book."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FFFF00","aliases":["Charisma"]},
  {"id":386,"x":450,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Northeast Gate Battlements","descriptions":["Straddling the Northeast Gate, the stone battlements overlook the busiest entrance to the city.  Stone merlons offer some cover to those fighting, and the embrasures appear designed to accommodate either onager or archer.  The cobbled walk only stretches a short distance to the west and south, where it is broken by the tall but unfinished expanse of the town wall."],"exits":[{"to":387,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":388,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":145,"exit":"go","move":"go stair"},{"to":171,"exit":"climb","move":"climb embrasure"}],"aliases":["NE Battlements"]},
  {"id":387,"x":450,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, East Wall Battlements","descriptions":["Before becoming impassable, the cobbled walkway atop the town wall slopes south toward the Segoltha River.  A small stone guardhouse is set snugly against the outer battlement wall, offering those warriors not on watch a place to shelter from the elements.  Some whimsical soul has set a flowerpot and a doormat proclaiming Go Away! by the guardhouse door."],"exits":[{"to":386,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":389,"exit":"climb","move":"climb break"},{"to":171,"exit":"climb","move":"climb small embrasure"},{"to":390,"exit":"go","move":"go stone guardhouse"}]},
  {"id":388,"x":410,"y":-528,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, North Wall Battlements","descriptions":["Although the defensive wall itself is sturdy and serviceable as it stretches toward the North Gate, the cobbled walkway atop the town wall crumbles to incompletion.  The chisel marks in the wall's stones are still fresh and raw, as if the rocks were set into place just recently.  From here, the most notable landmark is the Paladin guild and the homes near it.  On the inner side of the walkway, a low wooden barrier prevents anyone from stumbling backwards and dropping to the ground below."],"exits":[{"to":386,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":389,"x":470,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Outside East Wall, Footpath","descriptions":["Under the shadow of eastern section of The Crossing's stone town wall, this footpath serves as a shortcut.  Barely wide enough for one person, thick brambles and brush allow passage in single file.   A few crevices in the wall make adequate handholds as you squeeze your way along the uneven ground and past thorny branches."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":387,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wall"}],"linksTo":"Map8_Crossing_East_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":390,"x":430,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Battlement Guardhouse","descriptions":["Sparsely furnished, the guardhouse has an odd sense of cheerfulness.  The single cot has a brightly quilted coverlet, and the only lantern in this windowless room sports a garland of dried flowers.  A desk and a stool are shoved up against one of the stone walls, and someone has made a chalk outline on the wall to mimic a figure sitting on the stool."],"exits":[{"to":387,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Battlement Guardhouse"]},
  {"id":391,"x":364,"y":-190,"z":0,"title":"Mongers' Bazaar, Traders' Market","descriptions":["The large open tent billows with every caress of wind from above, pressing against the taut lines and wooden frame that hold the structure in place.  Tables line the center of the tent, ready to be set full of wares in hopes of attracting an eager eye and a heavy pouch."],"exits":[{"to":392,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":393,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":394,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Mongers' Bazaar","Bazaar","Tent"]},
  {"id":392,"x":364,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Mongers' Bazaar, Traders' Market","descriptions":["The large open tent billows with every caress of wind from above, pressing against the taut lines and wooden frame that hold the structure in place.  Tables line the center of the tent, ready to be set full of wares in hopes of attracting an eager eye and a heavy pouch."],"exits":[{"to":393,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":394,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":391,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":393,"x":374,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Mongers' Bazaar, Traders' Market","descriptions":["The large open tent billows with every caress of wind from above, pressing against the taut lines and wooden frame that hold the structure in place.  Tables line the center of the tent, ready to be set full of wares in hopes of attracting an eager eye and a heavy pouch."],"exits":[{"to":394,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":391,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":392,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":394,"x":374,"y":-190,"z":0,"title":"Mongers' Bazaar, Traders' Market","descriptions":["The large open tent billows with every caress of wind from above, pressing against the taut lines and wooden frame that hold the structure in place.  Tables line the center of the tent, ready to be set full of wares in hopes of attracting an eager eye and a heavy pouch."],"exits":[{"to":393,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":391,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":392,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":395,"x":430,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, East Gate Battlements","descriptions":["From this height, Ulf'Hara Keep is visible in the far distance, and southward flows the churning Segoltha River.  Two of the wall's embrasures contain signal pots, an archaic backup should gwethdesuan or thoughtcast fail.  The cobbled walkway here is directly atop Crossing's eastern gate, overlooking the road into town.","From this height, the ruins of Ulf'Hara Keep are visible in the far distance, and southward flows the churning Segoltha River.  Two of the wall's embrasures contain signal pots, an archaic backup should gwethdesuan or thoughtcast fail.  The cobbled walkway here is directly atop Crossing's eastern gate, overlooking the road into town."],"exits":[{"to":396,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":397,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":162,"exit":"go","move":"go stone stair"},{"to":170,"exit":"climb","move":"climb jagged embrasure"}]},
  {"id":396,"x":430,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, East Wall Battlements","descriptions":["The roof of a tall oak tower abuts the town wall's inner side, just feet below the cobbled walkway.  Scattered stones and feathers among the droppings dappling the roof suggest that a favorite pastime of the soldiers stationed here is chucking rocks at roosting birds.  From the crenellated outer wall the view is uninspiring: broken hovels and barren land marking the biting poverty of the Middens.  Northward, the cobbled walkway abruptly ends at the jagged rock of the unfinished wall."],"exits":[{"to":395,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":402,"exit":"climb","move":"climb break"},{"to":862,"exit":"climb","move":"climb low embrasure"}]},
  {"id":397,"x":410,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, South Wall Battlements","descriptions":["The town wall turns southwest, following where the old earthen wall once stood.  In the distance, the cabins of Riverpine Circle are visible through the embrasures.  The Segoltha River runs near the town wall here, bringing with it the sound of rushing water and sailors' shouts.  Further south, the cobbled walk dissolves into the jagged rock of the unfinished town wall."],"exits":[{"to":395,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":654,"exit":"go","move":"go campaign tent"}],"aliases":["S Battlements"]},
  {"id":398,"x":-361,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, West Gate Battlements","descriptions":["The fitted stone of the town walls intersects in a curved angle, one side becoming the western wall and the other stretching out against the northern border of the town.  From this vantage point above the West Gate, a warrior can watch for enemies breaking from the cover of the northern forest or sweeping up from the grassy plains to the southwest."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":399,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":121,"exit":"go","move":"go stone stairs"},{"to":172,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow embrasure"}],"aliases":["W Battlements"]},
  {"id":399,"x":-361,"y":-328,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, West Wall Battlements","descriptions":["The cobbled pavement atop the walkway crumbles into the unfinished wall as it stretches south toward the Segoltha River.  The view over the wall of lush grassland and farms is a stark contrast to the sight of the slums and squalid buildings that line Kertigen Road."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":403,"exit":"climb","move":"climb embrasure"},{"to":569,"exit":"go","move":"go enclosed lean-to"}]},
  {"id":400,"x":-341,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, North Wall Battlements","descriptions":["Rounding the city's northwestern-most point, the cobbled walkway stretches a short distance before being interrupted by an unfinished section of the town wall.  Although a stack of felled trees evidences the logging in progress, the forest is still perilously close to the new defenses and provides would-be attackers protective cover."],"exits":[{"to":398,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":434,"exit":"climb","move":"climb break"},{"to":864,"exit":"climb","move":"climb jagged embrasure"}]},
  {"id":401,"x":80,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"The True Bard D'Or, Fine Instruments","descriptions":["This is THE shop for Bards.  Famed far and wide for its range of instruments and things bardic, customers travel far just to shop here and to exchange tunes and to hear the latest gossip from Esmaril the owner.  The walls are covered with dozens of music-making devices and glass counters hold strings and reeds and straps.  Rows of pigeonholes hold sheet music from a hundred cultures and more.  A backroom serves as a performance hall and a place for traveling bards to meet and catch up on goings-on.","This is THE shop for Bards.  Famed far and wide for its range of instruments and things bardic, customers travel far just to shop here and to exchange tunes and to hear the latest gossip.  The walls are covered with dozens of music-making devices and glass counters hold strings and reeds and straps.  Rows of pigeonholes hold sheet music from a hundred cultures and more.  A backroom serves as a performance hall and a place for traveling bards to meet and catch up on goings-on."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":651,"exit":"go","move":"go backroom"},{"to":774,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["True Bard D'Or","Music"]},
  {"id":402,"x":450,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Outside East Wall, Footpath","descriptions":["The path winds in and out of a thick patch of stunted bushes near the exterior wall.  It emerges into an area of chipped rock where workers have dumped debris from the town wall's construction."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"linksTo":"Map8_Crossing_East_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":403,"x":-381,"y":-308,"z":0,"title":"Mycthengelde, Flatlands","descriptions":["The path winds through a thick grove of trees running north and south along the walls of The Crossing.  The pleasant smell of flowers mixed with damp earth permeates the air, and birds sing cheerfully from their homes in the foliage.  Directly south, the trees part to reveal a grassy expanse stretching towards a low series of hills."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":399,"exit":"climb","move":"climb town wall"}],"linksTo":"Map4_Crossing_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":404,"x":-170,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Guard House, Office","descriptions":["Like most towns, this one spared every expense when decorating the office of the local guard.  An ancient desk, battered and scarred from years of neglect, is positioned a little too closely behind the counter that divides the room in half.  Scraps of yellowed parchment flutter from a massive cork board just inside the door, where one of the local militia is busily arranging and rearranging the jumble."],"exits":[{"to":405,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":85,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Guard House"]},
  {"id":405,"x":-160,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Guard House, Hallway","descriptions":["At the far end of the hallway, faint light illuminates the iron grating set into a heavily barred door.  Hideous green paint flakes from the walls, settling onto the stone floors and crunching underfoot with each step."],"exits":[{"to":406,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":404,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":406,"x":-150,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Guard House, Chamber of Justice","descriptions":["A chill races through your spine as you stare up at the platform from which justice is so mercilessly dispensed by the local magistrate.  A few low benches stretch out along the western wall, where a heavily-armed guard oversees visitors and defendants alike with a stern, watchful eye."],"exits":[{"to":405,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Judge"]},
  {"id":407,"x":110,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Brother Durantine's Shop","descriptions":["In this small adjunct to a local order of monks, Brother Durantine offers a variety of holy items and related things.  An assortment of holy symbols may be had as well as blessed waters, candles and ritual vestments for any who wish to serve their own religious needs.  Cool stone walls decorated with scenes from the life of the founder of the order doing various good deeds provide inspiration to all who see them."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":775,"exit":"go","move":"go private room"},{"to":863,"exit":"go","move":"go dimly-lit storeroom"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Brother Durantine's Shop","Durantine"]},
  {"id":408,"x":-260,"y":-130,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Phosphorescent mosses line the damp rock, weakly piercing the gloom to reveal a narrow tunnel.  The odor of generations of refuse, stagnant water and things less unidentifiable assail your nose.  The faint sound of water can be heard in the distance. "],"exits":[{"to":409,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":298,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":409,"x":-250,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Moisture, seeping through the bedrock, has eroded the walls to the point of danger.  Once hard stone now crumbles at your touch making the footing slick and treacherous."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":420,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":408,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":410,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"}]},
  {"id":410,"x":-260,"y":-150,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The water, fed by the city's drainage system, deepens into a swiftly moving spate.  Echoed back from the tunnel walls, the water's thrum reverberates in a primal rhythm."],"exits":[{"to":409,"exit":"go","move":"go stone archway"},{"to":411,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":411,"x":-270,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Swirling and eddying, the water marches onward at a slightly slower pace.  Thigh high to a Gor'tog, the impenetrable blackness of the surface leaves you hoping that no aquatic creatures have chosen this as their home."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":412,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":412,"x":-280,"y":-170,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A layer of sludge coats the floor where the water, finally receding to a trickle, has deposited its burden of mud and sewage across the rock."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":411,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":413,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":413,"x":-290,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Aged oak timbers rise up to block off any further travel up this tunnel.   Fastened with thick iron spikes driven into the living rock, the heavy wood bears mute witness that this is no temporary blockade, though air rustling through some slight gaps indicates that there is space on the other side."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":414,"x":-270,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Bricked and mortared, the walls arch overhead to meet the stone of the ceiling while, underfoot, a channel carved into the floor carries run-off water into the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":415,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":412,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":415,"x":-260,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Piles of rusty scaffolding, illuminated from wall lanterns driven into the rock, fling angular shadows across heaps of unused stone.  Several cots molder in various corners and a disintegrating wheelbarrow stands frozen with its last load of debris.  Apparently a storage area or a worker's bunkhouse while the sewers were being constructed, the puffs of dust kicked up at every footfall prove it to be long abandoned."],"exits":[{"to":416,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":418,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":414,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":416,"x":-250,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Enveloping darkness has made this section of the sewers a hazardous obstacle course with loose bricks and slick rock waiting to catch unwary feet and elbows.  A sharp sound like an iron nail scratching across an articulated greave echoes faintly through the blackness."],"exits":[{"to":417,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":418,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":415,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":417,"x":-240,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The sewer suddenly empties out into a natural cavern substantially larger than the surrounding tunnels.  Phosphorous mosses and lichens, thriving in the damp air, add their light to more of the wall lanterns which, in turn, illuminate a huge mound of rubble growing from the floor of the cavern.  Several stories high, enterprising engineers apparently solved the problem of removing the detritus of tunnel excavation by simply dumping it here and forming the mound."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":416,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":888,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rubble mound"}]},
  {"id":418,"x":-250,"y":-170,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Raggedly oval in shape, a pool of darkness dwarfs the drainage trench that leads to its very edge.  A roaring mist is carried aloft by the strong updraft swirling through the area revealing the nature of the darkness a vast oubliette that plunges towards the core of Elanthia carrying the wastewater of the city with it."],"exits":[{"to":416,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":417,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":415,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":419,"x":-250,"y":-150,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The walls, perhaps due to some natural fault in the rock, angle inward somewhat here, and the weight of the city above presses down upon you."],"exits":[{"to":420,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":409,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":420,"x":-240,"y":-150,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Water running off from other parts of the sewer has puddled here in a slight depression in the floor.  The corpse of a skinned rodent bobs slowly in the lightly swirling current, playing water tag with the decomposing remains of a wooden crate."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":409,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":419,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":421,"x":-230,"y":-150,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Sharp scrittering emanates from a tangle of debris that has piled against a turning in the tunnel.  Dotted with slimy patches of moss, an unnatural shifting of the mound indicates it has become a den for...something."],"exits":[{"to":422,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":420,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":422,"x":-230,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Piles of decomposing refuse line the walls and the stink of decay is almost intoxifying in its presence."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":425,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":423,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":423,"x":-240,"y":-130,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A jagged fissure scars the floor here.  Too narrow for even a Halfling to squeeze through yet wide enough for the air currents to send small dust devils dancing about, the edges of the fissure are worn smooth."],"exits":[{"to":422,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":424,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":424,"x":-230,"y":-130,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Long parallel lines score the packed earth floor from one end to the other.  Roughly an inch in depth, it appears as if something heavy has been recently dragged through the tunnel."],"exits":[{"to":425,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":423,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":425,"x":-220,"y":-130,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["This section of the tunnel is unfinished by brick or mortar.  The stone is roughly hewn and marked by pick and shovel gouges."],"exits":[{"to":424,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":422,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":426,"x":300,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["Moss and lichen thickly blanket the walls and floor of the damp underground hall.  At one end, long spiraling oaken stairs hug the side of the shaft that leads up to the main room of the distant Empath Guild.  At the other end, two swinging doors lead into the Healerie proper.  Near the middle, a walnut ramp goes up towards the Hospital Triage while an arch leads into other areas.  Shielded lanterns light the area.","Moss and lichen thickly blanket the walls and floor of the damp underground hall.  At one end, long spiraling oaken stairs hug the side of the shaft that leads up to the main room of the distant Empath Guild.  Near the middle, a walnut ramp goes up towards the Hospital Triage while an arch leads into other areas.  Light reflected from aboveground through an intricate mirror system floods the area."],"exits":[{"to":427,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"},{"to":432,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut ramp"},{"to":431,"exit":"go","move":"go stone arch"},{"to":1007,"exit":"go","move":"go stone portal"},{"to":307,"exit":"go","move":"go some stairs"}]},
  {"id":427,"x":290,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, The Blue Area","descriptions":["Thick blue moss and lichen covering the floor absorb the water that falls from the ceiling of this enormous chamber as well as the blood from the many wounded who come here.  A vast forest of stone stalactites stretches from the ceiling above, the largest as big as great trees and bearing strange crystal orbs like fruit.  The orbs shed a strong bluish light that provides adequate illumination for healing.  A silver plaque has been set into the floor near the middle of this area."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":429,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":428,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"}],"aliases":["Blue Area","triage"]},
  {"id":428,"x":300,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, The White Area","descriptions":["Thick white moss and lichen covering the floor absorb the water that falls from the ceiling of this enormous chamber as well as the blood from the many wounded who come here.  A vast forest of stone stalactites stretches from the ceiling above, the largest as big as great trees and bearing strange crystal orbs like fruit.  The orbs shed a strong white light that provides adequate illumination for healing.  Stalagmites block passage beyond the light where the moss and lichen fail."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":427,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":430,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Healerie","White Area"]},
  {"id":429,"x":300,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, The Yellow Area","descriptions":["Thick yellow moss and lichen covering the floor absorb the water that falls from the ceiling of this enormous chamber as well as the blood from the many wounded who come here.  A vast forest of stone stalactites stretches from the ceiling above, the largest as big as great trees and bearing strange crystal orbs like fruit.  The orbs shed a strong yellow light that provides adequate illumination for healing.  Stalagmites block passage beyond the light where the moss and lichen fail."],"exits":[{"to":428,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":427,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":430,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Yellow Area"]},
  {"id":430,"x":290,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, The Viewing Area","descriptions":["Thick white moss and lichen covering the floor absorb the water that falls from the ceiling of this enormous chamber as well as the blood from the many wounded who come here.  A vast forest of stone stalactites stretches from the ceiling above, the largest as big as great trees and bearing strange crystal orbs like fruit.  The orbs shed a strong white light that provides adequate illumination for healing.  Stalagmites block passage beyond the light where the moss and lichen fail."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":428,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":427,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Viewing Area"]},
  {"id":431,"x":310,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, Dim Corridor","descriptions":["The dim light coming through the arch at the end of the corridor delineates the long shadows of those moving about considerably more than it does the features of the people themselves.  The small amount of additional light coming through the doorway halfway down the corridor further accentuates and twists the shadows of those present, playing them across the floor, walls, and ceiling of smoothly polished black stone.  Cool moist air flows over the stone leaving it slick to the touch."],"exits":[{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go stone arch"},{"to":847,"exit":"go","move":"go stone door"},{"to":1018,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":432,"x":280,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Martyr Saedelthorp, Triage","descriptions":["At first glance it is difficult to tell you are in the renowned healing arts' hospital of Martyr Saedelthorp.  It looks more like a battlefield healer's station.  Blood, gore, sweat and mud streak the tiled floor and the wooden benches.  Groaning adventurers in various states of shock and consciousness await tending by concerned but fatigued healers.  You gingerly step over a patient with a severed limb sprawled out on a canvas stretcher."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go wide arch"},{"to":426,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut ramp"}],"color":"#00BF80","aliases":["Healer","Kaiva","Martyr Saedelthorp","Saedelthorp"]},
  {"id":433,"x":-90,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Cormyn's House of Heirlooms","descriptions":["The walls here of an odd white adobe, smeared with stucco that has been inlaid with broken bits of colored glass, mirror fragments and round disks of polished metal resembling coins.  This is obviously Cormyn's idea of elegance.  The merchandise that others have pawned, or that is awaiting redemption, seems to be mostly flotsam and jetsam.  Noting the huge ruby on Cormyn's finger, and the stout gold chain about his neck, it dawns on you that there may be more here than meets the eye."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1016,"exit":"go","move":"go lunat door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cormyn's House of Heirlooms","Pawn"]},
  {"id":434,"x":-341,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Northwall Trail, Wooded Grove","descriptions":["A rhythmic chittering amid feathery patches of fern welcomes you to this grove.  Tall wyndwood and oak trees, thickly cloaked in ivy, arch over a thin trail that bends around the town wall to the northeast.  Like a puppeteer, the leafy canopy directs a dance of sunlight and shadow across the ground.","The rhythmic song of cicadas hums through the grove, welcoming the passerby's footfalls.  The silvery eyes of night peer down through the rustling canopy overhead, illuminating the bare soil of a thin trail that bends around the town wall to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":400,"exit":"climb","move":"climb town wall"}],"linksTo":"Map4_Crossing_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":435,"x":290,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Marcipur's Stitchery, Workshop","descriptions":["Only one word could possibly describe the atmosphere of this charming establishment: chaos.  Fabric in every hue and pattern imaginable spills onto the floor from countertops and tables, making every step an exercise in coordination.  The diminutive proprietress happily scampers about from one customer to the next, pinning up a hem here, deftly stitching up a bodice there, and hopping up onto a crate to adjust a neckline over in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Marcipur's Stitchery","Clothing"]},
  {"id":436,"x":390,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Talmai's Cobblery, Salesroom","descriptions":["Wiping his hands on his leather apron, Talmai emerges from the stockroom at the first sound of an approaching customer.  With one ham-sized, callused hand, he points first to the catalog lying on the low counter, and then to a makeshift wooden rack with sample shoes, boots, slippers and sandals.  With the other hand, he brandishes a measuring stick, almost like a club.  You smile and examine his wares."],"exits":[{"to":148,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Talmai's Cobblery","Shoes"]},
  {"id":437,"x":110,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Old Warehouse, Storeroom","descriptions":["The interior of this large warehouse is only partially filled with goods.  The squeak of rats scuttling in the shadows echoes eerily from the high ceiling.  Cracks and knotholes in the outer walls allow a dim grey light to penetrate the utter darkness."],"exits":[{"to":438,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":48,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":438,"x":110,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Old Warehouse, River Side Storage","descriptions":["This end of the warehouse projects out over the river on old and shaky pilings.  Waves echo through wide cracks in the flooring where dark waters thrash the muddy riverbank below.  There is a smell of must and rot, of things long away from clean air and warm sunshine.  Odd bits of mud here and there suggest that something has been dragged along the decking."],"exits":[{"to":437,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":636,"exit":"go","move":"go small trapdoor"}]},
  {"id":439,"x":-370,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"A Damp Cavern","descriptions":["The fetid air in this portion of the dark cavern is heavy with a green mist of fungi spores.  They sting and itch wherever they touch unprotected skin, and leave a burning sensation in mouth and throat."],"exits":[{"to":572,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":102,"exit":"go","move":"go splintered door"}],"aliases":["Damp Cavern"]},
  {"id":441,"x":90,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["A large kiln sits to the north, where stacks of lumber are slowly dried.  Here, close-set piles of green lumber air-dry before being taken to the kiln or used directly.  The huge piles of wood are stacked loosely, to allow air to circulate.  The local rats find these inner highways very much to their liking."],"exits":[{"to":442,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":244,"exit":"go","move":"go large kiln"}]},
  {"id":442,"x":90,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Several immense piles of rough-cut green lumber have been stacked in loose heaps to dry before further cutting and planing.  The air is rich with resin from the woodpiles.  Saw-dust and splinters form untidy heaps almost everywhere between the stacked boards."],"exits":[{"to":441,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":449,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":443,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":443,"x":80,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["A space has been cleared among the piles of lumber to allow planks and stringers to be hauled to the saw nearby.  The air is redolent with the smell of fresh-cut wood and a haze of saw-dust drifts in the air.  Several grunting laborers sweat and strain to arrange a pile of timbers as thick as a man's leg into some semblance of order.","A space has been cleared among the piles of lumber to allow planks and stringers to be hauled to the saw nearby.  The air is redolent with the smell of fresh-cut wood and a haze of saw-dust drifts in the air.  Numerous rats scamper about on the nearby woodpiles and their droppings are everywhere."],"exits":[{"to":442,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":444,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":451,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":444,"x":70,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Broken and rotted wood is piled in ragged heaps.  Lumber that has failed the grade is left here, to be used for lesser purposes or to be burned for fuel.  Some soul, with more time than sense, has made a neat pile of knots that have been knocked out of the wood.  Rats chitter from within the ruined stacks.","A space has been cleared among the piles of lumber to allow planks and stringers to be hauled to the saw nearby.  The air is redolent with the smell of fresh-cut wood and a haze of saw-dust drifts in the air.  Numerous rats scamper about on the nearby woodpiles and their droppings are everywhere."],"exits":[{"to":443,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":445,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":445,"x":80,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Wood, dark as the night sky, has been neatly stacked to dry.  Ebony and flame-grained oak mingle with ironwood and other rare species.  Barana never neglects the luxury trade that calls on his yard for their needs."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":444,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":446,"x":90,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Light and dark woods alternate in a zig-zag pile that reaches to a considerable height.  Some lengths are a good thirty or more feet long and jut out of the pile in a stair-step effect."],"exits":[{"to":447,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":445,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":452,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden lengths"}]},
  {"id":447,"x":100,"y":400,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Some accident or careless worker has tumbled a great stack of wood.  Broken and splintered lengths of ash and oak and other types litter the ground as though a tornado had whipped through the yard.  A dead rat hangs impaled on a jagged splinter high overhead where several lengths of wood from an adjoining pile protrude."],"exits":[{"to":448,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":446,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":448,"x":110,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Huge piles of wood in varying states of dryness and type are heaped into untidy rows and piles.  There is a faint rustling from within the larger stacks, where the rats that infest this place make their nests and breed their endless young."],"exits":[{"to":447,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":449,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":449,"x":100,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["A few rough tree trunks, stripped of bark and limbs, are piled into a giant's version of jackstraws.  A huge lathe nearby shows their intended fate is to become sturdy masts and yards for ships waiting repair.  One thick ash log, perhaps not suited to its original purpose, has been carved into a fanciful shape."],"exits":[{"to":450,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":448,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":442,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":450,"x":110,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lathe Works","descriptions":["A huge troughlike affair set low to the ground appears to be the bed of an enormous lathe.  Used to turn rough tree trunks into ruler-straight masts and yards, it is an awe-inspiring engine.  Several examples of its output lie scattered about on the chip-littered ground, awaiting further attention from spokeshave and drawknife to fit them for their role."],"exits":[{"to":449,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":451,"x":70,"y":370,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Circular Saw","descriptions":["A large circular saw squats like some obscure god waiting for the sacrifice of the logs piled high nearby.  Neat rows of sacks containing the left-over sawdust and woodchips await transport elsewhere, while rows of rough-hewn planks ponder their destiny in the drying racks and kiln."],"exits":[{"to":443,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":452,"x":110,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["The huge tottering pile of wood is unsteady underfoot.  It creaks and shifts with each movement and there are many gaps where the planks have been separated to dry better.  There is a fine view of the rest of the wood-lot, as well as a few of the nearby roofs of other buildings and the adjacent river and mudflats."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wood"},{"to":453,"exit":"go","move":"go dark niche"}]},
  {"id":453,"x":120,"y":410,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Lumber Stacks","descriptions":["Whether the gift of fate or the intent of lazy employees looking for a hide-out, this small space tucked deep between towering stacks of drying wood has an almost cozy feel to it.  An old rug, nailed to some boards, provides a modest shelter from the weather.  A few scattered tufts of fur show that the rats may enjoy this place as well."],"exits":[{"to":452,"exit":"climb","move":"climb lumber"}]},
  {"id":454,"x":110,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Office","descriptions":["Unpolished and dusty, a rosewood counter -- bare except for a scarred leather appointment book -- straddles the center of the office.  Thick air, damp and sour with the smell of dust, marsh and ocean, makes breath difficult in this little reception room.  Directly behind the counter, there is an oak door that leads to Barana's office.  Punctuating the dark paneled walls, several windows overlook the construction yards where vessels rest in various states of completion."],"exits":[{"to":455,"exit":"go","move":"go short corridor"},{"to":237,"exit":"go","move":"go leather flap"}]},
  {"id":455,"x":90,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Corridor","descriptions":["Two long benches give the short walls of this stubby corridor the appearance of being even more short than they are.  A doorless exit going out at the end of the hallway leads to the construction yards.  Other directions lead back to the main office and to the drydock, cartography, and brokerage services offices."],"exits":[{"to":456,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":454,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":457,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":458,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":459,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":456,"x":90,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Drydock Services","descriptions":["Stacked crates lean against the walls, along with kegs of tar, coils of rope, and casks of paint.  Amidst all the clutter is an antique roll-top desk covered in dust, cobwebs and surprisingly healthy plants.  Half-used candles rest in a spray of brass sconces mounted upon each wall."],"exits":[{"to":455,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":457,"x":90,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Brokerage","descriptions":["Scraps of paper advertising ships for sale layer the walls and partially overlap the small windows.  Several chairs elegantly covered in soft, buttery leather are scattered around the room to facilitate negotiations between parties -- or simply provide a comfortable place to nap.  A low table laid out with refreshments rests against one wall, just the thing to grease a deal along."],"exits":[{"to":455,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":458,"x":70,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Cartography Services","descriptions":["Framed ocean charts hang unevenly upon the dark paneled walls.  The wooden floor, once handsomely inlaid with a mariner's compass, is now a scuffed mess in desperate need of sanding and polishing.  A clerk is hunched over a drawing board, working on a new chart."],"exits":[{"to":455,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":459,"x":110,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Construction Yard","descriptions":["Set near the main office, this wide expanse of muddy earth bordering the Segoltha is the perfect setting for a construction yard.  Positioned near the water is a massive wooden frame, used to form the hull and hold it in place while the rest of the ship is built.  Planks, kegs of tar, pegs and pulleys arranged in blocks and tackle are scattered about the area, ready for the shipbuilder's use.  The construction yard continues southeast."],"exits":[{"to":460,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":454,"exit":"go","move":"go main office"}]},
  {"id":460,"x":130,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Construction Yard","descriptions":["Although sporadically flooded by seasonal rains and severe tides, the wooden cradle used for shipbuilding seems solidly stationed.  Another keel is being laid in it.  To the east is the mast pond, and in the distance, farther from the bank, is the sail-maker's shed."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":459,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":461,"x":150,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Construction Yard","descriptions":["Long, straight timbers of ash, ironwood and teak bob in the mast pond, awaiting their turn to be stepped into a ship to serve as proud bearer of sail.  Nearby, wooden scaffolding is ready to assist the shipwright in his trade.  Eastward, the mudflat juts a little further into the water, and moving westerly returns to the main shipyard office."],"exits":[{"to":462,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":460,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":462,"x":170,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Construction Yard","descriptions":["Set at the end of the muddy finger of land, this last construction area and its wooden cradle seem more a home for birds and fishermen than shipbuilding.  There is a neat row of small boats turned hull up to have the barnacles scraped from them.  The water's edge is littered with cracked mussel shells, dropped from above by gulls intent upon eating the soft interiors."],"exits":[{"to":461,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":463,"x":50,"y":-395,"z":0,"title":"Saranna's Sweet Tooth, Kitchen","descriptions":["Massive brick ovens take up at least half of the kitchen, keeping the room cozy in even the chilliest of weather. Pretty young maidens, elbow-deep in dough and frosting, work diligently behind heavy marble counters.  On the southern wall, an elderly halfling lady perches on the edge of a table, sculpting sugared roses and other decorations with deft fingers."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":128,"exit":"go","move":"go side door"}]},
  {"id":464,"x":70,"y":-395,"z":0,"title":"Saranna's Sweet Tooth, Sales Room","descriptions":["All the loveliest colors of spring have been woven into the decor of the village bakery, from sky blue walls, to daffodil yellow countertops, to soft rose rugs dotting the hardwood floors. Young maidens shuffle in and out from the north, constantly replenishing the counters with fresh trays of cream puffs, pies, cakes, and breads.  The slender form of Saranna appears at intervals, smiling and chattering as she hustles between the main sales room and a narrow doorway to the northwest."],"exits":[{"to":463,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":129,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":869,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Saranna's Sweet Tooth","Bakery"]},
  {"id":465,"x":-10,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Stables","descriptions":["White plaster walls hung with drifting cobwebs enclose this dank space.  Identical narrow stalls, each blanketed with a thick carpet of fresh straw, line the walls allowing just enough room for a pathway west to a smaller work area.  Tools and grain barrels rest between each stall, at the ready for any stablehand to use to care for their charges."],"exits":[{"to":466,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":122,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Stable"]},
  {"id":466,"x":-20,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Tack Storage","descriptions":["Barely more than a closet, this tiny space is practically filled with dozens of trunks, boxes, and baskets.  Each is filled to overflowing with goods that often find their way here to be repaired and resold -- one person's loss is another's profit.  Standing in a narrow corner is Stablehand Ilinear, occasionally rummaging through containers apparently looking for a particular piece."],"exits":[{"to":465,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":467,"x":160,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Town Green Pond","descriptions":["You stand on the bank of a tiny pond in the middle of the square.  A thick layer of ice seals the water, and in the distance you can hear the bustle of the town.  The smooth ice looks very inviting, and quite safe!","You stand on the bank of a tiny pond in the middle of the square.  Cool water laps against the soft, velvety silt that covers the shore, and in the distance you can hear the bustle of the town.  Sitting in the middle of the pond is a massive gelapod, looking content and not the least bit aggressive."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Pond"]},
  {"id":468,"x":-64,"y":-346,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Commons","descriptions":["Always a flurry of activity, the guild commons is a place where bards young and old meet to trade tips, tales, and motifs.  Thick, ruby-colored carpeting lines the floor while gold-laced red velvet curtains decorate the walls.  Padded benches surround the area, a few already in use by travelling musicians resting their tired legs."],"exits":[{"to":469,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":29,"exit":"out","move":"out","hidden":true},{"to":470,"exit":"go","move":"go mirrorlike portal"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["Bard","GL Bard","Silvyrfrost","RS Bard"]},
  {"id":469,"x":-54,"y":-346,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Repair Room","descriptions":["Shelves upon shelves of half-built mandolins, violins, lutes, flutes, and a slew of other unidentifiable parts cover the walls.  The scent of rosin and glue wafts in the air.  In the corner, a long sturdy workbench holds a plethora of specialized tools to aid in the crafting of the finest musical instruments."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":470,"x":-74,"y":-346,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Performance Hall","descriptions":["Plush seats lined up in rows face a hardwood stage raised four feet from the ground.  Red velvet curtains draped from the high vaulted ceiling cover the walls.  The acoustics create a warm echo which lends an air of nobility to the place.  A podium in the corner hints that the hall must be used for formal meetings as well as performances."],"exits":[{"to":468,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":471,"exit":"go","move":"go draped archway"}]},
  {"id":471,"x":-84,"y":-346,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Backstage Stairwell","descriptions":["The base of a steep sweeping staircase faces the archway that leads to the performance hall.  However the railing that rises with the stairs appears to be rather shaky, despite the polished surface imposed by years of rapid descents by Bards."],"exits":[{"to":470,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":472,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":473,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sweeping staircase"}]},
  {"id":472,"x":-94,"y":-346,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Prop Room","descriptions":["Set apart and removed from the guild proper by a sturdy door, this room serves as a waystation for traveling Bards to find a quiet place to put down for the night.  Several cots are set up around the room."],"exits":[{"to":471,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"}]},
  {"id":473,"x":-84,"y":-336,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Conservatory","descriptions":["Several smokeless candles flicker from behind cut-glass sconces, bathing the room in a soft and even light that refracts off the countertop of the wraparound bar.  The centerpiece of the conservatory is a beautiful ebonwood clavichord, framed by the top of a staircase and a sliding glass door."],"exits":[{"to":474,"exit":"go","move":"go small alcove"},{"to":475,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"},{"to":471,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sweeping staircase"}]},
  {"id":474,"x":-74,"y":-336,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Keg Alcove","descriptions":["Three oversized oak kegs fill the alcove, leaving barely enough room to reach a curious-looking cupboard on the back wall.  Broken tankards lie carelessly discarded in the corners, and damp stains spot the carpet around each keg, mute reproach to the housekeeping skills of the residents."],"exits":[{"to":473,"exit":"go","move":"go conservatory"}]},
  {"id":475,"x":-94,"y":-336,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Balcony","descriptions":["Sweet fragrances of bright perennials fill the air of the covered balcony that overlooks the boulevard below.  Several outdoor chairs are surrounded by potted lilac, lavender, and gardenia, aiding in the air of relaxation supported by the clear view of the sky above."],"exits":[{"to":473,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}]},
  {"id":476,"x":-350,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Trail","descriptions":["The sounds of the city fade slightly into the background, muffled by the steep slope of the riverbank that lines the trail.  The path follows the river, edging along the slippery slope that is littered with old bottles, broken wood and dead fish."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Segoltha River"],"linksTo":"Map50_Segoltha_River.xml"},
  {"id":478,"x":250,"y":-498,"z":0,"title":"Emmiline's Cottage, Porch","descriptions":["Dimly lit by the lantern in one window, the corners of the wide porch are veiled in shadow.  Dark shapes at one end vaguely resemble a table and seating area, while only a greyish oval window hints at where the door might be.","Swept clean of debris, the white porch stretches across the front of the cottage, protecting the entryway from the elements.  At one end is a small seating area with a swing, two chairs and a glass-topped table.  At the other is a wooden door to enter the cottage, polished to a high sheen and mounted with a frosted window.  The oval glass features an etching of a unicorn standing in a meadow with a small wren perched on its spiraling horn."],"exits":[{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden steps"},{"to":479,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":479,"x":250,"y":-508,"z":0,"title":"Emmiline's Cottage, Sales Floor","descriptions":["Shelves of wares gleam from the warm glow of lanterns lit in corners and on surfaces.  The sales floor seems hushed in the night, though the clerks still busy themselves with cleaning the racks and displays, and with helping customers.  A curtain has been pulled, partially obscuring a set of steps, and a small lantern illuminates the archway that leads to the other sales area.","Warmly toned, the large room invites browsing.  A rack stands in one corner, displaying fabrics in many hues, while in the center of the room, a large display holds an array of items.  Before one window sit a green striped sofa and chair, and a round table stands between them.  A maple and linen screen partially obscures an archway.  Two steps lead to an area hidden behind a curtain."],"exits":[{"to":480,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":478,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":481,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden steps"},{"to":482,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Emmiline's Cottage","Empath Shop"]},
  {"id":480,"x":240,"y":-508,"z":0,"title":"Emmiline's Cottage, Parlor","descriptions":["Quiet murmurs accompany the rustle of paper as clerks and customers alike rifle through the wares offered in the parlor.  A white marble fireplace, clean and unused, displays a number of items on its mantle while a book rack in the corner supports assorted papers and bindings.  Near the window, a white basket glistens in the minimal light available.","Sized and painted like a standard home's parlor, the room is bare of the typical seating arrangement one might expect.  In place of furniture, a large white basket is located near the window.  In one corner stands a book rack with assorted papers tucked into it and the mantle shelf above the fireplace holds additional items."],"exits":[{"to":479,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Emmiline Parlor"]},
  {"id":481,"x":250,"y":-518,"z":0,"title":"Emmiline's Cottage, Kitchen","descriptions":["The room is lit only by the lanterns down the hall in the shop area, casting odd shadows across the kitchen that nearly hide the closed bedroom door.  The fireplace is banked for the night, the kettle set on a granite stone in the ash to keep the contents warm for any late night guests.  Kitchen chairs are tucked neatly in their places next to the table, and the cushion in the corner looks lumpy, as if it has been pushed and pulled for hours.","A tidy kitchen with whitewashed cabinets and a round oak table opens just beyond a short hall leading from the front of the house.  The scent of chocolate drifts in the air and a kettle of tea burbles over the fire.  Placed neatly near the fireplace is a green cushion with lumps and strands of fur in its cloth.  An occasional breeze moves curtains made of yellow gingham tied off with lace ribbon scraps that hang at the windows.  The table is set for company, and a plaque hangs on the wooden door."],"exits":[{"to":479,"exit":"go","move":"go short hall"}]},
  {"id":482,"x":260,"y":-508,"z":0,"title":"Emmiline's Cottage, Pantry","descriptions":["A shelving unit gleams from regular polishing, their shelves laden with supplies and wares both available for sale and those yet to be unpacked.  In the center of the room, a short table sits before a glass display case, both of which hold sparkling treasures."],"exits":[{"to":479,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Emmiline Pantry"]},
  {"id":483,"x":270,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Communal Center, Veranda","descriptions":["Stretching the entire length of the communal center, this veranda faces east towards the Oxenwaithe.  It's a favorite gathering place for resort occupants, but at any given time a travelling merchant or two can be found enjoying a cool drink and the delightful view.  Several tables covered in crisp white cloth stand in neat rows across its length."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":484,"exit":"go","move":"go louvered doors"},{"to":505,"exit":"go","move":"go curving footpath"}],"aliases":["Communal Center"]},
  {"id":484,"x":250,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Common Room","descriptions":["An itinerant mage keeps a fragrant breeze, heavy with the scent of shalyria blossoms growing outside the windows, swirling softly about the room.  White wicker tables provide a place to relax while nibbling from an array of snacks which are laid out on a lunat sideboard along the back wall.  Dangling strands of colorful glass beads clatter musically as a young boy veers around a potted fern on his way to an archway opposite the louvered doors leading to the veranda."],"exits":[{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go louvered doors"},{"to":485,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained archway"}]},
  {"id":485,"x":230,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Narrow Hallway","descriptions":["Shifting patterns of deep red, sparkling sapphire, and clear yellow light dance about the white stucco walls of the hallway with each movement of a beaded glass curtain hanging over the archway leading to the common room.  The light, airy walls are a sharp contrast to the dark oak stairs which lead to the second floor of the building."],"exits":[{"to":484,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained archway"},{"to":486,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow steps"},{"to":487,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak stairs"}]},
  {"id":486,"x":210,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Basement","descriptions":["Gently glowing pillars support the vaulted ceilings, illuminating the basement's nooks and corners.  Between the lack of furnishings and the softly shining light, the guards stationed at either end of the room seem almost superfluous, yet from the alert way they eye all who enter, they evidently take their duties seriously.  A series of narrow steps lead back to the main floor of the Communal Center, while a heavy oak door and a short passage lead to other areas of the basement."],"exits":[{"to":485,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow steps"},{"to":500,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":501,"exit":"go","move":"go short passage"}]},
  {"id":487,"x":250,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["A kitten purrs contentedly as she drowses atop a small table at the end of the hallway, sleeping off a meal of scraps filched from guests.  One of several which inhabit the center, her usual mischievious demeanor is subdued now by slumber.  To the east, an airy white hallway runs the length of the building, while dark oak stairs lead down to the first floor."],"exits":[{"to":488,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":489,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":485,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak stairs"}]},
  {"id":488,"x":250,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Practice Room","descriptions":["White walls are unadorned, providing little to no distractions for students who wish to practice their craft.  The sole furnishings of this spartan room are a worn table and a few wooden chairs, suitable for scholarly pursuits.  Yet despite the stark nature of the room, a window looks out onto the land around the center, and the young people playing outside."],"exits":[{"to":487,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":489,"x":270,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["A light breeze flows from the windows of a room to the south, gently turning a small pink and white mobile which hangs from the ceiling.  Made of twigs and seashells gathered from the nearby beach, it clicks softly as it moves, a charming memento of some child's visit to the center."],"exits":[{"to":490,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":491,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":487,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":490,"x":290,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["The white stucco walls of the Communal Center are cheerful and bright, reflecting light from sun and candle alike.  A heavy oak door, carved with images of dolphins and merfolk playing in the waves, leads north.  To the east and west, the hallway spans the length of the building."],"exits":[{"to":492,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":489,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":491,"x":270,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gathering Room","descriptions":["Flames crackle in the hearth of a stone fireplace.  They glow with a flickering light, casting shadows which dance about the dimly lit room.  The wooden shutters which cover the windows allow air to circulate, but block the light of both sun and moon.  Leather chairs surround the fireplace, with a low tray in easy reach holding a tempting array of snacks.  At the far end of the room stands an odd half-round table surrounded by five wooden stools."],"exits":[{"to":489,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":492,"x":310,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["Strains of music fill the air, echoing about the hallway.  The music room to the south has long been used by bards and others who seek to improve their skills, the pleasant room carefully designed to enhance the performance of artists.  In a shallow niche, a candle burns beneath a driftwood sculpture of wrens perched upon a gnarled branch."],"exits":[{"to":494,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":493,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":490,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":493,"x":310,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Music Room","descriptions":["Soft yellow paint covers the stucco walls, reflecting the light with a soft amber glow.  Actors and musicians perform atop a low stage at one end of the music room, while the audience watches from rows of pale blue sofas and chairs.  Open windows line the southern wall, providing a view of the Crystalline Beach."],"exits":[{"to":492,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":494,"x":330,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway continues past a large room to the north.  Like most rooms along the hallway, there is no door barring the entrance, allowing air to circulate between the rooms in the hot summer months, and heat to spread evenly in winter."],"exits":[{"to":496,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":495,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":492,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":495,"x":350,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["Roses fill a crystal vase atop a polished cherry table at the eastern end of the hallway.  To the north, a tattered sign hangs on a louvered door, while to the south is an open room filled with sunlight, plants and the scent of green and growing things."],"exits":[{"to":497,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":494,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1019,"exit":"go","move":"go louvered door"}]},
  {"id":496,"x":330,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Lounge","descriptions":["Off in a corner, palm trees silently wave in the draft from a nearby window, their leafy green fronds moving gracefully about.  In front of them, carefully placed to catch that same breeze, are some wicker chairs, a low table, and a pile of cushions, such as children use to sprawl upon the floor.  With snacks upon a low table, and the company of friends, this is a charming room in which to relax."],"exits":[{"to":494,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":499,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":497,"x":350,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Solarium","descriptions":["Windows surround the room on the east and south, flooding the solarium with sunshine during the day, and moonlight at night.  Taking advantage of this, the designers of the center have set out several small chaises upon which guests can lie back and relax while they bask in the light.  Against the north wall, a glass tank houses a brightly colored siren fish which lazily swims about."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":498,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Solarium"]},
  {"id":498,"x":330,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Conservatory","descriptions":["Plants from all parts of the realm fill the room, from delicate palms to graceful lepradria orchids twining about the trunk of a fragrant lemon tree.  The spicy scent of a lily blends with the almost overwhelming sweetness of a freesia, the combination forming an altogether delightful aroma.  A glass door to the south leads to a small balcony."],"exits":[{"to":497,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":635,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"aliases":["Conservatory"]},
  {"id":499,"x":310,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Bar","descriptions":["As in other places of the center, the white stucco walls contrast sharply with the dark oak used to build a small bar.  Atop the bar, a small but ever-changing assortment of drinks have been set out, allowing guests to help themselves.  Stools provide a place to sit, or people may take their drinks over to the lounge to the east."],"exits":[{"to":496,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":500,"x":190,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Bank Teller","descriptions":["Clerks bustle about the tiny room, carrying bags of coins to and from the vault under the eye of a guard.  A teller stands behind a counter at one side of the room.  At the other end, the vault door stands open for those who must transact business via the moongates to other banks in the realms.","Clerks bustle about the tiny room, carrying bags of coins to and from the vault under the eye of a guard.  Visible through a small window, a teller stands behind a counter at one side of the room.  At the other end, the vault door stands open for those who must transact business via the moongates to other banks in the realms."],"exits":[{"to":486,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":502,"exit":"go","move":"go tiny alcove"},{"to":503,"exit":"go","move":"go vault door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Bank","Premium Teller"]},
  {"id":501,"x":237,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Passage","descriptions":["White walls combined with the soft warmth of gently glowing pillars chase away the shadows at the end of the passage.  A guard regards passers-by with an alert eye from his post beside a heavy oak door."],"exits":[{"to":486,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":504,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":502,"x":170,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gemsmith's Alcove","descriptions":["Gently glowing pillars stand to either side of the shallow alcove, their steady light illuminating the counter where the young gemsmith, Jasmine ap'Wyrr, does business.  Her nimble fingers and sharp eye expertly evaluate each gem offered her, while her ready smile and soft voice soften the disappointment when she refuses to purchase an item."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Gems"]},
  {"id":503,"x":190,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Foreign Exchange","descriptions":["The Communal Center prides itself on the special services it provides.  For the convenience of guests, the Center employs mages who, under the careful scrutiny of the guards, maintain moongates between the various banks, running the length and breadth of realms.  These gates allow customers to effortlessly transfer money from other banks, as well as to efficiently exchange currencies, saving their customers time as well as protecting their purses from the hazards of the road."],"exits":[{"to":500,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Premium Exchange"]},
  {"id":504,"x":237,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Fenwyrthie's Curio Shop","descriptions":["Oak shelves line the walls from floor to ceiling, covered with a thin film of dust and cobwebs.  Nestled beneath the stairs leading to the first floor, the shop offers an odd collection of items which catch the fancy of Nathaniel Fenwyrthie, the owner.","Cobweb-covered oak shelves line the walls from floor to ceiling while wicker baskets and oaken chests are nestled snugly before them.  Trays of copper and silver separate a maple table and a dusky oaken counter.  Too many items are certainly crammed into too small a space."],"exits":[{"to":964,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":501,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Fenwyrthie's Curio Shop","Premie Shop","Curio Shop"]},
  {"id":505,"x":350,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["The smell of the sea hangs heavy in the night air, and the sound of activity from the Crossing Docks pierces the darkness.  Moreover, the curving footpath is illuminated by several gaethzen globes hanging from the branches of the bordering trees.","Sand dotted with rocks and interspersed with wavy marram grass dominates the area.  The tree trunks lining the curving footpath tower above the hardy flowers that have managed to thrive.  Gaethzen globes hang from the branches, the orbs aglow despite the presence of daylight for added illumination."],"exits":[{"to":506,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":483,"exit":"go","move":"go curving footpath"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":506,"x":370,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["A few pockets of marram grass stick out of the sand, mixing with more traditional short green tufts that dot the area.  The trees, laden with gaethzen globes, also grow denser as the pathway winds its way northward away from the docks towards an old-growth forest.  Breaking the serenity of the landscape are countless large black ants diligently swarming around a damaged anthill near the base of a nearby willow.","Trees laden with gaethzen globes line the pathway as it continues toward an old-growth forest towards the north.  Black ants scurry in and around a damaged anthill.","The rhythmic sound and smell of the ocean linger faintly in the air, only interrupted by the occasional grunt, groan or curse for those working on the Crossing Docks.  Hanging gaethzen globes light a path in the darkness toward an old-growth forest northward and toward the sound of the crashing waves to the south.  Illuminated by the glow are several ants scurrying along the ground in and around a damaged anthill.","Several gaethzen globes light a path northwards towards an old-growth forest and southward toward the beach.  The glow also illuminates an anthill and several black ants."],"exits":[{"to":507,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":505,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":507,"x":370,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["In the darkness, the gaethzen globes appear to simply hover several feet above the footpath.  However, their light shines on the trees and grasses that surround pathway and cause long shadows to dance on the dirt surface with even the slightest breeze.  Occasionally, a lone rabbit ventures out of its leafy home, braving the darkness for one last meal.","Shaggy green grass and broad-leafed plants have mostly supplanted the marram stalks of the beach's sandy dunes.  Several young trees have gaethzen globes affixed to their braches, causing them to bend over the footpath and create a spacious, leafy arch large enough to permit even the tallest of Gor'Togs to easily pass under.  Woodland rabbits making their home in the foliage dart to and fro while searching for particular vegetarian delights."],"exits":[{"to":508,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":506,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":508,"x":390,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["Glowing like stars captured in the trees' branches, dozens of gaethzen globes shine upon the trees flanking the footpath.  The soft illumination causes the sand tucked inside the grass to glitter.  Flickers of silver inside the darkened underbrush allude to the local foxes' nighttime activity.","Only an occasional patch of sand can be seen in the grass when the wind caresses the blades a certain way.  Strung with gaethzen globes, the trees flanking the footpath are mature, although still not as tall as the old-growth trees that loom in the north.  Flickers of silver against the underbrush allude to the foxes forging a home in the nearby forest."],"exits":[{"to":509,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":507,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":509,"x":390,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["Though the darkness of night is omnipresent, the area retains a comfortable, homey feel due to the friendly chatter of woodland animals in the surrounding forest.  Gaethzen globes glow from their nests deep within the leafy branches of the arching trees.  A small wooden walkway leads toward an open glade astride the continuing route.","Only a few beams of daylight pierce though the canopy of the mature trees edging the dirt path.  Their long, broad leaves arch over the grassy lawns, casting the area in permanent shade and leaving only the gaethzen globes hung from the branches to illuminate the area.  A small wooden walkway leads toward an open glade astride the continuing route."],"exits":[{"to":510,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":508,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":510,"x":410,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["The thickly wooded area surrounding the footpath does an admirable job of ensconcing the area in deep black shadows.  Fastened securely to the many trees along the border, glowing gaethzen globes add a touch of manmade art to the natural environment.  Noisy crickets chirp their rhythmic tones every now and then to break the night's silence.","The thickly wooded area surrounding the footpath does an admirable job of ensconcing the area in muted green tones.  Fastened securely to the many trees along the border, gaethzen globes add a touch of manmade art to the natural environment.  Warbling birds sing their cheery songs every now and then to complement the rustling leaves."],"exits":[{"to":511,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":509,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":511,"x":430,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["Only glimpses of the night sky overhead filter through the trees towering overhead -- a clear indication that they're overdue for trimming.  Dark shapes skip eerily about when movement in the branches causes the dangling gaethzen globes to sway, oddly resembling the dance of shadows animated by a flickering flame.  The nocturnal animals inhabiting the brushwood don't seem to mind the sporadic illumination, scampering from black spot to black spot to avoid detection.","Little light filters through the trees towering overhead -- a clear indication that they're overdue for trimming.  Radiant beams skip gaily about upon the path, making the dirt their own private dance floor.  The local avian population also seems to enjoy the sporadic illumination and that provided by the gaethzen globes, fluttering in between bright shafts as if they were spotlights."],"exits":[{"to":512,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":510,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":512,"x":410,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["The trees beyond the borders of the path thin out at the southern part of the meandering route, yet the light from the gaethzen globes remains constant.  Cool night breezes coming from the southeast bring the scent of fresh river water mingled with the ocean's salty tang.  As if to mimic the neighboring sea, the windswept leaves rustle softly in patterns akin to crashing waves.","The trees beyond the borders of the path thin out at the southern part of the meandering route, yet the light from their gaethzen globes remains constant.  A breeze coming from the southeast brings the scent of the rivers occasionally mingled with the ocean's salty tang.  Gritty sand blends with the ground's dirt to create swirls of pale beige throughout the deeper brown."],"exits":[{"to":511,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":513,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":513,"x":410,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["A small, dark area has been cleared of brush and shrubs to the side of the path.  Visible under the soft glow of numerous gaethzen globes, stone benches and matching tables enclose a communal firepit and public woodbox.  Shadowy willow trees hang over the gathering spot as if to protect visitors from the onslaught of night.","A small area has been cleared of brush and shrubs to the side of the path.  Evenly spaced stone benches and matching tables enclose a communal firepit and public woodbox.  Graceful willow trees supporting numerous gaethzen globes hang protectively over the gathering spot, providing comfortable shade during the warmer months."],"exits":[{"to":512,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":514,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":514,"x":430,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Tree-lined Path","descriptions":["The meticulously tended trees slowly encroach upon the beach, yawning open as if tired from the imposing company of night.  Varied footprints in the malleable ground indicate the preponderance of travelers through the junction, though visitors are relatively scarce compared to during the day.  A small track diverges from the route toward a secluded cove, while a path branches westward in the direction of a small hill.","The meticulously tended trees slowly encroach upon the beach, with stalks of marram grass surrounding the sandy path.  Varied footprints in the malleable ground indicate the preponderance of travelers through the junction, though the atmosphere remains relatively calm and undisturbed.  A small track diverges from the route toward a secluded cove, while a path branches westward in the direction of a small hill."],"exits":[{"to":513,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":515,"exit":"go","move":"go winding path"},{"to":591,"exit":"go","move":"go small track"}]},
  {"id":515,"x":410,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Hilltop","descriptions":["The top of this hilly knoll is devoid of foliage, thus allowing a decent view of the surrounding area from the city's glow cutting through the darkness.  To the north, the woods are dominated by shadowy trees.  Sounds of the burbling Oxenwaithe can be heard as it flows into the chatty Segoltha River to the southeast.  Lights twinkle from the side of the Communal Center situated past the gardens.","The top of this hilly knoll is devoid of foliage, thus allowing a decent view of the surrounding area.  To the north, the thick woods are dominated by old-growth trees.  To the east, the Oxenwaithe River can be spotted as it flows into the Segoltha River to the southeast.  The Communal Center lies south and west past the gardens."],"exits":[{"to":516,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate gate"},{"to":514,"exit":"go","move":"go winding path"}]},
  {"id":516,"x":430,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["Though the evidence of lush foliage is present, mostly shadows greet the eye.  Vines heavy with roses twine themselves around the bordering fence, the blossoms adding their perfume to the fresh night air.  A path originates at the gate and drowns in the gardens' darkness.","Varying shades of green greet the eye.  Vines heavy with selmor roses twine themselves around the white wrought iron fence, the colorful blossoms adding their perfume to the fresh sea air.  A variegated stone path originates at the ornate gate and leads further into the confines of the lush gardens."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":519,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":518,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":515,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate gate"}],"aliases":["Gardens"]},
  {"id":517,"x":450,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["Ethereal tenra blossoms quiver slightly within their cushy bush abodes, each petal glistening with collected condensation from the cool air.  The flowers' delicately sweet odor combines with the saltiness of the ocean breezes, both scents heightened by the serene night atmosphere.  Hooting from nocturnal owls hidden nearby interrupts the mellow atmosphere in the gardens only occasionally.","Ethereal tenra blossoms bob their heads gaily from side to side on their cushy bush abodes.  Their delicately sweet odor is offset by the saltiness of the ocean breezes carried in on the wings of gulls and other water fowl.  The birds' waning cries interrupt the mellow atmosphere in the gardens only occasionally."],"exits":[{"to":521,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":520,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":519,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":516,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":518,"x":450,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["Restful coos of contentment and the occasional fluttering sound of wings come from a nearby tree.  As the sea breeze blows through the branches, the leaves rustle continuously.  The smattering of enshaen near the trunk glows a deep goldenrod hue underfoot, the dim illumination from the Center's windows failing to highlight the vibrancy of the blossoms' true colors.","Shrill chirps of rage interspersed with the gentle songs of more satisfied birds emanate from a low-lying scrub willow tree.  Gathered around the trunk, a smattering of yellow Zoluren enshaen grows together as if congregating for a party.  Only the uniformity of their hues gives away the master gardener's plan."],"exits":[{"to":519,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":520,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":522,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":516,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":519,"x":450,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["Crickets and peepers serenade each other over the constant murmur of running water.  Faint floral aromas mingle with the misty spray from the fountains jetting between three pools artfully inlaid amongst the lush grass.","Lush green grass grows close to a simple fountain consisting of three ground-level pools.  Water arcs at varying heights between the basins, filling the area with the soothing sound of running water.  The air thrums with their nose-tickling spray, which adjusts with each change of the wind's direction."],"exits":[{"to":517,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":521,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":520,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":522,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":518,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":516,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":520,"x":470,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["Large bushes huddle close to the building as if afraid of the dark.  They block off much of the light from the windows, leaving very little to illuminate the stairs and the blossomed vines climbing their railings.","Lozraet bushes grow close to the building, their berries harvested daily to create delectable desserts for Estate Holders.  Vines bearing brilliant white blossoms climb the railings of an ornate set of spiraling ironwork stairs leading to and from a small balcony above."],"exits":[{"to":521,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":522,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":518,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":519,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":517,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":523,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"},{"to":635,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ironwork stairs"}]},
  {"id":521,"x":470,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["In the faint light coming from a window of the Community Center, roses droop sleepily atop a bower arcing over a stone bench.  Their faint odor floats on the air, mingled with the scent of dew on the grass and the nearby sea.","The low drone of bees at work is constant, even when they are not visible.  Roses of crimson and pale pink cover a bower which arcs over a stone bench, their sweet scent tantalizing the noses of passers-by as much as it does the bees."],"exits":[{"to":520,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":519,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":517,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":522,"x":470,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Gardens","descriptions":["Diamonds of light from the windows of the nearby building dapple a broad arbor as it curves around a nearby bench.  The air is scented with a mixture of floral tones and the salty ocean breeze.","Bima vines climb a broad arbor affixed to the Center's side wall.  The tendrils attempt a daring escape up the textured stone, but the careful hand of the gardeners keeps them in check.  A stone bench rests underneath, its surface carved with many a whimsical rendering.  Tiny violets poke their heads above the manicured grass and bob merrily in any passing breeze."],"exits":[{"to":520,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":518,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":519,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":523,"x":490,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Herb Garden","descriptions":["Lifted into the sky by gentle zephyrs, the faint aroma of herbs peppers the air from the growth around a shadowy path.  Buzzing insects enliven the still night atmosphere along with glimmering lights from the neighboring building.","An abundance of herbs gathered from across the realms grow around a meandering cobblestone path.  Splitting and rejoining numerous times, the fitted stones wend their way almost haphazardly through the greenery.  The result is an intriguing way to effectively divide the various herbs from one another."],"exits":[{"to":524,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":520,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone steps"}]},
  {"id":524,"x":490,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Quiet Garden","descriptions":["Merely a square of silky grass, the modest patch of land overlooks the rest of the property behind the Communal Center.  The natural carpet resembles an unfurling layer of black velvet.  Concave stone seats embedded in pairs in the ground allow nighttime visitors to relax under the stars.","Merely a square of verdant grass, the modest patch of land overlooks the rest of the property behind the Communal Center.  The natural green carpet has been landscaped with a professional checkerboard pattern and remains free of intrusive weeds and dandelions.  Concave stone seats embedded in pairs in the ground allow visitors to relax in close proximity to the earth."],"exits":[{"to":523,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":525,"x":-240,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Foyer","descriptions":["Soft Ilithic carpetry, flanked by tiled marble flooring, muffles the sound of patrons entering and exiting the club.  Low tables are arrayed near the polished wooden walls, with plush high-backed chairs providing a place for members to chat with visiting guests.  Paintings of various Elanthian landscapes are placed aesthetically throughout the foyer, meshing with the rest of the decor to provide an aura of comfortable luxury."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":528,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":527,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":526,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":72,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"aliases":["Raven's Court"]},
  {"id":526,"x":-250,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Membership Desk","descriptions":["This small room off the main foyer is dominated by a single oaken desk with stacks of paper neatly arrayed atop it.  Across the middle of the desk, a screen separates the clerk from the patrons, with a small opening in the middle so that items can be exchanged from within and without."],"exits":[{"to":525,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Membership Desk"]},
  {"id":527,"x":-230,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Sun Room","descriptions":["Walls of floor-to-ceiling windows reveal the nighttime darkness, each tall glass pane meticulously washed and pristinely free of smudges.  The plush Ilithic carpet recedes to unveil the smooth marble tiling, clean and glossy in the soft candlelight to complement the comfortable white leather couches and loveseats.  Enclosed by a short rail along the eastern border, the cozy room overlooks a quaint indoor pond, accessible by a small set of marble steps.","Walls of floor-to-ceiling windows flood the space with daylight, each tall glass pane meticulously washed and pristinely free of smudges.  The plush Ilithic carpet recedes to unveil the smooth marble tiling, clean and bright in the sunlight to complement the comfortable white leather couches and loveseats.  Enclosed by a short rail along the eastern border, the cozy room overlooks a quaint indoor pond, accessible by a small set of marble steps."],"exits":[{"to":525,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1004,"exit":"climb","move":"climb small steps"}],"aliases":["Sun Room"]},
  {"id":528,"x":-230,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Ballroom","descriptions":["Music seems to linger in the air of the ballroom, echoing from the parquet floor and crystal chandeliers.  Candlelight reflects off the stained glass windows, which encircle the ceiling.  Along the western wall, a screen conceals a small musician's gallery.","With a heavily arched ceiling from which three massive crystal chandeliers hang, the ballroom has been designed to have excellent acoustics throughout the large space.  Colored light streams in through stained glass panels placed carefully across the ceiling, drawing attention towards the main floor.  A small screen is positioned discreetly along the western wall."],"exits":[{"to":525,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":529,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":546,"exit":"go","move":"go glass doors"}]},
  {"id":529,"x":-240,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Dining Room","descriptions":["Crafted crystal glassware, delicately gilded china and elegant silver adorn each of the dozens of polished ebony tables in the large dining room.  A detailed menu rests upon a carved goldenoak easel along the wall closest to the foyer, visible to patrons before they have been seated.  Ringing the walls of the room is a well-maintained water garden, with small fountains emitting the soothing sound of gently splashing water at each corner.","Crafted crystal glassware, delicately painted china and elegant silver adorn each of the dozens of polished ebony tables in the large dining room.  A menu is posted discreetly along the wall closest to the foyer, visible to patrons before they have been seated.  Ringing the walls of the room is a well-maintained water garden, small fountains emitting the soothing sound of gently splashing water at each corner."],"exits":[{"to":528,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":525,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":530,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":532,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble steps"}],"aliases":["Dining Room"]},
  {"id":530,"x":-250,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Kitchen","descriptions":["No expense has been spared in supplying this immaculate kitchen with the modern technological advances necessary to create high-class Elanthian dining.  With room for two dozen chefs, one particular station stands out near the middle of the kitchen.  Twice as large as the others and ringed with heavily customized tools, it is surrounded by the mingling aromas of exquisitely prepared dishes."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":531,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":543,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}]},
  {"id":531,"x":-250,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Pantry","descriptions":["This massive pantry is stocked to the brim with exotic spices, packaged meats and baked goods, creating a cornucopia of scents warring for attention.  The air in the room is quite cool, aiding in maintaining the freshness of the food stocked within.  However, a near complete lack of dust indicates the constant use and replacement of every single object the Raven's Court has stored away."],"exits":[{"to":530,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":545,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}]},
  {"id":532,"x":-240,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Landing","descriptions":["A portrait of the Raven's Court founders watches over members and guests as they reach the landing, its golden frame gleaming softly in the light from the dining room below.  Luscious crimson roses have been arranged in a crystal bowl atop a narrow mahogany table, their floral perfume mixing with the smell of the beeswax polish."],"exits":[{"to":529,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble steps"},{"to":533,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}]},
  {"id":533,"x":-290,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gallery Lobby","descriptions":["Colored a rich forest green, the painted walls retain an elegant matte finish to contrast with the gleaming polish of the golden oak wainscoting.  Padded benches border the area to provide seating for patrons who wish a brief respite from perusing the selection of fine art on display throughout the rest of the gallery.  Plush black carpeting cushions every footfall and dulls noise to allow for quiet observation and contemplation."],"exits":[{"to":534,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":535,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":532,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}],"aliases":["Gallery Lobby"]},
  {"id":534,"x":-290,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gallery","descriptions":["Colored a rich forest green, the painted walls retain an elegant matte finish to contrast with the gleaming polish of the golden oak wainscoting.  Sculpted gaethzen orbs dangle strategically over each piece of artwork to provide ample lighting for the Court's treasures.  Plush black carpeting cushions every footfall and dulls noise to allow for quiet observation and contemplation.  An ornately gilded balustrade runs along the southern edge of the area, permitting patrons to survey the foyer below."],"exits":[{"to":533,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":535,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":535,"x":-300,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gallery","descriptions":["Colored a rich forest green, the painted walls retain an elegant matte finish to contrast with the gleaming polish of the golden oak wainscoting.  Sculpted gaethzen orbs dangle strategically over each piece of artwork to provide ample lighting for the Court's treasures.  Plush black carpeting cushions every footfall and dulls noise to allow for quiet observation and contemplation.  An ornately gilded balustrade runs along the southeastern edge of the area, permitting patrons to survey the foyer below."],"exits":[{"to":533,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":534,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":536,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":536,"x":-300,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gallery","descriptions":["Colored a rich forest green, the painted walls retain an elegant matte finish to contrast with the gleaming polish of the golden oak wainscoting.  Sculpted gaethzen orbs dangle strategically over each piece of artwork to provide ample lighting for the Court's treasures.  Plush black carpeting cushions every footfall and dulls noise to allow for quiet observation and contemplation.  An ornately gilded balustrade runs along the eastern edge of the area, permitting patrons to survey the foyer below."],"exits":[{"to":535,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":537,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":537,"x":-300,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gallery","descriptions":["Colored a rich forest green, the painted walls retain an elegant matte finish to contrast with the gleaming polish of the golden oak wainscoting.  Sculpted gaethzen orbs dangle strategically over each piece of artwork to provide ample lighting for the Court's treasures.  Plush black carpeting cushions every footfall and dulls noise to allow for quiet observation and contemplation.  An ornately gilded balustrade runs along the northeastern edge of the area, permitting patrons to survey the foyer below."],"exits":[{"to":536,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":538,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":538,"x":-290,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gallery","descriptions":["Colored a rich forest green, the painted walls retain an elegant matte finish to contrast with the gleaming polish of the golden oak wainscoting.  Sculpted gaethzen orbs dangle strategically over each piece of artwork to provide ample lighting for the Court's treasures.  Plush black carpeting cushions every footfall and dulls noise to allow for quiet observation and contemplation.  An ornately gilded balustrade runs along the northern edge of the area, permitting patrons to survey the foyer below."],"exits":[{"to":537,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":539,"exit":"go","move":"go gold arch"}]},
  {"id":539,"x":-280,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Bejeweled Nook","descriptions":["Glossy vermilion paint floods the walls with dominant color, coordinating brightly with the polished golden oak wainscoting.  An end table resting in one corner supports a shiny bowl filled with mock fruit, each piece smothered in gemstones that sparkle radiantly under the soft glow of the red crystal chandelier overhead.  Fashioned into the shape of a carved ruby, the thick area rug upon the hardwood floor features lines of silver and indigo to highlight the faceting."],"exits":[{"to":540,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":538,"exit":"go","move":"go gold arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":540,"x":-280,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Bejeweled Nook","descriptions":["Colored a deep midnight hue, the walls create a subdued backdrop brightened only by the polished golden oak wainscoting that migrates inward from the surrounding rooms.  Motes of muted light from the blue crystal chandelier trickle downward, speckling the gemstone-encrusted urn resting in the corner with an ethereal mist of illumination.  The smooth area rug underfoot mimics a carved sapphire, enhanced with starbursts of white along the facet angles."],"exits":[{"to":541,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":539,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":541,"x":-270,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Bejeweled Nook","descriptions":["Pristinely white, the walls almost seem to glow in the light shed by the transparent crystal chandelier, dangling overhead as the ceiling's centerpiece.  The polished golden oak wainscoting, too, obtains a soft halo effect from the lambent illumination, while the clear glass harp in the corner gleams as brightly as ever.  Crafted with perfect symmetry, the plush area rug resembles a cut diamond, its edges and facets delineated by bold black lines."],"exits":[{"to":540,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":542,"exit":"go","move":"go velvet curtain"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":542,"x":-270,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Iolite Lounge","descriptions":["Beset with limpid jewels, large gaethzen orbs swell outward from the ceiling.  Each spills several strands of faceted iolite stones, meant to disseminate the light through twinkles of lavender and violet.  Luxury and regality abound in the secluded space, evidenced by the border of connected couches and layer of plush carpeting.  Though designed to nurture conversation and relaxation, the lounge does offer a modest supply of specialty items for the discerning patron upon a small silverwood table."],"exits":[{"to":541,"exit":"go","move":"go velvet curtain"}],"aliases":["Iolite Lounge"]},
  {"id":543,"x":-260,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Kitchen Garden","descriptions":["The cooking staff prides itself on offering a premium selection of the freshest vegetables for sating the palates of its patrons, evidenced here by the wide variety of produce under protective glass row covers.  The Court's owners have spared no expense for the maintenance of the miniature greenhouses lining the area, ensuring the plants are safe from the nibbling mouths of the local rabbit population."],"exits":[{"to":544,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":530,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}]},
  {"id":544,"x":-260,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Herb Garden","descriptions":["A flagstone walk winds past shadowy plant beds on its course through this tiny garden.  The subtle aromas of a mix of tasty and fragrant herbs linger in the air, indicating the presence of lavender, violet, sage, garlic and rosemary.  Creeping thyme cushions the space between the flagstones, evident from its perfume filling the air with each step.  A rustic stone bench surrounded by mint provides a quiet spot to rest in the darkness of night.","A flagstone walk winds past well-kept plant beds on its course through this tiny garden.  The aroma of lavender and violets blends with sage, garlic and rosemary in a copious collection of tasty and fragrant herbs.  Creeping thyme cushions the space between the flagstones, its perfume filling the air with each step.  A rustic stone bench surrounded by mint provides a quiet spot to rest."],"exits":[{"to":543,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Garden of Herbs"]},
  {"id":545,"x":-260,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Scullery","descriptions":["Massive stone sinks are stationed along the wall for use by the service staff, designed to accommodate large loads of dishes used in the kitchen and dining room of the Court.  The room is quiet at the moment, the basins scrubbed clean and the tableware stored in cabinets until the next meal."],"exits":[{"to":531,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"},{"to":861,"exit":"none","move":"go trapdoor"}]},
  {"id":546,"x":-200,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Terrace","descriptions":["An elegant rose garden borders this brick terrace along the side of the Raven's Court, the fragrance of flowers perfuming the air.  A fine mesh is strung overhead, providing further shade in moonlight, while marble benches edging the terrace perhaps enable companions to enjoy a quiet, romantic moment.","An elegant rose garden borders this brick terrace along the side of the Raven's Court, the fragrance of flowers perfuming the air.  The sun is filtered through a fine mesh strung overhead, allowing for enjoyment of its rays while keeping the area's temperature pleasant.  Marble benches edge the terrace, providing a place for club patrons to relax and converse with their friends."],"exits":[{"to":547,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":551,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":549,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":528,"exit":"go","move":"go glass doors"}]},
  {"id":547,"x":-200,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Rock Garden","descriptions":["Towering oaks provide a deep carpet of shadow when moonlight strains to break through the foliage.  Weathered rocks are made visible by shaded lanterns casting their light across the path, providing an aura of safety and security as the flagstones wind up this small hill behind the Raven's Court.","The flagstone path meanders up a small hill behind the Raven's Court, while lush oaks overhead provide a carpeting of shade.  Nestled under the protective embrace of the greenery, an array of weathered rocks dots the hill on either side of the path.  Green mosses and small flowers cling to the rocks, creating a splash of natural beauty while still appearing to enjoy the same level of care visible everywhere in the Court."],"exits":[{"to":548,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":546,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Rock Garden"]},
  {"id":548,"x":-200,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Quiet Pool","descriptions":["Just as the hill seems about to crest, it dips in the center to reveal a small hollow.  Nestled under the great oaks is a clear pool, disturbed only by the occasional fallen leaf.  A small deck, as well as several lounge chairs and mats, surrounds the pool, providing another peaceful opportunity for club patrons to relax.  A small sign is posted right at the edge of the pool's deck."],"exits":[{"to":547,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":549,"x":-220,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Silver Walk","descriptions":["The flagstones, made with silver coating atop more traditional rocks, shimmer beneath your feet in the moonlight.  Shadows cast by large oaks are countered by shuttered lanterns, and a large arched door is visible ahead, set into the side of the back end of the Raven's Court.  A small slot is visible in the door at about eye level, a large golden knocker taking the place of a handle.  A very prominent sign is placed out in front of the door.","The flagstones, made with silver coating atop more traditional rocks, glitter beneath your feet in the sunlight.  Large oaks provide shade while a large arched door is visible ahead, set into the side of the back end of the Raven's Court.  A small slot is visible in the door at about eye level, a large golden knocker taking the place of a handle.  A very prominent sign is placed out in front of the door."],"exits":[{"to":546,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":550,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":552,"exit":"none","move":"knock knocker"},{"to":576,"exit":"none","move":"tap knocker"}],"aliases":["Raven Thief"]},
  {"id":550,"x":-230,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Garden of Midnight","descriptions":["Tall boxwood hedges enclose the area, shielding the flora from all but the softest starlight.  A striking statue stands in the very middle, the silvery flagstone path unfurling outward in a large spiral from the center.  Slender beds of midnight glories fill the coil's twisting gaps, matched by a stunning arrangement of Dergati's Night blossoms encircling the shadowy sculpture.","Tall boxwood hedges enclose the area, shading the flora from the garish light of day.  A striking black jade statue stands in the very middle, the silvery flagstone path unfurling outward in a large spiral from the center.  Slender beds of midnight glories fill the coil's twisting gaps, matched by a curious arrangement of dark withered buds encircling the shadowy sculpture."],"exits":[{"to":549,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":859,"exit":"go","move":"go hole"}],"aliases":["Garden of Midnight"]},
  {"id":551,"x":-210,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Rose Garden","descriptions":["Roses of all colors grow in carefully tended beds, many mixed in with each other to build a vibrant tapestry of petals.  To the north, delicate white petals arranged in a half moon form a bed of Damaris' Dream, while to the west a flurry of pinks indicates the presence of Hodierna's Blush.  Lastly, a cluster of Smaragdaus' Glee forms a sea of crimson to the south.  A small path winds around the garden, with a wooden sign posted at the entry."],"exits":[{"to":546,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"aliases":["Rose Garden"]},
  {"id":552,"x":-220,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, VIP Suite","descriptions":["A large bar, fully stocked with an array of strong and exotic liqueurs, dominates the back side of this member's suite.  While plush stools are available, there are also an elegant fireplace and large ebony table surrounded by high-backed chairs on each side.  Sharply dressed waiters attend to each patron's needs immediately, weaving their way around priceless vases and past ancient paintings, simply another example of the opulence afforded to the Raven's Court's members."],"exits":[{"to":554,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":553,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":549,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"},{"to":562,"exit":"go","move":"go satin curtain"}],"aliases":["VIP Suite"]},
  {"id":553,"x":-230,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Cigar Lounge","descriptions":["Smoke fills the air as members relax with their drinks and discuss the day's trades in confident tones.  The major deals of the lands are made not in the banking halls or guilds, but amidst the pungent haze in the lounge's comfortable leather chairs.  Gnarled arms of iron candelabra reach upward to endow the area with just enough light so as to not disturb tired eyes."],"exits":[{"to":555,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":552,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Cigar Lounge"]},
  {"id":554,"x":-220,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Brandy Bar","descriptions":["Aged wooden casks support caramel-colored glass tops to create makeshift tables interspersed between the comfortable leather chairs.  Each barrel bears official stamps from foreign lands, indicating only the finest imports are served to the Court's exclusive members.  Deep burgundy carpeting stretches between the black marble walls to immerse patrons in extravagance from all angles.  Dozens of glass snifters hang over a fine-grained goldenoak bar dominating the eastern half of the room."],"exits":[{"to":556,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":552,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":555,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":561,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained archway"}],"aliases":["Brandy Bar"]},
  {"id":555,"x":-230,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Entertainment Room","descriptions":["A babble of noise greets those who enter the spacious room, from the quiet thud of well-aimed darts, to the tinkle of glasses, to the low murmur of voices as players strategize.  Challengers and onlookers gather around an armwrestling table in the center, while others observe and converse in one of the many leather chairs positioned near the gaming apparatuses.  Long mirrors placed along the upper halves of the black marble walls trick the eye into thinking the area is larger than its actual size."],"exits":[{"to":554,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":553,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Entertainment Room"]},
  {"id":556,"x":-220,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Gamblers' Den","descriptions":["Clinking sounds of metal on metal follow the exchange of coins between hands at the various tables set up for card and dice games.  Two deep-backed couches line the sides, set against the black marble walls as a means of surveying the action while enjoying a beverage or two.  The occasional cheer peppers the air from the direction of the gleaming silver-trimmed slot machine in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":557,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":554,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":560,"exit":"go","move":"go adderwood door"}],"aliases":["Gamblers' Den"]},
  {"id":557,"x":-220,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Barely audible tones of laughter drift in from the rest of the club, yet the area here remains mostly quiet and calm.  Along the smooth marble walls, flecks of glowstone shine inside the images of stars and moons formed from inlays of yellow diamond.  Errant rays of light filter inward from the south, giving the plush black carpet a slight sheen."],"exits":[{"to":558,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":556,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":559,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":558,"x":-210,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Channels of green diamond sprout into lily pads and frogs upon the smooth marble walls.  Tiny orbs of glowstone highlight the colorful jewels in addition to providing faint illumination for the dark, secluded corner.  Black as an ocean abyss, the plush carpeting underfoot appears to extend forever downward into endless depths."],"exits":[{"to":557,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":949,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":559,"x":-230,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Grooves inlaid with blue diamond stream through the smooth marble walls, outlining raindrops and snowflakes.  Nestled amidst the precipitation, tiny dots of glowstone cast a delicate radiance in the otherwise dark corner.  The plush wall-to-wall carpet is completely black, creating the illusion of walking in space."],"exits":[{"to":557,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":947,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":560,"x":-210,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Artist's Parlor","descriptions":["Away from the busy sounds of the rest of the club, this small room offers solace for the creatively gifted.  Opposite a small stool, a long leather divan provides space for a muse to model various sitting or lying poses, as does the white bearskin rug upon the floor.  Filled with lush red roses, a golden vase decorates the adderwood desk adjacent to the door."],"exits":[{"to":556,"exit":"go","move":"go adderwood door"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["Artist's Parlor"]},
  {"id":561,"x":-210,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Library","descriptions":["Maps cover the black marble walls, showing the major trade routes and local cities.  Brass lamps with green glass domes rest atop square tables to bequeath modest light for reading activities.  A trio of leather couches aids leisurely pursuits, while a broad smokewood desk and matching chair allow for more diligent studies.  Shadowed in one corner, a secluded alcove appeals to those who seek a more private atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":554,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained archway"},{"to":950,"exit":"go","move":"go secluded alcove"}]},
  {"id":562,"x":-210,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Commodities","descriptions":["Deluging the area in ambient light, glowstone veins in the ceiling compose the elegant outline of a raven with outstretched wings.  The pattern extends to the black marble walls, where feathers detailed from the same illuminator flutter downward, stopping just before they land on the gilded cases lining the area.  A faint, smoky sweetness lingers in the air like the fading impression of a snuffed cigar."],"exits":[{"to":552,"exit":"go","move":"go satin curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cigar Shop"]},
  {"id":563,"x":-160,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Cellars","descriptions":["Giant bins, huge wooden barrels and piles of overstuffed hogsheads all await distribution to their final retail destination or to warehouses and shippers around town for export to far corners of Elanthia."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":564,"x":-170,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Pure's Feed Emporium","descriptions":["The scent of grains and cut grass permeates the room.  A broad straw broom and long-handled dustpan are propped against sacks of grain that have been neatly arranged along the back wall.  The worn mahogany floors show signs of frequent use.  A faint chirping emanates from somewhere inside the grass bin."],"exits":[{"to":359,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"}],"aliases":["Pure's Feed Emporium"]},
  {"id":565,"x":-150,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Guest Suite","descriptions":["The suite is reserved for the elite of the Traders' Guild governing hierarchy, particularly those outlanders visiting the Guild headquarters on business.  The walls are paneled with rich, dark huljik wood, oiled to a fine sheen.  A mahogany writing table, decked with a silver inkwell and eagle quill stands before a tall bay window which affords a panoramic view of the town's commercial district.  A high, carved sleigh bed faces the window, flanked by nightstands holding books on trade and travel."],"exits":[{"to":355,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":566,"x":-140,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Vault","descriptions":["The vault walls are clad in thick steel plates, one of which has been engraved commissioned from Catrox the Smith.  Locked chests of various sizes, with members' names on them, are neatly stacked in metal racks.  You are being watched by the Gor'Tog guard through a narrow, almost imperceptible gap between two of the plates."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}],"aliases":["Negotiants"]},
  {"id":567,"x":-150,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Traders' Guild, Wholesale Outlet","descriptions":["Plain fittings display luxury goods from the farthest corners of the realms, but this wholesaler makes no attempt to puff up the goods or cajole the buyers.  This is a place where professionals do business with other professionals, all of whom know and disdain the weaseling tricks commonly played on customers.  Displays are sturdy and pleasant, but not fancy, and everything is brightly lit.  Rugs are a plain brown, walls are an unpanelled beige, and the atmosphere is one of business."],"exits":[{"to":356,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Wholesale Outlet","Trader Shop"]},
  {"id":568,"x":-230,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Haldofurd's Barn, Caravan Stable","descriptions":["Light filters through the open double doors illuminating the clean, whitewashed expanse of the barn's walls and dozens of spacious stalls line the interior, each thickly carpeted with fresh straw.  Stable boys bustle about filling water troughs and currying road dust from newly-arrived pack animals under the watchful supervision of equally dusty caravan drivers."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Caravan Stable"]},
  {"id":569,"x":-361,"y":-288,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, West Wall Battlements","descriptions":["This hastily made lean-to is constructed of thin pine boards nailed to a poplar frame, with a water-resistant tarpaulin tacked across the top for a roof.  There is a pervasive musty odor that almost masks the fetid smell rising from the city below.  Bare and damp, there isn't even a discarded crate to sit upon."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":570,"x":-30,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Falken's Tannery, Vat Room","descriptions":["Heaps of uncured pelts lie festering around a huge wooden vat at the center of the room.  Several young Gor'Togs, who seem oblivious to the stench, lumber about, tending to the tanning process.  Bubbles and fume spew forth from the vat each time they toss in a skin.  As you poke at a pile of hides awaiting tanning with your foot, you raise a storm of horseflies."],"exits":[{"to":220,"exit":"go","move":"go sturdy door"}]},
  {"id":571,"x":210,"y":7,"z":0,"title":"MAMAS Company, Main Office","descriptions":["The Assay Office looks like a contractor's storeroom: scaffolding, loose timbers, planks, and tools lie everywhere, as carpenters and plasterers work away.  Behind a tin-topped counter stands the assay clerk, who is adjusting the beam of the smallest of three graduated scales."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["MAMAS"]},
  {"id":572,"x":-380,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"A Damp Cavern","descriptions":["A series of yellowing wooden planks zigzag across a pitted cavern floor.  Water drips slowly from the darkened roof above, plinking in pools of lime green water.  Bulbous yellow eyes stare unwinking at you from small nooks in granite walls."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":573,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":574,"exit":"go","move":"go space"}]},
  {"id":573,"x":-390,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"A Damp Cavern","descriptions":["This dark, muddly corridor looks like an intestinal tract lined with roughage.  It smells like one, too.  Perhaps it's all the decaying vegetation or just the rats that seem to come here solely to die, but the fumes alone could crack leather armor."],"exits":[{"to":572,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":857,"exit":"go","move":"go dark hole","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":574,"x":-280,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["Sculpted hooks of peridot-studded basalt hold brightly lit oil lamps.  A long rug woven with a wandering nightshade pattern partially covers the obsidian tiles underfoot, cushioning footfalls that would otherwise echo along the hall.  Tapestries grace the walls, many displaying silver-threaded moonlit cityscapes.  Across from a heavy ebonwood door, a bored-looking human boy sits beside a shadowy azurite bin."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":576,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":572,"exit":"go","move":"go niche"},{"to":579,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}],"aliases":["Thief","Bin"]},
  {"id":575,"x":-280,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["Lit by grey-tinted oil lamps is a broad ebonwood arch carved with a midnight cityscape, a narrow steel doorway and a thick wooden door propped open with a brass spittoon.  Overhead is a clouded glass mosaic skylight that matches the grey silk curtain leading to a shop along the northeast corner of the hall."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":580,"exit":"go","move":"go silk curtain"},{"to":583,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":584,"exit":"go","move":"go steel doorway"},{"to":901,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}]},
  {"id":576,"x":-280,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Foyer","descriptions":["Smooth tiles of gleaming obsidian reflect the rich burgundy hue of the papered walls from below a clouded glass skylight.  A copperwood table, its rich grain glinting with swirls of its namesake mineral, supports a dark stone vase filled with lush, blood-red roses.  Tall candlesticks of lustrous rosewood support white beeswax candles whose flickering light illuminates the room.","Smooth tiles of gleaming obsidian reflect the rich burgundy hue of the papered walls.  A copperwood table, its rich grain glinting with swirls of its namesake mineral, supports a dark stone vase filled with lush, blood-red roses.  Overhead, a skylight of clouded glass allows sunlight to filter in."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":577,"exit":"go","move":"go black archway"},{"to":549,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"},{"to":97,"exit":"go","move":"go lattice grate"}]},
  {"id":577,"x":-270,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Library","descriptions":["Hooded candles cast a dim glow about the spacious chamber, the light enhancing the polished shine of the silverwood bookcase holding the Guild's library.  A deep-piled grey rug under several hardwood desks and chairs dulls harsh sounds and helps provide a quiet place for guests and regulars to study in peace and safety."],"exits":[{"to":578,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":576,"exit":"go","move":"go black archway"}],"aliases":["Thief Library"]},
  {"id":578,"x":-260,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Rescued Artifact Exhibition","descriptions":["Lining the curved walls, a series of raised cases outfit the dark, circular sanctum.  Thick black carpet stretches across the entire expanse of floor to maintain an aura of almost reverent silence.  Small glowstones set into the ceiling offer focused illumination only for the items on display.  A miniature skylight in the domed ceiling is precisely located above one of the cases, providing little light for the rest of the room."],"exits":[{"to":577,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":579,"x":-270,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Office","descriptions":["Painted pale blue with thin stripes of dark sapphire, the walls of this spacious office hold tapestries and wall hangings from exotic locales around Elanthia.  The room is dominated by a mahogany desk with a high-backed leather armchair behind it."],"exits":[{"to":574,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Thief","Kalag","Varsyth"]},
  {"id":580,"x":-290,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Shop","descriptions":["An odd assortment of wares is on display for sale here, cluttering the smooth wooden floors protected by small woven hemp rugs.  A candelabrum of white beeswax candles high above illuminates the shop."],"exits":[{"to":582,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":581,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":575,"exit":"go","move":"go silk curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Thief Shop"]},
  {"id":581,"x":-290,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Shop","descriptions":["Paneled deobar walls bear a variety of goods for sale.  A scrollwork rack and a smooth deobar shelf jut from the wood, displaying their wares at a slight angle.  Nearby, a coat rack, a brass stand and a low table sit across the room from a wide-mouthed barrel.  A woven spidersilk rug covers the polished hardwood floors."],"exits":[{"to":580,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":582,"x":-290,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Shop","descriptions":["Paneled walls match the hardwood floor here, though little is on display besides an open weapon crate atop a woven rug in the center of the room.  Overhead, the candlelight from the candelabra flickers slightly with the bustle of the occasional clerk."],"exits":[{"to":580,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":583,"x":-270,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Alchemy Kitchen","descriptions":["Below a centrally located skylight sits a Wayerd pyramid.  A thick column of leaded glass obscures the view to the outside world without blocking sunlight to the pyramid during the day.  A wide iron stove sits beside a fountain fed by a steady stream of water pouring from the wall.  Nestled within it is a water clock."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":584,"x":-280,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Training Room","descriptions":["Limestone floors, buffed but completely bare, indicate this room is more function than form.  Brightly lit oil lamps hang in abundance, the glare a definite change from the more subdued ambiance of the rest of the guild.  In the center of the room is an iron table surrounded by sturdy chairs.  A polished silver bucket sits to one side."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"go","move":"go steel doorway"}]},
  {"id":585,"x":-110,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"Ranger Guild, Main Hall","descriptions":["The Main Hall lacks a permanent roof and is open to the wide sky in all but the harshest weather.  Atop the rear wall is a canvas canopy that can serve as a cover for the Hall when needed.  Several well-polished bows line the walls and a banner at the far end of the long room displays the guild emblem.  A large picture window provides a view of the grove behind the Hall."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":586,"exit":"go","move":"go open archway"},{"to":587,"exit":"go","move":"go lunat door"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Ranger","Kalika","RS Ranger"]},
  {"id":586,"x":-110,"y":-498,"z":0,"title":"Ranger Guild, Storeroom","descriptions":["This small storage area contains shelves to hold a variety of tools and supplies used by rangers in their explorations.  Guild members leave items here for their comrades who may need them, and the only expected payment is that the favor be returned whenever possible.  In the corner, a sturdy cabinet dispensing essential herbs is hung on the wall above a weapons rack."],"exits":[{"to":585,"exit":"go","move":"go open archway"}]},
  {"id":587,"x":-120,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"Ranger Guild, Tree Grove","descriptions":["Nature's soothing embrace surrounds this private reserve of young felenok pines.  The rare trees bear golden-tipped cones and the aromatic scent of their needles fills the air.  Near the center of the grove, a mature pine rises majestically above the others, its branches supporting a small treehouse that is accessed by a dangling rope.  A tattered note is tacked to the wall of the guildhall between the large picture window and the door."],"exits":[{"to":588,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":585,"exit":"go","move":"go lunat door"},{"to":589,"exit":"climb","move":"climb large rope"}]},
  {"id":588,"x":-130,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"Ranger's Guild, West Tree Grove","descriptions":["The large trees that soar to the sky are home to the songs of several species of birds.  High above, their branches weave together to create a soothing green canopy.  Below, roots that bulge from the ground are bedded with leaves, twigs, and ferns, offering a silent invitation to a comfortable rest.  A few deer pause in their feeding to look around, before moving on to consume nearby flora."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":589,"x":-120,"y":-498,"z":0,"title":"Ranger's Guild, The Tree House","descriptions":["In an effort not to hurt the tree, the wall supports of this large room built among the branches and leaves are lashed instead of nailed.  Several simple chairs offer a comfortable seat for those that choose to rest here.  A small ladder climbs up to another room and a large rope dangling through a hole in the floorboards leads back down to the ground."],"exits":[{"to":587,"exit":"climb","move":"climb large rope"},{"to":590,"exit":"climb","move":"climb small ladder"}]},
  {"id":590,"x":-120,"y":-508,"z":0,"title":"Ranger's Guild, The Tree House","descriptions":["This plain room is made comfortable with several fluffy bear pelts strewn across the plank floor and clusters of beeswax candles that burden the narrow windowsills.  In the center, a thick pine stump sits next to a small sign and a wormwood crate filled with books.  A branch ladder leads down to the lower level and a set of crudely carved steps climbs upwards through a hole in the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":589,"exit":"climb","move":"climb pine ladder"},{"to":984,"exit":"climb","move":"climb carved steps"}]},
  {"id":591,"x":430,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Large Dune","descriptions":["The vantage point from this mound allows one to view most of the surrounding environs without much trouble.  Soft lights fade in and out of the trees' leafy cover in the western distance.  To the east lies a cove created by the turbulent convergence of the steel-grey flow of the Oxenwaithe and the greenish waters of the Segoltha.  Smiling visitors mingle about, traveling to and fro along the navigable routes, mainly heading in the direction of the Communal Center to see the activities planned for the day.","During the daytime, this mound allows one to view most of the surrounding environs without much trouble.  In the darkness, however, only a few soft lights fade in and out of the trees' leafy cover in the western distance.  The rhythmic crashing of waves emanates from the cove to the east, created by the turbulent convergence of waters flowing inward from the Oxenwaithe and Segoltha Rivers.  The navigable routes are mainly empty save for a few lingering visitors traveling in the direction of civilization."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":592,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":514,"exit":"go","move":"go grassy track"}]},
  {"id":592,"x":450,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["As the waves visit land, they forever change the shoreline's structure, brushing the sand upward and stealing some away.  The cove provides a relatively safe swimming area for visitors to The Strand, though one does need to mind the sporadic undertow.  Blending aesthetically with the water's soothing murmurs, the ships' bells in the distance announce the arrival of newly imported supplies for the city and surrounding towns.","As the waves visit land, they brush up against the shoreline like unfurling folds of black satin.  The cove provides a relatively safe swimming area during the day, but one must mind the deceptive undertows during the night.  Sounds from the city drift across the river and contrast the water's soothing murmurs."],"exits":[{"to":597,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":596,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":593,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":594,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":591,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF","aliases":["Seardaz Cove","Cove"]},
  {"id":593,"x":470,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["Calmer here than to the east, the slightly turbid water swirls in an almost ritualistic fashion.  Overhead, a flock of gulls reels in the sky, hoping for a handout or for a chance to steal food from the beachgoers to the south.  Other swimmers bandy about in the waves for both relaxation and exercise.","The calm, black water swirls in an almost ritualistic fashion.  A few gulls journey across the dark sky, intent on their destinations and traveling with haste.  Most other swimmers have long since abandoned the rocking waves in favor of other nighttime activities upon the shore."],"exits":[{"to":596,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":599,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":595,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":594,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":592,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":597,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":594,"x":470,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Cove Shallows","descriptions":["Just coming to the shins of the taller races, the water here is shallow enough for children to swim safely, sheltered from the swifter currents in the cove.  Various chatty birds loiter on the shore, wading in the water as their beady eyes scan the surface.  Fresh breezes blow urban noise inward to remind visitors of their close proximity to the city.","Just coming to the shins of the taller races, the opaque water here is shallow enough for a pleasant nighttime stroll without fear of sinking.  Several intrepid birds loiter on the shore despite the darkness in hopes of finding a late-night meal.  Fresh breezes blow the scent of river water inward to remind visitors of their close proximity to the major watery thoroughfares."],"exits":[{"to":593,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":595,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":592,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF","aliases":["Cove Shallows"]},
  {"id":595,"x":490,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["To the south, the land protrudes out into the river, providing the cove's lower boundary.  Swift-moving currents strike the obstacle at full force, splitting the flow.  Most of the water continues its frantic pace, though some slows dramatically with the impact, causing weak whirlpools to spiral about.  Hustle and bustle from the nearby shipyards can be heard as ships laden with cargo come and go throughout the day.","Shrouded in shadows, the land to the south protrudes out into the river, providing the cove's lower boundary.  Swift-moving currents strike the obstacle at full force, splitting the flow.  The typical hustle and bustle from the nearby shipyards has disappeared due to the onset of night, though a few deckhands are still scattered amongst the heavy cargo upon the docks."],"exits":[{"to":599,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":594,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":593,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":596,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":596,"x":470,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["Topped with foam and smelling of brine, the chilly water churns at an easy pace.  The rivers' swift currents are largely diverted by a series of nearby boulders and filler stones.  Several seabirds -- resembling children's toys at this distance -- wade out in search of small fish that linger too close to shore.","Pops and snaps erupt from the waves as salty bubbles explode from the water churning at its easy pace.  The rivers' swift currents are largely diverted by a series of dark, amorphous boulders further out.  A few lone transportation vessels -- resembling children's toys at this distance -- travel soberly toward the city's docks."],"exits":[{"to":598,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":600,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":599,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":595,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":593,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":592,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":597,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":597,"x":450,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Shore","descriptions":["The ground, slightly inclined from the nearby dune, levels out to create stable footing along the waters of the cove.  Waves gently lap at the sand and leave fleeting traces of their presence.  Stones rubbed smooth by years of exposure to the moving waters allow easy passage for visitors -- both the four-legged and two-legged kinds.","The ground, slightly inclined from the nearby dune, levels out to create stable footing along the waters of the cove.  Waves gently lap at the sand, and the habitual crashing lends a peaceful comfort to the night's chilly air.  Smooth bumps upon the shore indicate the presence of weathered stones that incidentally allow for easier passage through the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":598,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":596,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":593,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":592,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":591,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":598,"x":470,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Shore","descriptions":["Narrowed by the moving currents, the strip of land juts into the Oxenwaithe before following the flow further northwest.  Strong eddies swirl within the cove as the two major rivers come together, creating a grey-green mix of water.  Waves splash relentlessly at the uneven shoreline, causing the larger stones to become round and smooth to the touch.","Narrowed by the moving currents, the shadowy strip of land juts into the Oxenwaithe before following the flow further into darkness to the northwest.  Locals know to avoid the strong eddies swirling in the cove at night, created by the two major rivers coming together.  Heard but not always seen, the waves splash relentlessly at the uneven shoreline, pummeling the sand and stones."],"exits":[{"to":601,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":600,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":599,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":596,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":597,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":599,"x":490,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["Riptides suck water out of the cove along with unsuspecting swimmers, so constant vigilance is necessary when negotiating the flows.  Slightly brackish, the waters at the junction of the Segoltha and Oxenwaithe noticeably change temperature on a whim.  Glints flash underneath the surface from schools of fish moving between the buoys marking the cove's outer limit.","Riptides suck water out of the cove along with unsuspecting swimmers, so constant vigilance is necessary when negotiating the flows, especially at night.  Murky and black in the dim, the waters at the junction of the Segoltha and Oxenwaithe noticeably change temperature on a whim.  A short distance away, dark buoys nod like disembodied heads upon the surface, marking the cove's outer limit."],"exits":[{"to":600,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":595,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":593,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":596,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":598,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":600,"x":490,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["The turbulent waters create frothy white foam atop the moving currents as they crash into smoothed boulders shielding the cove.  Loud caws and twitters of sea birds pierce the clamoring din as they circle and dive at the fish that break the river's surface from time to time.  Lazy gulls often perch atop the buoys demarcating the small cove from the expansive crux of the Oxenwaithe and Segoltha rivers.","The turbulent waters noisily crash into the boulders shielding the cove, creating foamy spray that slaps and abuses swimmers nearby.  Chased away by the darkness, the sea birds retreat to the shore for the night, their loud caws and twitters silenced, at least for the time being.  A few dozing gulls still perch atop the amorphous buoys demarcating the small cove from the expansive crux of the Oxenwaithe and Segoltha rivers."],"exits":[{"to":601,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":599,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":596,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":598,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":601,"x":490,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Seardaz Cove","descriptions":["A strong current threatens to unbalance the unwary as flows from the Oxenwaithe are forced to change course.  Occasionally, otters playfully dart around as if in some sort of game known only to them.  Bobbing buoys corral swimmers into the cove, lest they inadvertently stray further into the unsafe waters where boats traverse.","A strong current threatens to unbalance the unwary as flows from the Oxenwaithe are forced to change course.  Every push and pull from the river creates the feeling of invisible hands tugging at one's extremities, bullying their way toward the body.  Dark shapes bobbing up and down in the water signify the buoys used to corral swimmers into the cove, lest they inadvertently stray further into the shadowy, unsafe waters beyond."],"exits":[{"to":600,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":598,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":602,"x":185,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Tower South, Air Floor","descriptions":["A dark grey carpet decorated with a pattern of crossing black lightning bolts covers the floor, matching the decoration on the grey-painted walls.  A constant, low thrum hangs just inside the range of hearing, its source nearby but not readily apparent.  Doors spaced in an even circle around the perimeter lead to initiates' private cells."],"exits":[{"to":603,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":55,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":896,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sandstone staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Tower South","Air Floor"]},
  {"id":603,"x":185,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"Tower South, Water Floor","descriptions":["Deep blue carpeting covers the floor, its surface cut in a manner that suggests the rippling of waves upon the surface of a lake.  Bright blue spirals, representing the element of water, fill the walls between a series of doors leading to initiates' private cells.  The air here is moist and cool upon the skin."],"exits":[{"to":604,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":602,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Water Floor"]},
  {"id":604,"x":185,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Tower South, Fire Floor","descriptions":["Lush, red carpeting covers the floor, muffling any ambient noise into oblivion.  Images of bloated red suns, representing the element of fire, fill the walls between a series of doors leading to initiates' private cells.  The air here is significantly warmer than on the tower's other floors, although the reason is not readily apparent."],"exits":[{"to":605,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":603,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Fire Floor"]},
  {"id":605,"x":185,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Tower South, Aether Floor","descriptions":["Carpeting the color of a death shroud covers the floor, devouring the light as hungrily as Aldauth consumes souls.  The walls are devoid of decoration, instead painted a uniform black to match the floor.  Only the doors leading to initiates' cells betray any hint of color in this otherwise cold, bleak room."],"exits":[{"to":604,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Aether Floor"]},
  {"id":606,"x":200,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"The Strand, Old Pier","descriptions":["This short pier juts several yards into the Oxenwaithe.  There's a nice mix of recreational vessels bobbing up and down at their moorings, while a larger fishing boat is tied to its end.  A salty old fisherman, following his daily routine, sits at the end of the pier, whistling a merry tune as he repairs the holes in his net.  Occasionally he glances up, nods, and returns to his work.","This short pier juts several yards into the Oxenwaithe.  There's a nice mix of recreational vessels bobbing up and down at their moorings, while a larger fishing boat is tied to its end.  Beyond the pier, the Segoltha runs lazily by, glimmering in the light of the moons."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Old Pier"]},
  {"id":607,"x":90,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["Clean, golden straw strews the walkway inside a low wooden gate, cushioning the dirt path underfoot and providing a ready source of nesting materials for the occasional bold sparrow.  A cluster of immaculate thatched cottages enjoys this vantage point, their brightly-curtained windows affording a pleasant view of the residents and visitors passing back and forth on their daily business."],"exits":[{"to":608,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":608,"x":100,"y":-250,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["This stretch of the lane is nothing more than a packed earth track bordered by grassy verges, but even so it is neatly criss-crossed with the even strokes of a willow broom.  Several of the homes here boast intricate knotted adornments of dried wildflowers and pungent herbs hanging under their eaves.  Punctuating the lush green verges, flat white stepping-stones lead to the front door of each tidy cottage."],"exits":[{"to":609,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":607,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":609,"x":110,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["A raised pavement of speckled granite cobbles runs along the center of the lane.  Stucco-fronted cottages stand in smart rows on either side, their squat chimneys exhaling hazy clouds of bluish charcoal smoke.  The inviting aroma of hearty stew and fresh-baked bread permeates the air, combining comfortably with the warm scent of drying pine that emanates from a large woodpile between two homes."],"exits":[{"to":611,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":610,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":608,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":610,"x":120,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["Several well-maintained brick and stone homes line the lane as it follows a gentle incline.  Weeping willows flourish between the cottages, draping each front door in frail tendrils and sweeping the pristine cobbled pavement with every flutter of their feathered residents.  A gentle breeze carries with it the musical twitter of birdsong."],"exits":[{"to":612,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":609,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":611,"x":110,"y":-270,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Crofton Walk","descriptions":["Sparkling white-painted wooden benches sit beneath ivied trellises at intervals around this tidy square, each tranquil bower carefully placed to provide a pleasant view of a crescent-shaped ornamental pond.  Flowerbeds fashioned from interlocking blocks of smooth granite and sandstone dot the square, their bright displays ablaze with seasonal blossoms and neatly-trimmed shrubs."],"exits":[{"to":612,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":609,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":616,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":615,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Crofton Walk"]},
  {"id":612,"x":120,"y":-270,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["Flowerbeds line the cobblestones, filling the air with a heady floral fragrance.  Elegant flamestalks bend in a gentle breeze, adding their fiery orange hues to a hedge of bright firethorn, and yellow vines twine around the sun-bleached garden gates which lead off the lane.  Rows of thatched cottages overlook the triangular intersection, basking in the blaze of color."],"exits":[{"to":613,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":610,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":611,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":613,"x":120,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["Small landscaped lawns surround neat cottages of golden sandstone on both sides of the narrow, cobbled lane.  Behind the low buildings, tall aspen and silverwillow trees sway gracefully in the high breeze that drifts down from the wilds beyond Crossing's walls, enfolding the city's spires and treetops in faint traces of cool, green freshness."],"exits":[{"to":612,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":614,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":614,"x":110,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Smithy Lane","descriptions":["The cool granite cobbles draw to a close at the foot of a wooden bridge that arches gently over a crescent-shaped pond.  Matching the bridge's carefully-maintained woodwork, polished acanth slats form narrow pathways leading from the lane to a group of cozy homes which overlook the pond, their crisp gingham curtains and bright, floral windowboxes adding a cheerful splash of color to the area."],"exits":[{"to":613,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":617,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden bridge"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":615,"x":100,"y":-270,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Crofton Walk","descriptions":["An ancient oak tree dominates this corner of the lane, its massive trunk and outstretched boughs dwarfing the neat cottages under its broad span.  Noticeable fractures in the cobblestone pavement stretching some twenty paces from the oak's base bear witness to the extent of its root mass, but the homes clustered upon the uneven ground seem to glory in its grandeur all the same."],"exits":[{"to":617,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":611,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":616,"x":100,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Crofton Close","descriptions":["The handiwork of some clever gardener adorns this quiet cul-de-sac in the form of a low topiary hedgerow.  Carefully crafted from the privet, various figures caper in a charming parade, enclosing the whitewashed stone cottages which occupy the Close.  Intermittent arches trimmed from the glossy, deep green foliage open onto short gravel pathways leading to the homes."],"exits":[{"to":611,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":617,"x":100,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Crofton Walk","descriptions":["A mosaic of red, umber and brown baked clay tiles spreads across the footpath here, the tiles' earthy tones swirling in a pattern reminiscent of windblown autumn leaves.  Several enormous oaks stand aside the unusual pavement, their enormous boughs bending over rows of tidy stone cottages and carefully-planted gardens of herbs and roses."],"exits":[{"to":615,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":614,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden bridge"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":618,"x":80,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Hameel's Carpet Emporium","descriptions":["Hameel oversees his fine collection of carpets and rugs like a hawk, moving between the display racks and picking invisible specks of dust from the fine wools and silks.  His spotless showroom complements the outstanding handiworks he imports from all over Elanthia, and much as he might prefer to maintain his collection as if it were a museum, he is known to part with the occasional carpet to the right customer at the right price."],"exits":[{"to":287,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Hameel's Carpet Emporium","Carpets"]},
  {"id":619,"x":40,"y":-488,"z":0,"title":"Medratha's Designs in Marble","descriptions":["The air is cool and still within Medratha's salesroom, where samples of flawless marble are on display around the walls like masterpieces in an upmarket art gallery.  The artisan himself moves among his customers, silent and catlike, his footsteps soundless on the expanse of snowy-white marble beneath his feet."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Medratha's Designs in Marble","Marble"]},
  {"id":620,"x":-150,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Guard House, Jail Cell","descriptions":["From the stench here, it is apparent that the guards have little interest in coddling criminals.  Mounds of musty-smelling hay have been pushed up along the walls, though it is impossible to imagine sleep as a viable possibility here."],"exits":[],"aliases":["Jail Cell"]},
  {"id":621,"x":-200,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The packed dirt tunnel leads east and west through soggy piles of refuse."],"exits":[{"to":299,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":622,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow opening"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":622,"x":-170,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The intermittent sound of mud echos down the passage as drops of water fall from strands of slimy brown moss and smack the damp dirt lightly at your feet."],"exits":[{"to":621,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow opening"},{"to":623,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":633,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":623,"x":-160,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The packed dirt tunnel leads east and west through soggy piles of refuse."],"exits":[{"to":624,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":622,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":624,"x":-150,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The packed dirt tunnel leads east and west through soggy piles of refuse."],"exits":[{"to":625,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":623,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":625,"x":-140,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The packed dirt tunnel leads east and west through soggy piles of refuse."],"exits":[{"to":626,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":624,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":626,"x":-130,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A large pile of dark sludge, rat carcasses and other refuse nearly clogs the passage.  The radiating stench prods you to move on."],"exits":[{"to":631,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":627,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":625,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":627,"x":-120,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The tunnel bends in a sweeping curve to the south and northwest.  Deposited by high water, a ridge of dirt and broken wood rises against the curve of the eastern wall."],"exits":[{"to":628,"exit":"go","move":"go jaged opening"},{"to":626,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":628,"x":-100,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A thick coating of dingy scum clings to a wrought-iron gate fixed into the wall, preventing further passage east.  The low hiss of moving water echoes in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":629,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":627,"exit":"go","move":"go jagged opening"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":629,"x":-90,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["The tunnel bends in a sweeping curve to the south and northwest.  Deposited by high water, a ridge of dirt and driftwood rises against the curve of the eastern wall."],"exits":[{"to":630,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":628,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":630,"x":-90,"y":-70,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Relatively dry and free of refuse, this small recess offers welcome relief from sewer filth."],"exits":[{"to":629,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":631,"x":-120,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Several wooden crates lie about the area, their rotting surfaces painted thickly with mold and mildewed dirt.  Corroded, empty bottles and other containers tipped lackadaisically on their sides bear witness to someone's enjoyment of the ballroom atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":632,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":626,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":632,"x":-120,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["A shallow depression at the tunnel's end traps the murky water in which you stand, fostering clods of rotting vegetation along its edges."],"exits":[{"to":631,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":633,"x":-180,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Branching here to the southwest, the dingy mud of the main tunnel gives way to hard clay.  A torch, flickering against the eastern wall, casts the area in deep ruddy red."],"exits":[{"to":622,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":634,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":634,"x":-180,"y":-70,"z":0,"title":"Sewer","descriptions":["Bumps and knobs of clay feel smooth beneath your feet, hard and slippery, as if the floor were made of tempered glass.  Flecks of orange, reflected from the north, dance vividly along the alcove's surfaces."],"exits":[{"to":633,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":635,"x":460,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Balcony","descriptions":["Palm fronds have been woven into an umbrella to shade a small table and chairs upon the balcony.  To the south, ships ply their trade on the river.  From a distance, the brightly-colored boats look more like children's toys than working vessels, as though a small boy had carefully set them adrift on a stream."],"exits":[{"to":498,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"},{"to":520,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}]},
  {"id":636,"x":150,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Warehouse, Riverbank Cave","descriptions":["The base of a weathered warehouse overhead casts a shadowy gloom over this small cave which opens onto the river.  The remains of small boat lie cast aside against a rotten set of pilings, abandoned and forgotten long ago."],"exits":[{"to":637,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":438,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":641,"exit":"go","move":"go river"}]},
  {"id":637,"x":150,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Warehouse Caves, Smuggler's Den","descriptions":["The stale air of this narrow crevice virtually drips with must and mildew.  Murky shadows roll across the slick floor, disguising footfalls and hiding obstacles from the unwary traveler."],"exits":[{"to":638,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":636,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":639,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":638,"x":160,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Warehouse Caves, Smuggler's Den","descriptions":["Through a thin shroud of oozing yellow-green algae, phosphorescent fungi cast a spectral glimmer across the cavern.  The eerily iridescent light reveals crates, barrels and bundles stacked randomly in rows and heaps, leaving little room for unencumbered passage."],"exits":[{"to":640,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":637,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":639,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":639,"x":140,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Warehouse Caves, Smuggler's Den","descriptions":["An overwhelming dank stench and the hollow echo of dripping water provide an incessant reminder of the river's proximity.  Nestled among the countless rocks and stones, aged bone splinters and fragments of skeletal remains rest beside thick mats of fungus.  Streams of slick and fetid scum cascade down the rock walls and drip from stalactites to pool on the cavern floor."],"exits":[{"to":640,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":638,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":637,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":640,"x":160,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Warehouse Caves, Smuggler's Den","descriptions":["The telltale signs of a hurried flight lie scattered haphazardly across the moss-covered floor of this chamber.  A pair of dilapidated boxes and an overturned crate are displaced beside a small pyramid of hastily discarded bottles.  A half-burned torch rests butt down on the cavern floor, as if recklessly extinguished."],"exits":[{"to":638,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":639,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":641,"x":150,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Old Warehouse, Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["A dilapidated warehouse looms ominously above, perched precariously on decayed wooden pilings.  Hordes of black flies, drawn by the fetor of rotting wood and organic wastes, choke the air and dart among crates half-submerged in yellowish mud.  To the south, long water grasses and thorny marsh brush effectively block your view of the river."],"exits":[{"to":642,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":646,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":636,"exit":"go","move":"go old warehouse"}]},
  {"id":642,"x":160,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["Splintered wooden fragments, remnants of tattered clothing, and other refuse discarded by careless citizens offer a hospitable habitat for the breeding of countless diseases and pests.  A dense overgrowth of water grasses and thorny marsh brush obstructs the view of the river and provides a refuge to those clandestine merchants wishing unseen passage."],"exits":[{"to":643,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":641,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":643,"x":170,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["A thin layer of lime-green algae atop knee-deep mud is broken only by a heavily trodden path, indicative of the frequent night-time passage of smugglers.  On the sprouting shoots of a hardy variety of vilt, tiny white and yellow blossoms break the bland monotony of green on grey."],"exits":[{"to":644,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":642,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":644,"x":180,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["The putrid stench of rubbish and rotting offal rises from off-colored swill in a cloud of faintly yellowish vapors.  The corner of an aged crate jutting above the bog serves as a sunning perch for a crusty scaled creature.  Other more elusive vermin scurry over the muddy surface of the bank, dodge between rustling bushes, or *PLOP!* into the murky waters of the river."],"exits":[{"to":645,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":643,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":645,"x":190,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["To the east a tangle of thorny weeds and yellowish mud conquer a narrow path and bring it to an end.  From the vantage point of an abandoned crate, the river is a tranquil and soothing sight of cool, crystalline water bubbling over smooth aged stone.  The contrast to the neglected riverbank is strikingly sharp."],"exits":[{"to":644,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":646,"x":140,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["A rotted warehouse pylon has collapsed and fallen into the depths of mud and reeds.  Quick to take advantage of the situation, a host of the riverbank's insectoid citizenry has taken up residence.  Already the column has begun an early decomposition as it becomes the focus of a swarm of termites, mosquitoes and beetles."],"exits":[{"to":647,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":641,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":648,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":647,"x":140,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["Against the rotting warehouse pylons, a makeshift dwelling has been built of broken boxes and stray boards.  A roof composed of dried vilt reeds woven tight and sealed with mud is a temporary but effective relief from the sun.  However, the structure's stopgap construction provides little shelter from the other elements."],"exits":[{"to":646,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":648,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":649,"exit":"go","move":"go makeshift dwelling"},{"to":650,"exit":"go","move":"go panel"}]},
  {"id":648,"x":130,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats","descriptions":["Although the earth is firm here, one quickly becomes caught in sinking mud and a tangle of river reeds another ten paces closer to the river.  Shattered fragments of wood, broken tools and castoff bits of clothing lie scattered about, washed up from the river and left to rot."],"exits":[{"to":647,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":646,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":649,"x":130,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Mud Hovel","descriptions":["Not much more than a hastily assembled lean-to, this shack doesn't have much in the way of headroom and barely enough floorspace to curl up on.  The ground is covered in a thick layer of dried grass and reeds to keep out the ever-present mud.  A rusted oil lamp sits in the corner, empty and devoid of light."],"exits":[{"to":647,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":650,"x":130,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Riverbank Mudflats, Rough Stairway","descriptions":["Barely visible in the murky air of the room, broken boards have been set into the earth to form a crude set of steps that tilt precariously away from the base of the panel to drop into the darkness beyond.  Shredded oilcloth has been jammed into the cracks around the panel as if an attempt has been made to prevent light or sounds from betraying activity here to the world outside."],"exits":[{"to":647,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":650,"exit":"climb","move":"climb crude steps"}],"color":"#808080","aliases":["5th Passage"],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":651,"x":80,"y":-170,"z":0,"title":"Luthier's, Performance Room","descriptions":["Tucked behind the Luthier's shop, this room serves as impromptu performance hall and lounge for wandering Bards.  Occasional performances are given here and sometimes the public is invited in for a few coins.  Wine and ale can be had, albeit discreetly since the place is not licensed.  A dozen or so comfortable benches are scattered about and in one corner a rather rag-tag troubadour seems to be sleeping off yesterday's tipple."],"exits":[{"to":401,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":652,"x":130,"y":205,"z":0,"title":"Fang Cove, Fate's Fortune Lane","descriptions":["A towering marble archway opens a gap in the wall to the north and separates the ongoing construction and somewhat more refined completed structures of Fate's Fortune Lane from the crude structures and makeshift walkway along the beach.  The entrance to a squat, wide bungalow sits in opposition to the arch, and the sheltering cliffs of Fang's Peak rise up from behind it.  To either side of the arch, cobblestones of different shapes and sizes have been laid out to form the wide Fate's Fortune Lane."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go exit portal"}],"linksTo":"Map150_Fang_Cove.xml"},
  {"id":653,"x":110,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"A Wagon","descriptions":["The dark cedar paneled walls commingle their essence with the scents of strong ink and old parchment that permeate this wagon.  Suspended just beneath the ceiling, locked iron-strapped cabinets hang far above the few thin cushions that are the room's only concession to comfort."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Card Shop","Card Collector"]},
  {"id":654,"x":390,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Battlements, Campaign Tent","descriptions":["This temporary structure offers few amenities, other than shelter from the weather.  A lone lantern swings from the top of the central tent post, showing only an upturned crate to sit upon and a couple of neatly stowed bedrolls."],"exits":[{"to":397,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Campaign Tent"]},
  {"id":655,"x":220,"y":-318,"z":0,"title":"Orielda's Blossoms, Front Room","descriptions":["Beautifully crafted earthen pots filled with brightly hued blossoms form a narrow walkway that curves from the doorway all the way to the counter of this tiny but airy shop.  Alongside the large cluttered counter, barrels overflowing with roses and carnations glisten with a delicate webbing of moisture, their luscious scent only slightly overpowered by the exquisite colors of the blooms themselves."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":656,"exit":"go","move":"go beaded doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Orielda's Blossoms","Florist","Flowers"]},
  {"id":656,"x":210,"y":-318,"z":0,"title":"Orielda's Blossoms, Workroom","descriptions":["Scarred counters and workbenches covered with all manner of floral arrangements, garlands, wreaths, corsages, and living plants, line all four walls of this tiny room.  From time to time, one of Orielda's assistants scurries through, whistling a merry tune as her hands fly gracefully over her work, then turning to chatter happily with another worker or the occasional customer wandering in."],"exits":[{"to":655,"exit":"go","move":"go beaded doorway"}]},
  {"id":657,"x":-40,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Menevia the Seeress, Seance Parlor","descriptions":["In a velvet robe punctuated with beetle-wing spangles, Menevia the Blind Seeress holds forth, seated at a round table.  She does not rise to greet you.  Querents huddle around her, awaiting answers on what the future holds.  Several cowled figures stand by a trelium display case, pointing at talismans, orbs and other trinkets, debating their virtues and price."],"exits":[{"to":658,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":35,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Menevia the Seeress","Seeress","Seance Parlor"]},
  {"id":658,"x":-40,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Menevia the Seeress, Rooftop Gazebo","descriptions":["This pleasant gazebo is a surprising annex to Menevia's stuffy chambers below.  Light from the astral bodies envelops you through enchanted glass, a kind that permits the full spectrum to penetrate.  Stained glass lightcatchers of unicorns, chimeras and griffins cast tiny rainbows on everything in the room, including you.  Menevia seems totally aware of the state of the heavens, sensing rather than seeing."],"exits":[{"to":657,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["Rooftop Gazebo","telescope","astrolabe"]},
  {"id":659,"x":70,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Grand Foyer","descriptions":["The two-story foyer of Skalliweg's Half Pint always seems crowded with jovial merrymakers coming and going.  All kinds gather here, but there is a noticeable predominance of Humans, Halflings and Dwarves.  An ornate wrought-iron spiral stair dominates the room, sweeping upwards to the second floor.  From a high archway to the east waft the sounds of good company and the smells of even better ale and victuals, and through some stout double doors to the south are heard roars of encouragement."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":660,"exit":"go","move":"go high archway"},{"to":663,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":664,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral stair"}],"aliases":["Half Pint"]},
  {"id":660,"x":70,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Main Saloon","descriptions":["Skalliweg Barrelthumper, proud proprietor of The Half Pint, perches alertly on a high stool behind the sleek, polished bar, shouting at serving wenches, cooks and customers alike.  Patrons dine, drink, dispute and dream on, in spite of the constant hum, draped over comfortable rush-seated chairs or hunched over well-worn tables.  Faces flicker and eyes glimmer in the dim light of the wrought-iron chandelier and candle stubs sputtering in crocks on the tables."],"exits":[{"to":661,"exit":"go","move":"go dimly arch"},{"to":659,"exit":"go","move":"go high doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":661,"x":70,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Bards' Corner","descriptions":["In sharp contrast to the Main Saloon and more boisterous reaches of The Half Pint, this quiet chamber is softly lit and tastefully decorated with antique tapestries depicting famed minstrels and legendary troubadours from the annals of Elanthia.  The room itself has no tables and chairs, but rather a recessed wooden seating pit with overstuffed cushions scattered about the floor.  At the far end is a raised platform with a lectern, a low ottoman and a music stand."],"exits":[{"to":662,"exit":"go","move":"go dance floor"},{"to":660,"exit":"go","move":"go dimly arch"}]},
  {"id":662,"x":80,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Dance Floor","descriptions":["A more recent addition to the Half Pint, the dance floor has a polished hardwood floor and a chandelier crafted from brushed silver and tiny blue crystals.  A strategic placement of mirrors makes the room seem bigger then it really is.  The musicians sit behind a decorated rail that keeps the dancers from accidentally falling into their beloved instruments."],"exits":[{"to":661,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Dance Floor"]},
  {"id":663,"x":70,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Gaming Room","descriptions":["Here are gathered some of town's most serious gamblers, gamers and wagerers.  They cluster about a few round tables rolling dice, rattling bones and casting shells.  Several square tables bear cards, tokens, game pieces, and painted wooden boards with various runes and numbers on them.  You observe a curious fact: the round tables heaped high with gold are surrounded by tense faces, while the crowds around the square tables are laughing, joking, drinking and enjoying themselves immensely."],"exits":[{"to":659,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"aliases":["Gaming Room","Dartboard"]},
  {"id":664,"x":60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Spiral Stair","descriptions":["The long spiral staircase seems to twist about for quite some time, with only a wrought-iron railing to keep travelers from taking a misstep off it to the floor below.  Many of those who climb tightly grip the rails as they make their way up, or down to their destinations."],"exits":[{"to":665,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":659,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":665,"x":60,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Upstairs Hall","descriptions":["Richly flocked fabric covers the walls here, and all manner of greenery in ceramic pots line the floor.  Large enamel vases of foreign design hold aromatic bunches of dried flowers, branches and herbs.  A rich, velvety carpet muffles footsteps, permitting guests to come and go with the utmost discretion."],"exits":[{"to":666,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":664,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wrought-iron staircase"},{"to":667,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":666,"x":50,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Upstairs Hall","descriptions":["The hall here is hung with paintings of various knights, maidens and wildlife in idealized, pastoral scenes.  The signatures scrawled in the corners of the artwork cover an impressive variety of notable artisans from around the realms."],"exits":[{"to":665,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":668,"exit":"go","move":"go iron-studded door"},{"to":669,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":667,"x":60,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Rainforest Suite","descriptions":["Gentle clucking noises from one corner draw attention to a gilded bird cage holding a riotously-colored parrot.  Approaching the bird sends it conversing in some unknown tongue.  The chamber is softly lit, like the light that filters down through the dense, leafy canopy of a tropical jungle.  Furnishings of rattan and bamboo surround a small, gurgling fountain in the midst of a pool, around which are potted palms and exotic dwarf fruit trees."],"exits":[{"to":665,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"aliases":["Rainforest Suite"]},
  {"id":668,"x":50,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Nightshade Suite","descriptions":["The wallpaper in this chamber is midnight blue.  Heavy velvet curtains with satin lining drape the windows, so that what little light can filter in seems tinged with the blush of eternal night.  An oil lamp burns with a bluish cast, illuminating a recessed pit in the floor which is filled with black silk pillows and dark blue comforters."],"exits":[{"to":666,"exit":"go","move":"go iron-studded door"}],"aliases":["Nightshade Suite"]},
  {"id":669,"x":40,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint, Moonlight Suite","descriptions":["A crescent-shaped, billowing bed dominates the center of this room.  The ceiling is painted midnight blue, with glowing gems twinkling in rhythmic sequence like some perfect night sky.  On the deep blue walls are depictions of the eleven planets and scenes of the Immortals who govern them engaged in feasting and merriment."],"exits":[{"to":666,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal door"},{"to":670,"exit":"go","move":"go blue-tinted door"}],"aliases":["Moonlight Suite"]},
  {"id":670,"x":30,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Half Pint Inn, Balcony","descriptions":["This intimate balcony looks out of the top story of the inn, over the river and the town, facing south.  From here, stunning views of the dawns, sunsets and the night's sky over the water greet you."],"exits":[{"to":669,"exit":"go","move":"go blue-tinted door"}]},
  {"id":671,"x":-150,"y":196,"z":0,"title":"The Thin Veneer","descriptions":["The walls and floor of this salesroom are a strange yet pleasing patchwork of polished woods in a variety of finishes and hues, each gleaming section an attractive example of the fine wood fittings stocked by the owner, Lustre.  In one corner, a selection of elegant tables complements the inventory, and the rich aroma of deep orange polishing oil hangs heavily in the air."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":672,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Thin Veneer","Lustre","Walls","Floors"]},
  {"id":672,"x":-150,"y":206,"z":0,"title":"The Thin Veneer, Chair Gallery","descriptions":["Lustre's own exquisite woods line the floor and walls of this pleasant showroom.  Groups of elegant chairs are arranged around the room in attractive displays, and yet more selections hang upon the walls, allowing customers to inspect the craftsman's high-quality products from all angles."],"exits":[{"to":671,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Chairs"]},
  {"id":673,"x":-202,"y":142,"z":0,"title":"Old Warehouse","descriptions":["The reek of dead fish permeates your nostrils making you feel ill.  Besides the stench, you notice piles and piles of old crates almost entirely filling this rotting deobar-paneled warehouse.  One of the crates in the corner has been smashed open, straw and broken glass spilling across the floor from it."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":674,"exit":"go","move":"go crate"}]},
  {"id":674,"x":-212,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Chamber","descriptions":["You find yourself on a slimy cobblestone floor in a dark, dank and smelly chamber.  Noxious trickles of effluent seep through tiny cracks in the tortured walls, which appear to be on the verge of collapse.  The hole in the rotted timber high above is hardly convenient for escape, and you realize with a chill that you must find another way out."],"exits":[{"to":675,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":675,"x":-212,"y":142,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["The walls of this narrow corridor are closer than is comfortable.  Bits and pieces of once-glorious tapestries still cling to their surfaces, caked with crud and sagging from the weight of the water they have absorbed.  Certain stones in the wall threaten to fall at any moment, and the floor is smattered with debris."],"exits":[{"to":676,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":674,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":676,"x":-212,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["Broken stones litter this part of the corridor.  The cobblestone floor is suddenly uneven, buckled by some ancient cataclysm.  A great boulder has punched its way through one wall, almost completely obstructing any northward progression.  Fine stress fractures trace the western wall, ending in a narrow crevice high above your head."],"exits":[{"to":677,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":675,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":875,"exit":"climb","move":"climb great boulder"}]},
  {"id":677,"x":-202,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["Tattered pieces of cloth are hung from rusted bars along each wall of this corridor.  While most of the fabric has disintegrated over time, a few remain somewhat complete, though dark splotches of mildew make it difficult to discern their patterns.  By the regularity of their placement, you gather that these are the remains of a series of heraldic banners."],"exits":[{"to":676,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":678,"exit":"go","move":"go curved arch"}]},
  {"id":678,"x":-100,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["Passing through this corridor, you are greeted by the overwhelming stench of the mushy, decaying rug beneath your feet.  Bedraggled and torn asunder, only the intricate thick binding along its edges is more or less intact.  A stark-white lizard appears out of a crack in the oozing walls and scurries for the other end of the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":679,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":677,"exit":"go","move":"go curved arch"}]},
  {"id":679,"x":-90,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["Iron brackets in the walls suggest that weapons once hung here, but nothing else remains in this spartan hallway."],"exits":[{"to":681,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":678,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":680,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":680,"x":-100,"y":122,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["A mass of crumbled wall and jagged rock fill the northern end of this corridor, making any further progress impossible.  Mixed in the rubble are shards of broken pottery and the bent remains of an iron torch ring.  Frozen in mid-crawl within a pool of mire, the mottled torso of a skeleton seems to be clawing its way from the ruins."],"exits":[{"to":679,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":681,"x":-90,"y":142,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["You find yourself in a narrow passageway where the stone walls have been overlain with wood slats.  Whatever purpose this room may have served at one time, it is now nothing more than a reeking mess of rotting boards and pooling ooze.  Every sloshing footfall stirs up a horrid odor as you make your way through."],"exits":[{"to":679,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":682,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":682,"x":-100,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["A collapsing wall spans the width of the eastern end of this corridor.  Crumbling bricks lie strewn across the cobblestones, and a thin layer of mortar dust coats tiny puddles of effluent."],"exits":[{"to":681,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":683,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broken wall;climb broken wall"}]},
  {"id":683,"x":-110,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["Something about this room causes you to give pause.  The air seems charged with some fantastic energy, and eventually you realize there is no destruction here.  Not a single stone is out of place, nothing putrid festers or fouls.  Though the hall bears no visible sign of an egress, something stirs you to press forward with extreme caution.  You give hefty consideration to the pristine floor, which is made of twelve massive tiles deeply etched with the icons of various items."],"exits":[{"to":682,"exit":"climb","move":"climb broken wall"},{"to":684,"exit":"go","move":"go portal"}]},
  {"id":684,"x":-120,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Crystal Chamber","descriptions":["To your utter astonishment, you find yourself engulfed in a breathtaking array of vivid, sparkling colors.  Constantly shifting in their prismic dance, they seem to make up the very air in the room, for as you move the hues and tones retreat and reconverge like liquid.  You feel as though you are standing at the very source of rainbows.  A pleasant, resonant hum reaches your ears."],"exits":[{"to":868,"exit":"go","move":"go portal"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Crystal Chamber"]},
  {"id":685,"x":-205,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, First Floor","descriptions":["This semicircular corridor is dry and slightly cool.  Its floor of packed earth is covered with an intricately woven, red and gold rug.  Lamps of glowstone line the room and a nearby staircase, bringing to the area a subdued but warm light."],"exits":[{"to":686,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":61,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1012,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Merchant Apartments"]},
  {"id":686,"x":-205,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, First Floor","descriptions":["The jackdaw sounds of everyday business in the Crossing have faded completely from this section of semicircular corridor.  Underneath a glowstone, a small wooden icon of Peri'el rests upon a sandstone lip.  An archway outlined in fluted columns leads south."],"exits":[{"to":685,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":687,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":687,"x":-205,"y":210,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, Plaza","descriptions":["Grape vines delicately entwine across grey trellises and eroded stone benches in this rounded, open area between the first floor corridors.  A faintly smiling water nymph carved from granite pours from a never-emptying pitcher into a small fountain.  A patch of the Crossing's sky functions for the plaza's dome, but no sound of the Crossing permeates this space.  An archway leads north."],"exits":[{"to":686,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":688,"x":-215,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, First Floor","descriptions":["The surface of this hallway is an aquamarine sandstone, buffed to a dull, marbled sheen.  The firmly encased, calcified remains of small marine creatures lay scattered about the top of the floor, one a large, golden starfish and the other an opalescent sea conch."],"exits":[{"to":689,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":62,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Korhege Apartments"]},
  {"id":689,"x":-215,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, First Floor","descriptions":["A large, decorative walnut chest adorns the end of this corridor.  Above it, wall-mounted iron supports in the shape of wave-lapped seahorses uphold a pair of cylindrical glowstones.  A stairwell leads to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":688,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":690,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":1008,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":690,"x":-215,"y":210,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, Garden","descriptions":["Oralana and climbers of maugwort, gravid with brown berries, tumble in profusion over gently eroded stone benches and tables in this central garden area.  The fragrance is mellow yet spicy, like standing downwind of a distant caravan loaded with herbs and costly fabrics."],"exits":[{"to":689,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":691,"x":-227,"y":166,"z":0,"title":"Burning Desires","descriptions":["Braziers of all shapes and sizes, all of the finest quality, stand in neat rows on the floor of this immaculate shop.  The air is heady with a potpourri of incenses burning in the models on display."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Burning Desires","Akhbar","Braziers"]},
  {"id":692,"x":-330,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Windows to the Universe","descriptions":["Paneless windows of various shapes and sizes line the walls, near them stacked large piles of multi-colored sands and small tubs of dyes.  Several sheets of finished glass sit near the exit, awaiting insertion into frames."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Windows to the Universe","Fenster"]},
  {"id":693,"x":-330,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, First Floor","descriptions":["The spare sandstone corridor is cool and quiet, its walls unsanded and rugged.  Running diagonally through one wall from ceiling to floor is a broad, glittering vein of golden feldspar.  Several lines of poetry, written in the Common tongue but using the flowing, elusive S'Kra script, have been incised across it."],"exits":[{"to":694,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":63,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Dintacui Apartments"]},
  {"id":694,"x":-330,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, First Floor","descriptions":["The bare, rocky hallway of white stone looks almost bleached in the light of several glowstone globes.  Four lines of poetry have been carved in a continuous, single wave along walls of the area.  A plain stairway leads up to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":693,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":695,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":892,"exit":"climb","move":"climb plain stairway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":695,"x":-320,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, Garden Room","descriptions":["This garden is furnished with thick pillows laid upon a tiled floor.  They form a hexagonal pattern around a single rosebush, fragrant with flowers.  Orange trees form a canopy, supplying sustenance and shelter from inclement weather."],"exits":[{"to":694,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":696,"x":-260,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Riverfront Portage, Office","descriptions":["The shouts of the dockworkers and the tang of river water penetrate even through the thick, earthen walls of this secure warehouse office.  Here are kept the records of all barge traffic along the river, the tariffs for haulage and storage.  A burlwood cabinet crammed chock full of files, a likewise overburdened rolltop desk and a brimming wastebasket all attest to the amount of paperwork that passes through this room."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":697,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze door"},{"to":698,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow arch"}]},
  {"id":697,"x":-260,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Riverfront Portage, Warehouse","descriptions":["Here, inside this brick hulk, merchants, traders and brokers store their goods bound for destinations along the river.  Offloaded cargo is also kept here, awaiting customs inspectors, tariff officers and hungry mice.  Pallet upon pallet of crates, barrels and boxes are lined up in neat rows, with the aisles between them wide enough for a horse-drawn cart to negotiate."],"exits":[{"to":696,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze door"}]},
  {"id":698,"x":-270,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Shipping Office","descriptions":["The hustle and bustle of the customs house seems magnified in the cramped shipping office as Traders rush in to ship their packages or wait for some to be delivered to them from other ports of call.  Dutiful clerks mark and organize the incoming crates, lining them according to their own system of letters and numbers to fit within deep, towering shelves that line the back wall."],"exits":[{"to":696,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Shipping Office"]},
  {"id":699,"x":-290,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Sand Spit Tavern, Barroom","descriptions":["Apparently made from a section of salvaged ship's hull the main bar area is constructed of ancient and scavenged nautical ware.  The decor is of the same vintage, an old hatch cover for a door, worn and broken capstans for tables with a hodge-podge of chairs of all sorts.  A long bar that has seen much better days is the main focus of the room.  The lighting is dim and there are many dark corners.  The clientele seems to prefer it that way to judge from the heavily curtained porthole windows."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":700,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowed table"},{"to":701,"exit":"go","move":"go dark corner"},{"to":858,"exit":"go","move":"go back area"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Sand Spit Tavern"]},
  {"id":700,"x":-300,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Sand Spit Tavern, Round table","descriptions":["Here in a very dark corner of the bar, sits a large table.  A rough wooden bench and some chairs are drawn up about it and a shaded oil-lamp sitting on it throws a narrow cone of light on the surroundings.  An ideal place to sit and drink or talk for those who'd prefer not to be disturbed."],"exits":[{"to":699,"exit":"go","move":"go main bar"}]},
  {"id":701,"x":-300,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Sand Spit Tavern, Dark Corner","descriptions":["This corner is dark and isolated from the main bar by a low wooden wall made from old spars bound together with rope.  A small square table and four chairs are the only furnishings.  Overhead, an old lantern sheds a pallid light over the nook.  The air is stale and smells of spilled beer and worse things."],"exits":[{"to":699,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":702,"x":-330,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Ulven's Warehouse, Storage","descriptions":["This storage area consists of a single well-ventilated, vast room with high ceilings.  Square wooden pallets hold stacks of bales, crates, kegs and hogsheads.  The stored goods all look fresh and intact, and the hustling workers running down the aisles pay you no heed."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Ulven's Warehouse"]},
  {"id":703,"x":-108,"y":86,"z":0,"title":"Shrine of Kertigen","descriptions":["The shrine here consists of a small rock garden with several stone benches placed at odd angles for meditation.  It is a cool and quiet respite that so delights you that you do not at first notice something most remarkable.  The miniature landscapes of tiny mountains and dwarf trees are not of stone and twig, but are actually fashioned out of precious metals and minerals."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine1-03","Kertigen"]},
  {"id":704,"x":-80,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Brisson's Haberdashery, Sales Salon","descriptions":["If understated elegance has a home, this is certainly it.  Rich mahogany floors, polished to a soft gleam are accented by thick handwoven rugs in burgundy and dark grey, that cushion each footfall.  Heavy cabinets with their doors ajar display a variety of handsome accoutrements for gentlemen of all tastes, ranging from understated to the more flamboyant apparel preferred by dandies."],"exits":[{"to":706,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":705,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":88,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Brisson's Haberdashery","Haberdashery"]},
  {"id":705,"x":-90,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Brisson's Haberdashery, Storage","descriptions":["Though quiet elegance may be the watchword in the salesroom, mayhem comes closer to describing these surroundings. Clerks, their arms piled high with exquisite garments, hats, canes, and scarves, scurry back and forth, whistling happily over their work. Near a large window in the back of the room, a new shipment is arriving, the burly delivery men looking coarse and rough compared to the smaller, softer appearance of the salespeople."],"exits":[{"to":704,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":706,"x":-70,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Brisson's Haberdashery, Fitting Room","descriptions":["Long rods suspended from the low ceiling display a mind-boggling variety of clothing.  Capes lined with silk, fine ceremonial tunics, and elegant frock coates nudge up against leather jerkins and other more protective garments, all awaiting the touch of a master tailor to define them more perfectly for their new owners. Bolts of fabric, march like small sentinels along sturdy shelves along the edges of the room, protecting the modesty of some of the more bashful patrons."],"exits":[{"to":704,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Brisson's Fitting Room"]},
  {"id":707,"x":-250,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Shrine of Ushnish","descriptions":["In a dark, fetid alley, hard behind the Viper's Nest Inn, you happen upon a small shrine.  Kicking away what appears to be rubbish from around it, you reveal a sculpted granite image of the serpent god Ushnish.  Seeing that, you realize with a shudder that it is not rubbish you just pushed aside, but offerings of dead rats, uncured, fresh skins and other offal left by devotees of the viper-headed deity."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine1-02","Ushnish"]},
  {"id":708,"x":-210,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Viper's Nest, Courtyard","descriptions":["Cracked flagstones pave the grim courtyard of the Viper's Nest Inn, making you stumble as you feel your way along.  A scabrous-looking, dense deobar tree blocks off any light.  Trails of mud, dust, sweat and blood streak the pavement, as if heavy burdens of all ilk had been dragged through here.  In a corner of the patio is a broken clay urn filled with water, the only place where guests and carousers can wash, or dunk themselves to shake off the haze of their intoxicants of choice."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":709,"exit":"go","move":"go storm cellar"},{"to":710,"exit":"go","move":"go scarred door"}]},
  {"id":709,"x":-200,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Viper's Nest, Storm Cellar","descriptions":["A battered storm cellar door leads down into the room via a few rickety, decrepit wooden steps.  The musty odor and clammy air are intensified by the darkness.  A constant dripping sound and the scurrying of creatures unseen about your feet makes you utter a quick prayer that there are no impending squalls out over Segoltha Bay.  Leaking casks of sour ale, maggot-ridden hogsheads of flour, and dark-stained, shapeless burlap bundles can barely be discerned in the half-murk."],"exits":[{"to":708,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":710,"x":-210,"y":-170,"z":0,"title":"Viper's Nest, The Pit","descriptions":["The Viper's Nest is known throughout the land for catering to the dregs of society.  The premises are often frequented by spies, conspirators, thieves, smugglers, rogue adventurers and crooked traders.  Folks congregate around long, rough-hewn tables, hunched forward listening, gesturing or speaking in harsh, sibilant whispers.  The ale is warm, the viands are inedible, nonetheless the Pit is jammed.  You notice a large proportion of S'Kra Mur and Gor'Togs in the mix."],"exits":[{"to":708,"exit":"go","move":"go scarred door"},{"to":711,"exit":"climb","move":"climb dimly-lit staircase"}],"aliases":["Viper's Nest"]},
  {"id":711,"x":-210,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Viper's Nest, Attic","descriptions":["The inn is not set up for overnight guests, but this cramped garret is often pressed into service for that purpose.  A filthy mattress with discolored ticking is thrown haphazardly in a corner.  Your feet adhere to the planks and, wondering why, you glance down to see reddish-brown spots that trail out the door.  A lone oil lamp provides dim light.  The harsh chatter of the crowd downstairs, and the scuffles from the courtyard insure that sleep here will be fitful at best."],"exits":[{"to":710,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":712,"x":-341,"y":-328,"z":0,"title":"Western Gate Tier, Guard House","descriptions":["This customs post is the roughest and least desirable station in the entire Militia, and looking at the guards here, you have no doubt of it.  Recruits from the town's most formidable dungeons, a stint in the Militia their ticket to freedom.  Weary traders and travelers argue with them about tariffs, and a badly beaten thief and an unconscious black marketeer both dangle from iron manacles against the far wall.  You quickly turn and leave, hoping not to catch the eye of a surly guard."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["W Guard House"]},
  {"id":713,"x":-10,"y":-418,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Lobby","descriptions":["Though many such inns dot the landscape, Taelbert's is known as especially hospitable to locals and wayfarers alike.  Here in the lobby, clerks busy themselves behind an antique mahogany counter, seeing to the needs of guests and directing the activities of the rather large staff."],"exits":[{"to":715,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":714,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":122,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":719,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden staircase"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Taelbert's Inn"]},
  {"id":714,"x":-20,"y":-418,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Bar","descriptions":["Bursts of laughter and excited shouts ring out from a game of dice being played at a corner table.  Other tables and chairs are scattered haphazardly through the room, but most of the regulars perch on high stools near the bar.  Apparently, the view of the buxom barmaid is more enticing from that angle."],"exits":[{"to":713,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":715,"x":-10,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Dining Room","descriptions":["The spacious dining room is elegant, if slightly frayed at the edges.  Faded blue velvet chairs cluster around white linen-covered tables set with fine old silver and occasionally mismatched china.  Set between two pillars on the southwest wall, a curtained alcove offers privacy, and to the southeast, soft light spills outward from a quiet corner."],"exits":[{"to":713,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":716,"exit":"go","move":"go wide arch"},{"to":718,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":716,"x":-10,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Banquet Room","descriptions":["Candles placed at regular intervals along several wide banquet tables light the room with a warm golden glow.  A single table placed at right angles to the rest sits atop a low platform near the northern wall.  Garlands of wildflowers drape in gentle spirals around stone pillars, filling the air with their delicate, sweet scent."],"exits":[{"to":715,"exit":"go","move":"go wide arch"},{"to":717,"exit":"go","move":"go tiny alcove"}]},
  {"id":717,"x":0,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Alcove","descriptions":["Little more than a niche off of the main banquet room, this dark alcove is at least quiet, if not sumptuous.  A faded sofa takes up much of the floorspace, and though not elegant by any means, it certainly appears inviting."],"exits":[{"to":716,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":718,"x":-20,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Private Dining","descriptions":["Softly polished mahogany lines the walls in this small room, creating an intimate setting for private dining.  The high-backed chairs are upholstered in rich forest-green velvet and are gathered round an elegantly set table.  On the wall opposite the doorway, a rough stone fireplace offers striking counterpoint to the simple elegance of the furnishings."],"exits":[{"to":715,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":719,"x":-10,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["At one time, this inn must have been a private home, which explains the relatively few rooms available for guests.  Several doors open up off this second floor hallway, which makes a sharp turn to the north at the far end."],"exits":[{"to":720,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":713,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden staircase"},{"to":722,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"},{"to":723,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":724,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}]},
  {"id":720,"x":-10,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["The north hall ends abruptly here at the quietest corner of the house."],"exits":[{"to":719,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":721,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":721,"x":-20,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Yellow Room","descriptions":["White lace curtains flutter at the windows on the wall opposite the door, as a gentle breeze wafts through the room.  A sofa covered with yellow and blue chintz looks inviting, as does the massive bed set on a platform just to the left of the window.  Soft yellow wallpaper in a simple stripe pattern completes the picture of a quiet, inviting place to relax in peace."],"exits":[{"to":720,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}]},
  {"id":722,"x":0,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Linen Closet","descriptions":["Shelves stacked neatly with fresh linens line the walls from floor to ceiling.  In one corner, a pile of fluffy comforters looks oddly out of place in the otherwise well-ordered room."],"exits":[{"to":719,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"}]},
  {"id":723,"x":-30,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Blue Room","descriptions":["Sky blue walls and indigo carpets combine to give this room a cool, soothing atmosphere.  The mahogany four-poster bed is covered with a patchwork satin comforter in shades of green and turquoise, offering a striking counterpoint to the crisp white, lace-edged linens that peek out from underneath."],"exits":[{"to":719,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":724,"x":-30,"y":-418,"z":0,"title":"Taelbert's Inn, Cozy Room","descriptions":["Though small in size, the room is comfortably furnished with a sturdy brass bed taking up much of the wall opposite the door, and a tiny desk tucked into one corner.  Thick braided rugs of deep green wool complement the walls, which have been painted a soft grey."],"exits":[{"to":719,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken door"}]},
  {"id":725,"x":50,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["A peaceful sitting area occupies the Fostra Square end of the cloisters, its three walls lined with low oak benches.  Plush velvet floor cushions in shades of cream and gold offer casual seating at the foot of each bench.  An elegant arrangement of flowers and fruits stands upon a highly polished table that occupies the center of the room, bringing a vibrant splash of color to the neutral tones of the cloister."],"exits":[{"to":726,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":125,"exit":"go","move":"go portico gate"}]},
  {"id":726,"x":50,"y":-578,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["The heady, cleansing aroma of incense wafts about the corridor, carried on a light breeze which floats in through an open window.  From outside, the peaceful cloister garden contributes its own natural perfume to the combination of fragrances which drift along the corridor and into the residential rooms which occupy this tranquil wing of the guild."],"exits":[{"to":727,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":725,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":727,"x":50,"y":-598,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["The soft candlelight flickers soothingly in this corner, where the gentle motion of air from the cloister's windows combines to provide a refreshing, scented breeze.  Delicate twists of dried flowers and grasses decorate the otherwise unadorned white walls, and though their colors are faded, they are still as pleasing to the eye as they were the day the Gods first painted their frail petals."],"exits":[{"to":726,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":728,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":728,"x":30,"y":-598,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["A constant light breeze whispers through an arched window, bringing with it the fresh scents of the cloister garden.  The intermittent ringing of bells drifts in reassuringly, bringing the soft melody of devotion into the corridor and forming a dulcet backdrop to the quiet rites of homage which cycle endlessly throughout the guild."],"exits":[{"to":727,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":729,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":729,"x":10,"y":-598,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["Laid end-to-end along the hallway, heavy tapestry rugs render the cool stone floor soft and soundless underfoot and allow a reverential silence to blanket the candlelit corridor.  A magnificent mural occupies one wall, its muted pastel shades describing scenes from the lives of Elanthia's gods and the good men and women of local history."],"exits":[{"to":728,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":730,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":730,"x":-10,"y":-598,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["A simple whitewashed corridor runs around three sides of the cloister garden, its occasional arched windows overlooking the tranquil courtyard.  Ranged evenly along one wall, numerous doorways lead into the private rooms of the Guild's resident members.  The quiet murmur of whispered prayers envelopes the corridor in a deep feeling of calm and serenity."],"exits":[{"to":729,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":731,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Todo: Go Iron Gate To Cleric-only Area"]},
  {"id":731,"x":-30,"y":-598,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["Gentle candlelight illuminates the passageway with a soft golden glow, shining down from ornate iron candelabra and warming the corridor's plain white walls like late evening sunshine.  Great oak beams run the length of the cloister, supporting the vaulted ceiling and suspending the chandeliers at regular intervals along the center of the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":730,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":732,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":732,"x":-50,"y":-598,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["An arched window allows passers-by to pause for a moment and admire the simple beauty of the cloister garden, its every leaf and branch a joyous tribute to the gods who give life to all things.  Inside the corridor, soft natural light blends comfortably with the flickering glow provided by the candelabra overhead, and by the banks of scented devotional candles arranged on iron stands outside each door."],"exits":[{"to":731,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":733,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":733,"x":-50,"y":-578,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["A pair of potted willow trees decorates the hallway here, standing to either side of the corridor and adding shades of silver and green to the soft light in the cloister.  Carefully tended by the residents, the elegant trees grow tall and strong, their lush foliage responding to the love for living things which is nurtured and celebrated in the daily rituals of the guild."],"exits":[{"to":732,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":734,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":734,"x":-50,"y":-558,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Residential Cloisters","descriptions":["Carved into the white plaster wall, a wide alcove is home to a selection of alabaster figurines, each one representing the benevolent aspect of the deities of Elanthia.  Beneath it, a simple iron stand holds a mass of tiny candles, each offering placed in worshipful thanksgiving for the kindnesses of the Gods.  Every little devotion is lovingly maintained at all times, and carefully replaced before its flame begins to dim."],"exits":[{"to":733,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":735,"x":110,"y":-548,"z":0,"title":"Elite Architecture","descriptions":["Shards of light glint on metallic inlays between the panels of expensive woods which line the walls of the shop.  Marble tiles and varnished flagstones spread across the floor, the surface polished to a glassy smoothness resembling a deep, still lagoon.  The elegant proprietor, Dulcinara, glides about the store with a natural grace, quietly demonstrating the quality of her wares to the monied folk who travel from afar to seek out her architectural expertise."],"exits":[{"to":133,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Elite Architecture","Home Exteriors"]},
  {"id":736,"x":170,"y":-538,"z":0,"title":"The Bottom Line","descriptions":["Warm yellow candlelight illuminates this welcoming cottage, and a log fire crackling in one corner adds to the homey comfort.  Bartina, a portly Dwarven woman with sparkling blue eyes and fat flaxen braids, bustles around the room flapping imaginary specks of dust from her selection of charming chairs."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bottom Line","Chair Shop"]},
  {"id":737,"x":350,"y":-428,"z":0,"title":"Martyr Saedelthorp, Dispensary","descriptions":["Piremus the Chemist presides over the hospital's dispensary.  Wounded, battleweary adventurers are sprawled out on an uncomfortable wood bench.  The chemist barks out a name, and one of them slowly, painfully rises to pick up some prescribed medicinal preparations.  Potions, salves, unguents, powders, and pills of all hues line a rack behind the blood-smeared counter.  No one leaves the hospital without paying for an additional dose or two."],"exits":[{"to":141,"exit":"go","move":"go hospital backdoor"}],"aliases":["Dispensary","PHA"]},
  {"id":738,"x":350,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Foyer","descriptions":["An elaborately ornamented desk serves as a check-in point for travellers seeking a night's rest.  Beside the ancient-looking wooden doorway which leads out, two amazingly detailed stone statues stand guard over the entryway.  You begin to wonder if they are truly the product of genius or perhaps the unfortunate result of some powerful mage's disfavor.  In the corner, a staircase leads up into darkness."],"exits":[{"to":741,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":740,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":739,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":144,"exit":"go","move":"go ancient door"},{"to":743,"exit":"climb","move":"climb dark staircase"}]},
  {"id":739,"x":340,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Solarium","descriptions":["Amongst a variety of unrecognizable red-orange plants, you notice a small riolur bush flourishing in the sunlight.  The ceiling is much lower here but is made up of a number of small multi-colored glass panes which add a curious tint to the atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":742,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":741,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":738,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":740,"x":360,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Barroom","descriptions":["Plush red carpet surrounds a glistening pinewood bar where thirsty travellers stop for a taste of Gaethrend's finest brew.  A seemingly endless array of bottles are lined up in front of a classic long bar mirror.  You note a few of the bottles contain actively swirling elixirs, twisting about in their containers as if alive."],"exits":[{"to":738,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":741,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":742,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Gaethrend's Court"]},
  {"id":741,"x":350,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Promenade","descriptions":["A grand glass skylight allows the sun to shine in from above, lending the court a warm glow.  Several booths circle the area, occupied by magicians, astrologers, and various traders of magical wares.  A wrought-iron spiral stairway rises into some scaffolding high above the center of the promenade."],"exits":[{"to":742,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":740,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":738,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":739,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":742,"x":350,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Dining Room","descriptions":["The quiet atmosphere and simple decor of the dining room soothes your nerves, making this the perfect spot for a relaxing meal with friends.  A regal-looking Eloth maitre d'hotel glides from table to table, keeping careful watch over his domain."],"exits":[{"to":740,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":741,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":739,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":743,"x":390,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Light seems to follow you as you move about, allowing you to see what's in front of you but very little of what's beyond.  A slight hint of sulfur and garlic is prevalent throughout the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":746,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":744,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":738,"exit":"climb","move":"climb dark staircase"},{"to":747,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":744,"x":380,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Light seems to follow you as you move about, allowing you to see what's in front of you but very little of what's beyond.  A slight hint of sulfur and garlic is prevalent throughout the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":745,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":743,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":750,"exit":"go","move":"go green-blue door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":745,"x":390,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Light seems to follow you as you move about, allowing you to see what's in front of you but very little of what's beyond.  A slight hint of sulfur and garlic is prevalent throughout the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":746,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":744,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":749,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":746,"x":400,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Light seems to follow you as you move about, allowing you to see what's in front of you but very little of what's beyond.  A slight hint of sulfur and garlic is prevalent throughout the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":743,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":745,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":748,"exit":"go","move":"go blue-green door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":747,"x":390,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Bedroom","descriptions":["This simple room contains everything you need for a good night's rest including a bed, dresser, and personal bath.  Everything here has a light blue tint.  Over the dresser, a mirror shows the reflection of the entire room except for your own, which is disturbingly absent."],"exits":[{"to":743,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":748,"x":400,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Bedroom","descriptions":["The light in this room is slowly shifting in color, causing the furnishings to appear to change from light blue to light green and back.  A complimentary yellow potion has been left sitting on the nightstand, but what the potion actually does is a subject for speculation."],"exits":[{"to":746,"exit":"go","move":"go blue-green door"}]},
  {"id":749,"x":400,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Bedroom","descriptions":["You are startled by the fact that the entire room seems built at a forty-five degree angle.  Even the small window in the far wall shows a tilted scene, and the overall effect is making you a bit ill.  On the angled dresser next to the bed, three silver spheres rest perfectly still, quietly ignoring the laws of gravity."],"exits":[{"to":745,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":750,"x":380,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Gaethrend's Court, Bedroom","descriptions":["The light in this room is slowly shifting in color, causing the furnishings to shift from light green to light blue and back.  A complimentary red potion has been left sitting on the nightstand, but what the potion actually does is a subject for speculation."],"exits":[{"to":744,"exit":"go","move":"go green-blue door"}]},
  {"id":751,"x":390,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Tower East, Air Floor","descriptions":["A dark grey carpet decorated with a pattern of crossing black lightning bolts covers the floor, matching the decoration on the grey-painted walls.  A constant, low thrum hangs just inside the range of hearing, its source nearby but not readily apparent.  Doors spaced in an even circle around the perimeter lead to initiates' private cells."],"exits":[{"to":752,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":157,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":755,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Tower East","Air Floor"]},
  {"id":752,"x":390,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Tower East, Water Floor","descriptions":["Deep blue carpeting covers the floor, its surface cut in a manner that suggests the rippling of waves upon the surface of a lake.  Bright blue spirals, representing the element of water, fill the walls between a series of doors leading to initiates' private cells.  The air here is moist and cool upon the skin."],"exits":[{"to":753,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":751,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Water Floor"]},
  {"id":753,"x":390,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Tower East, Fire Floor","descriptions":["Lush, red carpeting covers the floor, muffling any ambient noise into oblivion.  Images of bloated red suns, representing the element of fire, fill the walls between a series of doors leading to initiates' private cells.  The air here is significantly warmer than on the tower's other floors, although the reason is not readily apparent."],"exits":[{"to":754,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":752,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Fire Floor"]},
  {"id":754,"x":390,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Tower East, Aether Floor","descriptions":["Carpeting the color of a death shroud covers the floor, devouring the light as hungrily as Aldauth consumes souls.  The walls are devoid of decoration, instead painted a uniform black to match the floor.  Only the doors leading to initiates' cells betray any hint of color in this otherwise cold, bleak room."],"exits":[{"to":753,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Aether Floor"]},
  {"id":755,"x":390,"y":-10,"z":0,"title":"Tower East, Earth Floor","descriptions":["Bare, dark soil forms the floor underfoot.  The stony walls surrounding this circular room are similarly devoid of decoration, keeping instead the plain, natural look preferred by those mages who favor the element of Earth.  Doors leading to the initiates' private cells line the walls."],"exits":[{"to":751,"exit":"climb","move":"climb oak staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Earth Floor"]},
  {"id":756,"x":390,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Gate, Guard House","descriptions":["A few guards listlessly lean against the walls here in this shack.  There is not even anything to sit on in here, to insure they do not fall asleep at their posts.  A Gor'Tog day laborer, in shackles, is questioned by one sullen guard who doesn't seem particularly interested in answers."],"exits":[{"to":162,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["E Guard House"]},
  {"id":757,"x":230,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Tamsine's Rest","descriptions":["A shady clump of sicle saplings cluster around a large, moss-encrusted fragment of pink coral.  Carved into a hollow in the center of the coral landmark is a crude yet moving image of Tamsine, one of the patron goddesses of the town.  Before the simple shrine is a low limestone bench, where the weary traveler might take some rest in the shade, leave offerings of flowers or food, and contemplate matters of the soul and spirit."],"exits":[{"to":164,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":758,"exit":"go","move":"go low gate"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine1-01","Tamsine's Rest"]},
  {"id":758,"x":220,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Tamsine's Rest, Memorial Tea Garden","descriptions":["Water burbles over rocks to fill a shallow stone basin, conveniently positioned for visitors wishing to wash their hands upon entering the garden.  Thick cushions of green moss soften the stones and carpet the ground underfoot.  Red azaleas, deep purple irises and white chrysanthemums add vibrant touches of color against the velvety moss.  At the center of the garden, ribbon-tied parchment scrolls flutter from a red maple tree, celebrating the memory of loved ones lost."],"exits":[{"to":757,"exit":"go","move":"go low gate"}],"aliases":["Memorial Tea Garden","water"]},
  {"id":759,"x":27,"y":-266,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Library Hall","descriptions":["The library of the Academy is famed far and wide for its large collection of printed works on the Arts and Sciences.  A wall-long shelf holds this treasure securely against time and wearing.  Many comfortable chairs and low tables are scattered about for the ease of readers and several desks are available for the more serious scholar.  Several students are sprawled out in chairs reading and one is at a desk, crouched over a parchment, scribbling away on a notepad."],"exits":[{"to":206,"exit":"go","move":"go polished doors"}],"aliases":["Dictionaries","Languages"]},
  {"id":760,"x":-3,"y":-256,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Gallery of Fine Arts","descriptions":["This room is a gallery for all manner of art.  Paintings adorn the walls and niches hold statues of many sorts.  Large skylights bring in a flattering light and the north end of the room is set aside for use as a studio for painting and sculpting."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"go","move":"go stone door"}]},
  {"id":761,"x":17,"y":-256,"z":0,"title":"Asemath Academy, Founder's Theatre","descriptions":["This theatre is large enough to hold the entire staff and student body as well as at least a hundred more.  Comfortable seating slopes down to a raised stage so that all have an excellent view.  Dedicated to Asemath the Founder, one seat in the front row is always left vacant as a tribute to his efforts in building the Academy named after him."],"exits":[{"to":215,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":762,"x":-30,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Ragge's Locksmithing, Back Room","descriptions":["Taking a good look at some of the other customers, who appear at odd intervals, you find yourself clutching the coins in your pocket a little more closely.  Surreptitiously, you glance around to note that although the room itself is rather nondescript, the clientele is extremely colorful.  In one corner, the rickety folding table is apparently the center of attention, and though it makes you slightly nervous to do so, you quietly make your way over to peruse the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":218,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":763,"exit":"go","move":"go trap door"}]},
  {"id":763,"x":-30,"y":-90,"z":0,"title":"Ragge's Locksmithing, Basement","descriptions":["This might be some sort of storeroom, but the contents don't really fit what you know of the shop above.  Though the walls are lined with shelves, very few contain anything approaching what one would expect from a locksmith.  Glints of silver and gold catch your eye, as do the sparkling facets of more than a few pieces of rather expensive looking jewelry.  A barred window looks secure enough, and provides an interesting view of the feet of passersby outside."],"exits":[{"to":762,"exit":"go","move":"go trap door"}]},
  {"id":764,"x":190,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Mauriga's Botanicals, Root Cellar","descriptions":["A stair carpeted with a richly patterned runner leads down to the root cellar when Mauriga prepares and preserves her concoctions, based on ancient clan and family recipes.  Raw materials fill jar after crystal jar, on niches in the earthen walls.  Always needful of ingredients, she happily buys herbs from adventurers and keeps them here as well.  A few serious-looking Elves and Eloths, and a snoozing Halfling, sit around a mixing table, fiddling with scales, scoops, and vials."],"exits":[{"to":219,"exit":"climb","move":"climb carpeted stair"}]},
  {"id":765,"x":60,"y":350,"z":0,"title":"Barana's Shipyard, Drying Kiln","descriptions":["Heavy stone floors and walls retain a good deal of heat.  This dries the damp river air and makes this large enclosure almost a pleasant resting place.  Thick layers of soot on everything makes it unwise to sit or rest anything valuable on the ground or anywhere else.  Unlike the killing heat needed to fire ceramics, this place is more like a smokehouse.  Green wood is brought here to age and dry under controlled conditions, to assure it remains straight and true."],"exits":[{"to":244,"exit":"go","move":"go kiln door"}]},
  {"id":766,"x":240,"y":-478,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Up a Linden Tree","descriptions":["The entire northeast corner of the city can be seen from this vantage point high above the rooftops.  To the north rises the gleaming white block of the Paladin's Guild, tucked up against the city walls marking the edge of the forests to the northeast.  The glowing windows of Gaethrend's Court are visible to the east, and the bustle of the Infirmary and the Empath's Guild lying to the south can be only dimly heard.","The entire northeast corner of the city can be seen from this vantage point high above the rooftops, lights twinkling through the darkness.  To the north is dimly visible the gleaming white block of the Paladin's Guild, tucked up against the city walls marking the edge of the forests to the northeast.  The pulsating glow of Gaethrend's Court lights the sky to the east, and the bustle of the Infirmary and the Empath's Guild lying to the south can be only dimly heard."],"exits":[{"to":252,"exit":"climb","move":"climb tree trunk"}],"aliases":["Linden Tree"]},
  {"id":767,"x":260,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Willow Walk, Water Lily Pool","descriptions":["Water trickling down from the fountain provides a constant musical backdrop.  Tiny fish swim among the floating water lilies, darting up to the surface occasionally to search for their next meal.  The water, coming from wells far below the surface, remains cool to the touch in every season."],"exits":[{"to":260,"exit":"go","move":"go garden"}],"aliases":["Pool"]},
  {"id":768,"x":230,"y":-230,"z":0,"title":"Treetop Perch","descriptions":["A small platform wedged between two large limbs provides a stable resting place high in the apple tree.  A canopy of leaves blocking out most of the view of the sky and the ground below gives the perch a feeling of privacy.  It is not exactly quiet here, but the bright song of birds and whisper of a breeze passing over verdant green foilage is pleasant and soothing.  The sturdy trunk of the tree has a couple of steps hammered down the side to aid climbing to the ground below.","A small platform wedged between two large limbs provides a stable resting place high in the apple tree.  A canopy of leaves that blocks out most of the sky and ground gives the perch a feeling of privacy.  It is not exactly quiet here, but the gentle chirp of crickets and the whispering rush of water in the creek below is pleasant and soothing.  The sturdy trunk of the tree has several steps hammered down the side to aid climbing to the ground below."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"climb","move":"climb tree trunk"}]},
  {"id":769,"x":320,"y":-388,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Champions' Arena","descriptions":["A perimeter of immense granite walls and galleries encloses this stark field of death.  Rough gravel carpets the battleground, the brown stains of blood distinctly visible against the pale rocks, tainting the arena like a scourge.  To the south lies a caged portcullis from which unknown lethal opponents can be unleashed into battle."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go portcullis"}],"aliases":["Champions' Arena"]},
  {"id":770,"x":330,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Arena Stands","descriptions":["Ringed by a steel railing, rows of stone seats afford an excellent view of the arena below.  An iron-bound oak door leads deeper into the guild, while a spiral staircase leads back down to the stadium pits.  Keeping a wary eye on those present, a large Gor'Tog guards a leather flap on the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":771,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":776,"exit":"go","move":"go flap"}],"aliases":["Arena Stands"]},
  {"id":771,"x":340,"y":-388,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, The Slaughter House","descriptions":["Leather chairs line the lounge, allowing the patrons to sit comfortably around wooden tables.  The bartender, Rushleel, stands behind a long teak-topped bar along the northern wall, serving drinks to thirsty warriors.  Directly opposite the bar, samples of the cuilinary delights available from the menu are displayed atop a sideboard.  A large iron-bound oak door leads into the viewing area overlooking the Champions' Arena."],"exits":[{"to":770,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":772,"x":-160,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Thrifty Doors","descriptions":["Large rectangular wooden tables clutter this small room, each one bowed under the weight of a stack of doors.  Unfinished and second-hand doors lean against the walls and lurch in heaps on the floor, and several of the better specimens hang on chains from the rafters.  A grumpy-looking Dwarf leans against a battered oak counter, squinting suspiciously at customers and sucking noisily on a clay pipe which belches thick brown smoke into the air."],"exits":[{"to":338,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Thrifty Doors","Doors"]},
  {"id":773,"x":0,"y":-548,"z":0,"title":"Clerics' Guild, Wine Cellar","descriptions":["As your eyes adjust to the sudden darkness, you see several bookshelves that have been converted into criss-crossed wine racks with a corked bottle in each cubby hole.  The air is cool and dry, making this the perfect storage area for the aging liquid."],"exits":[{"to":348,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden stairway"},{"to":1006,"exit":"go","move":"go sloping tunnel"}]},
  {"id":774,"x":90,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Luthier's, Private Showroom","descriptions":["Tiny gaethzen globes light the room, adding a soft gleam to the silks draping the displays and tables that feature some of the luthier's more intricate work, available for his most discriminating clients.  A settee provides seating, and a small tray offers beverages and snacks to entice those shopping into staying longer -- and buying more.  A heavy lined curtain leads back out to the main shop."],"exits":[{"to":401,"exit":"go","move":"go lined curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Luthier's"]},
  {"id":775,"x":110,"y":10,"z":0,"title":"Brother Durantine's, Private Salon","descriptions":["This small room is for private consultations with Brother Durantine.  A low table and a pair of plain chairs are the only real furnishings.  A small incense burner wafts a heavy musky scent around the room."],"exits":[{"to":407,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":776,"x":340,"y":-398,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Private Seats","descriptions":["Several rows of leather-clad seats offer plenty of room to sit and cheer on a favored combatant.  Plush damask draperies cover the back and side walls of this exclusive viewing box, while a polished teak railing separates the spectators from the gladiators below.  Opposite the exit flap, a small buffet offers a few choice tidbits for the parched or hungry pit fanatic."],"exits":[{"to":770,"exit":"go","move":"go flap"}]},
  {"id":777,"x":330,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Atrium","descriptions":["Pale pillars of carved ashen granite surge upwards, encircling and supporting a large globular chandelier.  The golden light accentuates the carvings and bathes the atrium in brilliance."],"exits":[{"to":778,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":783,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":785,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":786,"exit":"go","move":"go flame-shaped opening"},{"to":302,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"}]},
  {"id":778,"x":330,"y":-338,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory Row","descriptions":["Large granite tiles stretch the length of the hallway, cushioned only by a jewel-toned runner woven with intricate geometric designs.  The steady flames of iron-banded oil lamps illuminate the wall tapestries and bathe the stone walls in a welcoming glow.  Two large steel sculptures stand like guardians at the entrance of the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":777,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":779,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":779,"x":320,"y":-338,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory Row","descriptions":["Large granite tiles stretch the length of the hallway, cushioned only by a jewel-toned runner woven with intricate geometric designs.  The only significant decoration for this portion of the hallway is a vivid wall mosaic depicting a lone man holding aloft a bloodied sword."],"exits":[{"to":778,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":780,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":780,"x":310,"y":-338,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory Row","descriptions":["Nestled in a corner between two doors is a polished ebony sculpture in the shape of a snarling wolf.  Padded benches, too low and narrow to comfortably sit upon, provide a place for those wishing to meditate.  A gnarled ironwood war club is clenched within the wolf's snarling maw, one of the many relics on display throughout the guildhall's corridors."],"exits":[{"to":781,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":779,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":781,"x":310,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Dormitory Row","descriptions":["No ornamentation softens the hallway's stark stone walls.  Grey on grey, ceiling flows into wall into floor with little variation in color or texture.  The monochromatic surroundings are broken by a thick-paned window on the western wall.  Stretching from floor-to-ceiling, the window offers a clear view of the Champions' Square outside."],"exits":[{"to":782,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":780,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":782,"x":310,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Common Room","descriptions":["The hallway opens up into this spacious circular chamber.  Heavy damask draperies cover the stone walls, broken only by a few iron-banded oil lamps and the doors blocking entrance into their respective living quarters.  Standing like a lone sentinel at the center of the room, an intricately carved totem rises nearly to the ceiling, its commanding presence demanding full attention."],"exits":[{"to":781,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":783,"x":340,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Vishlan's Wares","descriptions":["Highly polished mahogany paneling reflects and intensifies the flickering light cast by wrought iron sconces bolted to the walls.  Narrow veins of crimson crystal thread through the black marble floor, spreading across the surface like curling tongues of flame.  Cherry and ebonwood shelves hang along one wall, while a wide mahogany counter contains several displays."],"exits":[{"to":784,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":777,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood archway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Vishlan's Wares","Barbarian Shop"]},
  {"id":784,"x":350,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Vishlan's Wares","descriptions":["The highly polished mahogony paneling continues on from the main room, reflecting and intensifying the flickering light cast by wrought iron sconces bolted to the walls.  Narrow veins of crimson crystal sparkle in the black marble floor, spreading across the surface like curling tongues of flame.  A rack rests against one wall between an oak table and an ebonwood shelf."],"exits":[{"to":783,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":785,"x":340,"y":-338,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, The Brunken Darbarian","descriptions":["Leather chairs line the lounge, allowing the patrons to sit comfortably around wooden tables.  The bartender, Rushleel, stands behind a long teak-topped bar along the northern wall, serving drinks to thirsty warriors.  Directly opposite the bar, samples of the culinary delights available from the menu are displayed atop a sideboard.  A large iron-bound oak door leads into the viewing area overlooking the Champions' Arena."],"exits":[{"to":777,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":770,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Barbarian bar"]},
  {"id":786,"x":340,"y":-368,"z":0,"title":"Barbarian Guild, Antechamber","descriptions":["Granite benches divide the room into a central square surrounded by a wide onyx-floored walkway.  Within the square, a pillar of twisting flames roar up from a wrought-iron brazier with the commanding vigor of a berserker's rage.  Banners and tapestries depicting fierce battle scenes line the antechamber's walls."],"exits":[{"to":777,"exit":"go","move":"go flame-shaped opening"}],"aliases":["Antechamber"]},
  {"id":787,"x":355,"y":-546,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Library","descriptions":["A small table surrounded by chairs rests in the center of the room, enclosed on all sides by towering shelves stocked full with books and journals.  The colorful spines of the manuscripts depict the names of masterpieces collected over the years, and some bear tell-tale signs of wear and age.  A large sign with gold-foil lettering hangs behind a mahogany book return desk."],"exits":[{"to":798,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden doors"}]},
  {"id":788,"x":210,"y":-588,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Herald Street","descriptions":["You stand before a pristine white building, two stories high - the Paladins' Guild.  Its roof is angled to catch the rays of the sun, moons and stars through a crystal skylight set into one of the eaves.  The only color is provided by round, stained-glass windows, depicting vignettes from the lives of illustrious paladins of Elanthia's past.  An arched doorway topped by a carved wooden lintel leads inside."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":789,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}],"aliases":["tithe box"]},
  {"id":789,"x":297,"y":-536,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Meeting Hall","descriptions":["Light shines in from above through a large skylight placed in the ceiling of this grand hall.  All of the chairs have been arranged in a circle, representing the symbolic equality of all guild members.  Mounted above the doorway, a shining silver broadsword points skyward."],"exits":[{"to":791,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":790,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":788,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":793,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"}],"aliases":["Paladins' Guild"]},
  {"id":790,"x":287,"y":-536,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Armory","descriptions":["Displays of armor and shields line the walls, some plain save for the scars of battle, some gleaming bright and emblazoned with the devices of noble houses.  Myriad weapons of war and peace sit behind unlocked glass cases, on display until the day when they must once more be lifted in the name of the gods and the Light.  A weapons rack has been fitted into one wall for the express purpose of outfitting those warriors of the Guild who lack the coin for proper gear."],"exits":[{"to":789,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":791,"x":307,"y":-536,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Chambers","descriptions":["Several mats have been spread about this quiet chamber.  A single circular stained-glass window allows light to softly brighten the room.  Simple weapon racks have been placed before each mat, allowing the seeking paladin a room to meditate before his sword, in hopes of visualizing the purest path."],"exits":[{"to":789,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":792,"exit":"go","move":"go soulstone archway"}]},
  {"id":792,"x":327,"y":-536,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway walls are lined with portraits of the Guild leaders and tapestries depicting beautiful scenes and ancient heroes hang from the ceiling.  A set of brass-bound ironwood doors stands at the end of the hall.  Flanking the doors are two Gor'Tog-sized suits of gleaming silver ceremonial plate armor, complete with gigantic pole-axes sporting nasty serrated blades."],"exits":[{"to":791,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":794,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"},{"to":795,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":796,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doors"}]},
  {"id":793,"x":297,"y":-546,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Guild Leader's Office","descriptions":["Despite the dark, foreboding atmosphere in this office, it is strangely comforting.  A large cave bear hide lies on the floor in front of a small fireplace.  Off to the side, a comfortable looking chair is placed adjacent to a bookcase and a small table.  A large desk sits directly opposite the fireplace and fills out the room's meager, but functional, furnishings."],"exits":[{"to":789,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Paladin","Verika","RS Paladin"]},
  {"id":794,"x":327,"y":-516,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Training Room","descriptions":["The training room smells of sweat and the air is hot.  Large posters are tacked to the walls amidst racks for weapons and hooks for shields.  The floor is heavily scarred and notched and, although it looks as though it's been swept clean, the deeper gouges are still caked with blood-soaked sawdust."],"exits":[{"to":792,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":797,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}],"aliases":["Training Room"]},
  {"id":795,"x":327,"y":-556,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Portico","descriptions":["A covered breezeway, this portico connects the main guildhall with the courtyard and outer buildings of the compound.  The tiled roof covering the long corridor is draped with softly twisting vines and offers shade from the sun in summer and shelter from the elements the rest of the year.  Weary combatants in training are often seen resting here among the greenery."],"exits":[{"to":799,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":792,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"aliases":["Portico"]},
  {"id":796,"x":347,"y":-536,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, The Great Chamber","descriptions":["Tapestries and flickering torches line the walls of the circular meeting room.  Eight sets of silverwood benches, arranged in ascending rows, face a central speaker's podium.  The topmost row, a full three Tog-lengths above the main floor, sits at eye level with a large chandelier that hangs from the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":792,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doors"},{"to":798,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ironwood staircase"}],"aliases":["Great Chamber"]},
  {"id":797,"x":337,"y":-516,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Basement","descriptions":["The short stairwell opens up to a shadowy room barely lit by a steel candleholder.  The smell of must indicates a lack of ventilation however, there is a sense of simple tidiness.  A large rug in the center of the room partially covers a dark stone floor that is kept swept and clean."],"exits":[{"to":794,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}],"aliases":["Basement"]},
  {"id":798,"x":347,"y":-546,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Balcony","descriptions":["A well-polished ironwood banister guards the narrow walkway that overlooks the Grand Hallway.  Spanning the length of the wooden floor is a tightly woven rug of forest green that slips beneath a pair of massive wooden double doors, each set with a bronze knocker fashioned into a roaring lion's head."],"exits":[{"to":796,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ironwood staircase"},{"to":787,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden doors"}],"aliases":["Balcony"]},
  {"id":799,"x":327,"y":-566,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Courtyard","descriptions":["Supported by iron lattices, wild rose bushes cling together forming a dense wall of brilliant scarlet against a backdrop of lush evergreens.  Veins of ebony streak through the grey marble flagstones, their pattern spiraling in towards a bronzed statue.  Beyond it, a stone bench with ornate armrests stands watch over an open, iron gate."],"exits":[{"to":795,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":800,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":800,"x":327,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Training Grounds","descriptions":["A simple, marbled pathway winds its way around the spacious grassy yard, breaking off in many directions.  Casting a canopy of shade over those engaging in contests of skill is a massive flamethorne tree with a leather-wrapped target dummy swaying from a low, sturdy limb.  To the east, a series of wooden rails peek above the horizon, tracing a distant line of fencing.","A simple, marbled pathway winds its way around the spacious grassy yard, breaking off in many directions.  Veiling the stars from those engaging in contests of skill is a massive flamethorne tree with a leather-wrapped target dummy swaying from a low, sturdy limb.  To the east, a series of wooden rails peek above the horizon, tracing a distant line of fencing."],"exits":[{"to":801,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":802,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":803,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":799,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"},{"to":866,"exit":"go","move":"go pebbled path"}]},
  {"id":801,"x":327,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Northern Courtyard","descriptions":["A large vine-covered edifice, this building looms over the courtyard and is matched in height only by the guild proper.  Ivy, speckled with tiny violet flowers, twines around the flagstones as they broaden into half-moon shaped steps before a polished ebonwood door.  Hanging from the entryway is an inlaid wooden sign, its darkened lettering set upon a lighter field.  A cobbled drive winds behind the building where artisans are often seen unloading new wares and custom crafted armor and weaponry."],"exits":[{"to":800,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":811,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}]},
  {"id":802,"x":337,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Northeast Courtyard","descriptions":["Smooth, multicolored river pebbles line the ground before a large wooden barn.  Tufts of grass peek between the gravel at the stone foundation, the tips of their blades just grazing the redwood slats.  An overhanging chute juts out from above and bits of straw and hay cling tenaciously to the metallic mouth as if afraid to let loose and tumble to the stony floor below."],"exits":[{"to":800,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":819,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden barn"}]},
  {"id":803,"x":317,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Western Courtyard","descriptions":["The path ends abruptly before an elongated, neatly trimmed building, its tiled roof overhanging rows of double windows that gaze over the courtyard like pairs of unblinking eyes.  Long benches placed on the porch offer a place to sit while removing muddy boots, and young squires are often seen sweeping the long porch under the careful watch of an armored guard.  Standing near the oaken doors, a silent protector and observer, he casts a dark shadow over a nearby bronze spittoon."],"exits":[{"to":800,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":832,"exit":"go","move":"go porch"}]},
  {"id":804,"x":347,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Sentinel's Way","descriptions":["The pebbled path widens into an elongated patio, shaded by a lush copse of evergreen trees.  Their darkened branches provide a canopy of shade and the scent of pine lingers heavily in the air.  A gentle trickling echoes with the passing breeze, indicating a nearby presence of water while the melodic voices of songbirds add to the rustic setting."],"exits":[{"to":800,"exit":"go","move":"go path"},{"to":805,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered trellis"}]},
  {"id":805,"x":367,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Sentinel's Rest","descriptions":["Surrounded by lush greenery, the crystal clear waters of a small, limpid pool reflect the sun's light and sparkle brilliantly.  Lily pads speckle the surface, clustering together near the middle and bouncing gently with the ripples from a nearby waterfall.  Several well-kept pebbled paths branch off in opposite directions, each trimmed with small purplish flowers."],"exits":[{"to":806,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":809,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":808,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":810,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":807,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":804,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered trellis"}]},
  {"id":806,"x":367,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Holy Warrior's Promenade","descriptions":["Several young saplings are interspersed within the older, taller growths.  Though shielded from the life-giving sun, they are strong and sturdy and thrive heartily.  The meticulously painted fence tapers to an end with one long beam extending diagonally towards the ground."],"exits":[{"to":809,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":805,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":146,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Holy Warrior's Promenade"]},
  {"id":807,"x":367,"y":-576,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Holy Warrior's Promenade","descriptions":["A neat row of trimmed hedges borders a quaint whitewashed fence, their branches carefully clipped to form a perfect rectangular shape.  Growing in lush clumps, small pale purple flowers edge the colorful pebbled path and fill the air with the sweet scent of lavender.","A neat row of hedges borders a fence, their branches clipped to form a perfect rectangular shape.  Growing in lush clumps, small flowers edge the path and fill the air with the sweet scent of lavender.","A neat row of trimmed hedges borders a quaint whitewashed fence, their branches carefully clipped to form a perfect rectangular shape.  Growing in lush clumps, small flowers edge the colorful pebbled path and fill the air with the sweet scent of lavender.","A neat row of hedges borders a fence, their branches clipped to form a perfect rectangular shape.  Growing in lush clumps, small flowers edge the path and fill the air with the sweet scent of lavender."],"exits":[{"to":805,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":810,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":808,"x":377,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Holy Warrior's Promenade","descriptions":["Twined between the fence's whitewashed slats, wild raspberries cling tenaciously, their branches a thorny tangle.  Nestled among the briars, several clumps of berries dangle heavily -- dark and purple and ready for the picking.  A lush sweet fragrance drifts from their tiny white flowers."],"exits":[{"to":809,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":810,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":805,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":809,"x":377,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Holy Warrior's Promenade","descriptions":["A small birdhouse perches atop an iron pole at the intersection of two paths.  A simple thing, capable of holding only one resident, the construct is painted a deep brick red with a white roof.  Several daffodils are planted around its base, their bright yellow color mimicking the sun."],"exits":[{"to":808,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":805,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":806,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":810,"x":377,"y":-576,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Holy Warrior's Promenade","descriptions":["The thick, sturdy boughs of a towering oak tree reach skyward as if seeking to touch the heavens above.  One lone limb sweeps outward over the path, and beneath it the grass has been worn away, leaving nothing but packed, bare dirt behind.  A plank of wood has been fashioned into a swing and tethered to the massive branch, left to dangle loosely from a securely knotted rope.","The thick, sturdy boughs of a towering oak tree reach skyward as if seeking to touch the very planets above.  One lone limb sweeps outward over the path, and beneath it the grass has been worn away, leaving nothing but packed, bare dirt behind.  A plank of wood has been fashioned into a swing and tethered to the massive branch, left to dangle loosely from a securely knotted rope."],"exits":[{"to":808,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":807,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":805,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":811,"x":327,"y":-624,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Front Room","descriptions":["Embellished with golden accents, the marble walls glitter to life, highlighted by an overhanging chandelier.  An elaborately woven dark blue rug lies before the polished ebonwood door and stretches towards a simple wooden counter that displays a golden plaque.  A nearby set of winding stairs curves its way to the second floor, its gilded gold banister polished to a soft sheen."],"exits":[{"to":813,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":812,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":801,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":814,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"aliases":["Iprilu's Emporium"]},
  {"id":812,"x":317,"y":-624,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Garments for the Lord","descriptions":["A large mahogany counter dominates the back half of the room, bearing a finely tooled wooden display case.  Just within the entrance is a hat stand, its elegantly carved wooden arms heavily laden with goods.  Nearby, a three-tiered shelf has been stocked full with folded items, their colors bright against the darkened wood grain, and at its base rests an oversized chest with silver trimmings."],"exits":[{"to":811,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":813,"x":337,"y":-624,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Garments for the Lady","descriptions":["Several hanging tapestries decorate the walls, their bright colors portraying vivid scenes of battle.  An overstuffed velvet chair rests near the alcove entrance, with woven shawls carefully draped over the back and a matching footrest at the base.  A walnut wardrobe towers in a nearby corner, its doors propped open on both sides by two well-dressed wicker mannequins."],"exits":[{"to":811,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":814,"x":327,"y":-634,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Landing","descriptions":["The staircase gives way to a circular landing, halved by two soulstone arches that shimmer softly, their radiance glimmering off the smooth, polished, marble flooring.  High above glitters a stained-glass skylight portraying a noble Paladin brandishing a silvery sword in combat against a menacing stone gargoyle."],"exits":[{"to":811,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":815,"exit":"go","move":"go east archway"},{"to":817,"exit":"go","move":"go west archway"}]},
  {"id":815,"x":337,"y":-634,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Nook of Shields","descriptions":["Hanging from the wall are many heavy shields, each with a differing design and some symbolic emblem of the Paladin guild.  The light shimmers over them brightly, accenting their unique craftsmanship and flawless design.  A plush wolf-skin rug covers the floor, muffling heavy footsteps from boot-clad customers."],"exits":[{"to":816,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":814,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":816,"x":347,"y":-634,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Armor Delights","descriptions":["A crystal chandelier dangles from the ceiling, its brilliant light bouncing over the highly polished armor positioned over two mannequins lined against the far wall.  An entry table is draped with a lace doily to protect its surface from the heavy items it bears.  Nearby, a hanging rack has been suspended from a long beam, allowing it to spin freely and display a variety of headpieces."],"exits":[{"to":815,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":817,"x":317,"y":-634,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Holy Relics","descriptions":["The lighting in this room burns softly from hanging oil lanterns, and casts a warm glow over a crystal case along the far wall.  Strangely, the items hanging on the wall are illuminated with more brilliance than the three lanterns can provide and the illusion is given that the light comes from within the objects themselves.  A lone table sits opposite the case, embedded within the shadows and shrouded with a heavy black cloth."],"exits":[{"to":818,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":814,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":818,"x":307,"y":-634,"z":0,"title":"Iprilu's Emporium, Weapons of Fancy","descriptions":["Mounted over the door is a massive broadsword, its blade serrated and set into a golden hilt.  So enormous is its size, it is obvious it is a piece meant for show and not for battle, for clearly no warrior could lift it alone.  An elongated weapons rack covers the far end of the room, displaying an assortment of swords, while a nearby hanging case holds a variety of smaller weapons over a linen-covered counter."],"exits":[{"to":817,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":819,"x":367,"y":-616,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Stable","descriptions":["The scent of horse sweat and well-oiled leather lingers in the air, carried on a gentle cross breeze.  Sunlight filters through the redwood slats, dancing over a thick layer of straw strewn on the aisle floor.  Lined on both sides of the aisle by a series of wooden stalls, shadows emitted from their hulking height fall more heavily on the far end, nearly concealing a stone-encased corner.  A pair of heavy wooden doors leads to the stable's side yard."],"exits":[{"to":820,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden staircase"},{"to":802,"exit":"go","move":"go redwood door"},{"to":821,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden doors"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":820,"x":367,"y":-626,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Hayloft","descriptions":["Bale upon bale of yellowed hay is stacked eight-high against the roughened walls, each one bound by heavy twine.  Scattered bits litter the floor to mix with a fine layer of dust.  An opening in one wall reveals a metal chute overlooking the gravel entryway, its wide mouth large enough to fit two simultaneous bales."],"exits":[{"to":819,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden staircase"},{"to":802,"exit":"go","move":"go metal chute"}],"aliases":["Hayloft"]},
  {"id":821,"x":225,"y":-616,"z":0,"title":"Paladin's Guild, Stable Yard","descriptions":["Marred by heavy hoofprints, the dirt is uneven and clumpy.  A three-rail wooden fence surrounds three quarters of the perimeter, its slating painted a bright white.  Various equipment is neatly stacked against the back side of the barn just beside a pair of heavy doors that lead inside."],"exits":[{"to":822,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":819,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden doors"}]},
  {"id":822,"x":255,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Side Lawn","descriptions":["Velvety grass surrounds the back exposure of the two-story edifice.  From this perspective the pristine marble building looms imposingly against the horizon, the acute angle of the barracks roof lending an illusion of extended height.  Ivy clings to the side of the building, slowly meandering towards the sky and a tall iron staircase, bolted securely into the moldings, runs diagonally from the ground to a tiled archway on the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":821,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":823,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel pathway"},{"to":137,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"},{"to":825,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron staircase"}]},
  {"id":823,"x":255,"y":-556,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Jousting Arena","descriptions":["Dozens of footprints score the ground from heavy use and continual traffic.  On one side, tall stands provide spectator seating, crowned with brightly burning torches that illuminate the arena with an orange and yellow glow.  A heavy gate leads into the arena proper, guarded by a burly S'kra Mur in full plate mail.","Dozens of footprints score the ground from heavy use and continual traffic.  On one side, tall stands provide spectator seating, crowned with brightly hued pennants that splash the sky with color.  A heavy gate leads into the arena proper, guarded by a burly S'kra Mur in full plate mail."],"exits":[{"to":822,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel pathway"},{"to":824,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy gate"}]},
  {"id":824,"x":255,"y":-546,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Jousting Arena","descriptions":["Surrounded by a split-rail fence, the arena floor is a mixture of sand and dirt.  Marred with deep hoof-prints and churned completely in areas, the ground bears the telltale signs of frequent use.  Rows of wooden stands line the far end of the rail for spectator seating, and a wooden observation box towers above them, providing safety for the officiator."],"exits":[{"to":823,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Jousting Arena"]},
  {"id":825,"x":255,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Back Landing","descriptions":["Despite the height, the view is blocked by the barracks and all that can be seen is the yard below and the bustling street beyond the gate.  The landing is narrow, but what lacks in width is made up for in length and can easily hold a large group of people.  A solitary guard stands at the door, carefully eyeing all that pass."],"exits":[{"to":822,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron staircase"},{"to":826,"exit":"go","move":"go tiled archway"}]},
  {"id":826,"x":275,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks","descriptions":["A colorful archway stands at the end of the hall, providing a view of the balcony beyond.  The murmurs of city life drift through, a constant hubub of activity at all hours."],"exits":[{"to":827,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":825,"exit":"go","move":"go tiled archway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":827,"x":275,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks","descriptions":["The wooden floors remain unmarred despite the heavily armored feet that often traipse across it.  A green glass vase sits atop a small three-legged table, displaying a preserved bouquet of jonquils, their vibrant yellow color as bright now as when they were freshly cut."],"exits":[{"to":826,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":828,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":828,"x":275,"y":-576,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks","descriptions":["An emblazoned shield hangs upon the wall, framed by two small brass oil lanterns, their flames enclosed in glass flumes.  Their dim lighting casts a warm yellow glow over the doorframes throughout the hallway.  A deep scar mars the surface of the oaken floor, remnants of a careless footstep long ago."],"exits":[{"to":827,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":829,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":829,"x":285,"y":-576,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks","descriptions":["Young squires bustle up and down a secluded stairwell, their arms heavily laden with pieces of their master's armor.  From behind a nearby door, the lingering scent of cabbage wafts through the air, tell-tale signs of a home cooked meal.  At the end of the hallway hangs a painting of a golden lion, its head thrown back in a deep roar, mane flowing wildly around its massive head."],"exits":[{"to":830,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":828,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":830,"x":285,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks","descriptions":["The soft beige walls are embellished with a golden filigree pattern and contrast tastefully with the deep green rug laid over the wooden flooring.  Interwoven with silvery threads, the plush woolen floor covering bears the Zoluren provincial crest."],"exits":[{"to":831,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":829,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":832,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":831,"x":285,"y":-596,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks","descriptions":["An armored figure stands at attention in the corner, its heavy sword raised to its metal-clad brow in a respectful salute.  Hanging lanterns cast a soft sheen over the highly polished wooden flooring and illuminate the dark mahogany walls, highlighting their intricately grained pattern."],"exits":[{"to":830,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":832,"x":305,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Barracks Front Porch","descriptions":["Long wooden flats have been sanded to a smooth finish and comprise the flooring and handrails of this enclosed porch.  Covered by a tiled roof, the enclosure provides a sheltered place to rest and relax after a long and tiring day.  A long bench rests against one rail, directly opposite a hanging porch-swing, both upholstered with soft cushions."],"exits":[{"to":803,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steps"},{"to":830,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":833,"x":320,"y":7,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Main Lobby","descriptions":["In stark contrast to the bustling streets outside, the quiet of this office is broken only by the muffled rustlings of a clerk behind a corner desk.  An open door floods the area with light that sparkles off several dozen ivory candles supported on tall golden stands.  Servants and other staff filter up and down the winding staircase and through the arch.  A chaise, its watered-silk cushions a deep shade of blue, provides patrons with a place to enjoy the surrounds.","Echoing the quiet night streets outside, the tranquil nature of this office offers shelter from the night air.  Mounted in tall, golden stands, ivory candles cast flickering shadows over the wooden floor, their sweet wax scenting the air.  Muffled rustlings of paper can be heard from the room's corner as night clerks shuffle through documents filed on a large desk next to an ornate arch.  Servants and other staff filter up and down the winding staircase."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":988,"exit":"go","move":"go arched entrance"},{"to":987,"exit":"go","move":"go administrator's office"},{"to":834,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate arch"},{"to":835,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding staircase"}],"aliases":["Order Headquarters","Order HQ"]},
  {"id":834,"x":330,"y":7,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, The Crossings Room","descriptions":["A sea of lit candles, held high on a multitude of turned candle stands, casts a pale gold glow over the spacious dance floor that almost tangibly beckons to be used.  The rich color of the oak buffet picks up the candle glow tint, and the windows reflect and multiply the slender flames.  Sets of round tables and red velvet chairs cluster in the southern corners of the room, giving respite to the patrons.","Glossy tiled floors and long oak buffets flank the spacious dance floor.  Sash windows, the panes spotlessly clean and almost invisible, are festooned with brocade draperies.  Small clusters of polished round tables attended by red velvet chairs on turned legs fill the corners, giving tired patrons a spot to rest."],"exits":[{"to":833,"exit":"go","move":"go ornate arch"}],"aliases":["Crossings Room"]},
  {"id":835,"x":320,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Second Floor Landing","descriptions":["Sunlight drifts in through a bronze-framed oval window and dances over the polished surface of an octagonal parquet table.  Atop it, a crystalline vase holds a tasteful bouquet of brightly colored lilies, suffusing the area with a faint, sweet aroma.  Next to the vase rests a thin, leather-bound journal with an embossed gold title.","A bronze-framed oval window provides a view of the night sky.  Atop an octagonal parquet table, a bouquet of colorful lilies in a crystalline vase gives off a faint, sweet aroma.  A thin, leather-bound journal with an embossed gold title rests next to the vase."],"exits":[{"to":838,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":837,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":836,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":839,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":833,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding staircase"},{"to":951,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble steps"}]},
  {"id":836,"x":300,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, West Wing","descriptions":["Lit by several mounted silver lanterns, the long hallway is interrupted by a series of curtain-draped archways.  The elaborate frames of the entryways are crafted out of ornate woods and enhanced with carved leaf patterns that mimic the trees from which they were cut.  A woven lambswool carpet spans from end to end, its soft nap providing a muffled cushion against even the heaviest footfalls."],"exits":[{"to":835,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":843,"exit":"go","move":"go satinwood archway"},{"to":842,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood archway"},{"to":841,"exit":"go","move":"go acanth archway"}]},
  {"id":837,"x":340,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, East Wing","descriptions":["Supported by heavily oiled, dark wooden beams, the whitewashed plaster walls add a sense of tidiness to the long hall.  The finish on the wood-framed archways shines warmly, basking in the softened glow of several silver lanterns.  A variegated pattern of leaves twines gently over the curtain-draped supports, each arch bearing a symbolic mark of the tree it once was."],"exits":[{"to":835,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":846,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood archway"},{"to":845,"exit":"go","move":"go flamewood archway"},{"to":844,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood archway"}]},
  {"id":838,"x":320,"y":-31,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, The Library","descriptions":["Long heavy curtains drop from ceiling to floor and are flung wide to allow an abundance of light through the long-paned windows in the northern wall.  Tall shelves of cedar and oak line the east and west walls.  At each small reading desk sits a lantern ready to provide ample light for patrons who choose to read at night.  The hushed stillness is broken only by the soft murmur of conversation between librarians, who return the books left on the small mahogany returns desk.","Heavy curtains that drop from ceiling to floor cover the windows in the northern wall.  At each small reading desk, a lit lantern provides ample light for patrons who may choose to avail themselves of the plump armchairs.  The hushed stillness is broken only by the soft murmur of conversation between the librarians who quietly go about their business.  As books are returned to the mahogany desk, they put them in their rightful places on the cedar and oak shelves on the east and west walls."],"exits":[{"to":835,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Order library"]},
  {"id":839,"x":300,"y":-31,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Second Floor Landing","descriptions":["Supported by heavily oiled, dark wooden beams, the whitewashed plaster walls add a sense of tidiness to the hall.  The finish on many wood-framed archways shines warmly, basking in the softened glow of several silver lanterns.  A variegated pattern of leaves twines gently over the curtain-draped supports, each arch bearing a symbolic mark of the tree it once was."],"exits":[{"to":835,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":840,"exit":"go","move":"go golden archway"}]},
  {"id":840,"x":300,"y":-41,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, The White Rose Recruitment Office","descriptions":["Draped over the archway is a sweeping black silk banner that winds lazily around the bottom edge of a heavy silver-trimmed coat of arms.  Standing sentry at the side is a small three-legged table.  On the far side of the room, an inlaid stand supports a deposit box fastened with a heavy iron lock.  Mounted on the wall behind the stand hangs a shining bronze plaque detailing the Order's governing body."],"exits":[{"to":839,"exit":"go","move":"go golden archway"}],"aliases":["White Rose Recruitment Office","OWR"]},
  {"id":841,"x":290,"y":-21,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, The Apostles Recruitment Office","descriptions":["An embroidered scarlet banner is draped above the archway, enveloping the lower portion of a pristine white coat of arms.  Tucked neatly into a nearby corner is a small three-legged table.  On the far side of the room an oak stand supports a deposit box fastened with a heavy iron lock.  Mounted on the wall behind the stand hangs a bronze plaque detailing the Order's governing body."],"exits":[{"to":836,"exit":"go","move":"go acanth archway"}],"aliases":["Apostles Recruitment Office"]},
  {"id":842,"x":290,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, The Black Fox Recruitment Office","descriptions":["Tucked against the frame of the ironwood arch stands a small three-legged table.  Hung above it, a crescent-shaped silk banner twines loosely over a white tower shield with a bold red chevron that bears an emblazoned image of a small black fox.  On the far side of the room, an inlaid stand supports a deposit box fastened with an iron lock.  Mounted on the wall behind the stand hangs a bronze plaque detailing the ruling body of the Order."],"exits":[{"to":836,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood arch"}],"aliases":["Black Fox Recruitment Office","OBF"]},
  {"id":843,"x":290,"y":-1,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, The Tavern Troupe Recruitment Office","descriptions":["Poised above the satinwood archway is a sweeping bard-blue banner with golden tassels that fringe the top portion of an elaborate ivory emblem.  Sitting to the side of the entryway is a small three-legged table.  On the far side of the room, a pine stand supports a deposit box fastened with a heavy iron lock.  Mounted on the wall behind the stand hangs a gleaming bronze plaque outlining the Order's governing body."],"exits":[{"to":836,"exit":"go","move":"go satinwood archway"}],"aliases":["Tavern Troupe Recruitment Office"]},
  {"id":844,"x":350,"y":-21,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Iron Circle Recruitment Office","descriptions":["Placed above the archway is a massive gold and black shield etched with the vivid image of a mighty dragon and loosely draped with a banner of scarlet silk.  Atop a nearby table rests an elaborately feathered quill.  Against the far wall, a heavy wooden stand supports a wooden box, fastened with a polished silver lock.  Above it, a brass plaque hangs shimmering softly in the available light."],"exits":[{"to":837,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood archway"}],"aliases":["Iron Circle Recruitment Office"]},
  {"id":845,"x":350,"y":-11,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Theren Guard Recruitment Office","descriptions":["A bold silver crest hangs proudly above the archway, which is draped with a sweeping crimson and gold silk banner.  Tucked near the entryway is a small, three-legged table displaying a goose-feather quill.  On the far side of the room, an inlaid stand supports a deposit box fastened with a heavy iron lock.  A shimmering bronze plaque that hangs on the wall by a black chain displays the governing body of the Order."],"exits":[{"to":837,"exit":"go","move":"go flamewood archway"}],"aliases":["Theren Guard Recruitment Office","OTG"]},
  {"id":846,"x":350,"y":-1,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Dragon Shield Recruitment Office","descriptions":["Placed above the archway is a massive gold and black shield etched with the vivid image of a mighty dragon and loosely draped with a banner of scarlet silk.  Atop a nearby table rests an elaborately feathered quill and against the far wall, a heavy wooden stand supports a box fastened with a polished lock.  Above the table hangs a brass plaque shimmering softly in the available light."],"exits":[{"to":837,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood archway"}],"aliases":["Dragon Shield Recruitment Office","ODS"]},
  {"id":847,"x":310,"y":-458,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, Lecture Hall","descriptions":["Large crystals in the upper corners of this room shed a soft glow on the tiers of comfortable seats that look down on the ebony lectern below.  A velvet curtain covers the wall behind the lectern.","Large crystals in the upper corners of this room shed a soft glow on the tiers of comfortable seats that look down on the ebony lectern below.  Behind the lectern, inset into the wall, the brightly lit viewing area of The Healerie is clearly visible through the thick crystal."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"go","move":"go stone door"}],"aliases":["Lecture Hall"]},
  {"id":848,"x":190,"y":-66,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall, Records Storage","descriptions":["This cramped, dusty office displays all the standard appointments that mark it as serving an extremely important role in the bureaucracy of the town government.  Dilapidated, make-shift shelves are crammed full of books and papers that bear no evidence of being organized in any useful manner.  Everything is covered with a thick layer of dust, and the walls and ceiling are stained with black from the smoke that rises from the single, small lamp that rests on a high desk in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":849,"exit":"go","move":"go simple curtain"},{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}]},
  {"id":849,"x":180,"y":-66,"z":0,"title":"Town Hall Records Office, Booth","descriptions":["You've entered a space which is wedged between two rows of filing cabinets and sectioned off by a heavy brocade curtain.  In it is a simple modwir desk with an elderly clerk sitting behind it, peering over the mounds of paper which surround him.  He snorts to himself once, mutters something under his breath, then returns to work."],"exits":[{"to":848,"exit":"go","move":"go simple curtain"}],"aliases":["Item Registration"]},
  {"id":851,"x":-51,"y":26,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Crafting Supplies","descriptions":["Expertly fitted grey marble slabs frame the lower half of the shop's alabaster walls.  Shadows dance at the light produced by carefully arranged copper torch holders about the room.  This area sells a variety of supplies to eager crafters and offers some shelter from the loud noises of productivity emanating from the east.","Expertly fitted grey marble slabs frame the lower half of the shop's alabaster walls.  A sliver of light shines through a pair of squat windows bordered by well-polished oak molding and fitted with iron bars styled to resemble vines of ivy.  This area sells a variety of supplies to eager crafters and offers some shelter from the loud noises of productivity emanating from the east."],"exits":[{"to":927,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":874,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":925,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":83,"exit":"go","move":"go mistwood door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering tools"]},
  {"id":852,"x":320,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Mongers' Square","descriptions":["Shreds of cloth are strewn about the area, intermingled with shattered bones and bodies.  The only remaining indication of the market's former glory is the statue of Divyaush, its bronze smile tinged with sadness in wake of the destruction.  The wrecked husk of the market tent looms silently to the southwest."],"exits":[{"to":384,"exit":"go","move":"go walkway ramp"}]},
  {"id":853,"x":230,"y":-200,"z":1,"title":"Underground Passageway","descriptions":["This lengthy passageway is clogged with knife-sized bits of sharp debris.  Overhead several massive boulders block out most of the light, and the din of town traffic is reduced to a surflike roar.  No one stops to glance down between the chinks of rubble, leaving your travels unnoticed and undisturbed."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":854,"x":419,"y":-334,"z":1,"title":"Underground Passageway","descriptions":["Jagged piles of debris line the center of this passageway, chips and shards of large rocks lodged deep in the low ceiling above.  A fine grey dust blankets everything else, sifting into clouds at knee-level from the passage of thieves."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":855,"x":-80,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"A Dank Dark Passage","descriptions":["An obstacle course formed of pillaged packing crates in all sizes, shapes and states of decomposition hinders your movement through the passage.  Straw filling, moldy and brown, lies scattered about, jagged edges of rusty metal implements occasionally jutting above the mess.  This is a good place to walk softly."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow footholds"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":856,"x":215,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"A Dank, Cluttered Passage","descriptions":["An obstacle course formed of pillaged packing crates in all sizes, shapes and states of decomposition hinders your movement through the passage.  Straw filling, moldy and brown, lies scattered about, jagged edges of rusty metal implements occasionally jutting above the mess.  This is a good place to walk softly."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":54,"exit":"go","move":"go loose grill"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":857,"x":-290,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Sand Spit Tavern, Cellar Room","descriptions":["This dank and cheerless place is the tavern's cellar.  Once a wine vault, the moisture and brackish water seeping in from the estuary ruined the wine.  Old barrels, mostly rotted and splintered still stand in a row.  Now largely unused, you have heard lurid tales of smugglers hiding down here to buy and sell and conduct other, less savoury dealings."],"exits":[{"to":858,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rickety ladder"},{"to":1020,"exit":"go","move":"go boards"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":858,"x":-290,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Sand Spit Tavern, Backroom","descriptions":["Behind the bar you find the storage area with barrels and casks of assorted brew.  A pot boy washing up some glasses in a pail of indifferently clean water looks up at you with dull surprise and continues his work.  There is a litter of broken glass here and you wonder if and when the place was last swept out."],"exits":[{"to":857,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rickety ladder"},{"to":699,"exit":"go","move":"go main bar"},{"to":857,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":859,"x":-241,"y":6,"z":1,"title":"The Raven's Court, Secret Passage","descriptions":["Though the cool stone walls are bare, a long maroon runner with pale golden fringe spreads across the length of the floor.  The tunnel's interior is visible only by the overflow of light from the basement beyond.  Despite being underground, a fresh breeze fills the space from an opening overhead cleverly concealed with leafy hedges above."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":550,"exit":"go","move":"go hole"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":860,"x":79,"y":26,"z":1,"title":"Behind the Half Pint Inn","descriptions":["Heavy wooden ale kegs line the small back alley on all sides to form high barriers, save for the area to the southwest that slopes into a dark underground tunnel.  Dimpled glass windows along the building wall prevent the tavern's patrons from noticing any suspicious activity in the cramped lot.  A tangle of blue violet wolfsbane spills over the edges of a faded red flower box toward the cobble below as if attempting a daring escape from its wooden prison."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":861,"x":-280,"y":50,"z":1,"title":"The Raven's Court, Basement","descriptions":["Crowding every inch of wall space, several shelves store everything from empty wine barrels to shiny gardening tools.  Piled into one corner, a collection of overturned boxes are arranged into layered seating like rows in an amphitheatre.  A long vegetable crate has been propped on its side for use as a podium in this makeshift meeting room."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":545,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"}],"linksTo":"Map1a_Crossing_Thief.xml"},
  {"id":862,"x":450,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Outside East Wall, Footpath","descriptions":["Crumbling mud bricks and loose rock lay in a pile near the sturdy stone town wall.  Sounds of night-hidden creatures rustle in the weeds and nearby brush as they search for prey or leftover scraps.","Crumbling mud bricks and loose rock lay in a pile near the sturdy stone town wall.  A small field mouse nibbles at a crust of bread, perhaps discarded from the wall workers' lunch portion."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":396,"exit":"climb","move":"climb town wall"}],"linksTo":"Map8_Crossing_East_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":863,"x":100,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Brother Durantine's, Storeroom","descriptions":["Behind the counter, a tiny storeroom lined with shelves holds a selection of seasonal supplies for clerics.  White-robed novices work to stock the shelves, silently brushing past as they lay out items for the perusal of Brother Durantine's favored customers."],"exits":[{"to":407,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":864,"x":-321,"y":-408,"z":0,"title":"Northwall Trail, Wooded Grove","descriptions":["The sweet smell of wildflowers carried on the breeze mingles with the spicy smell of cedar and juniper.  Sunlight dapples the mossy ground in golden hues and glistens on the dew-laden petals of tiny snowflowers.  A gnarled oak tree, cracked in two by a great tempest's fury, lays beside the trail.","The sweet smell of wildflowers carried on the breeze mingles with the spicy scent of cedar and juniper.  At the sound of an owl, a startled woodmouse scurries across the trail toward a gnarled and broken oak tree."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":400,"exit":"climb","move":"climb town wall"}],"linksTo":"Map4_Crossing_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":865,"x":332,"y":-301,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Book Store","descriptions":["Freshly chiseled granite walls surround an area where forgers can quickly resupply.  A passageway covered by a leather flap pierces the wall to the south, and from the passage resound the clangs of an anvil chorus.  A simple wooden door leads back outside."],"exits":[{"to":902,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging Society","Forging books","Forging prestige"]},
  {"id":866,"x":347,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Sentinel's Way","descriptions":["The pebbled path widens into an elongated patio, shaded by a lush copse of evergreen trees.  Their darkened branches provide a canopy of shadows and the scent of pine lingers heavily in the air.  A gentle trickling echoes with the passing breeze, indicating a nearby presence of water while the quiet chirping of crickets adds to the rustic setting."],"exits":[{"to":800,"exit":"go","move":"go pebbled path"},{"to":867,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered trellis"}]},
  {"id":867,"x":367,"y":-586,"z":0,"title":"Paladins' Guild, Sentinel's Rest","descriptions":["Surrounded by lush greenery, the crystal clear waters of a small, limpid pool reflect the nighttime sky and glimmer peacefully.  Lily pads speckle the surface, clustering together near the middle and bouncing gently with the ripples from a nearby waterfall.  Several well-kept pebbled paths branch off in opposite directions, each trimmed with small flowers.","Surrounded by greenery, the waters of a pool reflect the sun's light.  Lily pads speckle the surface, clustering together near the middle and bouncing gently with the ripples from a nearby waterfall.  Several paths branch off in opposite directions."],"exits":[{"to":806,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":809,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":808,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":810,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":866,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered trellis"}]},
  {"id":868,"x":-120,"y":142,"z":0,"title":"Wildulf Woods, Dense Forest","descriptions":["Towering trees grow close together here.  Their silvery-green leaves rustle in the breeze and whisper softly to each other, adding to the hushed expectancy of the forest.  A network of interwoven branches forms a canopy overhead with gaps of sky peeking through it.  You catch a glimpse of a dark bird circling high above."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":""},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":""},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":""}],"linksTo":"Map4_Crossing_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":869,"x":80,"y":-395,"z":0,"title":"Saranna's Sweet Tooth, Tea Room","descriptions":["White lace tablecloths ripple silently in the constant draft from a window left ajar, beckoning the weary (or hungry) adventurer to come and sit for awhile.  Centering each table, crystal bowls filled with crimson roses reflect stray beams of light trailing in from the narrow doorway to the southeast.","White lace tablecloths ripple silently in the constant draft from a window left ajar, beckoning the weary or hungry traveler to come and sit for awhile.  Centering each table, crystal bowls filled with crimson roses reflect stray beams of light trailing in from the narrow doorway to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":464,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow doorway"}]},
  {"id":870,"x":110,"y":-394,"z":0,"title":"Barsabe's Grocery, Salesroom","descriptions":["Every shelf, every counter, every table, every square inch of this spacious shop is crammed with visions and fragrances of culinary delight.  Long ropes of spicy-sweet sausages, huge wheels of aromatic cheeses, and loaves of fresh bread create a tantalizing focal point in the center of the room.  Amid the hustle and bustle of a steady flow of customers, the diminutive (if slightly rotund) proprietor himself takes a moment to smile at you as he puts the finishing touches on some new, delicious creation."],"exits":[{"to":872,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":871,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":129,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Barsabe's Grocery","Grocery"]},
  {"id":871,"x":100,"y":-394,"z":0,"title":"Barsabe's Grocery, Deliveries","descriptions":["Walls, apparently formed of an endless supply of oaken barrels, tower impressively over your head, testament to the popularity of the town's favorite grocer.  As youths from the kitchen race out to request more of one item or another, the burly workmen grumble somewhat, but nearly stumble over themselves to help the prettier maidens who work at the bakery next door."],"exits":[{"to":870,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":872,"x":110,"y":-384,"z":0,"title":"Barsabe's Grocery, Kitchen","descriptions":["The clatter of pots, punctuated by the delighted laughter of the kitchen help as they go about their business greets you here.  Drying meats of all shapes and sizes swing merrily from the low-beamed ceiling, as if dancing on the warm breezes created by the regiment of cast iron stoves that ring the room."],"exits":[{"to":870,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":873,"x":-15,"y":-184,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Entry Hall","descriptions":["Thick curtains upon a large, arching window are held open by ornate brass hooks placed on either side of the pane.  Pressed upon one wall are crushed flecks of seashells in varied hues of blues and greens beneath a painted orange sun which have been assembled to resemble a gentle ocean sunset.  Nestled into a corner is a padded chair next to a carved oak table."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":910,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":"go large door"}],"aliases":["Outfitting Society"]},
  {"id":874,"x":-41,"y":26,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Depot","descriptions":["Grey marble walls give way to alabaster columns framing an open supply depot.  The northern hallway bears a sign indicating it leads to workshops, and a well-used road meanders out to the east.  Crisscrossing wagon ruts in the dirt remain from trips to supply the guild with stone and wood supplies."],"exits":[{"to":926,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":851,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":82,"exit":"go","move":"go well-used road"},{"to":1028,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Engineering Society","Engineering supplies"]},
  {"id":875,"x":-222,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Corridor","descriptions":["Here you find a nearly intact raised mosaic floor.  Tiny tiles of many colors form patterns unlike any you've ever seen, its beauty still apparent despite the wreckage strewn about.  Touching one of the tiles, you are surprised to find it soft and pliable like cork, which might explain why this part of the corridor has endured the upheaval.  At the southern end, a great boulder has nearly blocked all passage in that direction."],"exits":[{"to":876,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":876,"x":-212,"y":122,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Cubiculum","descriptions":["Scant light filters in from a narrow section of grating in the ceiling far above.  Looking about, you find yourself hemmed in by walls on three sides.  On the floor, you see a series of battered and broken tiles, remnants of some ancient artisan's work.  After careful study, you believe they depict a wizened old mage holding forth a pulsating crystal."],"exits":[{"to":875,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":877,"exit":"go","move":"go dark opening"}]},
  {"id":877,"x":-222,"y":122,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Passageway","descriptions":["Cascading nitre hangs thick along the walls of this passageway, which wends into utter darkness.  The fetid remains of a dead rat invite a host of vermin to keep you sorry company."],"exits":[{"to":878,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow chasm"}]},
  {"id":878,"x":-232,"y":122,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, Passageway","descriptions":["A collapsed hallway twists and turns in the darkness, filled with great piles of stone and rotted timber. "],"exits":[{"to":877,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":879,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow opening"},{"to":676,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow tunnel"}]},
  {"id":879,"x":-232,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["Rotting deobar planks clotted with reeking sewage comprise the floor of this narrow corridor.  Thin streamers of decayed silk hang from rusting iron sconces, while soggy, mottled tapestries of indeterminate design lie clumped along the baseboards.  Nitre is thick and cloying, and a steamy heat envelopes you.  What is left of the floor slopes like a ramp, leading into darkness."],"exits":[{"to":878,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":880,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":880,"x":-242,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["Stone walls and floors echo each footstep as you cautiously make your way along the slippery incline.  A soft scuffling and distant chitter cut through the darkness, assaulting your imagination."],"exits":[{"to":879,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":881,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":881,"x":-252,"y":132,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["Cobblestone strewn with sludge and debris stretches out in this cavernous hold, set with a large iron gate at one end.  Rubble from the broken foundations of the Close lies in piles in each corner. "],"exits":[{"to":882,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":880,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":883,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":882,"x":-252,"y":142,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["Fetid puddles combined with the absence of fresh air give rise to a suffocating humidity.  Your mind's eye envisions all manner of vermin scaling the moist stone walls or crunching beneath your feet.  There is a scraping sound which echoes from either side of this corridor."],"exits":[{"to":881,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":884,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":883,"x":-252,"y":122,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["Putrid water filters through cracks in the stone walls and cuts moist paths through the clinging nitre.  A large desk lies on its side, swollen and rotting from the surrounding puddles of muck."],"exits":[{"to":881,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":884,"x":-252,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["The constant drip of water seeping through the walls becomes immediately irritating as you make your way through this large, dark room.  In some areas, the mire is ankle deep, threatening to slip you into its embrace.  A strong smell of decaying flesh permeates the dank air, but without adequate light, its source remains unknown."],"exits":[{"to":882,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":885,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":887,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":886,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":885,"x":-242,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["The walls of this corridor are agonizingly close.  Nitre and foul-smelling slime streak your clothing and skin as you move slowly on the pitted stone floor.  A massive pile of rubble at the southern end makes it impossible to continue in that direction."],"exits":[{"to":884,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":886,"x":-262,"y":152,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["The walls of this corridor are agonizingly close.  Nitre and foul-smelling slime streak your clothing and skin as you move slowly on the pitted stone floor.  A massive pile of rubble at the southern end makes it impossible to continue in that direction."],"exits":[{"to":884,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":887,"x":-252,"y":162,"z":0,"title":"Aesthene's Close, The Vaults","descriptions":["In odd contrast to the sparsity of its surrounding rooms, this chamber houses the rotting remnants of someone's sleeping quarters.  A soggy bed snuggles up against one wall, flanked by a broken chair and a sloping nightstand.  A reed torch lies in a puddle of sludge, and a cracked mirror hangs on a slimy wall.  Though its current state is less than inviting, it would appear it was never outfitted for comfort."],"exits":[{"to":884,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":888,"x":-230,"y":-190,"z":0,"title":"Cavity","descriptions":["Clean sand carpets the floor of a cavity burrowing deep into the rock of the cavern.  Worn tapestries of bright colors and simple patterns cover most of the wall space though an old desk sits patiently beneath one particularly fine specimen."],"exits":[{"to":889,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":417,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rubble mound"}]},
  {"id":889,"x":-230,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Tunnel","descriptions":["Narrowing dramatically, the cavity turns back into a tunnel with rough stone walls.  Leading deeper into the bedrock, jagged scrapes and unnatural shapes indicate that this area was man-made."],"exits":[{"to":890,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":888,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":890,"x":-220,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Tunnel","descriptions":["Cold and narrow, the tunnel makes an acute turn to the northwest, vanishing into deep shadow."],"exits":[{"to":889,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":891,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":891,"x":-230,"y":-210,"z":0,"title":"Tunnel","descriptions":["A heap of stone, remnant of a fairly recent cave-in, effectively ends the tunnel's sojourn.  Overhead the rock creaks and moans, protesting the burden of the city above, and an occasional trickle of dust filters down from the unstable ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":890,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":892,"x":-340,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, Second Floor","descriptions":["An arm has been sculpted out of one white, rugged corridor wall, from shoulder to outstretched palm.  Beneath it are several lines of poetry in S'Kra script.  A plain stairway leads down to the first floor."],"exits":[{"to":893,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":694,"exit":"climb","move":"climb plain stairway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":893,"x":-340,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, Second Floor","descriptions":["A circular brass plate as large as a tower shield is firmly mounted upon a wall of this hallway.  Several lines of poetry are carved upon the wall, encircling the plate and the image of an exotic city engraved upon its surface.  A plain stairway leads to the third floor."],"exits":[{"to":892,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":894,"exit":"climb","move":"climb plain stairway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":894,"x":-350,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, Third Floor","descriptions":["A ship's mast was affixed to the wall here sometime in the past, though its fabric has long since eroded away to leave a barren stump.  A few crudely-etched words are carved in the rock which serves as its base.  A plain stairway leads down to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":895,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":893,"exit":"climb","move":"climb plain stairway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":895,"x":-350,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Dintacui Apartments, Third Floor","descriptions":["A giant geometric rose has been sculpted out of the end of this corridor.  Underneath it run several lines of poetry, lit by glowstones emitting softly pearling light."],"exits":[{"to":894,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":896,"x":185,"y":290,"z":0,"title":"Tower South, Earth Floor","descriptions":["Bare, dark soil forms the floor underfoot.  The stony walls surrounding this circular room are similarly devoid of decoration, keeping instead the plain, natural look preferred by those mages who favor the element of Earth.  Doors leading to the initiates' private cells line the walls."],"exits":[{"to":602,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sandstone staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Earth Floor"]},
  {"id":897,"x":20,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Orem's Bathhouse, Women's Locker Room","descriptions":["The ladies locker room is sparkling clean.  Decorated in soft pastels, it has stone benches handy for changing.  A sharp-eyed female attendant maintains propriety, though a large sign warns that she is not responsible for items left behind."],"exits":[{"to":325,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":898,"x":-1,"y":86,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Alchemy Society, Entrance","descriptions":["Ill-fitted boulders jut at odd angles from the damp granite walls.  Even the ceiling looks a bit ramshackle here, as though the entry-way were built with speed more than safety in mind.  A slight draft blows from deep inside the building and carries a mixture of odd smells with it."],"exits":[{"to":931,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":1027,"exit":"go","move":"go obsidian entryway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy Society","Alchemy prestige"]},
  {"id":899,"x":170,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Grey Raven Commissary","descriptions":["A cedar counter spans the room from wall to wall, topped by a series of brass bars, preventing anyone from reaching the back of the shop where the various wares are displayed.  A wiry clerk stands behind a small opening in the bars, able to securely pass the items for sale out to buyers.  A red door leads back out to the street."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"},{"to":900,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained archway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Grey Raven Commissary"]},
  {"id":900,"x":160,"y":-378,"z":0,"title":"Grey Raven Commissary, Tattoo Parlor","descriptions":["Painted a plain ocean-grey, the walls do little to provide aesthetic in this cramped corner of the hut.  A low cedar table displays a variety of dark stains and contains materials for the artist to perform his skilled work.  Adjacent to the workstation, a reclined chair with scarred padding provides the space for clients to occupy during a session."],"exits":[{"to":899,"exit":"go","move":"go curtained archway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Tattoo Parlor"]},
  {"id":901,"x":-270,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Den","descriptions":["Plush velvet armchairs and pillow-laden sofas dot the meticulously appointed room.  A mahogany cart occupies a corner beneath a leaded glass window, its polished surface bearing refreshments.  Elaborately wrought sconces of hammered iron hold white beeswax candles that light the room with their glow.  Along the perimeter of the lush silk rug set in the center of the obsidian-tiled room are dark grey basalt pedestals bearing alabaster busts."],"exits":[{"to":575,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"},{"to":986,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}],"aliases":["Den"]},
  {"id":902,"x":332,"y":-291,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Lobby and Maker's Mark Ordering","descriptions":["A chamber with stone walls and a lofty, vaulted ceiling links the rooms of the forge.  Its high arches help to subdue the clangor, letting it rise and echo in the space overhead.  Waves of heat and flickering reddish light from the foundries to the west strive with the scream of the grindstones to the east and the pounding din of metal on metal from the smithies to the south."],"exits":[{"to":865,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":905,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":906,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":960,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Maker's Marks"]},
  {"id":903,"x":322,"y":-301,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["This area is the one most favored by the knowledgeable smiths in the guild.  Tall, narrow windows in the northern wall admit whatever breaths of air are stirring, occasionally fanning the flames beneath a granite crucible.  Like the two foundries to the south, this one has all needed implements close at hand."],"exits":[{"to":960,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Foundry1"]},
  {"id":904,"x":322,"y":-281,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["Windows high in the vaulted ceiling ventilate the south corner of the foundry, reducing its oven-like temperature to something endurable.  The forms of a granite crucible and a pile of fuel shimmer in the heat waves rising from the orange bricks of the firepits.  Two similar crucibles hang to the north."],"exits":[{"to":960,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Foundry2"]},
  {"id":905,"x":342,"y":-291,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Tool Store","descriptions":["Masters and journeyman of the forging craft find a home in this room purchasing tools and ingredients.  Loud thumps and groaning accompany the loading and unloading of goods from storage."],"exits":[{"to":962,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":963,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":902,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging tools","Forging clerk"]},
  {"id":906,"x":332,"y":-271,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Supplies","descriptions":["A chamber with stone walls and a lofty, vaulted ceiling links the rooms of the forge.  Its high arches help to subdue the clangor, letting it rise and echo in the space overhead.  Waves of heat and flickering reddish light from the foundries to the west strive with the scream of the grindstones to the east and the pounding din of metal on metal from the smithies to the south."],"exits":[{"to":902,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1021,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":907,"exit":"go","move":"go western arch"},{"to":908,"exit":"go","move":"go central arch"},{"to":909,"exit":"go","move":"go eastern arch"},{"to":1025,"exit":"go","move":"go stone doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Forging supplies","deeds","forging deeds"]},
  {"id":907,"x":312,"y":-261,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Smithy","descriptions":["An iron anvil is mounted on a thick oaken stump in the center of the chamber.  Against the wall behind it is the forge, stoked by Yalda's apprentices, where the sword- or shield-to-be is brought to a red-hot glow before being hammered into shape."],"exits":[{"to":906,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Smithy1"]},
  {"id":908,"x":322,"y":-261,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["These small rooms at the back of Yalda's establishment are the shrines of the smiths, housing the furnaces where the glowing metal is heated, tempered, and beaten into shape.  Just a step away from the forge is an iron anvil, bolted to a charred but solid wooden support."],"exits":[{"to":906,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Forge1"]},
  {"id":909,"x":342,"y":-261,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Smithy","descriptions":["This eastern chamber of the smithy is equipped like the others, with a forge and anvil for heating and tempering the castings from the foundry.  From time to time, the din of hammers pounding on the heated blanks rings out from the anvils in the other rooms."],"exits":[{"to":906,"exit":"go","move":"go arch"}],"aliases":["Smithy2"]},
  {"id":910,"x":-25,"y":-184,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Office","descriptions":["Simple yet slightly elegant, the office serves as a second home for Society Master Milline.  Set within the center of the spacious room, upon a neatly woven black rug, is a masterfully carved oak desk and chair.  Matching the setting within the entry of the hall, crushed seashells in blues and greens span the walls in cresting waves.  Upon a fitting dummy is a stunning black nightsilk dress, accented with brilliant orange jewels."],"exits":[{"to":873,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Outfitting Office"]},
  {"id":911,"x":-5,"y":-184,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Painted ivy vines flow the length of the tan colored walls of the hallway.  Set against one wall is a chaise lounge covered with a light green cotton throw.  Light brown mats rest upon the floor before marble, oak, and ivory doorways which lead into several workrooms."],"exits":[{"to":912,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":915,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":873,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":922,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":923,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"},{"to":924,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Outfitting prestige","Outfitting clerk"]},
  {"id":912,"x":-5,"y":-194,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Book Shop","descriptions":["Several bookshelves stand within the room, holding the store inventory for sale.  Harried women pass through a beaded curtain and return with more products, ensuring the shop is fully stocked at all times.  To the rear of the shop is a long counter where a line of patrons wait patiently to purchase their goods."],"exits":[{"to":913,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":911,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting books"]},
  {"id":913,"x":5,"y":-194,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Tool Shop","descriptions":["Though devoid of decoration, rows of shelving line the walls which hold various tools for sale in the shop.  Filling the shelves on the wall are fine spools of thread, flat irons, straight pins and needles -- the absolute essentials for creating the perfect garment.  Tiny cobwebs hang in the corners of the ceiling, strands dangling down to the surfaces below."],"exits":[{"to":914,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":912,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting tools"]},
  {"id":914,"x":15,"y":-194,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Materials Shop","descriptions":["Grand marble tables and shelves fill the room with fashionable product for sale.  Upon the surfaces are a wide variety of stylish fabrics in a broad spectrum of color."],"exits":[{"to":913,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Outfitting supplies"]},
  {"id":915,"x":-5,"y":-174,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Painted groves of trees span the length of the dark green walls of the hallway.  Set against one wall is a chaise lounge covered with a dark green knitted throw.  Light brown mats rest upon the floor before gold, maple, and oak doorways which lead into several workrooms."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":916,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":919,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"},{"to":920,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"},{"to":921,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":1024,"exit":"go","move":"go wicker archway"}]},
  {"id":916,"x":-5,"y":-164,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Hallway","descriptions":["Painted rose bushes span the length of the dark brown walls of the hallway.  Set against one wall is a chaise lounge covered with a dark green knitted throw.  Light brown mats rest upon the floor before cedar and painted doorways which lead into several workrooms."],"exits":[{"to":915,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":917,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"},{"to":918,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"}]},
  {"id":917,"x":15,"y":-164,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Workroom","descriptions":["Hooks and shelves line the light blue walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the painted door is a simple table and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink."],"exits":[{"to":916,"exit":"go","move":"go painted door"}]},
  {"id":918,"x":25,"y":-164,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Workroom","descriptions":["Hooks and shelves line the deep red walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the carved cedar door is a simple table and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink."],"exits":[{"to":916,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"}]},
  {"id":919,"x":15,"y":-174,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the deep purple walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the gold door is a simple table and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink."],"exits":[{"to":915,"exit":"go","move":"go gold door"}],"aliases":["Weaving1"]},
  {"id":920,"x":25,"y":-174,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the bright orange walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the maple door is a simple table and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink."],"exits":[{"to":915,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}],"aliases":["Weaving2"]},
  {"id":921,"x":35,"y":-174,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Weaving Room","descriptions":["Set in the back of the large workroom is a hefty loom.  Hooks and shelves line the dark green walls, holding various tools and spools of thread that are currently not in use.  Next to the carved oak door is a simple table and chair, a place to take a load off and enjoy a cool drink."],"exits":[{"to":915,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"aliases":["Weaving3"]},
  {"id":922,"x":15,"y":-184,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Fanciful paintings of birds in flight flow across the bright yellow walls.  Beneath a large spinning wheel is a soft white rug trimmed with black fur.  Pressed against the back of the room is a large workbench and chair, a place to relax or work on a project that requires more attention to detail.  A stained oak door leads back out into the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"aliases":["Spinning1"]},
  {"id":923,"x":25,"y":-184,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Fanciful paintings of birds in flight flow across the dark green walls.  Beneath a large spinning wheel is a soft white rug trimmed with black fur.  Pressed against the back of the room is a large workbench and chair, a place to relax or work on a project that requires more attention to detail.  A polished marble door leads back out into the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"}],"aliases":["Spinning2"]},
  {"id":924,"x":35,"y":-184,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, Spinning Room","descriptions":["Fanciful paintings of birds in flight flow across the light blue walls.  Beneath a large spinning wheel is a soft white rug trimmed with black fur.  Pressed against the back of the room is a large workbench and chair, a place to relax or work on a project that requires more attention to detail.  A carved ivory door leads back out into the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":911,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory door"}],"aliases":["Spinning3"]},
  {"id":925,"x":-61,"y":26,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Rangu's Repair Shop and Bookstore","descriptions":["A small forge in the corner of this room basks everything in its warmth.  Adjacent to it, a long counter sits cluttered with numerous tools and devices for repairing things.  Bundles of repaired goods rest against the far wall waiting for pickup."],"exits":[{"to":851,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Engineering clerk","Rangu's","Engineering Books"]},
  {"id":926,"x":-41,"y":16,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Hallway","descriptions":["A long hallway cut from smoky alabaster echoes with all sorts of clinks and clanks.  Doors leading to solitary workshops line the walls, manned by attendants waiting to deliver on deed orders."],"exits":[{"to":874,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":930,"exit":"go","move":"go birch door"},{"to":929,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":928,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}],"aliases":["Engineering Prestige"]},
  {"id":927,"x":-51,"y":16,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Talia's Office","descriptions":["Mechanical components of all shapes and sizes lay scattered about the polished marble floor.  A large workbench littered with diagrams sits under a pair of shelves cluttered with widgets and gears.  The office's rear contains a row of overflowing bookcases lacking any semblance of organization."],"exits":[{"to":851,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Engineering Office","Talia's Office"]},
  {"id":928,"x":-51,"y":6,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["This workshop contains several orderly crafting areas established with eye-level oak partitions.  The alabaster walls appear recently washed, and the floor is even lacking in dust buildup.  A pair of attendants waits quietly at the door, moving occasionally to clean a work area or empty the waste bucket."],"exits":[{"to":926,"exit":"go","move":"go maple door"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workshop1"]},
  {"id":929,"x":-41,"y":6,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["Unfinished stone furniture, statues and more lie spread out across dozens of reinforced tables.  Crafters hurry to finish designs as attendants haul away pieces too large to carry, storing them for later retrieval."],"exits":[{"to":926,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workshop2"]},
  {"id":930,"x":-31,"y":6,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, Workshop","descriptions":["Tall alabaster walls encompass rows of tables covered with unfinished stone pieces.  A massive iron gate and a large chain hanging from a system of pulleys and winches dominate the north end of the room.  Attendants stand at the ready to collect and store crafters' furniture that would otherwise be too large to carry."],"exits":[{"to":926,"exit":"go","move":"go birch door"}],"aliases":["Engineering Workshop3"]},
  {"id":931,"x":-1,"y":96,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Alchemy Society, Tool Shop","descriptions":["Tall oak supply crates flank an extended counter displaying various alchemical tools for sale.  A pair of robed individuals rush about helping customers restock.  You notice the overwhelming combination of smells is somewhat reduced here."],"exits":[{"to":898,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":932,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Alchemy tools","Alchemy clerk","press1","grinder1"]},
  {"id":932,"x":-1,"y":106,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Alchemy Society, Bookstore","descriptions":["A haze of dust permeates the air and casts a glow about the wall torches.  A large bookshelf rests against the back wall and a robed figure scurries up and down a ladder to sell tomes and recipes to interested patrons."],"exits":[{"to":931,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":933,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy books"]},
  {"id":933,"x":-1,"y":116,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Alchemy Society, Supplies","descriptions":["A pungent odor combines with the powder-filled air to make breathing here more difficult.  Racks of spices, herbs, plants and other materials line the walls as attendants scurry about helping customers.  Pewter trays in each corner hold burning incense sticks.  Despite the size and large amount of smoke wafting from each stick, it is nearly impossible to detect even a hint of their scent."],"exits":[{"to":932,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":934,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Alchemy supplies","press2","grinder2"]},
  {"id":934,"x":-1,"y":126,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Alchemy Society, Office","descriptions":["Cut into the granite of the far wall is a shelf containing an elaborate collection of alchemical equipment.  The assortment overshadows the Society Master's desk, a simple piece of oak furniture pushed unceremoniously against the wall."],"exits":[{"to":933,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Alchemy Office"]},
  {"id":935,"x":-206,"y":276,"z":0,"title":"Kertigen's Honor","descriptions":["The length of this ferry is filled to capacity with travelers making their way to the opposite bank of the Segoltha.  Several children kneel at the ferry's edge, watching the water lap gently against its side, while a group of Dwarven merchants glance longingly towards land."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go south docks"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go north docks"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":936,"x":-174,"y":276,"z":0,"title":"Hodierna's Grace","descriptions":["A few weary travelers lean against a railing at the bow of this ferry, anxiously waiting to reach the opposite bank.  An elderly S'Kra Mur stands alone at the stern, thoughtfully watching the shallow wake of the ferry shiver and become still."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go south docks"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go north docks"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":937,"x":-241,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Foyer","descriptions":["This tasteful entry hall is paneled with a variety of exotic woods.  The parquet floor is patterned in alternately light and dark diamond shapes, surrounding the Estate Holder crest in the center of the room.  Lining the walls are several plush couches for the comfort of those awaiting appointments."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":938,"exit":"go","move":"go viewers' hallway"},{"to":940,"exit":"go","move":"go business hallway"}],"aliases":["Estate Holders' Headquarters"]},
  {"id":938,"x":-231,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Spectator Hallway","descriptions":["A short hallway leads from the front of the building to the viewing room, where members can watch council meetings.  A slender royal blue runner carpets footfalls, preventing heavy steppers from disturbing those in attendance.  The walls display portraits of prominent estate holders, past and present."],"exits":[{"to":937,"exit":"go","move":"go entry foyer"},{"to":939,"exit":"go","move":"go teak door"}]},
  {"id":939,"x":-231,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Spectator Gallery","descriptions":["This auditorium provides a place from which the council chambers can be viewed when a meeting is in session.  Comfortable benches, padded in port wine-colored velvet, are arrayed in rows facing a glass window which affords a clear look at the proceedings.  The walls are a finely lacquered teak."],"exits":[{"to":938,"exit":"go","move":"go teak door"}]},
  {"id":940,"x":-262,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Office Hallway","descriptions":["This wide hallway is somewhat less opulent than the entry foyer and the rooms dedicated to council meetings, reflecting the fact that this is where the day-to-day business takes place.  Several offices open off from here, with frequent visitors coming and going.  The walls display portraits of prominent estate holders, past and present."],"exits":[{"to":937,"exit":"go","move":"go entry foyer"},{"to":941,"exit":"go","move":"go housing doorway"},{"to":942,"exit":"go","move":"go exchange doorway"},{"to":943,"exit":"go","move":"go acquisitions doorway"},{"to":944,"exit":"go","move":"go expansions doorway"}]},
  {"id":941,"x":-272,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Housing Office","descriptions":["This is a large office with a well-worn counter, several windows each with a Use Next Window, Please sign and apparently one clerk actually working.  Every town in the land seems cursed with lines and waiting and fees.  This office is for the obtaining of permits, licenses and similar matters."],"exits":[{"to":940,"exit":"go","move":"go pine doorway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Housing Office"]},
  {"id":942,"x":-272,"y":90,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Home Exchange Office","descriptions":["Tiny, stuffed with old, dusty furniture, and smelling like yesterday's laundry, this office is anything but a testimony to bureaucratic efficiency.  Large piles of yellowing papers spill from cracked file cabinets and lie scattered upon the floor, fallen from large, ungainly stacks on what little desk space is not taken up by piles of mouldering food."],"exits":[{"to":940,"exit":"go","move":"go oak doorway"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Home Exchange Office"]},
  {"id":943,"x":-272,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Office of Acquisitions","descriptions":["Maps cover practically every inch of available wall space, with overview maps covering all of Kermoria ranging down to ones detailing individual neighborhoods.  Trays labeled IN and OUT are filled to overflowing, although the IN box is piled deeper by far.  Government officials, landowners and couriers seem to form a parade of traffic through the office."],"exits":[{"to":940,"exit":"go","move":"go deobar doorway"}]},
  {"id":944,"x":-262,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Estate Holders' Headquarters, Office of Expansions","descriptions":["This office is like a cousin to the Acquisitions Office without all the hubbub.  There are a handful of maps on the wall, with pushpins marking areas for development.  A few office workers are engaged in conversation with merchants and artisans, discussing potential development opportunities."],"exits":[{"to":940,"exit":"go","move":"go maple doorway"}]},
  {"id":945,"x":-94,"y":-356,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Wine Cellar","descriptions":["Strong support beams crisscross the ceiling above, converging towards wide brick columns that stoically maintain the foundation of the guild.  Shallow grooves worn into the floor attest to the memory of several absent storage racks."],"exits":[{"to":946,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":946,"x":-84,"y":-356,"z":0,"title":"Bards' Guild, Old Library","descriptions":["Time has not been kind to the cornerstone room of the old Bards' Guild, as is evident by the vein-like cracks and discolorations to the aged brick foundation.  Several long black streaks scar the floor at the west wall where a door might have stood -- a visible reminder and striking mystery as to the demise of the missing portal."],"exits":[{"to":945,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":947,"x":-230,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Raven's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["The fanfare of the outer club fades to memory along the quiet hallway, a place where some of the more esteemed members reside.  A repeating pattern of small, gilded fleur-de-lis imbeds the smooth marble walls, while channels of magnificent blue diamonds crisscross amid the design.  Tiny glowstone orbs create a starry effect against the dark ceiling overhead, the subdued lighting casting a soft glow along the length of the wide corridor."],"exits":[{"to":948,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":559,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":948,"x":-220,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Raven's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Plush black carpet cuts a wide swath down the broad hallway, softening the footsteps of all who pass.  In the muted light of the glowstone orbs overhead, hues of vibrant azure glint along the diamond-jeweled marble walls, adding to the elegance of the area.  Tucked within an ornately sculpted niche is a breathtaking glaes statue, displayed behind a velvet stanchion rope."],"exits":[{"to":949,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":947,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":949,"x":-210,"y":-50,"z":0,"title":"Raven's Court, Hallway","descriptions":["Tiny glowstone orbs overhead create a soft glow along the quiet hallway, the rich black carpet underfoot and glinting channels of blue diamond that crisscross the walls adding to the starlit ambience.  A potted bougainvillea stands against a nearby wall, its velvety white petals scenting the area with their subtly sweet aroma."],"exits":[{"to":558,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":948,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":950,"x":-200,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Secluded Alcove","descriptions":["Delicate floral scents blend with a heavier musk, left to lurk in the air from the former occupants' perfume and cologne.  Dimly lit by the subtle glow of the library's lamps, the niche features a smattering of fat pillows upon the carpeted floor and little else.  Uninterrupted save for a small gap, shrouding drapes of rich velvet envelop the area, serving to mute all sound and prevent conversation from reaching potential eavesdroppers in the main room."],"exits":[{"to":561,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}],"aliases":["Secluded Alcove"]},
  {"id":951,"x":419,"y":-94,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Third Floor Landing","descriptions":["The darkened heavens gaze down upon the landing through an octagonal skylight, shadowing a golden seal inlaid within the polished wooden flooring.  Washed out by the moonlight, the faded reflection of the seal plays against the room's darkly oiled paneling.  A solitary ebonwood chair tucked into one corner invites visitors to rest their weary bones upon its deep green velvet cushions."],"exits":[{"to":952,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":953,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":835,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble steps"}]},
  {"id":952,"x":439,"y":-94,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Third Floor Landing","descriptions":["Strung from a heavy wooden cross beam, a row of lanterns casts a soft glow over the high, vaulted ceiling and brings to life gentle shadows along the ivory walls.  Golden nameplates flicker with the warm light cast over them, shimmering softly from their homes upon the faces of wooden doors lining both sides of the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":951,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":954,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":955,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"},{"to":956,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut door"}]},
  {"id":953,"x":399,"y":-94,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Third Floor Landing","descriptions":["A flocked, dark blue fabric with splashes of iridescent silver decorates this expansive hallway while off-white carpeting muffles footsteps from a nearby attendant.  Small silver engravings dangle within each of the many doorframes, labeling the rooms beyond, and a single, large potted plant reaches velvety branches towards the vaulted ceiling, as if seeking to touch the heavy wooden cross beams."],"exits":[{"to":951,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":957,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":958,"exit":"go","move":"go sandalwood door"},{"to":959,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"}]},
  {"id":954,"x":439,"y":-104,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Glacis Hall","descriptions":["Edged with a dark mahogany ceiling trim, a magnificent ceiling fresco canopies this spacious hall, its rich oil colors adding a quality of beauty to the simple meeting room.  Painted with meticulous detailing, the image appears almost life-like both in its size and in its craftsmanship.  Resting upon a plush, deep-green expanse of carpet, the speaker's podium partially obscures the view from a tall, wooden-framed picture window as it stands at attention behind several rows of satin cushioned benches."],"exits":[{"to":952,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"aliases":["Glacis Hall"]},
  {"id":955,"x":449,"y":-94,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Sithsia Hall","descriptions":["Walls of soft sky-blue, edged with an antiqued-bronze filigree trim, enclose lustrous light pine flooring.  A richly hued gold-gilded painting hangs securely along one wall, while at the far side of the room cream-colored brocade curtains have been tied back with a golden rope to reveal a multi-paned window.  In the center of the hall a speaker's podium stands before several rows of pine chairs, sitting beneath a large crystal chandelier dangling from the ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":952,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}],"aliases":["Sithsia Hall"]},
  {"id":956,"x":439,"y":-84,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Sorril Hall","descriptions":["The walls are painted sky-blue and embellished with a pattern of mauve roses and white wisteria, adding a brightness to contrast against the midnight blue carpeting.  Spanning the length of the side wall, illuminated by two oil lamps, hangs an elegant, bronze-framed watercolor painting.  A speaker's podium stands before a congregation of velvet-covered chairs, and behind it, a walnut-framed picture window overlooks the city below."],"exits":[{"to":952,"exit":"go","move":"go walnut door"}],"aliases":["Sorril Hall"]},
  {"id":957,"x":399,"y":-104,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Ortug Hall","descriptions":["Laid in an alternating pattern of light tan and deep brown, the wooden floor glistens from heavy polishing, free of any scuff or scratch.  The pattern continues down the length of the hall with the vertical planks creating an illusion of elongation that is interrupted only by the thick fur of an enormous honey-hued bear skin rug.  Mounted behind a matching ebonwood table and chairs set hangs a scarlet tapestry edged with an elaborate golden brocade."],"exits":[{"to":953,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}],"aliases":["Ortug Hall"]},
  {"id":958,"x":389,"y":-94,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Wolfjaw Hall","descriptions":["Lined with a thick wolf skin rug, the wooden flooring blends with the grey and white fur, adding richness to the earthy wall color.  Columns, painted shades of light and dark grey over the tawny background of the walls and spaciously separated, give the room a larger appearance.  A deep burgundy tapestry, trimmed with glinting silver brocade, hangs behind an inlaid sandalwood table.  Several matching brocade-cushioned chairs surround the table, each with a tall, engraved back."],"exits":[{"to":953,"exit":"go","move":"go sandalwood door"}],"aliases":["Wolfjaw Hall"]},
  {"id":959,"x":399,"y":-84,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Daffleberry Hall","descriptions":["A faint scent of cedar seeps from the wooden paneling and floats through the air, blanketing the hall with a sense of freshness.  Heavily oiled, the panels take on a deep reddish hue and rise from the floor halfway up the wall.  The top portion is painted soft beige and displays a hand-hewn snow-white tapestry adorned with golden tassels and framed by two brass oil lamps.  Atop a plush, snowbeast-pelt rug rest the heavy clawed feet of a massive redwood table and thirteen matching chairs."],"exits":[{"to":953,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar door"}],"aliases":["Daffleberry Hall"]},
  {"id":960,"x":322,"y":-291,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["Waves of heat, blasting with an almost tangible force, roll from the flames of a brick-lined firepit.  Over the firepit, a blackened granite crucible hangs by stout chains from an oak beam high overhead.  Near the crucible's spout stand stone molds of different shapes, with a pile of fuel within easy reach.  Similar crucibles hang to the north and south."],"exits":[{"to":903,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":902,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":904,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":961,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Foundry3"]},
  {"id":961,"x":312,"y":-291,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Foundry","descriptions":["Waves of heat, blasting with an almost tangible force, roll from the flames of a brick-lined firepit.  Over the firepit, a blackened granite crucible hangs by stout chains from an oak beam high overhead.  Near the crucible's spout stand stone molds of different shapes, with a pile of fuel within easy reach."],"exits":[{"to":960,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Foundry4"]},
  {"id":962,"x":342,"y":-301,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["Several large grindstones on wooden frames stand in the middle of the workroom.  From time to time, a Dwarven apprentice scatters sand over the floor, both for more secure footing and as a safeguard against fire from the sparks cascading off the grindstones.  A high-pitched keening and the smell of hot metal rise from those in use and from others to the south."],"exits":[{"to":905,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Forge2"]},
  {"id":963,"x":342,"y":-281,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Forge","descriptions":["The south end of the grindstone room has a few more of the big stone wheels, all in good condition.  Apprentices of Yalda inspect them daily, treating them with oil and checking for chips on the grinding face.  Other grindstones stand to the north."],"exits":[{"to":905,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Forge3"]},
  {"id":964,"x":222,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Fenwyrthie's, Collectibles","descriptions":["Memorabilia from Fenwyrthie's years of travels and collecting are crammed into every available space.  Items are so tightly wedged on the shelves, racks and stands that pulling one threatens to trigger an avalanche of bags, sacks, bits of junk and dust.  A winding maze of tiny trails wends through the tables, trunks and carpets jammed into the small floorspace."],"exits":[{"to":504,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":965,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Fenwyrthie Collectibles"]},
  {"id":965,"x":205,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Fenwyrthie's, Keepsakes","descriptions":["Trinkets, toys, bags, and tools of all sorts appear strewn onto every available space.  The visual assault of colorful containers along racks, counters, bins, and shelves does nothing to improve the dusty and cob-web ridden state of the shop.  Nearly every inch of the floor space is taken up by sale surfaces, leaving walking room at a minimum."],"exits":[{"to":964,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Fenwyrthie Keepsakes"]},
  {"id":966,"x":290,"y":-438,"z":0,"title":"Empaths' Guild, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Soft robin's egg blue paper covers the walls of this large room, patterned with delicate arabesques in an even lighter shade of powder blue.  Several gaily-colored painted landscapes complement the rich hue of the paper, their heavy gilt frames resembling windows into perfect summer days.  The vibrant golden oak of the floor is muffled by a sumptuous woolen ivory rug with a deep, luxurious pile.  Several cheerful golden sconces provide bright -- but not harsh -- light, the oil they burn perfuming the air with a fresh citrus scent."],"exits":[{"to":309,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"aliases":["Sitting Room","Constanze"]},
  {"id":967,"x":119,"y":36,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Walk","descriptions":["A peaceful sanctuary from the bustle of the city beyond, neatly trimmed hedges shield this garden from the main road.  An ornate marble bench rests in the far corner whilst a neatly ordered rock garden frames the entryway.  A series of manicured lawns provide space for a peaceful stroll punctuated by the occasional flowerbed.  Interspersed amongst the flowerbeds, an array of thirty nine diminutive pale marble statues present an interesting distraction from the natural beauty of the gardens."],"exits":[{"to":968,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go hedged archway"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":968,"x":119,"y":46,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Walk","descriptions":["Resting at the centre of the array of lawns and gardens, a large pond dominates the area.  Unlike the rest of the lawns this area retains an air of chaos.  Randomly placed stepping stones lead to the centre of the pond where a circular bench provides a place to view the entire garden.  An occasional fallen leaf swirls upon the surface guided by the eddies and currents caused by the small stream feeding the pond."],"exits":[{"to":967,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":971,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":972,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":969,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":970,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":969,"x":119,"y":56,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Walk","descriptions":["Manicured topiary trees have been placed across the lawn, offering a natural playground for games of hide and seek.  Each tree bears an animal carving on its trunk in honour of the Immortals.  At the foot of each tree, a small alcove provides a place for offerings to the gods.  Further back at the edge of the lawn a tiny flower border has been placed in front of a neat row of homes."],"exits":[{"to":968,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":970,"x":109,"y":46,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Walk","descriptions":["Dizzying swirls of sand create the setting of a serene rock garden.  Smooth, polished rocks have been placed in symmetrical patterns amidst the golden hued sands.  A single sana'ati wood rake rests near the edge of the rock garden.  A marble box, ornately carved with a swirling pattern houses a collection of additional rocks in a myriad of riverstone hues."],"exits":[{"to":968,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":971,"x":129,"y":46,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Walk","descriptions":["Well kept, lush verdant grass spreads like a carpet, occasional splashes of violet and dusky pink blot the lawn.  Along the border of the lawn the foliage has been ordered and structured to provide a sense of calm.  An Ilithi peach tree has been planted in the furthest corner, providing a shaded spot to rest and contemplate the gardens."],"exits":[{"to":968,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":972,"x":129,"y":56,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing, Immortals' Walk","descriptions":["More of a glade then a garden, a collection of wildflowers borders the area.  Clusters of bushes provide a sweet perfume that drifts through the glade.  A small blanket has been laid out beneath a small pear tree that provides a serene view of the glade."],"exits":[{"to":968,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":973,"x":130,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Item Registration Office","descriptions":["Red tile continues its way through the open doorway and stops abruptly at a long wood counter with polished brass bars positioned to form a cage around the clerks.  A soft glow comes from a single lantern placed atop a long row of filing cabinets.  Papers are strewn about the tops of the cabinets and have spilled over onto the floor."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":974,"exit":"go","move":"go simple curtain"}]},
  {"id":974,"x":130,"y":-70,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Registrar's Office","descriptions":["Not actually a separate room, but sectioned off via a tall row of cabinets is a cramped area, just big enough to fit a table.  The red tile is not so spotless here, but rather has a deep wear pattern that leads from the curtain to a chair in front of the Registrar's desk."],"exits":[{"to":973,"exit":"go","move":"go simple curtain"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Registrar's Office","item registration"]},
  {"id":975,"x":260,"y":-375,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Meeting Hall, Entrance","descriptions":["Kept very clean and tidy, the walls of the Meeting Hall entrance are covered in stained wood.  Several glass windows are enshrouded in dark crimson curtains, and twin potted plants stand tall on opposite sides of the exit.  A long carpet runs the length of the long hallway, decorated with a loose mosaic pattern that mimics cobblestone."],"exits":[{"to":976,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":8,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":979,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"},{"to":978,"exit":"go","move":"go small archway"}],"aliases":["Crossing Meeting Hall","Meeting Hall"]},
  {"id":976,"x":260,"y":-385,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Meeting Hall, Corridor","descriptions":["Gaethzen lights illuminate the hallway in wide strips set into the edges of the ceiling.  Darkly stained mahogany paneling covers the walls, and several pictures of the city hang on the walls.  A long carpet runs the length of the hallway, a cobblestone motif making it appear like a well-used road."],"exits":[{"to":977,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":975,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":980,"exit":"go","move":"go violet door"},{"to":981,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}]},
  {"id":977,"x":260,"y":-395,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Meeting Hall, Corridor","descriptions":["Two small lanterns stand on long poles in each corner of the hallway, which ends at a large portrait of the old Ulf'Hara Keep.  Small twin shelves line the walls, with candles giving off a bit of soft light.  Vertical boards of polished and darkly stained mahogany wood cover the walls, giving it a homey feel."],"exits":[{"to":976,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":982,"exit":"go","move":"go yellow door"},{"to":983,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":978,"x":270,"y":-375,"z":0,"title":"The Crossing Meeting Hall, Lounge","descriptions":["Candles adorn the many surfaces within the room, casting their fickle, flickering light across the area.  Rough-hewn wooden walls, dressed up by several elaborate paintings, encircle a floor that's covered in carpet.  Long couches are arranged in the middle of the room, set up for quiet talking."],"exits":[{"to":975,"exit":"go","move":"go small archway"}]},
  {"id":979,"x":250,"y":-375,"z":0,"title":"Red Meeting Room","descriptions":["Dark red paint covers the low walls of the meeting room, and tasteful red roses grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each finely carved from cedar.  A small table against one wall holds a few refreshments."],"exits":[{"to":975,"exit":"go","move":"go red door"}],"aliases":["Red Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":980,"x":250,"y":-385,"z":0,"title":"Violet Meeting Room","descriptions":["Light violet paint covers the low walls of the meeting room, and tasteful purple lilies grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each finely carved from cedar.  A small table against one wall holds a few refreshments."],"exits":[{"to":976,"exit":"go","move":"go violet door"}],"aliases":["Violet Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":981,"x":270,"y":-385,"z":0,"title":"Blue Meeting Room","descriptions":["Sky blue paint covers the low walls of the meeting room, and tasteful bluebells grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each finely carved from cedar.  A small table against one wall holds a few refreshments."],"exits":[{"to":976,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}],"aliases":["Blue Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":982,"x":250,"y":-395,"z":0,"title":"Yellow Meeting Room","descriptions":["Sunny yellow paint covers the low walls of the meeting room, and tasteful marigolds grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each finely carved from cedar.  A small table against one wall holds a few refreshments."],"exits":[{"to":977,"exit":"go","move":"go yellow door"}],"aliases":["Yellow Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":983,"x":270,"y":-395,"z":0,"title":"Green Meeting Room","descriptions":["Forest green paint covers the low walls of the meeting room, and tasteful ferns grow in stone pots in one corner.  Several rows of high-backed benches are arranged in the center of the room, each finely carved from cedar.  A small table against one wall holds a few refreshments."],"exits":[{"to":977,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"aliases":["Green Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":984,"x":-120,"y":-518,"z":0,"title":"Ranger's Guild, The Tree House","descriptions":["This platform perched high in the treetop offers a breathtaking view of the surroundings, and a small spyglass secured to the banister provides an opportunity to get a closer look.  A slight breeze caresses the leaves of the trees with a sound like the voice of nature whispering secrets to those who will listen.  A few leaves occasionally blow down the carved steps leading to the room below."],"exits":[{"to":590,"exit":"climb","move":"climb carved steps"},{"to":985,"exit":"climb","move":"climb branch"}],"aliases":["Tree House"]},
  {"id":985,"x":-140,"y":-518,"z":0,"title":"Northwall Trail, Tree Top","descriptions":["Faint light streams down through the tree's upper limbs, painting the branches in an eerie, pale hue.  Now and then the surrounding foliage rustles with movement, though whatever is causing it cannot be seen.  Occasionally something glints in the depth of the shadows -- could it be watchful eyes?  But they appear and are gone again so quickly that perhaps they were only a trick of the imagination.","Natural light filters down through the tree's mighty limbs.  The bark of the trunk is well worn with use, as if something or someone has been using this as a way of getting around.  Often, the leaves overhead flicker with movement as squirrels leap playfully through the canopy.  The tree has several crude carvings on it, apparently done by someone who had nothing better to do."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":984,"exit":"climb","move":"climb branch"}],"aliases":["Northwall trail"],"linksTo":"Map6_Crossing_North_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":986,"x":-260,"y":-110,"z":0,"title":"Thieves' Guild, Master's Den","descriptions":["Sumptuous curtains of heavy Musparan silk drape from the walls, obscuring them in the hues of eventide.  Crushed velvet divans, dyed a deep plum hue, boast cloth-of-gold pillows.  Underfoot, the granite floors glitter with flecks of precious metals.  A low goldbark table sits in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":901,"exit":"go","move":"go dark curtain"}],"aliases":["Master's Den"]},
  {"id":987,"x":320,"y":27,"z":0,"title":"Order Headquarters, Administrator's Office","descriptions":["Thick burgundy carpet adds color and warmth throughout the room, a soft contrast to the rich grain of the flamewood walls which enclose the entire room in an intricately carved pattern of ivy.  Gaethzen orbs dangle from chains secured to the thick ceiling beams that traverse the room, bathing the area in a muted golden hue.  Mounted along the wall's upper moulding, elongated planter boxes encircle the room with overflowing ivy that spills forth a multitude of cascading vines, offsetting the tasteful oil paintings and potted palms."],"exits":[{"to":833,"exit":"go","move":"go teakwood door"}],"aliases":["Administrator's Office"]},
  {"id":988,"x":310,"y":7,"z":1,"title":"Commendable Collectibles, Foyer","descriptions":["An immense fish tank dominates the small entryway, illuminated from behind by soft lamps.  Two arches flank the structure to lead further into the shop, and a plush black sofa rests opposite the tank, allowing visitors to take a seat and enjoy the scene."],"exits":[{"to":989,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":990,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":833,"exit":"go","move":"go arched entrance"}],"aliases":["Commendable Collectibles"]},
  {"id":989,"x":320,"y":-3,"z":1,"title":"Commendable Collectibles, Showroom","descriptions":["A richly woven lambswool carpet spreads out across the floor, muffling the footsteps of any who pass over it.  Poised atop the carpet are a wide glass table and a glass display case, holding a large array of jewelry and charms.  Along the far wall, silver and glass hooks present ribbon bars while a selection of additional ribbons and medallions rest upon an adjacent glass rack."],"exits":[{"to":988,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":991,"exit":"go","move":"go small alcove"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":990,"x":300,"y":-3,"z":1,"title":"Commendable Collectibles, Showroom","descriptions":["Bright light bathes the room in warmth, radiating from a grand crystal chandelier hanging in the center.  Painted shelves mounted along one wall stretch from the floor to the ceiling, bearing knickknacks and trinkets for sale.  On the opposite wall, two wide racks present an array of shields and swords."],"exits":[{"to":988,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":992,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":991,"x":320,"y":-13,"z":1,"title":"Commendable Collectibles, Alcove","descriptions":["Rich, polished mahogany covers the walls of the area, which is softly lit by a golden gaezthen orb that hangs suspended from the ceiling.  A vibrant tapestry hangs above a small stone fireplace, flanked by a pair of velvet armchairs, which overlooks the clothing rack at the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":989,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany archway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":992,"x":300,"y":-13,"z":1,"title":"Commendable Collectibles, Dim Closet","descriptions":["Dim light emanates from a small lamp, spilling onto a squat wooden counter that stands atop the dark carpet of this tiny closet, piled high with clutter.  Crowded against the back wall, a set of over-stuffed shelves seems to loom precariously over the room."],"exits":[{"to":990,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":993,"x":130,"y":-30,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Carousel Family Services","descriptions":["A series of guarded arches line the southern wall.  The complicated framework of iron and timbers spans across the ceiling.  Countless gears, pulleys and weights form the strikingly complex mechanism which drives the Carousel."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Family Vault"]},
  {"id":994,"x":179,"y":-474,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Entrance","descriptions":["A dim and flickering torch provides barely-adequate illumination of the Society's entryway.  The hall immediately forks before a shimmering sign indicating directions down each hall.  Distorted echoes from numerous chanting voices rebound down the hallway and combine to form a somber melody in this acoustically well-placed room."],"exits":[{"to":139,"exit":"go","move":"go wide door"},{"to":995,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":998,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Enchanting Society"]},
  {"id":995,"x":189,"y":-484,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Bookstore","descriptions":["Aisle after aisle of books stand side by side in this place.  The walls of the hall curve back and forth in a visually confusing fashion, but somehow the bookshelves and cobblestone floor are still aligned perfectly.  Robed attendants stand ready to take book orders."],"exits":[{"to":996,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":994,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1026,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowy alcove"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Books"]},
  {"id":996,"x":189,"y":-494,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Supplies","descriptions":["Flickering torches are set in bronze sconces that line the walls of the square hall.  A series of shelves with open cubbyholes line the back of the room in tidy rows.  Standing behind a sturdy oak counter, robed attendants stand ready to take supply orders."],"exits":[{"to":997,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":995,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Supplies"]},
  {"id":997,"x":189,"y":-504,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Tool Store","descriptions":["Pairs of torches are set at each corner of the triangular room, causing strange shadows to shift and undulate against the rough stone walls.  Open shelving stacked neatly with supplies line the furthest corner of the room.  A trio of robed attendants stands ready to take orders for enchanting tools."],"exits":[{"to":996,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enchanting Tools"]},
  {"id":998,"x":169,"y":-484,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Rotunda","descriptions":["Hooded figures stand within recessed balconies that surround the perfectly circular room.  Their low-pitched chanting echoes through the area with a deep thrumming sound.  Four doors are placed at equal intervals along the curved wall of the rotunda."],"exits":[{"to":999,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":994,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1000,"exit":"go","move":"go azure door"},{"to":1001,"exit":"go","move":"go sienna door"},{"to":1002,"exit":"go","move":"go cobalt door"},{"to":1003,"exit":"go","move":"go crimson door"}]},
  {"id":999,"x":169,"y":-494,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Society Master's Office","descriptions":["A large domed ceiling is magnificently painted into a faithful recreation of the night sky, complete with constellations and moons.  A plump tasseled cushion is placed on the cobblestone floor at the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1000,"x":159,"y":-494,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Air Workroom","descriptions":["Azure velvet padding lining the walls and plush carpet covering the cobblestone floor prevent outside sounds from disturbing the peaceful sanctity of the workroom.  A large marble table with cyclone-shaped legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"go","move":"go azure door"}],"aliases":["1000","Enchanting1","AirEnchanting","EnchantingAir","EAir"]},
  {"id":1001,"x":159,"y":-484,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Earth Workroom","descriptions":["Sienna velvet padding lining the walls and plush carpet covering the cobblestone floor prevent outside sounds from disturbing the peaceful sanctity of the workroom.  A large marble table with mountain-shaped legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"go","move":"go sienna door"}],"aliases":["1001","Enchanting2","EarthEnchanting","EnchantingEarthEEarth"]},
  {"id":1002,"x":159,"y":-474,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Water Workroom","descriptions":["Cobalt velvet padding lining the walls and plush carpet covering the cobblestone floor prevent outside sounds from disturbing the peaceful sanctity of the workroom.  A large marble table with raindrop-shaped legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"go","move":"go cobalt door"}],"aliases":["1002","Enchanting3","WaterEnchanting","EnchantingWater","EWater"]},
  {"id":1003,"x":169,"y":-474,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, Fire Workroom","descriptions":["Crimson velvet padding lining the walls and plush carpet covering the cobblestone floor prevent outside sounds from disturbing the peaceful sanctity of the workroom.  A large marble table with flame-shaped legs provides ample working space."],"exits":[{"to":998,"exit":"go","move":"go crimson door"}],"aliases":["1003","Enchanting4","FireEnchanting","EnchantingFire","EFire"]},
  {"id":1004,"x":-220,"y":30,"z":0,"title":"The Raven's Court, Indoor Pond","descriptions":["Floating lily pads hover gently along the water's surface that ripples from every subtle contact with the fish swimming languidly underneath.  Though only darkness is visible through several etched glass windows, sconces placed along the walls illuminate the area with flickering candlelight.  A collection of cushioned marble benches and potted palms border the small pool, allowing visitors to relax and reflect in a supremely soothing atmosphere.","Floating lily pads hover gently along the water's surface that ripples from every subtle contact with the fish swimming languidly underneath.  Daylight drenches the area through several glass windows, each etched with an artistic fantasy of flora and fauna.  A collection of cushioned marble benches and potted palms border the small pool, allowing visitors to relax and reflect in a supremely soothing atmosphere."],"exits":[{"to":527,"exit":"climb","move":"climb small steps"}]},
  {"id":1005,"x":-90,"y":-468,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Escape Tunnels, Kuniyo's Egress","descriptions":["Rough-hewn blocks of sandstone form a tall arch with a stylized metallic eye gleaming at its apex.  The structure curves over a hard-packed path of earth mixed with clay and pine needles that slopes abruptly down and into darkness.  Stray beams of light reveal that this is no dead-end, barely outlining a narrow passage at the foot of the incline."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["1005"],"linksTo":"Map2d_Escape_Tunnels.xml"},
  {"id":1006,"x":-20,"y":-548,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Escape Tunnels, Truffenyi's Way","descriptions":["A stylized eye of some metallic substance is set at the apex of a granite arch that guards the entrance to this room.  Against one wall, a plank between two stacks of clay bricks forms a makeshift shelf, supporting a row of tallow candles in brass holders.  Their flickering illumination, combined with pervasive dampness, imbues the atmosphere with a topaz-hued glow."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["1006"],"linksTo":"Map2d_Escape_Tunnels.xml"},
  {"id":1007,"x":280,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Escape Tunnels, Hodierna's Path","descriptions":["Dense walls hacked out of earth and stone curve around a massive arch centered with a stylized metal eye that shadows a series of unevenly-chiseled steps wending their way down into darkness.  Gloom obscures the area beyond, but a chilly draft from below hints at an opening of some kind."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["1007"],"linksTo":"Map2d_Escape_Tunnels.xml"},
  {"id":1008,"x":-225,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, Second Floor","descriptions":["The sand in the corridor's surfaces, frozen in rolling, shaded blue patterns, imitates the flow of waves.  One wall reveals the skeleton of a boulder-sized sponge.  Another swarms with fragments of fish scales, sea-changed into mother-of-pearl.  A stairwell leads to the first floor."],"exits":[{"to":689,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"},{"to":1009,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1008"]},
  {"id":1009,"x":-225,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, Second Floor","descriptions":["A set of tiles have been inlaid along the blue sandstone walls of this hallway.  Their ivory backgrounds are covered with geometric patterns featuring artemisia, purple variwinkle blossoms and k'dira leaves.  A stairwell leads to the third floor."],"exits":[{"to":1008,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1010,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1009"]},
  {"id":1010,"x":-235,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, Third Floor","descriptions":["Hundreds of seashell splinters glint like diamond dust in the sandstone hallway.  A hexagonal brass table, narrow and tall, stands unobtrusively to one side.  A stairwell leads to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":1009,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairwell"},{"to":1011,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1010"]},
  {"id":1011,"x":-235,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Korhege Apartments, Third Floor","descriptions":["A small fountain shrine decorates the end of this corridor, bearing an image of Lemicus attended by merfolk.  Amplified by the stone walls, the eternally bubbling water takes on a soft, deep murmur."],"exits":[{"to":1010,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1011"]},
  {"id":1012,"x":-195,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, Second Floor","descriptions":["This interior stone corridor is bare save for a green and gold rug and a single, brightly shining glowstone.  Translucent paints have been delicately applied to the latter, creating a splay of soft, geometric shadows upon the far wall.  A staircase leads down to the first floor."],"exits":[{"to":685,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":1013,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1012"]},
  {"id":1013,"x":-195,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, Second Floor","descriptions":["A dwarf plovik tree sits quietly in an earthenware pot in one corner of this sandstone corridor.  Its lustrous, splayed leaves draw nourishment from the soft but warm light of numerous glowstones.  A staircase leads up to a third floor."],"exits":[{"to":1012,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1014,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1013"]},
  {"id":1014,"x":-185,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, Third Floor","descriptions":["This spartan corridor has been rendered more lively by a flat-woven, floor-length kelim in deep magenta, black and gold, its fringes laced with tiny, round, brass bells.  Pearlescent glowstones shine softly next to each room.  A staircase leads down to the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":1015,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1013,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1014"]},
  {"id":1015,"x":-185,"y":190,"z":0,"title":"Merchant Apartments, Third Floor","descriptions":["The kelim continues here, its pebble-sized bells jangling with any movement that ruffles its surface.  Above it, recessed in a small alcove of one sandstone wall, a small statue of Hav'roth reclines upon a square-cut throne."],"exits":[{"to":1014,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["1015"]},
  {"id":1016,"x":-77,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Cormyn's House of Heirlooms","descriptions":["This private office is a welcome contrast to the front room of the Cormyn's pawnshop.  It appears to be a luxuriously appointed retreat for someone of great wealth and prominence.  Due to its quiet, tasteful decor, you are sure it must be someone other than Cormyn.  An ebony desk and a high-backed leather chair show signs of frequent use.  In the corner, a ceiling-high safe holds secrets to which you are not privy."],"exits":[{"to":433,"exit":"go","move":"go lunat door"}],"aliases":["1016"]},
  {"id":1017,"x":265,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Seacaves of Peri'el, Tidal Cave","descriptions":["Water bubbles up from a small spring before it tumbles over the edge of the hill, plunging down a smooth rock chute.  Far below, the water splashes into a crystal blue grotto which sparkles in the sunlight."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"out","move":""}],"aliases":["1017","seacaves"],"linksTo":"Map502_The_Seacaves_of_Peri'el.xml"},
  {"id":1018,"x":320,"y":-448,"z":0,"title":"The Healerie, Combat Wing","descriptions":["The corridor widens here, the ceiling arching upwards in a dramatic vaulted style from which lanterns hang to provide lighting.  A practice mat, complete with a display that holds an impressive-sized shield, provides space for training defensive maneuvers and healing while in the thick of combat.  Set behind a painted paper screen depicting battle, a circle of soft chairs surrounds a table topped with a decanter and a vase of pink dahlias."],"exits":[{"to":431,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["1018","overhealers anonymous","overhealers"]},
  {"id":1019,"x":350,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Strand Communal Center, Alchemists' Workshop","descriptions":["Shelves and counters line the walls, their surfaces scratched and marred, and the built-in stove is crusted with unidentifiable debris.  Broken bottles sit haphazardly upon the shelves, and a utilitarian unlonchai bucket has been fastened to the floor.  In a tiny skylight, a Wayerd pyramid has been installed for drying herbs and other supplies.  No attempt has been made to add decoration to the room, yet the workaday tools of the practicing alchemist have a certain charm."],"exits":[{"to":495,"exit":"go","move":"go louvered door"}],"aliases":["1019"]},
  {"id":1020,"x":-290,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"Sand Spit Tavern, The Raven's Nest","descriptions":["A cacophony of cheers and groans emanate from a crowd circled around a rust-stained ring of rags in the center of the makeshift speakeasy.  A series of grunts and shouts sound out over the gathering while groups of cloaked figures shy away from the commotion and cluster together at mismatched sets of well-crafted tables and chairs that are carelessly arranged around the perimeter.  Occasionally, a figure draped in a feathered cloak moves through the dim flickering light in the room to stand near a nondescript box at the jagged entrance."],"exits":[{"to":857,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["1020"]},
  {"id":1021,"x":332,"y":-261,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, Bulk Materials","descriptions":["A chamber with stone walls and a lofty, vaulted ceiling links the rooms of the forge.  Its high arches help to subdue the clangor, letting sounds rise and echo in the space overhead.  The flickering of flames and sounds of metal clanging against metal are more muted here, and the pace is less frantic.  Well-dressed tradesmen come and go as they place orders for large quantities of goods and supplies."],"exits":[{"to":906,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["1021","bulk Forging supplies"]},
  {"id":1022,"x":230,"y":-70,"z":0,"title":"The Office of Inspiration, Work Room","descriptions":["Very little furniture adorns this understated office, the walls formed of simple paneling to match the worn wooden floorboards that have seen better days.  A small end table pushed against the far wall displays an array of books in various stages of use, some closed, others opened, their assorted pages earmarked to denote several passages of interest.  At the center of the room, a large desk consumes most of the available space with its hulking form, scattered with crumpled slips of paper around two half-empty coffee mugs too long neglected to give off any steam."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow door"}],"aliases":["1022"]},
  {"id":1023,"x":145,"y":-45,"z":0,"title":"Crossing, Rundmolen Post Office","descriptions":["Tucked away in a corner of the square is a wide stone counter set into the conical carousel beneath an angled metal awning.  Vast, countless rows of differently sized shelves are visible within, and the intricate Dwarven mechanisms that shuffle the vaults also rearrange the package-covered storage.  Clerks shuffle endlessly back and forth between the counters and shelving as they assist patrons with their packaging and mailing needs."],"exits":[{"to":184,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["1023","Post Office","mail"]},
  {"id":1024,"x":-15,"y":-174,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Outfitting Society, A Private Outfitting Room","descriptions":["A pure-white wainscoted hall is topped by lilac-hued paisley painted walls.  Occupying the back third of the room is a solid-looking loom, while a large spinning wheel sits near the entrance.  Resting atop a deep purple rug is a sturdy worktable and a comfortable, wicker chair.  Running parallel along opposing walls are several hooks and shelves, holding practically every conceivable tool, spool of thread, bobbin, thimble and scrap."],"exits":[{"to":915,"exit":"go","move":"go wicker archway"}],"aliases":["1024","Private Outfitting"]},
  {"id":1025,"x":352,"y":-261,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Forging Society, A Private Forge","descriptions":["Thick walls struggle to contain the blistering heat of the workshop where the fires blaze endlessly night and day.  The flickering flames give a reddish glow to the racks and shelves of tools and equipment, all neatly placed and ready for use.  Workers enter in their protective gear from time to time, checking the equipment and reporting back to a sentry at the entry."],"exits":[{"to":906,"exit":"go","move":"go stone doors"}],"aliases":["1025","Private Forging"]},
  {"id":1026,"x":200,"y":-494,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Enchanting Society, A Private Enchanting Room","descriptions":["Pieced together by a seemingly blind worker, the walls are covered with scraps of rugs, blankets, and carpets in a kaleidoscope of colors.  A burly, light pink feldspar table is stashed in a corner of the room, providing plenty of room to work."],"exits":[{"to":995,"exit":"go","move":"go shadowy alcove"}],"aliases":["1026","Private Enchanting"]},
  {"id":1027,"x":10,"y":86,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Alchemy Society, A Private Alchemy Room","descriptions":["A large workbench dominates one side of the room with numerous pieces of alchemical equipment scattered haphazardly upon its surface.  The high, vented windows provide relief from the common, yet unpleasant, smell that permeates the room."],"exits":[{"to":898,"exit":"go","move":"go obsidian entryway"}],"aliases":["1027","Private Alchemy"]},
  {"id":1028,"x":-30,"y":26,"z":0,"title":"Crossing Engineering Society, A Private Engineering Room","descriptions":["A fine layer of wood and stone shavings covers most of the well-worn granite floor.  The white walls have seen better days, and black and grey scuff marks adorn much of the open space.  A large workstation along one wall is unnaturally free of clutter and holds several organized tools and implements.  Grunts, curses, and labored breathing from other patrons echo throughout the large workroom."],"exits":[{"to":874,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}],"aliases":["1028","Private Engineering"]},
  {"id":1029,"x":-26,"y":-355,"z":0,"title":"Siryn's Courtyard, Intro Terrace","descriptions":["Named in tribute to famed Bard Siryn Mistbringer, this welcoming courtyard is an oasis of peace from the hustle and bustle of Clanthew Boulevard.  Sounds of music and laughter filter in from the Bard's Guild next door, drifting across the thick stone walls that enclose the neighborhood.  A flock of wrens perches under the protection of maple trees that provide shade and shelter with their widespread branches."],"exits":[{"to":1032,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1033,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1030,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}],"color":"#00FFFF","aliases":["Siryn's Courtyard"]},
  {"id":1030,"x":-26,"y":-336,"z":0,"title":"Siryn's Courtyard, Chorus Terrace","descriptions":["Positioned underneath an enormous cedar tree, a well-stocked bar of polished mahogany is set out to entice visitors to sit and stay.  A collection of wrought-iron tables and chairs are thoughtfully placed around the terrace, perfect for those who wish to linger and enjoy a drink or two either alone or in the company of friends."],"exits":[{"to":1029,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1033,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1031,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1031,"x":-7,"y":-336,"z":0,"title":"Siryn's Courtyard, Outro Terrace","descriptions":["Tucked away in the southeast corner of the terrace, a lone nightingale perched upon the branch of a basswood tree whistles and trills a sweet song to those passing by.  Charmingly low wrought-iron fencing, crafted into a five-line staff with musical notes, separates each courtyard resident's yard from another."],"exits":[{"to":1032,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1030,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1033,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1032,"x":-7,"y":-355,"z":0,"title":"Siryn's Courtyard, Verse Terrace","descriptions":["Rosewood trees strung with creamy white seashells and silvery windchimes border the walkway that winds through the various residences in this spacious terrace.  In contrast to the simple austerity of the border, brightly colored tulips and buttercups are planted at each bend of the path, providing splashes of colors to please the eyes."],"exits":[{"to":1031,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1033,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1029,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1033,"x":-17,"y":-346,"z":0,"title":"Siryn's Courtyard, Encore Fountain","descriptions":["Spruce trees stand guard alongside several benches around a dramatic Bardic Spirit Knot water fountain.  The sounds of leaves rustling in the wind and water splashing blend together into a restful sonata to nature.  A sturdy outdoor stage facing the fountain is well suited for entertainment purposes throughout the year, ready and waiting for the next song and dance."],"exits":[{"to":1032,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1031,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1030,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1029,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1034,"x":145,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Front Garden","descriptions":["Standing an august three stories tall, a charming old boarding house with rounded gables looms over the boxwood-hemmed lawn laid out before it.  Despite needing a fresh coat of teal paint, it still manages to present a warm and attractive facade to the adjoining Strand.  Ivy climbs the drain pipes and dangles capriciously from the house's gutters and eaves, while a shingled wraparound porch converges on its front steps, welcoming residents and visitors alike through the wide front door.","Standing an august three stories tall, a charming old boarding house with rounded gables looms over the boxwood-hemmed lawn laid out before it.  Dense ivy clings to its darkened facade, climbing up the drain pipes and porch balusters to dangle from the uppermost eaves.  The first-floor windows are all aglow, and colorful light streams through a stained glass window set into the house's wide front door."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"go","move":"go whitewashed gate"},{"to":1035,"exit":"go","move":"go boarding house"},{"to":1043,"exit":"climb","move":"climb drain pipe"}]},
  {"id":1035,"x":219,"y":226,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Entry Hall","descriptions":["A foyer full of whimsical knick-knacks greets visitors to the Two Rivers Boarding House, widely reputed as a cozy haven for sojourning Estate Holders.  The appointments are lived-in but tidy, the colorful drapes and upholstery showing more quirk and character than meaningful wear.  Enticing newcomers further into the house, the aromas of a freshly cooked meal waft down one end of the hall while a gentle glow and warmth emanate from the other."],"exits":[{"to":1038,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1036,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1039,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":1034,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1036,"x":189,"y":196,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Dining Room","descriptions":["Flanked by two long benches and piled high with hearty fare, an oaken table dominates this cheery communal dining room.  A fire crackles in the stacked flagstone hearth, and faint chatter from the nearby scullery drifts through the warm air along with the smell of baking bread."],"exits":[{"to":1037,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1035,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":1037,"x":199,"y":186,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Scullery","descriptions":["Crowded but orderly, the scullery is astir with the bustle of constant meal preparations.  Stooped over a sudsy sink in the corner, an apron-clad Gor'Tog hums to himself as he washes a stack of dirty dishes that never seems to diminish thanks to a steady stream of new arrivals from the dining room."],"exits":[{"to":1036,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1045,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1038,"x":229,"y":236,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Parlor","descriptions":["Beside a low tea table draped in homespun lace, a worn-in pair of mismatched sofas provides visitors a homey fireside spot to sit and socialize.  Opposite the massive slate fireplace, a rosewood clavichord stands against the parlor wall near a corner alcove serving as the doorstep for several boarders' suites."],"exits":[{"to":1035,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1039,"x":229,"y":216,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Second Floor","descriptions":["A beige rug tapestried with twining ivy skirts along the well-trod hardwood, passing beneath a quaint painting of the Siergelde Mountains on display by the landing.  Coated in road dust, an elegant three-piece set of luggage is stacked against the opposite wall a little further down, its owner's whereabouts uncertain."],"exits":[{"to":1041,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1040,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1042,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":1035,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1040,"x":219,"y":206,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Second Floor","descriptions":["Heavy broadcloth curtains are drawn across the windows at this end of the hall, suffusing the area with eerie gloom.  An oil lantern sputters weakly atop a shallow side table in the corner and casts oozing shadows over a raggedy doll and some wooden blocks scattered across the floor, apparent leftovers from a forgetful child's playtime."],"exits":[{"to":1039,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1041,"x":239,"y":226,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Second Floor","descriptions":["Sage-green wallpaper patterned with gladioli complements the fine walnut wainscoting that runs along this quiet corridor.  A quilt-draped rocking chair rests at the edge of the tapestry runner, its window-facing position affording it a picturesque view of the Strand below."],"exits":[{"to":1039,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1042,"x":229,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Third Floor","descriptions":["Boarders occasionally stop to engage in polite small talk as they meet in passing at this upstairs juncture.  Complementing the floral wallpaper, some potted geraniums sit atop a little round side table by the stairwell landing, a ceramic tabby cat nearly concealed beneath their red-orange blooms."],"exits":[{"to":1044,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1043,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1039,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":1047,"exit":"climb","move":"climb attic stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1043,"x":209,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Third Floor","descriptions":["Muffled conversation is just barely audible through the walnut-wainscoted walls here.  Propped open with a large book, a wide window at the end of the hall invites a draft that flutters its broadcloth curtains and stirs the heady scent of pipe tobacco lingering in the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":1042,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1034,"exit":"climb","move":"climb drain pipe"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1044,"x":239,"y":211,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Third Floor","descriptions":["Soft daylight illuminates this tidy stretch of corridor.  The window at the end of the hall affords a clear view of the Segoltha below, and one can see the ferries going back and forth toward Leth Deriel, dauntlessly fighting the strong river currents with each persistent crossing."],"exits":[{"to":1042,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1045,"x":199,"y":196,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Cellar","descriptions":["Muted through the floorboards above, footsteps and the occasional snippet of conversation carry down from the dining hall and scullery.  A sooty oil lantern dangles from the rafters at the base of the cellar's wood plank stairs, its feeble flame tasked with illuminating the entire stone-walled chamber."],"exits":[{"to":1046,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1037,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1046,"x":209,"y":206,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Cellar","descriptions":["Meager lamplight barely reaches this end of the cold, damp cellar.  Tucked away in the shadows against the far wall, a collection of dusty mead casks rests beside several long shelves laden with provisions for the house."],"exits":[{"to":1045,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1047,"x":229,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Two Rivers Boarding House, Attic","descriptions":["The meticulous cleaning standards of the boarding house's other levels do not seem to apply to its uppermost floor.  Cobwebs dangle from the rafters and bits of rubbish are accumulated in each dim corner of this stuffy attic, though the entryways to the modest valet apartments allotted here are relatively clear and tidy.  Motes of dust drift languidly through sunbeams cast by a small stained glass window serving as the only light source for the dingy room."],"exits":[{"to":1042,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":1048,"x":750,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Entry Gates","descriptions":["The immense outer walls of the temple meet here, a thick lacquered mahogany gate acting as their mediator.  The hardwood entrance has been banded with sturdy bars of steel to ensure its stamina in the most dire of times.  A cobblestone path leads to the north, winding off into the various parts of the temple grounds."],"exits":[{"to":1049,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany gate"},{"to":1078,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany building"}],"aliases":["Entry Gates","Gates"]},
  {"id":1049,"x":750,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["The astonishing sight of the grand temple lies to the north, atop a massive stairway.  Three towers flank the sides of the structure, a complex network of walkways stretching between them and the temple's top levels.  A smooth cobblestone path runs east and west here, curving around to the grounds areas on either side of the temple."],"exits":[{"to":1061,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1048,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1050,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1090,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":1228,"exit":"climb","move":"climb massive stairway"}]},
  {"id":1050,"x":670,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["The cobblestone road curves gently here, the round stones smooth and freshly-swept by the ever vigilant groundskeepers.  A broad expanse of thick brambles stretches to the northwest, obscuring any vision of what may lie beyond them."],"exits":[{"to":1049,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1051,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Fidakel"]},
  {"id":1051,"x":610,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["A thorny thicket of brambles obscures direct vision to the northeast.  The top half of the temple's massive orb is still visible, rising like the moon over the errant foliage, the veils of night draping lightly over it.","A thorny thicket of brambles obscures direct vision to the northeast, although the top half of the temple's massive orb is still visible.  Its lustrous black ironwood surface gleams in the sunlight, accented by polished silverwood window frames and sconces.  A bizarre contrast with the errant foliage, indeed."],"exits":[{"to":1050,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1052,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1052,"x":530,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["A black marble birdbath stands in the center of this three-way intersection in the cobble path.  The road is silent now, the various groundskeepers and other temple employees having gone home for the day.  A dedicated monk or priestess bustles by every so often, but naught else disturbs the intersection at this late hour.","A black marble birdbath stands decoratively in the center of this three-way intersection, hurried townsfolk bustling by silently.  Many monks, priestesses, and others dressed in ceremonial garb are likely to be heading to the shrine of their patron deities for a few moments of quiet reflection and respite from the rushing world around them."],"exits":[{"to":1055,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1051,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1053,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1053,"x":510,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["Thorny thistles skirt the northern border of the freshly-swept cobbled path, covered with bright purple and yellow flowers.  The prickly foliage hasn't discouraged the animal life, for a startled chittering sounds from beneath one bush as footsteps pass by.","Thorny thistles skirt the northern border of the freshly-swept cobbled path, bare of their leaves and flowers in the cold winds.  The prickly foliage hasn't discouraged the animal life, for a startled chittering sounds from beneath one bush as footsteps pass by."],"exits":[{"to":1052,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1054,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1054,"x":490,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Southwest Tower","descriptions":["The cobblestone path winds to a close before the massive black tower that looms to the west.  Surely built with strategic defense in mind, this construct arcs outward into the northeastern sky.  Several walkways extend from it to the other two towers in a spidery weblike pattern with the temple itself serving as the nexus point."],"exits":[{"to":1053,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1080,"exit":"go","move":"go white cottage"}],"aliases":["Southwest Tower"]},
  {"id":1055,"x":530,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Beside a Stream","descriptions":["Water tumbles over rounded stones in the stream that borders the gravel path.  A dense bramble thicket, dark and impenetrable, towers over the path, while on the other side of the stream, the fragrance of roses drifts on the wind from the wedding glade to the northeast.  The temple rises in the distance, its spherical surface like an eye constantly watching over its children as they scurry about their daily tasks."],"exits":[{"to":1059,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1052,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1056,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1056,"x":510,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Courtyard","descriptions":["The cobblestone path comes to a fork here, flanking a large shade tree to the east that grows amidst a lush garden of brilliant floral blooms in a veritable rainbow of color.  This garden has been well-tended by the temple groundskeepers, the carefully pruned bushes and healthy vibrant flowers being no accident of nature.","The cobblestone path comes to a fork here, flanking a large bare tree to the east growing amidst a garden standing fallow in the winter cold.  This garden has been well-tended by the temple groundskeepers, the carefully pruned bushes and composted flower beds waiting only for spring warmth to bring them back to vibrant life."],"exits":[{"to":1058,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1055,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1057,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1057,"x":490,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Beside the Bathing Pool","descriptions":["A tiny rivulet of crystal-blue water babbles through the area, arcing outward from the pond to the south.  Independent of the miniature stream, a luxurious marble bath has been placed amidst a garden of fresh sirese blooms, flanked with ivory statues carved in the shape of graceful swans.  Several large stone pots stand beside the statues, placed conveniently to replenish the waters of the bathing pool when the sun's rays cause it to thirst.","A thin rivulet of frozen water streaks through the area, arcing outward from the pond to the south.  Independent of the frigidly stagnant stream, a marble bath lies empty amidst a patch of barren ground, the sirese blooms absent in the winter frost.  Ivory statues carved into the shape of swans take on a quality of despair, their usually graceful forms covered with a burdensome layer of snow, icicles hanging from their beaks and wings.  Several stone pots stand in a lonely row, full of freshly fallen snow.  ","A tiny rivulet of crystal-blue water babbles through the area, arcing outward from the pond to the south.  Independent of the miniature stream, a luxurious marble bath has been placed amidst a garden of fresh sirese blooms, flanked with ivory statues carved in the shape of graceful swans.  Several large stone pots stand beside the statues, placed conveniently to replenish the waters of the bathing pool when the sun's rays cause it to thirst.  "],"exits":[{"to":1056,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1079,"exit":"go","move":"go marble bath"}]},
  {"id":1058,"x":530,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Garden","descriptions":["A veritable forest of color explodes before you as the cobbled path comes to an end amidst this lush garden, blooms of every flower imaginable skirting the path.  The vegetation here is oddly vibrant year round, as if bolstered by some subtle vein of life energy itself."],"exits":[{"to":1056,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Garden","vela'tohr plant","Eaadrich"]},
  {"id":1059,"x":550,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Wedding Glade","descriptions":["A stately white marble reception hall stands to the north, slightly eclipsing your view of the majestic orb-like temple that paints the backdrop of the northeastern sky from this vantage point.  The pungent smell of freshly-cut foliage wells up in your nostrils, wafting over from a cobblestone path that leads to the northwest, beneath a whitewashed latticework archway.  A thick patch of brambles obscures all vision to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":1060,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1055,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1081,"exit":"go","move":"go reception hall"},{"to":1231,"exit":"go","move":"go latticework archway"}]},
  {"id":1060,"x":570,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Wedding Glade","descriptions":["The picturesque wedding chapel stands to the north, its vaulted steeple rising up to pierce the looming orb of the temple in the distance.  Several lush bushes, pruned to perfection, flank a pair of oaken double doors leading into the formal house of worship, bearing a crop of pristine white roses."],"exits":[{"to":1059,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1084,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":1061,"x":810,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["A small wooden shrine lies to the north of the cobblestone road, the southern side of the path cradled by the protective walls surrounding the grounds area.  A stubby stool stands before the shrine, allowing one to sit and seek audience with their deity."],"exits":[{"to":1062,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1049,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1062,"x":870,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["Large mounds are scattered about in the grassy earth to the north of the cobblestone road, and a tall tree flanks the path to the west as it curves.  The mounds are home to the furry inhabitants of the temple grounds -- ever meddlesome pests to those who work to keep the foliage lush and alive.","The cobblestone path is littered with slush and a crunchy coating of frost as it winds through the temple grounds.  A large tree flanks the path to the west, laden with a thick covering of icicles.","A small host of burrows in the grassy earth directly north of the cobblestone road suddenly bustles with activity as you approach, small furry creatures retreating into their respective dens.  A pile of walnuts lies at the foot of a large tree to the west, apparently forgotten by the foraging animals in their mad scramble to safety."],"exits":[{"to":1063,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1061,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":1063,"x":950,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Memorial Shrine","descriptions":["The cobblestone intersection lies silent, the normally bustling traffic dispersed until dawn inevitably abates the dusk.  A broken statue stands in the middle of the intersection, wreathed in the cold, shadowy night air.  A scene of despair and sorrow, one might wonder what the statue looked like in its former glory.","This broad cobblestone intersection bustles with traffic as people scurry about their daily routine.  Amidst all the confusion, a lone marble statue stands in disarray, its surface cracked and broken from some cataclysmic battle.  Perhaps once a statue depicting one of the Fae, this work of art is now but a sundered monument to blasphemy.  A single wing is left intact, its drooping form seeming to point downward, bringing subtle attention to a glass box lying at the feet of the statue."],"exits":[{"to":1066,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1064,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1062,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Memorial Shrine"]},
  {"id":1064,"x":970,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Memorial Shrine","descriptions":["The deserted cobblestone path is bordered to the north by a small circle of sooty marble, creating an odd sort of shrine illuminated by the pale silver starlight.  A quietness settles over this solemn memorial of destruction.","A small shrine surrounded by a low fence of soot-covered marble rubble lies to the north, apparently commemerating some horrid disaster of the past.  Priestesses, monks, and acolytes alike bustle by hurriedly, averting their eyes with a painful grimace."],"exits":[{"to":1065,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1063,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1077,"exit":"go","move":"go memorial shrine"}]},
  {"id":1065,"x":990,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Southeast Tower","descriptions":["Gracefully-carved silverwillow accents adorn the giant ironwood tower, giving it a less ominous appearance.  The giant structure arcs up and to the northwest, reaching for the temple as a newborn reaches for the comfort of its mother."],"exits":[{"to":1064,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Southeast Tower"]},
  {"id":1066,"x":950,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["The East Tower is a short distance to the southeast from here, stretching up and out above you to grasp toward the beacon area atop the temple.  A network of frighteningly thin catwalks stretches between the temple and its three towers, as people who appear to be the size of silverfish scurry to and fro upon them."],"exits":[{"to":1067,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1063,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1067,"x":950,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cobblestone Path","descriptions":["The cobbled path meanders north and south here, creeping between the curving black ironwood walls of the temple off to the west and the massive granite outer wall directly to the east.  Colorful bursts of vibrant wildflowers have exploded in the lush green summer grass to either side of the path.","The cobbled path meanders north and south here, creeping between the curving black ironwood walls of the temple off to the west and the massive granite outer wall directly to the east."],"exits":[{"to":1068,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1066,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1068,"x":950,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Cemetery Approach","descriptions":["The cobbled path sinks into the ground to the northwest, giving way to a trail of black gravel that crunches audibly with every footstep, no matter how light.  A large recess that has been carved out of the wall to the east appears to serve as the starting point for funeral processions.  To the west, a black steel-plate fence blocks the cemetery from sight."],"exits":[{"to":1069,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1067,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1070,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1069,"x":970,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Mourner's Hollow","descriptions":["This large recess within the eastern wall surrounding the temple grounds area is shrouded in black silken and velvet tapestries, marking the occasion of mourning.  A pristine white marble bier standing flush against the east wall serves to hold the body of the beloved aloft during the ceremonial blessing.  The somber sculpture of a woman is suspended upon the wall above the bier, her gaze affixed down at where the deceased are laid."],"exits":[{"to":1068,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Mourner's Hollow"]},
  {"id":1070,"x":830,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Gate of The Mourned","descriptions":["A pathway of crunching black gravel stretches out to the northwest with a black ironwood tower in the distance, looming behind the temple itself.  A freshly-oiled steel gate stands sentry to the west, guarding the temple's small cemetery."],"exits":[{"to":1068,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1071,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1073,"exit":"go","move":"go steel gate"}]},
  {"id":1071,"x":790,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Gravel Trail","descriptions":["This side of the temple is poorly lit beneath the dusky shroud that has snuffed the sun's fire for the evening.  Shadows seem to move of their own accord, whirling about in the corner of your eye, but halting their dance the moment one attempts to catch them.  The looming branches of a tree to the west stretch out attempting to grasp at anyone that may happen to cross this path.","A tall green silverwillow tree rises to the west of the black gravel pathway, enjoying the cool shadow cast by the temple.  A small nest of woven sticks and twigs lies in the crook of the tree, wedged between a thick branch and the light silvery bark of the trunk.  To the northwest, the North Tower stands sentry, guarding the temple's back.","A tall silverwillow tree rises to the west of the black gravel pathway, branches barren in the winter cold and shivering in the mammoth shadow cast by the temple.  A small abandoned nest of woven sticks and twigs lies in the crook of the tree, wedged between a thick branch and the light silvery bark of the trunk.  To the northwest, the North Tower stands sentry, guarding the temple's back."],"exits":[{"to":1070,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1072,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1072,"x":750,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, North Tower","descriptions":["The rocky path of black volcanic gravel draws to a close, a somber carpet before the Northern sentinel tower.  The thick black ironwood outer walls curve sharply behind the structure to seal off the temple grounds, banded with steel for extra reinforcement to ward off a possible siege."],"exits":[{"to":1071,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1234,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doorway"}],"aliases":["North Tower"]},
  {"id":1073,"x":770,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Cemetery, Road of the Dead","descriptions":["Somber rows of statues and modestly marked graves line the pathway here, leading westward from under the steel gate to the east, deeper within the heart of the small cemetery."],"exits":[{"to":1074,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1070,"exit":"go","move":"go steel gate"}]},
  {"id":1074,"x":750,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Cemetery, Crystal Spire","descriptions":["The cemetery lies in eerie silence beneath the vacant cloak of night.  Shadows wreathe the ring of gravestones and statues gathered about a large crystal spire that rises up from the ground in the center of the area.","A crystalline obelisk juts upward from the ground in the middle of the dirt pathway.  Rows of granite gravestones and marble statues have been set up in a circular pattern, with the unlit spire as their epicenter."],"exits":[{"to":1076,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1073,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1075,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Cemetery","Crystal Spire","Spire","Khurek"]},
  {"id":1075,"x":730,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Cemetery, Unmarked Graves","descriptions":["This small plot at the corner of the cemetery seems to be laid out for those who could not afford much ceremony, the dismal resting place of the poor and forgotten.  A small wicker basket has been placed on a bulging unmarked grave, filled with vegetables in offering, or perhaps apology, to a lost loved one."],"exits":[{"to":1074,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Unmarked Graves"]},
  {"id":1076,"x":750,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Cemetery, Memorial of The Beloved","descriptions":["Rows of bejewelled marble statues crowd against the cemetery path, their night-shrouded visages glowering forth at all who pass by.  An eerie sense of unrest lies with the gem-encrusted gargoyles, as if plotting in silence to rise up against those that intrude upon their domain.","The daylight brings a gentle lifelike quality to rows of bejewelled marble statues that have been placed here in memory of relatives and friends who have passed along to their journey upon the Starry Road.  Professionally chiseled marble headstones prominently mark each grave in this small cluster."],"exits":[{"to":1074,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Memorial of The Beloved"]},
  {"id":1077,"x":970,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Memorial Shrine","descriptions":["A large stone pillar rises in the center of this shrine, surrounded by a ring of sooty marble rubble, the walls of some grand structure of yore.  Delicate colored tiles have been inset upon the pillar in a valiant restoration of a destroyed mosaic, possibly belonging to a place of worship in days past."],"exits":[{"to":1064,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1078,"x":730,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Guidepost","descriptions":["A rich mahogany counter covered in neatly arranged stacks of parchment fills the small, yet well-kept cottage.  A pleasant demeanored monk garbed in crisp white linen robes stands just behind the counter, awaiting patrons."],"exits":[{"to":1048,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1079,"x":470,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Bathing Pool","descriptions":["The luxurious marble bathing pool lies sunken snugly into the earth, surrounded by a fresh garden of fragrant sirese blooms.  Butterflies, bees, and all species of small woodland creatures approach the garden now and then, creating a gentle atmosphere of nature and serenity secluded from the bustling cacophony of the city.  The pool is currently bone dry, all of the water having evaporated.","The luxurious marble bathing pool lies beneath a deathly pall of frost and ice.  The water has been completely emptied from the pool to avoid cracking the delicate marble as it expands in the freezing process.  Surrounding the bath is a rather forlorn-looking garden, barren in the winter months and dusted with a faint snowy powder.  ","The luxurious marble bathing pool lies sunken snugly into the earth, surrounded by a fresh garden of fragrant sirese blooms.  Butterflies, bees, and all species of small woodland creatures approach the garden now and then, creating a gentle atmosphere of nature and serenity secluded from the bustling cacophony of the city.  The shimmering pearlescent waters of the pool are currently full, a gentle steamy fog rising up from them as they lap around you.  ","The luxurious marble bathing pool lies sunken snugly into the earth, surrounded by a fresh garden of fragrant sirese blooms.  Butterflies, bees, and all species of small woodland creatures approach the garden now and then, creating a gentle atmosphere of nature and serenity secluded from the bustling cacophony of the city.  The glassy, still waters of the pool are currently very full, shining with a luminous silver glow beneath the gentle starlight.  "],"exits":[{"to":1057,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Bathing Pool"]},
  {"id":1080,"x":470,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Temple Grounds, Scriptorium","descriptions":["This tiny one-room cottage is quite cramped amidst all the clutter that has been packed into it.  An oversized oak desk dominates the northern side of the room, just beneath a lustrous silver placard that displays several parchment titles and their prices.  Various cases built to hold delicate papers have been piled atop shelves and racks that flank the desk, while the larger ones hang in display upon the wall."],"exits":[{"to":1054,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Scriptorium"]},
  {"id":1081,"x":550,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Reception Hall, Foyer","descriptions":["The bright light of glass-chambered lamps in silver sconces along the walls fills the room.  Vibrantly colored velvet ribbons streaming down the walls create a riot of color that contrasts sharply against the smooth white marble.  Scattered haphazardly along the floor surrounding several low birch tables are piles of velvet cushions in aquatic tones that complement the silvery grey tapestry rugs spread beneath them."],"exits":[{"to":1059,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1082,"exit":"go","move":"go painted archway"},{"to":1235,"exit":"go","move":"go velvet curtain"}]},
  {"id":1082,"x":550,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Reception Hall, Refreshments","descriptions":["Garlands of richly hued wildflowers braided with ivy hang from the pure white walls, filling the room with a gentle, lingering fragrance.  More garlands, woven with blue and silver ribbons that dangle nearly to the polished marble floors, are draped along the edges of the polished rosewood table and bar.  Near a festively painted archway leading to the foyer sits a rosewood cart festooned with multicolored streamers and covered with refreshments befitting the god of levity."],"exits":[{"to":1083,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1081,"exit":"go","move":"go painted archway"}]},
  {"id":1083,"x":570,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Reception Hall, Ballroom","descriptions":["Polished walnut floors spread across the length of this chamber.  Chips of lighter wood inlaid in its center form an intricate mosaic, mirrored directly above in a majestic circular skylight set in the vaults of the arching ceiling.  Dozens of streamers in aquatic colors hanging to each side of the stage provide a vibrant backdrop for several ornate statues of alabaster fae.  Breezes sweeping through open windows into the room stir the silk streamers to surround the statues in their own aerial dance."],"exits":[{"to":1082,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1084,"x":590,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Chapel, Foyer","descriptions":["Sunlight filters through skylights in the vaulted ash ceilings above, reflecting off pristine white walls.  Its bright radiance falls upon the tapestries, hung to each side of passages leading to the north and south, whose hues echo those of a lavishly embroidered white velvet carpet spreading across the floor.  Guarding a tall silverwillow archway are two alabaster statues wound with tendrils of malachite ivy, while mirroring it to the west is a pair of oaken doors leading back outside.","Candlelight flickers with warm luminance off the graceful figures of two statues guarding a silverwillow archway, diffusing the shadows found in the hours of darkness.  More candlelight pools from passages to the north and south, highlighting the edges of tapestries hung to either side of them.  Opposite the archway, a pair of large oaken doors reveals the way back outside."],"exits":[{"to":1085,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1086,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1089,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow archway"},{"to":1060,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken doors"}]},
  {"id":1085,"x":590,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Chapel, Groom's Chambers","descriptions":["Sunlight catches on the burbling surface of a brook that can be seen through a pair of panoramic windows to the north.  Cast into shadow between them is a polished mahogany desk framed by the dark velvet curtains.  A deep brown leather couch dominates the wall to one side, its dark hue matching those of soft armchairs scattered around it.  In their midst is a low mahogany table topped with glass.  A soft silvery grey carpet spreads along the floor underfoot.","The light of the many silver candelabras fills the room with its warm glow.  Surrounding a low mahogany table is a soft couch and several deep brown leather armchairs sitting upon a silvery grey carpet.  A matching mahogany desk sits between two panoramic windows along the northern wall, its panes now dimmed with night."],"exits":[{"to":1084,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1087,"exit":"go","move":"go small door"}]},
  {"id":1086,"x":590,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Chapel, Bride's Chamber","descriptions":["The pale hues of the tapestries and velvet carpet reflect the light washing through two large windows along the southern wall.  Piles of velvet and tasseled cushions tossed on the floor bathe in a pool of sunlight, clustering around a low glass-topped ash table.  On the other side of the windows, a cheval mirror is poised to reflect the image of the bride and her attendants, with a carved ash vanity beside it for last-minute adjustments to hair and accessories.","The glass windows now lay dark, glinting with the flickering glow of the lit candelabras sitting upon nearly every available surface.  Surrounding a low ash table topped with an etched glass pane are dozens of soft velvet cushions in shades of ivory and gold.  A tall ash-framed mirror stands next to a vanity on the other side of the room."],"exits":[{"to":1084,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1087,"exit":"go","move":"go small door"}]},
  {"id":1087,"x":610,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Chapel, Dais","descriptions":["Sunlight sets the panes of a large stained glass window afire with vibrant colors.  Standing before it like a pale ghost is a white marble altar framed by descending rows of tall white candles held in the arms of dancing alabaster fae.  Across the length of the dais lays a soft white velvet carpet embroidered with subtle golden threads that shimmer slightly where touched by the light.","Golden light shines upon the faces and arms of dancing alabaster fae from the wax candles they hold in their grasp as they stand to each side of a low white marble altar.  Behind the altar is a darkened stained glass window, its colors still rich even when dimmed by night.  Across the length of the dais lays a soft white velvet carpet embroidered with subtle golden threads that shimmer slightly where touched by the light."],"exits":[{"to":1088,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":1088,"x":630,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Chapel, Seating","descriptions":["Sunlight from the southern windows falls upon rows of padded oak benches facing the eastern end of the chamber.  An aisle carpeted with white velvet makes a straight path between them to a wide, brightly illuminated dais.","The resplendent glow of dozens of candles sitting in tall candelabras chases away the shadows that come with the night.  Between the rows of padded oak benches facing the east end of the chamber is a carpeted aisle leading to a wide, brightly lit dais."],"exits":[{"to":1089,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1089,"x":610,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Chapel, Atrium","descriptions":["Sunlight dapples the patterned marble floor as it shines through arching windows to the north and south that offer a wide view of the temple gardens.  Two long tables sit sheltered by the undrawn curtains between them, covered wth an array of light refreshments and freshly picked flowers.  Next to a pair of oaken doors leading deeper into the chapel is a wrought iron stairway, the bottom steps carefully roped off to prevent outsiders from entering.","The darkened windows glisten with the reflected glow of many candles, faintly throwing back the radiance to futher illuminate the room.  Two tables sitting in the shelter of the undrawn curtains between them offer a light array of refreshments and fresh flowers.  Almost hidden in the shadow of a pair of large oaken doors, a wrought iron stairway leads to the higher levels of the chapel."],"exits":[{"to":1084,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow archway"},{"to":1088,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow doors"}]},
  {"id":1090,"x":750,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Li Stil rae Kwego ia Kweld","descriptions":["Fragrant smoke drifts from censers to carry periodic ripples of sound from the rooms beyond, bringing the silvery chime of bells and rhythmic cadence of chant to rise and fall in the air like the heartbeat of the Temple itself.  An ivory rug cloaks the floor, surrounding an altar of translucent obsidian swirled with fiery highlights.  Stained-glass gaethzen orbs circle the altar with a misty nimbus of violet light shading to crimson and then to amber and gold -- the colors of dawn and of life renewed."],"exits":[{"to":1049,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":1091,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1100,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Resurrection Creche","favor altar","depart"]},
  {"id":1091,"x":674,"y":-62,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Chamber of Rains","descriptions":["Softly luminous gaethzen orbs hang suspended from polished brass chains.  The delicate-looking globes are draped with gauzy fabric in a myriad of soft blues and greens.  The veined granite of the far wall has been chiseled into a three-dimensional mural resembling lush foliage.  Gentle pattering laughter of a spring shower fills the room as water from a hidden source cascades in wide rivulets down the sculpted flora.  Large tapestry cushions carpet the floor with embroidered verdure."],"exits":[{"to":1092,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1090,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}],"aliases":["Chamber of Rains"]},
  {"id":1092,"x":623,"y":-122,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hallway","descriptions":["Hanging from a golden brazier is a colorful wreath of branches bearing dark green leaves.  Sprinkled amongst the verdant boughs are pea-sized dirdel flowers of fiery red bearing triangular silver foliage.  The wreath adds a bit of color to the hallway of drab white."],"exits":[{"to":1093,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1091,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1093,"x":610,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hearth Chamber","descriptions":["Flames crackle merrily in a large circular fireplace set upon an elevated flagstone dais in the center of the room.  A wrought iron hood is attached to a ventilation shaft which rises upward, leading to a grate on the far wall.  Fine mesh screens enclose the blaze, intricate patterns in the links forming the shadowy images of the thirteen avatars.  Richly woven panels of warm russet wool trimmed with heavy gold braid line the stone walls.  Thick black bearskin rugs carpet the floor beneath leather divans."],"exits":[{"to":1094,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1092,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}],"aliases":["Hearth Chamber"]},
  {"id":1094,"x":644,"y":-272,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hallway","descriptions":["The long, slightly turning, white plaster walls are interrupted by a mahogany staircase leading upward.  The granite floor is slightly scuffed here, perhaps by the countless feet that have trodden upon it, or perhaps by some heavy object having been pushed along."],"exits":[{"to":1095,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1093,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1101,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany staircase","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":1095,"x":711,"y":-314,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hallway","descriptions":["A golden candelabra, its treasured flame flickering in the passing breeze of each supplicant moving through the temple halls, casts a soft glow about the curving corridor.  The evened floor of cold granite absorbs what little warmth and comfort the tiny blaze gives off."],"exits":[{"to":1096,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1094,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1096,"x":789,"y":-314,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hallway","descriptions":["Flanked on either side by white plaster barriers, this smooth granite floor displays the image of a painted starburst pattern.  In the center of the bright red ornamentation, a white flower blooms as though newly touched by spring."],"exits":[{"to":1097,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1095,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1097,"x":850,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hallway","descriptions":["A low relief has been carefully carved into the rough granite overlooking a mostly nondescript arch, and through the wide arch the twisting granite-hewn steps of an ascending staircase can be seen.  The protruding depictions of the relief portray a group of people before what may be the sun."],"exits":[{"to":1098,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1096,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1102,"exit":"go","move":"go stairs","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":1098,"x":889,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Triage Hall","descriptions":["This brightly-lit interior is devoid of decoration, the utilitarian design allowing healers to focus on evaluating the wounded.  Patients are directed toward treatment according to severity and degree of life threat, and straw-filled pallets line the perimeter of the room for the most severe cases.  The walls have been scrubbed clean, their faint citrus smell not quite masking the coppery scent of blood.  Fresh rushes spread across the floor help to absorb the inevitable spills of bodily fluids."],"exits":[{"to":1099,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1097,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}],"aliases":["Triage Hall"]},
  {"id":1099,"x":877,"y":-122,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Hallway","descriptions":["The smooth arcing is just barely noticeable in the oblique hallway extending throughout the lower walls of the temple.  The curving white plaster partitions enclosing the corridor are adorned in spots by brown woolen tapestries depicting scenes ranging from a prostrate monk to a rearing unicorn."],"exits":[{"to":1100,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1098,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1100,"x":826,"y":-62,"z":0,"title":"Resurrection Creche, Dispensary","descriptions":["A bustle of activity greets each fresh arrival of wounded.  Long rows of narrow cots covered with immaculate white linen are reserved for recovering patients.  Empaths move efficiently through the room, offering words of comfort as they check on the status of their charges.  The smooth granite walls are adorned along the upper border with a brightly painted plaster frieze depicting long garlands of medicinal herbs interspersed with jadice flowers."],"exits":[{"to":1090,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1099,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}],"aliases":["Dispensary"]},
  {"id":1101,"x":889,"y":-260,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Twin plaster columns rise on either side of a descending stairway, supporting the spheriform walls.  Along the inner curve of the hallway, an arched mahogany entrance leads to a white marble walkway that spans the distance between the circular rim and the High Altar at the center of the Temple."],"exits":[{"to":1094,"exit":"go","move":"go winding stairway","hidden":true},{"to":1103,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1112,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1129,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany arch"}]},
  {"id":1102,"x":611,"y":-260,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Four beautifully detailed figures grace this intersection in the circular hallway.  Two mahogany carvings join in a proud arch, establishing an exquisitely veneered frame for the awe-inspiring view of the High Altar.  Glowing softly in the sunlight, the Altar is joined to the rim by a long gracious grey marble causeway, its tiles meeting up at the threshold of the arch.  Opposing the walkway, two molded plaster columns stand guard above a set of stairs which descends along the curve of the sphere."],"exits":[{"to":1097,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs","hidden":true},{"to":1110,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1109,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1126,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany arch"}]},
  {"id":1103,"x":910,"y":-180,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Flickering torches secured in iron sconces illuminate a sprawling mural upon the walls.  Panoramic images depict a gathering of diverse figures joined in concentric circles about a large white boulder resting at the center of a forest clearing.  The pristine surface of the monolithic stone is scorched with a totemic simulacrum of a great horned owl in flight."],"exits":[{"to":1104,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1101,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1104,"x":889,"y":-100,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Curiously elusive, a faint musty smell intrudes upon an otherwise elegant hallway.  An antique crystal chandelier emits a warm golden glow that caresses everything from the central wooden pedestal to the narrow wooden staircase that ascends the outside wall."],"exits":[{"to":1105,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1103,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1130,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":1105,"x":830,"y":-41,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["A fresh breeze wafts along the passage, bringing with it the gentle but fragrant scents of the garden.  Along the outside wall, a long curving planter filled with rich soil provides a tiny sanctuary for young saplings to grow.  Standing protectively in front of them, a mahogany pedestal rises like a monument to its living brethren."],"exits":[{"to":1106,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1104,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1106,"x":750,"y":-20,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["Light flows like a stream from beyond a large archway, enveloping the entire entrance hall with radiance.  Beautifully carved pillars stand on either side of the arch, greeting visitors and monks that make their way towards the center of the globe.  Curving along the outer wall of the Temple, long plaster hallways with polished mahogany floors lead worshippers clockwise and widdershins around the sphere."],"exits":[{"to":1107,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1113,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany pillars"},{"to":1230,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"},{"to":1105,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}],"aliases":["Entrance Hall"]},
  {"id":1107,"x":670,"y":-41,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Serene white plaster walls curve along the narrow temple passage, bowing up to the ceiling in a gentle arc.  Not a pinch of dust or dirt can be seen in the hall -- even the walls have been scrubbed to perfection.  Reflecting every movement, the immaculate low-lustre floors dance with hazy images of monks as they pass on their way to prayer.  In the center of the room is a small wooden pedestal, its surface guarded by a flawless glass case."],"exits":[{"to":1108,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1106,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1106,"exit":"go","move":"double doors"}]},
  {"id":1108,"x":611,"y":-100,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Polished wooden floors meet a sweeping staircase which rises along the outer wall.  Clerics in colorful robes pass through the corridor or on the stairs, their footsteps echoing with a natural rhythm.  In the center of the passage, a pedestal sits on a tiny dais.  Illuminated by strategically placed mirrors behind the candle sconces, the pedestal demands attention, reaching out to onlookers as if it had a story to tell."],"exits":[{"to":1109,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1107,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1131,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":1109,"x":590,"y":-180,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Light streams out from a torch set into a pedestal in the center of the room, creating distorted shadows on the curved walls.  Securely mounted along the outer curve is a display of battle-worn weapons, all old but obviously well cared for.  The presence of such items within the peaceful solemnity of the Temple acts as a grim reminder of the dangers in the outside world."],"exits":[{"to":1102,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1108,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1110,"x":670,"y":-319,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["The ceiling fixture in this room has not been lit, giving the hallway a darkened appearance.  Along the inner wall, a square patch of floorboards has a dull finish, unlike the polished wood which gleams through the rest of the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":1111,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1102,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1111,"x":750,"y":-340,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Accented by the lingering smell of wood oils, the slippery surface of the glossy mahogany flooring reflects the hallway's illumination like carefully polished armor.  Standing guard in the center of the room is a simple wooden pedestal, shielding its display beneath a thin glass case."],"exits":[{"to":1112,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1110,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1112,"x":830,"y":-319,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Hallway","descriptions":["Candles glow softly behind stained-glass holders in the sconces along the walls, sending beacons of red and blue light dancing along the curve of the hallway.  Shadows pool sullenly along the baseboards and floor, driven down by the vivid illumination higher on the walls to meld with the dark wooden floorboards.  Tiny droplets of paint have been speckled into the floor's finish, spreading out from the base of the pedestal like miniature stars in a mahogany sky."],"exits":[{"to":1101,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1111,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1113,"x":750,"y":-48,"z":1,"title":"The Crossing Temple, Main Arch","descriptions":["Beneath the main arch, this alcove offers an awe-inspiring view of the High Altar.  A black marble promenade sweeps between two of the vast step-like seating areas as it heads towards a circular platform in the center of the domed sphere.  Prismatic light beams down upon the altar from above, its illumination stretching though the main arch, embracing everyone entering the Temple.  Beneath the apex of the arch is a golden basin set upon a humble wooden pedestal."],"exits":[{"to":1106,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany pillars"},{"to":1114,"exit":"go","move":"go alabaster arch"}],"aliases":["holy water basin","basin"]},
  {"id":1114,"x":750,"y":-76,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Dark Promenade","descriptions":["Toward the south, an alabaster archway has been inlaid with highly polished onyx to form the image of a spiked mace in low relief.  A mahogany pedestal cradling a shallow basin is visible beyond the arch, while in the opposite direction, black marble tiles line the ground between pale walls of granite and lead toward the temple's High Altar."],"exits":[{"to":1115,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1113,"exit":"go","move":"go alabaster arch"}]},
  {"id":1115,"x":750,"y":-104,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Dark Promenade","descriptions":["The sound of footsteps against black marble is trapped by the tall granite walls, sending a haunting echo down the length of the promenade.  Beams of light cast down from the temple's great skylight glint off the surfaces of the passage in cool luminescent streams, emphasizing a stark contrast between the dark marble underfoot and the pale grey stone that rises upward on either side."],"exits":[{"to":1116,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1114,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1116,"x":750,"y":-132,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Dark Promenade","descriptions":["The marble-tiled passage continues its path between the grey granite walls.  High above, rows of mahogany benches are visible as they sweep upward toward the rim of circular chamber.  Lining the promenade, murals have been etched into the stone's surface, depicting stylized renditions of the negative aspects of the Thirteen."],"exits":[{"to":1117,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1115,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1117,"x":750,"y":-160,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Dark Promenade","descriptions":["A circular mosaic formed of interlaced black, white and grey marble tiles cascades from the base of a granite platform.  A torrent of black marble streams out of the tiling, cutting through great walls of granite to form passage toward an archway to the south."],"exits":[{"to":1118,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1116,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1122,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1123,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"}]},
  {"id":1118,"x":770,"y":-160,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Southeast Stairway","descriptions":["Seamlessly arranged around the altar platform to the northwest, tiles of white, black, and grey circle gracefully beneath the colorful Eyes of the Thirteen.  Rising with solemn pride, a line of granite stairs climbs the distance between this promenade and the ring of six arches far above, granting access to the upper levels of the temple as well as the southeastern seating areas."],"exits":[{"to":1119,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1117,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1123,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"},{"to":1225,"exit":"climb","move":"climb granite stairway"}]},
  {"id":1119,"x":770,"y":-200,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Light Promenade","descriptions":["A circle of small marble tiles has been laid over the floor surrounding a low grey platform, forming an exquisitely patterned mosaic of grey, black and white.  At this end of the promenade, the white marble streams out of the tiling and extends across the passage as it cuts northeast through the curving granite that rises above on either side."],"exits":[{"to":1127,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1118,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1120,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1123,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"}]},
  {"id":1120,"x":750,"y":-200,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, North Stairway","descriptions":["Square tiles of white, black, and grey circle around the raised altar to the south, every footstep quietly sounding beneath the watchful gaze of the Thirteen.  Rising with steady confidence, a line of granite stairs climbs the distance between this walkway and a ring of arches far above, allowing access to the upper levels of the temple, as well as the coliseum-style seating areas."],"exits":[{"to":1119,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1121,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1123,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"},{"to":1201,"exit":"climb","move":"climb granite stairway"}]},
  {"id":1121,"x":730,"y":-200,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Grey Promenade","descriptions":["Upon a granite platform rests a metallic altar, its stone base surrounded by a mosaic formed of grey, white and black marble.  Underfoot, grey marble extends from the tiling and cascades to the northwest as smooth as a stream toward a mahogany arch.  Tall walls of granite are visible a few paces down the passage, rising on either side to form the promenade."],"exits":[{"to":1120,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1122,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1124,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1123,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"}]},
  {"id":1122,"x":730,"y":-160,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Southwest Stairway","descriptions":["Tiles of grey, white, and black scatter around the altar platform to the northeast, every footstep resounding softly beneath the vigilant gaze of the Thirteen.  Rising with solemn pride, a line of granite stairs climbs the distance between this promenade and a ring of six arches far above, granting access to the upper levels of the temple, as well as the staggered seating areas."],"exits":[{"to":1121,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1117,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1123,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"},{"to":1222,"exit":"climb","move":"climb granite stairway"}]},
  {"id":1123,"x":750,"y":-180,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, The High Altar","descriptions":["The gentle touch of the sun is caught by the temple's great skylight high overhead, falling in rays of prismatic light upon a large metallic altar poised on this pale granite platform.  The varied colors cast down from the domed Eyes of the Thirteen add to the day's brush of illumination, melding softly upon the altar's reflective surface.  From this sacred point, the massive chamber sweeps majestically upwards, stairways and benches rising to meet the archways and domes of light that circle above.","High above, the temple's great iris skylight ushers in the stars' cool illumination, bathing the large metallic altar in pale light.  Drawn as if to a lodestone, soft glints of color from the domed Eyes far overhead lend their prismatic overtones to the clarity of starlight.  Sweeping majestically upwards from this raised platform, the stairways and benches lining the massive chamber dwindle into deepest shadow as they climb to meet the vague outlines of archways arrayed in a surrounding ring far above."],"exits":[{"to":1120,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1119,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1118,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1117,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1122,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1121,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine1-06","Ve Aevan Gaenan","High Altar"]},
  {"id":1124,"x":710,"y":-220,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Grey Promenade","descriptions":["Row upon row of mahogany benches lines the upper edge of the granite walls that border this promenade, marking a gentle slope that curves upward toward the rim of the spherical chamber.  A massive mural has been etched into the entirety of the spacious pale stone, spanning from the grey marble tiles to the upper edge of the wall, stretching so far above that the highest placed carvings slip from focus."],"exits":[{"to":1121,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1125,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1125,"x":690,"y":-240,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Grey Promenade","descriptions":["Glints of light are visible in the distance, reflecting off the High Altar's smooth surface in the center of this cavernous room.  The tall pale granite walls seem to meld into the smooth grey marble underfoot that extends towards a mahogany arch to the northwest and the altar to the southeast."],"exits":[{"to":1124,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1126,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1126,"x":670,"y":-260,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Grey Promenade","descriptions":["The grey stone walls rise to an immense height, dwarfing anyone who stands between their massive countenance.  The murals etched into the walls that depict the neutral emblems of the Thirteen take on an almost overwhelming presence upon the tall slabs of granite, their gaze constant upon all who pass.  In contrast, a mahogany arch beckons silently to the northwest, the wood heavily polished and carved with images of shields overlaid one atop another."],"exits":[{"to":1125,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1102,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany arch"}]},
  {"id":1127,"x":790,"y":-220,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Light Promenade","descriptions":["The white marble passage continues between the tall grey granite walls.  On both sides, images have been carved into the stone, creating an elaborate but elegant mural.  Sconces line the walls, casting a soft glow upon both the etchings and the marble underfoot.  Above, row upon row of mahogany benches lines the great stairways, curving upwards along the sloping granite."],"exits":[{"to":1128,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1119,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":1128,"x":810,"y":-240,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Light Promenade","descriptions":["Drifting gracefully from the great skylight above, pale beams of starlight fall upon the marble tiles and stream across the tall granite walls, lending subtle warmth to the coolness of stone against stone.","Drifting gracefully from the great skylight above, pale beams of sunlight fall upon the white marble tiles and stream across the tall granite walls, lending subtle warmth to the coolness of stone against stone."],"exits":[{"to":1129,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1127,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":1129,"x":830,"y":-260,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Light Promenade","descriptions":["The promenade ends at a mahogany arch, bordered by row upon row of mahogany benches lining the sloping edge of the granite walls.  In the distance, the metallic gleam of the temple's High Altar is visible near the center of the sphere, illuminated by the great skylight high overhead.","The promenade ends at a mahogany arch, bordered by row upon row of mahogany benches lining the sloping edge of the granite walls.  Moonlight streams through the skylight to bathe the temple's High Altar in a soft glow."],"exits":[{"to":1128,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1101,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany arch"}]},
  {"id":1130,"x":871,"y":-313,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway continues its curved passage leading to each of the Eyes of the Thirteen.  A narrow wooden staircase, recessed into one wall, is visible as it curves gently downward toward the lower portions of the temple.  To the northwest within the curving passage, sprinkles of some kind of shimmering purple dust are visible on the floor, adding a remarkable contrast of color against the white plaster walls."],"exits":[{"to":1104,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase","hidden":true},{"to":1135,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1134,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1131,"x":629,"y":-313,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The lacquered mahogany borders that ornament the hallway arc over a break in the curving walls.  Recessed slightly, a staircase curves and vanishes from vision as it gently slopes downwards, faint beams of light visible as they reflect off the surfaces below."],"exits":[{"to":1108,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase","hidden":true},{"to":1132,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1146,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1132,"x":685,"y":-348,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["Warm textured layers of rich dark mahogany frame an archway, beckoning towards a golden-hued marble platform.  The faint glow from within the shrine cascades across the stark white plaster walls, lending its warm glow to this stretch of hallway as it curves its way around the temple."],"exits":[{"to":1133,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1131,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1147,"exit":"go","move":"go framed archway"}]},
  {"id":1133,"x":750,"y":-360,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The lily-white plaster walls gently curve along the corridor, following the spheriform shape of the temple itself.  Through a bleached ash archway along the inner wall, a pale alabaster platform extends out over the High Altar area."],"exits":[{"to":1134,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1132,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1149,"exit":"go","move":"go ash archway"}]},
  {"id":1134,"x":815,"y":-348,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["Lacquered mahogany trim streaks across the bottom of the white plaster wall as it meanders its way around the gentle curvature of the hallway.  A set of wolf prints sprinkled with deep purple alexandrite dust is sculpted into the floor, leading the way into the shrine which lies beyond the polished black granite archway."],"exits":[{"to":1130,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1133,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1151,"exit":"go","move":"go black archway"}]},
  {"id":1135,"x":911,"y":-260,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["Matte black marble rises in a graceful arch leading to the entrance to a shrine.  Steel dagger hilts, their blades buried in the stone, radiate outwards along the curve of the arch, while the keystone is carved with the image of a snarling amber-eyed panther."],"exits":[{"to":1136,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1130,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1153,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"}]},
  {"id":1136,"x":929,"y":-197,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["Finely carved mahogany borders hug the curves of the archway which serves as entrance to the shrine.  A faint corona of ruddy light flows through the arch, bathing the pale paster with a pale reddish tint."],"exits":[{"to":1137,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1135,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1155,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany arch"}]},
  {"id":1137,"x":923,"y":-131,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The pale walls of the hallway curve to each side, reflecting on floors of polished marble tile.  Set into the tiles before the entrance to the Shrine of Mortals is an intricate mosaic crafted from multicolored glass.  Diffused blue light pours through the silver-inlaid mahogany archway, setting the glittering mosaic afire with color."],"exits":[{"to":1138,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1136,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1157,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany archway"}]},
  {"id":1138,"x":894,"y":-72,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The scent of incense from somewhere nearby wafts through the air, filling the space with a mild, sweet aroma.  Revealed by a narrow arch within a section of the curving walls, a narrow staircase flows upwards and disappears above as it arcs up toward the uppermost areas of the temple."],"exits":[{"to":1139,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1137,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1174,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":1139,"x":845,"y":-27,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The curving white plaster walls are tinted a rich luminous green as light flows beneath a gem-encrusted satinwood archway.  Beyond the archway, a silver platform leads out into the Eye of the Serpent."],"exits":[{"to":1140,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1138,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1159,"exit":"go","move":"go satinwood archway"}]},
  {"id":1140,"x":783,"y":-3,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The hallway continues its circular path within the white plaster walls of the temple.  Perfect mirror images, two cresting waves have been inlaid into the tile floor before a narrow archway leading toward a blue crystal platform."],"exits":[{"to":1141,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1139,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1161,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow archway"}]},
  {"id":1141,"x":717,"y":-3,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The cool white walls of the hallway are broken by two pillars of ivory -- a pair of carved mammoth tusks forming an archway to a shrine bathed in amber light."],"exits":[{"to":1142,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1140,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1163,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory arch"}]},
  {"id":1142,"x":655,"y":-27,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["The gentle glow of candlelight emanates from beneath a lacquered oaken archway, causing fickle figures to dance across the delicate white plaster walls."],"exits":[{"to":1143,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1141,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1165,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken archway"}]},
  {"id":1143,"x":606,"y":-72,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["A faint flickering of color and luminescence cascades along the white plaster walls, drifting from the nearby shrines dedicated to the gods and their aspects.  The path of the play of light is broken momentarily as it crosses a narrow archway curving over a staircase leading upwards, deeper into the temple's structure."],"exits":[{"to":1144,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1142,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1173,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"}]},
  {"id":1144,"x":577,"y":-131,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["Rosy light flows into the hallway from a carved white crystal archway, casting a gentle pinkish tint over the white plaster walls.  The faint sound of music echoes through the air."],"exits":[{"to":1145,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1143,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1167,"exit":"go","move":"go white archway"}]},
  {"id":1145,"x":571,"y":-197,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["Curving along pristine walls of white plaster, a reflection of light, emanating from a translucent jade archway, creates a striking contrast between subtle shadow and dominant light.  Claws, carved with a remarkably realistic effect, stand at the base of the archway, warding off some unseen attack."],"exits":[{"to":1146,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1144,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1169,"exit":"go","move":"go jade archway"}]},
  {"id":1146,"x":589,"y":-260,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hallway","descriptions":["This portion of the hallway is dominated by a polished ebony archway that leads into the Shrine of the Void.  Nothing is visible beyond the arch, as the only light which streams out on to the platform is the weak ambient light from down the hall."],"exits":[{"to":1131,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1145,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1171,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony archway"}]},
  {"id":1147,"x":692,"y":-329,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Kertigen's Shrine","descriptions":["Flecks of platinum and gold embedded in the marble floor shimmer softly in the warm serene glow of light filling the area as it seeps through the sunlight-colored dome.  Resting quietly on the end of the platform, a scintillating statue of glimmering crystals and precious metals stands in reverence to the god of riches."],"exits":[{"to":1132,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":1148,"exit":"go","move":"go glittering platform"}],"aliases":["Divyaush","Zachriedek"]},
  {"id":1148,"x":699,"y":-311,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Kertigen","descriptions":["Gazing out over the temple floor, a statue atop the altar rests protected by a fine crystalline dome covering the end of the platform.  The light from the temple, shaded to a rich golden yellow, washes over the heavily adorned sculpture.  Its wealth of gems and precious metals splash tiny reflections on every surface, a sea of shining stars across a sunlit sky."],"exits":[{"to":1147,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Kertigen"]},
  {"id":1149,"x":750,"y":-340,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hodierna's Shrine","descriptions":["The platform is surrounded by a large opaline crystal dome.  Leading out to the hallway of the temple, a bleached ash archway stands as noble sentry, guarding this sacred shrine.  Faint etchings have been made in the pale alabaster floor, leading inward toward the end of the crystal half-sphere."],"exits":[{"to":1133,"exit":"go","move":"go ash archway"},{"to":1150,"exit":"go","move":"go alabaster platform"}],"aliases":["Asketi","Berengaria"]},
  {"id":1150,"x":750,"y":-320,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Hodierna","descriptions":["The air itself seems to glow here as the light from beyond the dome filters through in a luminous blur.  At the end of the platform, nestled up against the crystal, stands a low white marble altar which rises seamlessly upward into a magnificent triptych statue, basking in the nimbus of pearly light that permeates this place."],"exits":[{"to":1149,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Hodierna"]},
  {"id":1151,"x":808,"y":-329,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Meraud's Shrine","descriptions":["Carved alexandrite-dusted wolf prints continue their trek over a black onyx platform, making their way towards a polished granite altar set at the darkened far end.  On either side of the dome are black steel braziers that are lit with eerie purple flames, setting a surreal ambience in the room.  The lighting caresses its way across the four intricate carvings lined on either side of the tracks set into the platform."],"exits":[{"to":1134,"exit":"go","move":"go black archway"},{"to":1152,"exit":"go","move":"go onyx platform"}],"aliases":["Firulf","Kerenhappuch"]},
  {"id":1152,"x":801,"y":-311,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Meraud","descriptions":["The gem-kissed wolf tracks end their journey at an inscription carved before a polished black granite altar veined in deep purple alexandrite.  Sitting on top of the structure is a stunningly detailed statue sculpted from polished granite as dark as the stone from which the altar is made.  Encompassing the platform is a faceted dark crystal dome that refracts the incoming light with the glow coming from the braziers into a dimly hued array of color and shadow."],"exits":[{"to":1151,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Meraud"]},
  {"id":1153,"x":893,"y":-251,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Damaris' Shrine","descriptions":["Walls draped entirely in black silk fill the length of this platform with shadows that shift from ebon to deep azure as light falls from the dome of midnight-blue glass above.  Barely silhouetted in the gloom is the lithe form of a life-sized obsidian panther depicted in full stalk, the great cat seeming to lead the way towards the room beyond.  Someone has placed a garland of scarlet nightshade around its neck, the blossoms gone fiery against the dark, glassy stone of the sculpture."],"exits":[{"to":1135,"exit":"go","move":"go marble arch"},{"to":1154,"exit":"go","move":"go onyx platform"}],"aliases":["Phelim","Dergati"]},
  {"id":1154,"x":875,"y":-242,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Damaris","descriptions":["Filtering through crystalline stars circling the apex of the midnight-blue dome, beams silvered like moonlight edge a graceful obsidian altar at the end of the platform.  Countless bas-relief nightingales swirl up its sides, wings flared and heads flung back in eternal nightsong.  Encircling its base is a ring of shrike skulls, each polished to the warm glow of old ivory and gleaming with opulent rows of tiny jet and lapis beads."],"exits":[{"to":1153,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Damaris"]},
  {"id":1155,"x":909,"y":-195,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Everild's Shrine","descriptions":["Fiery shades of red blaze within the confines of this stark chamber, the light from the temple shining smoothly through the warmth of the crystal resting over the far end the platform.  A gentle tapping whispers throughout the room as a barbed spear suspended from the ceiling strikes softly against a battered shield that hangs above the archway.  Resting silently at the edge of the platform, a statue set in pure silver gazes outward, its vigil over the temple floor below constant and unending."],"exits":[{"to":1136,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":1156,"exit":"go","move":"go crimson-covered platform"}],"aliases":["Kuniyo","Trothfang"]},
  {"id":1156,"x":889,"y":-193,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Everild","descriptions":["Streaks of red tint the fine crystal dome, cascading over the surface of the altar and down to the lip of the platform.  A single white beam of light pokes through a tiny fracture in the crystal, reflecting brightly upon a polished silver statue."],"exits":[{"to":1155,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Everild"]},
  {"id":1157,"x":905,"y":-135,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Truffenyi's Shrine","descriptions":["A silvery blue dome erupts from the wall above, creating a hemisphere to enclose the shrine in hues that mimic the summer sky.  Sunlight filtering through the crystal from the chamber beyond fills the room with a steady glow that sparkles where it touches silver specks in the dark granite platform beneath you.  Sitting near the archway, an obsidian stand is tipped slightly beneath the paws of an impish agate weasel, leaving a silver magpie on top to backwing as its perch is pushed out from under it.","A silvery blue dome erupts from the wall above, creating a hemisphere to enclose the shrine in hues that mimic the summer sky.  Starlight filtering through the crystal from the chamber beyond fills the room with a wan glow that glitters where it touches silver specks in the dark granite platform beneath you.  Sitting near the archway, an obsidian stand is tipped slightly beneath the paws of an impish agate weasel, leaving a silver magpie on top to backwing as its perch is pushed out from under it."],"exits":[{"to":1137,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany archway"},{"to":1158,"exit":"go","move":"go granite platform"}],"aliases":["Alamhif","Huldah"]},
  {"id":1158,"x":885,"y":-142,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Truffenyi","descriptions":["The granite platform sparkles slightly where touched by the diffused light shed by the silvery blue dome.  Silver feathers inlaid in the crystal dapple the surface of a polished granite altar with tiny shadows that almost blend into the stone's already mottled surface.  Rising from the altar's center is an ornately carved triptych statue crafted so seamlessly as to appear an extension of the same stone of the altar."],"exits":[{"to":1157,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Truffenyi"]},
  {"id":1159,"x":834,"y":-44,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Hav'roth's Shrine","descriptions":["The silver platform below you gleams as a sea of liquid emerald, the light striking it tinted by a green crystal half-sphere that encases this small shrine.  Tiny people bustle in and out of the seats in the High Altar chamber below, some likely waiting for the next sermon to begin under the Eyes of the Thirteen."],"exits":[{"to":1139,"exit":"go","move":"go satinwood archway"},{"to":1160,"exit":"go","move":"go silver platform"}],"aliases":["Peri'el","Ushnish"]},
  {"id":1160,"x":824,"y":-61,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Hav'roth","descriptions":["A faceted green crystal dome encases the end of the smooth silver platform, giving the shrine the appearance of being trapped within the delicate crystalline structure of an emerald.  The green glow casts itself throughout, as if the only color ever known to this place.  At the edge of the platform, just against the dome, a bejeweled silver triptych statue rests upon a low altar."],"exits":[{"to":1159,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Hav'roth"]},
  {"id":1161,"x":779,"y":-23,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eluned's Shrine","descriptions":["Glistening like cool water, a blue crystal platform leads toward a coral statue resting deeper within the Shrine of the Ocean Mother.  Fashioned from the same material as the passage underfoot, a great oval dome curves down to cradle the shrine in the deep blue light found within the heart of the sea.  An indigo glaze marks the center of the colored half-sphere above the far statue, as though this were the eye of Eluned herself, gazing down upon the High Altar below."],"exits":[{"to":1162,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal platform"},{"to":1140,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow archway"}],"aliases":["Lemicus","Drogor"]},
  {"id":1162,"x":776,"y":-42,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Eluned","descriptions":["A rose coral statue rises from its altar base as seamlessly as a wave, silhouetted against a large blue crystal dome that juts out toward the center of the temple.  Filling the space with a bluish glow, faint streams of light accent the ridges and valleys along the carving, granting it a sense of motion despite its lifeless structure."],"exits":[{"to":1161,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Eluned"]},
  {"id":1163,"x":721,"y":-23,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Glythtide's Shrine","descriptions":["The arch leading to the hallway is flanked by two large murals depicting key moments in divine history.  They are bathed in a warm amber glow coming from the direction of the platform.  The wash of golden light makes the room seem as if one were viewing it through a mug of pale beer."],"exits":[{"to":1141,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory arch"},{"to":1164,"exit":"go","move":"go platform"}],"aliases":["Saemaus","Smaragdaus","Be'ort"]},
  {"id":1164,"x":724,"y":-42,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Glythtide","descriptions":["A huge ale-brown crystal dome bows out into thin air, providing an amber-tinted view of the chamber below.  Golden light washes over an altar crafted from thick, twisted grapevines sitting at the end of the platform.  A three-part statue rises seamlessly from the top of the altar."],"exits":[{"to":1163,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Glythtide"]},
  {"id":1165,"x":666,"y":-44,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Tamsine's Shrine","descriptions":["A pale golden crystal dome extends outward from the wall to surround the amber platform which stretches out from beneath the lacquered oaken archway.  Two rows of Halfling-high candles line either side of the platform, casting an inviting glow throughout the entire shrine."],"exits":[{"to":1142,"exit":"go","move":"go oaken archway"},{"to":1166,"exit":"go","move":"go amber platform"}],"aliases":["Albreda","Harawep"]},
  {"id":1166,"x":676,"y":-61,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Tamsine","descriptions":["The amber platform ends here, both rows of candles curving around to meet each other behind a low yew altar that stands just before the end of the pale golden crystal dome.  The candlelight gleams brightly against the sloping window, creating an illuminating halo about a yew triptych statue that rests upon the altar."],"exits":[{"to":1165,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Tamsine"]},
  {"id":1167,"x":596,"y":-136,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Faenella's Shrine","descriptions":["Mirrored panels line the reflective glass of the platform, echoing the image of the altar located at the front of the shrine from innumerable different angles.  Light ripples in through the ruby-colored dome that arcs over the shrine, casting everything in the room with a pink hue.  An elaborately carved crystal archway leads into the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":1144,"exit":"go","move":"go white archway"},{"to":1168,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal platform"}],"aliases":["Murrula","Idon"]},
  {"id":1168,"x":615,"y":-142,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Faenella","descriptions":["Bathed in a pale rose hue from the light flowing through the moonlight ruby colored dome, the mirror-paneled chamber reflects multiple images of the carved rosewood statue upon the altar at the edge of the platform."],"exits":[{"to":1167,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Faenella"]},
  {"id":1169,"x":591,"y":-195,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Chadatru's Shrine","descriptions":["Walls of jade edged in mahogany line the shrine, creating the feel of a clouded atmosphere.  Finely carved from mahogany and possessing startling lifelikeness, lions peer out beyond their posts with an eyeless gaze.  Translucent jade forms a platform that extends outward, towards a muted dome, while an archway leads back toward the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":1145,"exit":"go","move":"go jade archway"},{"to":1170,"exit":"go","move":"go jade platform"}],"aliases":["Rutilor","Botolf"]},
  {"id":1170,"x":611,"y":-193,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Chadatru","descriptions":["Formed out of seamless translucent jade-colored crystal, a dome extends out beyond the platform that supports it, drawing in an eerie reflection of light from the exterior of the dome.  Sculpted from jade is a simple altar that extends outward, upon which rests a translucent triptych statue that stands as mute sentry to its surroundings."],"exits":[{"to":1169,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Chadatru"]},
  {"id":1171,"x":607,"y":-251,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Urrem'tier's Shrine","descriptions":["A sea of inky shadows is all that is visible deeper within the black glass dome.  The glossy jet platform gleams with what little light filters through the polished ebony archway that leads back into the temple halls."],"exits":[{"to":1146,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony archway"},{"to":1172,"exit":"go","move":"go jet platform"}],"aliases":["Eylhaar","Aldauth"]},
  {"id":1172,"x":625,"y":-242,"z":3,"title":"Eyes of the Thirteen, Eye of Urrem'tier","descriptions":["The artificial light brought into this chamber seems feeble and choked, as if struggling for its own life amidst the blackness that saturates this small shrine.  A giant obsidian dome envelops the glossy jet platform, trapping the chamber in eternal darkness.  Resting flush up against the dome on the edge of the platform is a low onyx altar upon which rests a strange statue."],"exits":[{"to":1236,"exit":"none","move":"pull silver candlestick"},{"to":1171,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"aliases":["Urrem'tier"]},
  {"id":1173,"x":595,"y":-221,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["The scent of fresh baked bread and a multitude of herbs wafts from a narrow arch as the cramped hallway continues its curved path leading from one section of the monks' quarters to the next.  A niche in one wall leads to a staircase that provides access to the lower sections of the temple."],"exits":[{"to":1143,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase","hidden":true},{"to":1182,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":1183,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow arch"}]},
  {"id":1174,"x":905,"y":-221,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["A panel of glass between the white plaster walls blocks the northern end of the passage.  Various plants growing heartily are visible beyond, the heavy scent of dirt managing to waft its way through and filling the hallway with a metallic, earthy scent."],"exits":[{"to":1138,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase","hidden":true},{"to":1175,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"}]},
  {"id":1175,"x":905,"y":-139,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["A bleached pine door stands silently on the east side of the curved hallway, the scent of amber emanating slightly from the room beyond.  The white plaster ceiling slopes in a gentle curve above the door, bringing attention to a watercolor mural."],"exits":[{"to":1174,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1176,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1180,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":1176,"x":863,"y":-67,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["A bleached pine door, surrounded by a molding carved to depict sirese flowers in full bloom, stands to the east toward the rim of the sphere while a highly polished ebonwood door blocks passage at the southern end of the hallway.  The light scent of amber wafts within the walls from two oil burners mounted into the white plaster, filling this otherwise confining space with a sense of warmth and welcoming."],"exits":[{"to":1175,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1177,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1179,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":1177,"x":791,"y":-25,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Library","descriptions":["Glass-covered bookcases hug the walls, protecting the various tomes from the rough hands of time and dust.  Small cushioned chairs fill the center of the room and provide a comfortable space for monks, scholars or those simply filled with curiosity to read the treasure of stories, histories and accounts that fill the shelves.  Carefully tended by the monks to guard against fire or smoke damage, candles have been lined along the mahogany molding."],"exits":[{"to":1176,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":1178,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"aliases":["Tamar","Library"]},
  {"id":1178,"x":709,"y":-25,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["Small sconces line the walls.  Maintained by the temple's monks, they provide ever-present light within the passages.  A mahogany door stands proudly at the end of the hallway, the gentle glow from the candles making the polished wood glisten with a reddish hue."],"exits":[{"to":1177,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":1181,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"}]},
  {"id":1179,"x":849,"y":-81,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, East Dormitory","descriptions":["Warm light drifts from four tall candle holders placed in each corner of the room, casting a gentle glow upon a watercolor painting on the east wall.  A wooden desk is cramped between two small bunk beds, each draped with a red wool blanket."],"exits":[{"to":1176,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":1180,"x":885,"y":-144,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Meditation Room","descriptions":["Ten willow-reed mats circle a single oil lamp which gives off the faint, wafting scent of burning amber.  The aroma induces a feeling of calm and serenity, creating the perfect environment in which to spend hours in prayer and meditation.  A large plaque is centered above a tall fern on the far wall."],"exits":[{"to":1175,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":1181,"x":637,"y":-67,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["The plaster walls are accented with red mahogany borders at both the ceiling and floor as the hallway continues its circular path.  A small wooden door carved with a tiny trail of vines along each of its four sides stands welcoming against the southern wall while an ebonwood door blocks further passage in a clockwise direction."],"exits":[{"to":1178,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1182,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"}]},
  {"id":1182,"x":595,"y":-139,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Dining Room","descriptions":["A silver plaque, adorned with the stylized rendition of a rearing unicorn, hangs on the wall above a circular oak table that fills most of this room.  Torcheres line the walls and fill the small space with a gentle light and the everpresent mild scent of smoke.  A narrow red rug lines the barely passable space between the fixtures and the chairs that surround the table."],"exits":[{"to":1181,"exit":"go","move":"go ebonwood door"},{"to":1173,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":1183,"x":637,"y":-293,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Kitchen","descriptions":["This small kitchen is as warm and full of wonderful scents as a Halfling grandmother's.  A pine sideboard is draped with a cheery red tablecloth, and a large iron stew pot sits atop a simple wood stove.  Sconces cover the walls between narrow cupboards, filling the windowless room with a soft glow and the scent of smoke mixed with herbs and fresh baked bread.  A crowd of pots and pans hangs from the ceiling, making it impossible to pull one object down without sending all the others toppling to the floor."],"exits":[{"to":1173,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow arch"},{"to":1184,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":1184,"x":709,"y":-335,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["A door formed from bleached pine wood and another of frosted glass stand on either side of this short hallway.  Near the uppermost portion of the sphere, this passage is remarkably constricted, every amount of space having been preserved for the monks' living areas."],"exits":[{"to":1183,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"},{"to":1185,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"},{"to":1187,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":1185,"x":791,"y":-335,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Garden","descriptions":["The floor of this room has been structured to extend further toward the center of the sphere.  Panels of glass surround it, allowing sunlight to filter through the skylight on the top of the temple and feed the ever-hungry plants and herbs that grow here.  Rows of shelves fill the semi-circular room, permeating the space with color and the scent of growth.","The floor of this room has been structured to extend further into the sphere, below the temple's great skylight.  Panels of glass surround the space and function like a greenhouse, keeping this room ever warm and moist.  Small candles burn in between the pots of plants, flowers and herbs, complementing the multitudes of stars above."],"exits":[{"to":1184,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"},{"to":1186,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":1186,"x":863,"y":-293,"z":4,"title":"Monks' Quarters, Gardener's Room","descriptions":["This entire room is filled in every nook and cranny with flowers, plants and herbs.  Some have been carefully wrapped with thin cotton cloth as one would a fresh wound.  A tiny cot just fits between two large potted ferns whose leafy tendrils cascade down and drape across the floor.  In one corner, a large wicker basket is filled with dirt-stained garden tools."],"exits":[{"to":1185,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":1187,"x":750,"y":-300,"z":5,"title":"High Priestess' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["Granite benches provide a place to sit for those waiting to hold audience with the High Priestess of the temple.  The door to her office is fashioned from mahogany, carved with the crest of the guild of clerics which is encircled by two palm leaves.  Tendrils of smoke carrying the scent of exotic incense float lazily through the archway, drifting up from the monks' quarters below."],"exits":[{"to":1184,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase","hidden":true},{"to":1188,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1191,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":1188,"x":864,"y":-217,"z":5,"title":"High Priestess' Quarters, Hallway","descriptions":["Each step echoing from the cool marble floor of the hallway reverberates against the temple's plaster walls, intruding upon the monastic silence.  A faint breeze, redolent with the sweet fragrance of flowers and the spicy aroma of herbs, drifts down a narrow winding staircase, while the muffled sounds of distant chanting floats up from the temple below."],"exits":[{"to":1187,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1189,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":1192,"exit":"climb","move":"climb winding stairway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":1189,"x":821,"y":-83,"z":5,"title":"High Priestess' Quarters, Private Chambers","descriptions":["Comfortable furnishings clutter this cramped bedchamber, the need for function competing with the limits of the space.  A flickering pool of light plays over a tiny writing table near the mahogany door, cast by a tallow candle.  In the center of the room, a mahogany bed nestles amidst teetering stacks of books and parchments fallen from a shelf along the wall."],"exits":[{"to":1188,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"},{"to":1190,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":1190,"x":679,"y":-83,"z":5,"title":"High Priestess' Quarters, Defense Control","descriptions":["Two large cambrinth-framed mirrors -- one oval, the other rectangular -- seem out of place as the only attempt at decoration in this chamber.  A rounded marble console emerges fluidly from the wall as though part of the same stone, or sculpted by magic.  Atop the console, a series of unusual gems are arrayed on the surface of a bronze panel."],"exits":[{"to":1189,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":1191,"exit":"go","move":"go iron-bound door"}],"aliases":["Defense Control Room"]},
  {"id":1191,"x":636,"y":-217,"z":5,"title":"High Priestess' Quarters, Office","descriptions":["A dark wooden desk sits before a small window that looks over the temple below.  Bronze braziers stand to either side of an iron-bound door, their glowing embers providing light and warmth to the office of the key religious leader of the province.  Two wooden chairs provide a place to sit for those who would seek advice or counsel with the High Priestess of the great temple."],"exits":[{"to":1190,"exit":"go","move":"go iron-bound door"},{"to":1187,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Tallis","High Priestess"]},
  {"id":1192,"x":730,"y":-160,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["Well-tended rows of herbs and flowers stretch in leafy array over the convex surface, reined in by a sturdy railing that guards against a perilous drop from the steepening curve of the dome.  A gravel path trails between the rows and rises gently toward a spire that juts from the center of the roof.  The fire from the top of the nearby watchtower flares faintly against the warm light of day.","Well-tended rows of herbs and flowers stretch in leafy array over the convex surface, reined in by a sturdy railing that guards against a perilous drop from the steepening curve of the dome.  A gravel path trails between the rows and rises gently toward a spire that juts from the center of the roof.  The fire from the top of the nearby watchtower flickers brightly against the night sky."],"exits":[{"to":1188,"exit":"go","move":"go winding stair","hidden":true},{"to":1193,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1199,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"climb","move":"climb gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1193,"x":750,"y":-140,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["Sturdy, thick planks of wood curve around the perimeter of the garden.  A small streamer of ivy has wound around the railing and swings gently with every gust of wind.  The breeze bears with it the reeking scents of the Segoltha River mingled with the sharp tang of smoke from the nearby watchtowers."],"exits":[{"to":1194,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1192,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1194,"x":770,"y":-160,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["When the wind shifts, smoke from the watchtower directly southeast drifts through the slats of the railing and across the path.  The flourishing plants appear not to suffer for it, however, and thrive in the rays of the sun.","When the wind shifts, smoke from the watchtower directly southeast drifts through the slats of the railing and across the path.  The flourishing plants appear not to suffer for it, however, and thrive in the light of the stars."],"exits":[{"to":1195,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1193,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1195,"x":790,"y":-180,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["A curious sculpture in the shape of a plant with clear leaves stretches low to the ground, taking up much of this patch of soil and swaying gently near the edge of the gravel path.  Sparkles of sunlight dance along the structure, which radiates in thirteen points from its center stalk.  The leaves chime faintly when they brush against the stones and the railing.","A curious sculpture in the shape of a plant with clear leaves stretches low to the ground, taking up much of this patch of soil and swaying gently near the edge of the gravel path.  Sparkles of starlight dance along the structure, which radiates in thirteen points from its center stalk.  The leaves chime faintly when they brush against the stones and the railing."],"exits":[{"to":1194,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1196,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1196,"x":770,"y":-200,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["The scent of rich loam rises from a mounded heap of dirt from which the monks replenish the garden.  Ivy has gained a foothold in the soil and drapes thickly over the wooden slats, stretching toward the skylights and the curve of the temple below.  One tenacious strand crawls along the gravel path, slowly making its way toward the beacon spire."],"exits":[{"to":1195,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1197,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1197,"x":750,"y":-220,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["Here at the northernmost point of the roof garden, a massive watchtower rises beyond the wooden railing, mostly blocking the view of the city below.  The expanse of smooth slate on the tower is mirrored in the metallic beacon spire opposite it at the center of the garden.  A gravel path leads toward the spire and stretches through the rows of leafy plants."],"exits":[{"to":1196,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1198,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1198,"x":730,"y":-200,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["A small rosebush clings to the railing, swooning gracefully against its strong support.  Other, better behaved flowers nestle in the thin soil surrounding the gravel paths and flourish among the herbs.  Their blooms follow the sun on its course through the sky's dome, halting only when the shadows of the watchtowers and beacon spire fall across them.","A small rosebush clings to the railing, swooning gracefully against its strong support.  Other, better behaved flowers nestle in the thin soil surrounding the gravel paths and flourish among the herbs.  Their blooms are quiescent beneath the night sky, lit only by the fires atop the watchtowers that jut beyond the roof."],"exits":[{"to":1197,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1199,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1199,"x":710,"y":-180,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, Gardens","descriptions":["City sounds rise as a complex melody from the Crossing's teeming streets, drifting aimlessly before fading into the breeze like the smoke that rises from the vents beyond the railing.  The crunch of the gravel path underfoot, the vibrancy of the plants, and the silent spire of the beacon at the center of the roof all contribute to the sense of remoteness from the busy world below."],"exits":[{"to":1198,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1192,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1200,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel path"}]},
  {"id":1200,"x":750,"y":-180,"z":6,"title":"High Priestess' Sanctuary, The Beacon","descriptions":["At the center of the dome's surface is a thick metallic spire that rises into the sky, the conjunction of the paths from the edges of the roof and the focus of the three watchtowers.  It is to here, in times of trouble, that the greatest defenses of the temple -- and the city -- are summoned.  The silvery surface of the beacon is cool to the touch, even on the sunniest of days."],"exits":[{"to":1197,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1196,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1195,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1194,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1193,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1192,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1199,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1198,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Beacon","Temple Beacon"]},
  {"id":1201,"x":750,"y":-235,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, North Stairway","descriptions":["Divided only by these steps of pale granite, a vast sea of mahogany benches lies methodically staggered into the sloping walls of this cavernous room, each seat providing a clear line of sight to the altar below.  Further up the slightly rough stairs, a thick metallic pillar stands proudly, sunk into the granite foundation as if it were required as some fundamental means of support."],"exits":[{"to":1202,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":1120,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":1202,"x":750,"y":-270,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, The Pillar","descriptions":["Thick and unyielding as an ancient oak, a steel-like pillar rises from deep within these granite steps, its surface skillfully etched with the nightingale of Phelim and the great wolf of Meraud.  Constructed of the same material as the altar below, the formidable column is capped with a halved sphere of an opalescent mineral whose milky interior swirls with a lazy power.  Seating areas rest on either side of this great marker, each perched in silent vigil high above the sacred altar."],"exits":[{"to":1203,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":1201,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"aliases":["cambrinth orb"]},
  {"id":1203,"x":750,"y":-305,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, North Stairway","descriptions":["From this landing poised just beneath the Iris Rim, a sweeping granite stairway ascends to the circular ledge above, providing access to the six arches that line the equator of this spherical space, and drawing one toward the watchful Eyes of the Thirteen.  The stairs continue downward in a gentle curve toward the metallic altar, their progress as fluid and graceful as water streaming down a rough face of rock."],"exits":[{"to":1202,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":1204,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":1204,"x":750,"y":-340,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["Just below this granite ledge, a steep staircase sweeps down toward the metallic High Altar.  The descending steps are lined on either side by countless mahogany benches, the clean scent of oiled wood drifting upward to fill this airy space.  A black marble arch breaks the smooth wall of plaster to the north, granting access to one of the six shrines located around the Iris Rim."],"exits":[{"to":1203,"exit":"climb","move":"climb granite stairway","hidden":true},{"to":1205,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1215,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1221,"exit":"go","move":"go black arch"}]},
  {"id":1205,"x":830,"y":-320,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["Far below, marble tiles of grey, black and white stream outwards from the base of the High Altar, their motley arrangement growing monochromatic as they begin to define the entrances to their respective promenades.  The broad granite ridge underfoot continues its circular progress around the lofty circumference of Ve Aevan Gaenan, granting access to shrines that wait in either direction."],"exits":[{"to":1206,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1204,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1206,"x":890,"y":-260,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["A dark marble arch stands patiently to the northeast, its base melding seamlessly with the granite that comprises this curving passage.  Any who dare skirt the rim's inner edge risk a cliff-like fall through open air, only a slight breeze standing between this ledge and the white marble tiles below."],"exits":[{"to":1207,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1205,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1216,"exit":"go","move":"go grey arch"}]},
  {"id":1207,"x":910,"y":-180,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["From the edge of the Rim, myriad mahogany benches begin their graceful procession down into the bowl of Ve Aevan Gaenan, every seating area intent on the High Altar.  Appearing for a moment like the delicate sheen of a silken fabric, lines of pale yellow light trace shifting patterns over the white plaster walls, wavering in time with a slight breeze that tickles over the sconces circling the ledge's perimeter."],"exits":[{"to":1208,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1206,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1208,"x":890,"y":-100,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["Along the outer wall, a lapis-edged arch stands vigil over the entrance to one of the temple's shrines, hints of incense wafting from within to mingle with the mild scent of smoke that drifts along the ledge.  Opposite the shrine's arch, a massive stairway descends toward the interior of the sphere, approaching the nadir of this holy chamber where the High Altar stands in quiet splendor."],"exits":[{"to":1209,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1207,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1217,"exit":"go","move":"go lapis-edged arch"},{"to":1227,"exit":"climb","move":"climb granite stairway","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":1209,"x":830,"y":-40,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["The dulcet sound of chanted devotions fills this space, its steady rhythm keeping time with the quiet footsteps that circle the granite Rim.  Cradled within the cauldron of Ve Aevan Gaenan, the temple's High Altar rests beneath the watchful gaze of the Thirteen."],"exits":[{"to":1210,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1208,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1210,"x":750,"y":-20,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["A red granite arch parts the delicate wall of white plaster, stone meeting stone as the grey passage underfoot continues to circle the inner perimeter of the temple sphere.  Two silver sconces frame the arch, their pale yellow light casting shadows that disappear into the valley of mahogany benches below."],"exits":[{"to":1211,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1209,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1218,"exit":"go","move":"go red arch"}]},
  {"id":1211,"x":670,"y":-40,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["Visible from the edge of this lofty ridge, the High Altar stands proudly upon a raised platform far below, its metallic surface bathed in the soft light that streams down from the watchful Eyes of the Thirteen.  The Iris Rim continues its circular path around the circumference of this massive chamber, both directions leading toward one of the six arches that line this level of the Temple."],"exits":[{"to":1212,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1210,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1212,"x":610,"y":-100,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["The circular rim underfoot seems to flow toward the graceful cascade of a pale granite stairway, its procession of worked stone streaming down around a steel-like pillar below.  Opposite the stairway, a pale-green chalcedony arch beckons silently toward the shrine that waits within."],"exits":[{"to":1213,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1211,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1219,"exit":"go","move":"go chalcedony arch"},{"to":1224,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairway"}]},
  {"id":1213,"x":590,"y":-180,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["The wide granite walkway of the Iris Rim curves around the interior of the temple sphere, its circular path visible across the vast expanse of the bowl-like chamber.  Six stone archways are spaced evenly along the entire circumference of the ledge, each poised in silent dignity before the shrine that waits within."],"exits":[{"to":1214,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1212,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1214,"x":610,"y":-260,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["The edge of the walkway marks a perilous drop to the marble of the Grey Promenade that divides the northeast seating areas of Ve Aevan Gaenan.  Toward the center of the chamber below, grey tiles mingle with those of white and black, uniting to form an elegant mosaic around the High Altar.  An alabaster arch beckons in the opposite direction, providing access to one of the six shrines that line the Iris Rim."],"exits":[{"to":1215,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1213,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"},{"to":1220,"exit":"go","move":"go alabaster arch"}]},
  {"id":1215,"x":670,"y":-320,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Hallway","descriptions":["Following the inner circumference of the Temple, the Iris Rim provides an uninterrupted view of both the High Altar below and the vigilant Eyes of the Thirteen above.  From those thirteen iris-shaped panes of glass, thirteen different colors of cool light touch the chamber below, illuminating with a pale grace."],"exits":[{"to":1204,"exit":"go","move":"go clockwise"},{"to":1214,"exit":"go","move":"go widdershins"}]},
  {"id":1216,"x":854,"y":-240,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Shrine of Destruction","descriptions":["The walls of this room are formed of smooth black trachyte, the reflective surface carved with images of Gorbesh soldiers ransacking and pillaging the former temple.  Resting in the center of the shrine, a dull iron altar leans awkwardly, its base cracked and broken.  A fierce depiction of the power of destruction, this room is an eerie reminder that nothing is eternal."],"exits":[{"to":1206,"exit":"go","move":"go grey arch"}],"aliases":["Shrine of Destruction","Destruction"]},
  {"id":1217,"x":854,"y":-120,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Shrine of Outwardness","descriptions":["Dedicated to spirit manifested outwardly, one wall of this room is dominated by a rich tapestry.  Its opulent stitchery depicts a kneeling, plate-clad warrior humbly offering his blade to an Alfar whose blazing, unearthly beauty surrounds him with radiance.  A stained glass roundel depicting Elanthia graces the ceiling, traced in gold with the major trade routes of land and sea.  A bright flicker in one corner reveals an extraordinary sculpture -- a crystal phoenix rising amidst real flames."],"exits":[{"to":1208,"exit":"go","move":"go lapis-edged arch"}],"aliases":["Shrine of Outwardness","Outwardness"]},
  {"id":1218,"x":750,"y":-60,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Warrior's Shrine","descriptions":["This room is faced with polished deep red porphyry and is dedicated to those whose burden in life is blood and battle.  Burning steadily, two torches frame a small steel altar forged from broken weapons, and cast long finger-like shadows across the shards of glistening metal.  A simple porcelain bowl rests in the middle of the altar, its white surface stained copper by the many offerings of blood droplets the temple monks provide during their vigils."],"exits":[{"to":1210,"exit":"go","move":"go red arch"}],"aliases":["Warrior's Shrine"]},
  {"id":1219,"x":646,"y":-120,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Shrine of Thought","descriptions":["To free the mind for journeying along the pathways of thought, this room is bare of ornamentation, the bustle and din of the outside world held at bay by thick marble walls draped in blue-black velvet.  Deep silence reigns here, and soft darkness surrounds all.  Suspended near the apex of the high arched ceiling is a luminous crystalline sphere, its silvery light falling upon a single white lotus blossom centered on a little sandalwood altar."],"exits":[{"to":1212,"exit":"go","move":"go chalcedony arch"}],"aliases":["Shrine of Thought","Thought"]},
  {"id":1220,"x":646,"y":-240,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Shrine of Healing","descriptions":["Designed to honor those who devote their lives to the salvation of bodies and souls, this shrine is decorated with a profusion of flowers and medicinal herbs.  Fresh flowers adorn the wall next to the alabaster arch leading into the hallway, and a collage of dried flowers protected by glass looms over the altar in the back of the room."],"exits":[{"to":1214,"exit":"go","move":"go alabaster arch"}],"aliases":["Shrine of Healing","Healing"]},
  {"id":1221,"x":750,"y":-300,"z":2,"title":"The Iris Rim, Shrine of Foresight","descriptions":["This shrine is possessed of a dreamlike ambiance, watery illumination emanating from the core of a delicate crystal bowl resting upon the central altar.  Faint streaks of colored light meet walls obscured by sheer curtains of smoke and shadow around the circumference of the room painted constellations and moons tease at the edge of recognition before again slipping behind the cloak of satin darkness."],"exits":[{"to":1204,"exit":"go","move":"go black arch"}],"aliases":["Shrine of Foresight","Foresight"]},
  {"id":1222,"x":710,"y":-140,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Southwest Stairway","descriptions":["Rows of mahogany benches blend into a continuous sea of darkly stained wood, the wedge-shaped seating area bisected by the clean lines of these granite steps.  Further up the stairs, a thick metallic pillar stands firmly, rooted deep into the foundation as if it had been built around rather than added to the structure."],"exits":[{"to":1122,"exit":"down","move":"stairs down"},{"to":1223,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"}]},
  {"id":1223,"x":690,"y":-120,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, The Pillar","descriptions":["Rising from deep within the pale granite, a steel-like pillar stands with regal dignity, its surface carefully etched with the horned owl of Firulf and the great wolf of Meraud.  Its composition strikingly similar to the altar below, the formidable column is capped with a halved sphere of an opalescent mineral whose milky interior swirls with a tamed power.  Spacious seating areas rest on either side of this great marker, each perched in silent vigil high above the sacred altar."],"exits":[{"to":1224,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"},{"to":1222,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"}],"aliases":["cambrinth orb"]},
  {"id":1224,"x":670,"y":-100,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Southwest Stairway","descriptions":["From this landing poised just beneath the Iris Rim, a sweeping granite stairway climbs onto the annular ledge above, providing access to the six arches that line the equator of this spherical space, and drawing one toward the watchful Eyes of the Thirteen.  The stairs continue downward in a gentle curve toward the metallic altar, their progress as fluid and graceful as water streaming down a rough face of rock."],"exits":[{"to":1212,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"},{"to":1223,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"}]},
  {"id":1225,"x":790,"y":-140,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Southeast Stairway","descriptions":["Individual rows of darkly stained benches blend into a continuous sea of mahogany, the wedge-shaped seating area bisected by the sharp lines of these pale steps.  A thick metallic pillar stands further up the stairs, buried deep into the foundation as if it had been present far before the stone that currently surrounds it."],"exits":[{"to":1118,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"},{"to":1226,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"}]},
  {"id":1226,"x":810,"y":-120,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, The Pillar","descriptions":["From deep within these granite steps a great pillar rises proudly -- its surface skillfully etched with the unicorn of Hodierna and the great wolf of Meraud, its strength unassailable and without equal.  A halved sphere of an opalescent mineral caps the pillar, its milky interior swirling with a lazy power.  Spacious seating areas are perched on either side of this great marker, resting in silent vigil high about the sacred altar."],"exits":[{"to":1225,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"},{"to":1227,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"}],"aliases":["cambrinth sphere"]},
  {"id":1227,"x":830,"y":-100,"z":1,"title":"Ve Aevan Gaenan, Southeast Stairway","descriptions":["From this landing poised just beneath the Iris Rim, a sweeping granite stairway ascends to the circular ledge above, providing access to the six arches that line the equator of this spherical space, and drawing one toward the watchful Eyes of the Thirteen.  The stairs continue downward in a gentle curve toward the metallic altar, their progress as fluid and graceful as water streaming down a rough face of rock."],"exits":[{"to":1226,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"},{"to":1208,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"}]},
  {"id":1228,"x":750,"y":40,"z":1,"title":"Temple Grounds, Grand Stairway","descriptions":["Below to either side, paths curve around in between the main temple and the east and west towers.  The monoliths stretch upwards and lean slightly toward the temple itself, as if grasping out toward the beacon area atop the structure, above the Eyes of The Thirteen.  Smoothly cut granite steps lead upward to the north, climbing toward the massive temple."],"exits":[{"to":1049,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"},{"to":1229,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"}]},
  {"id":1229,"x":750,"y":20,"z":1,"title":"Temple Grounds, Grand Stairway","descriptions":["The grand stairway continues its ascent to the north, approaching the looming orb of the temple.  Ornate silverwillow banisters curve down from the entrance, polished to a lustrous sheen and carved to resemble flowing streams, trickling serenely to the bottom of the stairs."],"exits":[{"to":1230,"exit":"up","move":"rt up"},{"to":1228,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"}]},
  {"id":1230,"x":750,"y":0,"z":1,"title":"Grand Stairway, Temple Entrance","descriptions":["The stairs descend to the south providing a spectacular view of the meandering Segoltha river.  The grand orb-like temple yawns open directly to the north, its massive double doors sure to ward off any foolish invaders who may besiege this religious fortress.  Two massive bronze sconces protrude above the entryway, each shaped like an outstretched feline's paw clutching an eternal flame -- surely a blessing from the goddess of civilization who aided in the reconstruction of this monument."],"exits":[{"to":1229,"exit":"down","move":"rt down"},{"to":1106,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"aliases":["Temple Entrance"]},
  {"id":1231,"x":570,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Wedding Glade, Outdoor Chapel","descriptions":["A smooth cobblestone path meanders its way from under a whitewashed latticework archway to the southeast, leading beneath the gentle shade of a gazebo to the north.  Lush green modwyn vines reach up from the ground, coiling about the gazebo's posts to intertwine atop it, creating a picturesque canopy to shield any would-be wedding parties from the elements.  Festive streamers of a myriad of colors weave a sweeping rainbow before the small chapel's entrance."],"exits":[{"to":1232,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1059,"exit":"go","move":"go latticework archway"},{"to":1233,"exit":"climb","move":"climb brass ladder"}]},
  {"id":1232,"x":550,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Outdoor Wedding Chapel, Reception Plaza","descriptions":["A thick carpet of pale golden-brown leaves covers the ground of this small plaza, barely allowing one to see the concealed cobbled road beneath.  Festive golden streamers lazily dance about, tied to small wooden posts that hold the pruned hedges at bay.  A large nearly-naked cherry tree rises in the center of the plaza, shedding its crisp golden feathers, having borne its children for the year.","The fresh, wintry crunch of the crisp white snow beneath each footstep heralds the arrival of the late months.  A large cherry tree stands dormant, barren of leaves and sporting only a few small, frozen buds.  The dulled daylight shines off the snow, casting an ambient glow upon everything in sight.  The hedges appear as snowbanks, buried beneath the frosty white carpet that drapes over all in this small cul-de-sac."],"exits":[{"to":1231,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":1233,"x":570,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Beneath the Wedding Glade, Sundering Chapel","descriptions":["Fresh dirt walls have been packed in crudely, a thin tunnel in the ceiling leading up to the wedding chapel above.  The faint laughter of a joyous party is heard in the distance, muffled and given an eerie quality tinged with sorrow in this small hovel within the earth.  A crude obsidian slab has been smoothed into a makeshift altar, littered with shattered crystal shards -- the remnants of former scission blades, and the only physical trace of the sundered wedding vows made by countless people before."],"exits":[{"to":1231,"exit":"climb","move":"climb brass ladder"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine1-05","Sundering Chapel"]},
  {"id":1234,"x":730,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Temple, North Tower","descriptions":["Diffuse golden light falls from somewhere above, its honeyed beams drifting down the length of the tower.  Matched flagstones of deep grey slate create a broad landing that punctuates the staircase as it continues its gradual climb."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":1072,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood door"}],"aliases":["Escape Tunnels","Tunnels"],"linksTo":"Map2d_Escape_Tunnels.xml"},
  {"id":1235,"x":570,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Reception Hall, Stage","descriptions":["Smooth walnut boards underfoot and rich blue velvet curtains along the walls make this an elegant nook where minstrels and performers can share their music with those in the ballroom.  Wooden chairs sit in neat rows facing the north, each with a silver stand set in front shaped like a lyre.  A cleared space made in front of them is framed by multicolored silk streamers that flutter onto the stage."],"exits":[{"to":1081,"exit":"go","move":"go velvet curtain"}]},
  {"id":1236,"x":650,"y":-230,"z":3,"title":"Eye of Urrem'tier, Warding Chamber","descriptions":["Concave walls of pitch black obsidian carve out a small spherical chamber.  Etched into the walls are strange sigils and warding runes that glimmer every so often with a white radiance.  The chamber is bare save for a simple black ironwood stand in the center and an ebony rack on one wall."],"exits":[{"to":1172,"exit":"go","move":"go small hatch"}]},
  {"id":1237,"x":-104,"y":296,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Entrance","descriptions":["Throngs of children mill around, licking lollipops and poking at one another.  Salty air drifts upon the wind, causing bits of old paper to dance around freshly painted garbage bins.  Various buildings and attractions are visible further down the wide wooden and metal pier.","Salty air drifts upon the wind causing bits of old paper to dance around half-full garbage bins, while sweepers go by cleaning up the day's refuse.  Various buildings and attractions are visible in the torchlight further down the wide wooden and metal pier."],"exits":[{"to":1238,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1239,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1240,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":58,"exit":"go","move":"go elaborate gate"}],"aliases":["Amusement Pier"]},
  {"id":1238,"x":-64,"y":336,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Este Lane","descriptions":["Gentle waves lap against the huge poles that bear the weight of this busy pier.  Sturdy rails are placed along the edges, keeping stray children from tumbling off into the cold waters below.","Gentle waves lap against the huge poles that bear the weight of this quiet pier.  Sturdy rails are placed along the edges, keeping stray children from tumbling off into the cold waters below.  Brightly lit lanterns attract colorful moths to dance within their flames."],"exits":[{"to":1241,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1239,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1237,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1239,"x":-104,"y":336,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Centre Lane","descriptions":["The breeze carries with it a tangy citrus scent from a small wooden stand whose base is carved with painted lemons.  A few stools offer seating for those wishing to enjoy the fruity lemonade sold by a Gnome maid who wears a pointed hat dusted with glitter.","The breeze carries with it a tangy citrus scent from a small wooden stand whose base is carved with painted lemons.  A few stools offer seating for those wishing to enjoy the fruity lemonade sold by a Gnome maid who wears a pointed hat dusted with glitter.  The torchlight gives her face a warm glow as she smiles at customers."],"exits":[{"to":1237,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1238,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1240,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1240,"x":-144,"y":336,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["Gentle waves lap against the huge poles that bear the weight of this busy pier.  Sturdy rails are placed along the edges, keeping stray children from tumbling off into the cold waters below.","Gentle waves lap against the huge poles that bear the weight of this quiet pier.  Sturdy rails are placed along the edges, keeping stray children from tumbling off into the cold waters below.  Brightly lit lanterns attract colorful moths to dance within their flames."],"exits":[{"to":1237,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1239,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1243,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1282,"exit":"go","move":"go canvas tent"}]},
  {"id":1241,"x":-64,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Este Lane","descriptions":["Along the edge of the pier, rows of benches are set in a half-circle, all facing a big wooden theater.  Clothed in darkness, the images on its painted doors are barely visible in the flickering torchlight.  Sea birds often land upon the roof, squawking as though performing for a crowd.","Placed along the edge of the pier an area is set up with rows of benches all facing a big wooden theater.  Clothed in darkness it sits, the images on its painted doors barely seen by the flickering torches placed near it.  Sea birds often land upon it, squawking as if performing for a crowd."],"exits":[{"to":1238,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1244,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1242,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1260,"exit":"go","move":"go row"}]},
  {"id":1242,"x":-104,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Centre Lane","descriptions":["Miniature boats dart between cast-pewter figures of birds in flight that adorn a nearby fountain, cheered on by the calls of children.  The fountain also provides a haven for real birds who splash with gleeful abandon in the water, sending up waves that nearly swamp the tiny vessels.","Miniature boats drift lazily between cast-pewter figures of birds in flight that adorn a nearby fountain.  Late night romance blooms as a young Bard plays softly on a flute, his thoughts his own in the night's dim light."],"exits":[{"to":1241,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1245,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1243,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1243,"x":-144,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["A bright red shop roofed with dark brown shingles stands here, with its wide-paned windows painted with apples.  Barrels filled with various kinds of apples stand against the shop, a small Gnome guarding them with a pointy broom.  The scent of fresh apples permeates the air, inviting all to enter and partake."],"exits":[{"to":1240,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1242,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1277,"exit":"go","move":"go red shop"}]},
  {"id":1244,"x":-64,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Este Lane","descriptions":["A dark establishment stands starkly in contrast with the gaiety surrounding it.  Wind gently swings the sign that names this place, Zackes.  An arched door stands open with a hint of ale drifting out upon the sea air.","A dark establishment stands starkly in contrast with the gaiety surrounding it.  Wind gently swings the sign that names this place, Zackes.  An arched door stands open with a hint of ale drifting out upon the night air."],"exits":[{"to":1241,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1249,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1245,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1279,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}]},
  {"id":1245,"x":-104,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Centre Lane","descriptions":["Big brawny lads and giggling maidens gather round to see who is the strongest in the lands.  A few Halfling children gawk at the huge Gor'Tog that blocks their view of the next contestant.","Torches flicker as big brawny lads and giggling maidens gather round to see who is the strongest in the lands.  A couple of huge Gor'Togs snicker amongst themselves as a Gnome attempts the tower of strength."],"exits":[{"to":1242,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1244,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1248,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1246,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1267,"exit":"go","move":"go crowd"}]},
  {"id":1246,"x":-144,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["Crowds gather round to enter a man-made cave that slopes down into the water and off the edge of the pier.  A huge sign above it is decorated with the image of a dragon, a mighty warrior within its claws.  A couple of maidens dressed in gossamer and silk direct people into the cave in a disorderly fashion."],"exits":[{"to":1245,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1247,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1247,"x":-144,"y":476,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["Nifty Gifts! proclaims the sign that hangs from above a picture of daisies and ribbons.  Brightly painted, this shop is crowded with young and old alike as they chatter about the goodies inside.  The scent of fresh-baked cookies drifts from the half-open door."],"exits":[{"to":1246,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1248,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1268,"exit":"go","move":"go painted shop"}]},
  {"id":1248,"x":-104,"y":476,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Carousel","descriptions":["Bright ribbons dance upon the air as the huge carousel goes round and round.  Fun-loving passengers scamper through a black iron gate to reach the various carved animals supported by beribboned poles.  A young Elven lass has a bright smile for all as she stands ready to take their coin in exchange for a ride."],"exits":[{"to":1245,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1249,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1247,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1261,"exit":"go","move":"go painted stall"},{"to":1263,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":1249,"x":-64,"y":476,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Este Lane","descriptions":["Gentle waves can be heard lapping against the huge poles that bear the weight of this pier.  Sturdy rails have been placed along the edges, keeping stray children from tumbling off into the cold waters below.","Gentle waves can be heard lapping against the huge poles that bear the weight of this pier.  Sturdy rails have been placed along to the edges to keep stray children from tumbling off into the cold waters below.  Large lanterns have been lit, where the moths gather to dance within their light."],"exits":[{"to":1244,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1250,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1248,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1262,"exit":"go","move":"go squat building"}]},
  {"id":1250,"x":-64,"y":536,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Este Lane","descriptions":["Gentle waves lap against the pilings that support the weight of this busy pier.  Construction appears to be going on as boards are stacked up and barrels of various tools and nails are piled along the pier's railings."],"exits":[{"to":1249,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1253,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1251,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1251,"x":-104,"y":536,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Centre Lane","descriptions":["Ribbon spirals up poles bearing colorful paper lanterns that line the walkway leading to the doors of a gaily-decorated shop.  A gigantic catapult stands toward the end of the pier, giving patrons cause to look carefully around when exiting the shop to make sure there is no one flying in their direction."],"exits":[{"to":1250,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1254,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1252,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1270,"exit":"go","move":"go gaily-decorated shop"}]},
  {"id":1252,"x":-144,"y":536,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["A simple wooden booth stands here with faded colors reflecting the passage of time.  Laughter dances upon the air drifting from inside the gaming booth that offers a place to enjoy a bit of leisure time.","A simple wooden booth stands here with faded colors reflecting the passage of time.  Small paper lanterns hang from it, surrounding it with a playful glow.  Laughter dances upon the air drifting from inside the gaming booth that offers a place to enjoy a bit of leisure time."],"exits":[{"to":1251,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1255,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":1253,"x":-64,"y":576,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Este Lane","descriptions":["A decrepit shop, its doors stiff from rusted hinges, stands silent vigil over the street.  Coated windows stare blindly out, covered with some dark smelly substance -- though what it is exactly is anyone's guess.  At times the door quickly opens and shuts with a horrific squeal, allowing a person to rush away from the facade, their bowed head echoing the protective clasp on the bundles they carry off greedily."],"exits":[{"to":1250,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1256,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1254,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1274,"exit":"go","move":"go decrepit shop"}]},
  {"id":1254,"x":-104,"y":576,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Centre Lane","descriptions":["Piles of hay lie scattered on the ground, providing a soft landing place for those flung from the catapult.  Giggles of children playing hide and seek mingle with the cheers of catapult spectators as they watch a particularly rough landing.","Piles of hay lie scattered on the ground, providing a soft landing place for those flung from the catapult.  Giggles of young maidens playing hide and seek mingle with the cheers of catapult spectators as they watch a particularly rough landing."],"exits":[{"to":1251,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1253,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1256,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1255,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1255,"x":-144,"y":576,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["Wave after gentle wave slowly laps against the pilings that support the weight of the busy pier.  Sturdy railings along the edges keep stray children from tumbling into the cold waters below.","Wave after gentle wave slowly laps against the pilings that support the weight of the busy pier.  Sturdy railings are visible in the torchlight, keeping those patrons who reel in the wake of the local ale from tumbling into the cold waters below."],"exits":[{"to":1252,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1254,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1256,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":1256,"x":-104,"y":616,"z":0,"title":"Bouncer's, Catapult","descriptions":["Dominating this area of the pier is a massive catapult, its poles decorated with yellow and blue streamers.  Children watch amazed as daring adventurers take their turn in the catapult's wicker basket.","Dominating this area of the pier is a massive catapult, its poles decorated with yellow and blue streamers.  The polished wooden frame reflects glints of light from the numerous paper lanterns used to light the area."],"exits":[{"to":1254,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1253,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1257,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1255,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":1257,"x":-104,"y":636,"z":0,"title":"Amusement Pier, Centre Lane","descriptions":["A small inn sits at the end of this long pier, its wide doors painted with multi-colored flowers.  A porch made of dark blue and misty-green tile makes a semi-circle beneath the door.  A soft tinkling sound emits from the porch when visitors step on it, informing the owners that potential guests are near."],"exits":[{"to":1256,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1258,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1259,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1287,"exit":"go","move":"go wide doors"}]},
  {"id":1258,"x":-84,"y":636,"z":0,"title":"Fisherman's Corner, Este Lane","descriptions":["The music of the sea is heard in the soft lulling sound of the waves lapping against the base of the pier and in the echoing calls of seagulls to one another.  A lone bench rests near the railing with fishing equipment casually leaning against it.","The music of the sea is heard in the soft lulling sound of the waves lapping against the base of the pier and in the echoing calls of seagulls to one another.  Flickering lanterns cast a dim pool of radiance over a lone bench resting near the railing, glittering on the metal bits of the fishing pole leaning against it."],"exits":[{"to":1257,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1259,"x":-124,"y":636,"z":0,"title":"Fisherman's Corner, Wilde Lane","descriptions":["Cantankerous old Humans come here, vying with one another for the best fishing spot.  Occasionally cheers are raised as one particularly large fish is reeled in.  The view off the pier is spectacular as ships sail by, friendly sailors waving from their decks.","Soft, flickering flames dance from torches placed along the end of the pier, providing romantic lighting to nighttime strollers.  A slight breeze causes some to snuggle close to one another, while a scattering of Bards can be heard playing various instruments."],"exits":[{"to":1257,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Fishing"]},
  {"id":1260,"x":-54,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Nightingale's Rest Theater, Seating","descriptions":["Carved benches are strategically placed to face the theater, each with a perfect view of the entertainers that often perform.  The stage is decorated in bright colors with lit sconces laid along the base for nighttime viewing."],"exits":[{"to":1241,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1261,"x":-84,"y":456,"z":0,"title":"Prize Stall","descriptions":["Rough wooden beams hold up this small prize stall.  Painted brown bears dance upon colorful balls along the walls, interspersed with prancing horses.  Each shelf is draped in decorative lace that holds assorted prizes, just out of the reach of small children.  A colorful sign has been nailed upon one wall, giving information about the different prizes."],"exits":[{"to":1248,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Prize Stall"]},
  {"id":1262,"x":-24,"y":476,"z":0,"title":"Prickle Tattoo Shop","descriptions":["Pale oak walls are covered with various examples of the designs in skin art, ranging from the simple to extreme in detail.  The smell of fresh ink permeates the room, wafting from the shelves that line the far wall.  A couch lies in one corner, covered in dark tapestries with a footstool placed nearby, while some tables are evenly spaced about the shop."],"exits":[{"to":1249,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Prickle Tattoo Shop","Tattoo Shop"]},
  {"id":1263,"x":-194,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"A Carousel","descriptions":["The gaily decorated carousel is painted with scenes of leaping fish, soaring birds, and fierce beasts.  Several carved and painted wooden animals are suspended by poles, beckoning a ride."],"exits":[{"to":1264,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1266,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1248,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1264,"x":-184,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"A Carousel","descriptions":["The gaily decorated carousel is painted with scenes of leaping fish, soaring birds, and fierce beasts.  Several carved and painted wooden animals are suspended by poles, beckoning a ride."],"exits":[{"to":1265,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1263,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1248,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1265,"x":-184,"y":446,"z":0,"title":"A Carousel","descriptions":["The gaily decorated carousel is painted with scenes of leaping fish, soaring birds, and fierce beasts.  Several carved and painted wooden animals are suspended by poles, beckoning a ride."],"exits":[{"to":1264,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1266,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1248,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1248,"exit":"none","move":"none"}]},
  {"id":1266,"x":-194,"y":446,"z":0,"title":"A Carousel","descriptions":["The gaily decorated carousel is painted with scenes of leaping fish, soaring birds, and fierce beasts.  Several carved and painted wooden animals are suspended by poles, beckoning a ride."],"exits":[{"to":1263,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1265,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1248,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1267,"x":-124,"y":416,"z":0,"title":"Mighty Warriors, Strength Test Game","descriptions":["Off to one side, a metal pole towers high above the crowds.  A sturdy wooden lever squats on the ground at its base, while a bronze bell tops the tall structure.  A roustabout leans on a heavy sledgehammer, hawking his game to passers-by."],"exits":[{"to":1245,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1268,"x":-184,"y":476,"z":0,"title":"Nifty Gifts, Front Room","descriptions":["Like many other shops in the province, an array of wares is displayed for shoppers on shelves and racks.  A pot of tea is brewing in the corner, where the owner also keeps a crossbow loaded, prepped and ready for any would-be thieves.  Scents of homemade candy emanate from the beaded curtain that leads into the back room."],"exits":[{"to":1247,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1269,"exit":"go","move":"go beaded curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Nifty Gifts"]},
  {"id":1269,"x":-194,"y":476,"z":0,"title":"Nifty Gifts, Back Room","descriptions":["A cloth-covered counter bears today's offerings to soothe a customer's sweet tooth.  Behind the counter a young Halfling works to keep up with the demand for sugar-coated jellies and frosting-covered cookies.  A small sign crookedly hung above the door reads, Tasty treats by the handful, enjoy!"],"exits":[{"to":1268,"exit":"go","move":"go beaded curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Back Room"]},
  {"id":1270,"x":-104,"y":516,"z":0,"title":"Simply Souvenirs, Lobby","descriptions":["The lobby is wide open and welcoming without any clutter, with carpeted runners leading off to the different parts of the store.  Prisms of all shapes and sizes hang from the ceiling, catching the light filtering in from the hexagonal window, causing tiny rainbows to dance across the walls."],"exits":[{"to":1271,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1273,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1251,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Simply Souvenirs","Souvenirs"]},
  {"id":1271,"x":-94,"y":506,"z":0,"title":"Simply Souvenirs, Amazing Accessories","descriptions":["Knick-knacks and trinkets are placed all over the room, giving it a closed-in, cluttered feel.  A wide rack hangs on one wall, elegantly displaying a number of finely crafted fans that are for sale.  Next to the rack stands a tall fanciful tree made from glass, holding various accessories."],"exits":[{"to":1270,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1272,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Amazing Accessories"]},
  {"id":1272,"x":-104,"y":496,"z":0,"title":"Simply Souvenirs, Random Rarities","descriptions":["Far from the sounds of the busy pier, this room is cozy and comfortably furnished.  A playfully carved archway, depicting cartwheeling clowns is set in the south wall, with a thick felt curtain covering its contents.  Along the opposite wall stands a line of chairs, mismatched but all focused on the same point, a tall cushioned pedestal in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":1271,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1273,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Random Rarities"]},
  {"id":1273,"x":-114,"y":506,"z":0,"title":"Simply Souvenirs, Plush Presents","descriptions":["A huge comical plush tree stands in the middle of the room, with a big goofy face painted on its front.  Its branches completely cover the ceiling, with long strips of green cloth hanging down like weeping leaves.  A round wooden counter painted to resemble a short stone wall encircles the soft tree."],"exits":[{"to":1272,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1270,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Plush Presents"]},
  {"id":1274,"x":-24,"y":576,"z":0,"title":"Shop of Horrors, Outer Chamber","descriptions":["Rotted boards forming the walls are roughly thrown together, leaving splits large enough to reach into in some places.  Shadows obscure a shelf along the back wall, while on the side wall something heavy dangles from a hook.  A smoky lantern hangs from a pole in the center of the room, the only source of illumination."],"exits":[{"to":1275,"exit":"go","move":"go crooked arch"},{"to":1253,"exit":"go","move":"go creaky door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Shop of Horrors"]},
  {"id":1275,"x":-14,"y":576,"z":0,"title":"Shop of Horrors, Inner Sanctum","descriptions":["A thick cobweb covers the one small window, tiny trapped bodies in neatly wrapped packages here and there in its strands.  A shadowed figure lurks in the corner, larger than the rest, its eyes reflecting in the lantern-light.  An assortment of dark silhouettes rests on a rickety shelf, a crumbling display case squatting under it.  Remnants of carpeting lump under a lopsided table in one corner, the goods on it tilting sideways as if trying to hang onto the surface."],"exits":[{"to":1276,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden ladder"},{"to":1274,"exit":"go","move":"go crooked arch"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Inner Sanctum"]},
  {"id":1276,"x":-4,"y":576,"z":0,"title":"Shop of Horrors, Drowned Cellar","descriptions":["The sound of lapping water reverberates against the distorted walls that seem to melt into the water around your legs, but on second glance it's only the noxious slime dripping down its surface and into the fetid liquid.  Mold covers everything else, including the hole-riddled ladder missing several rungs in one corner."],"exits":[{"to":1275,"exit":"climb","move":"climb wooden ladder"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Drowned Cellar"]},
  {"id":1277,"x":-184,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Gnoshy and Sons, Orchard's Bounty Ordering Room","descriptions":["A long wide counter dominates the small, but functional, lobby of Gnoshy's hastily constructed retail outpost.  A small, hand-lettered sign has been tacked to the back wall, next to a more elaborate menu.  Through large chinks and gaps in the wall, smells of cinnamon, honey, and chocolate drift pleasingly."],"exits":[{"to":1278,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1243,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Gnoshy and Sons"]},
  {"id":1278,"x":-194,"y":376,"z":0,"title":"Gnoshy and Sons, Orchard's Bounty Store","descriptions":["Empty bins, buckets, barrels, and crates lie in organized piles in the corners of the room, out of the way of the patrons and the occasional workers, who scurry to and fro amidst the browsing clientele.  Two long, low tables are situated near the back wall of this well-lit room.  A strong, cidery smell tinged with sweet and sugary undertones pervades the air."],"exits":[{"to":1277,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":1279,"x":-14,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"Zackes' Place, Bar","descriptions":["Many a seaman calls this rough and tumble place home.  Its tall stools and carved oak bar are perfect for carousing the night away with friends.  On either side of the bar are different areas for letting off steam."],"exits":[{"to":1281,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1280,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1244,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Zackes' Place"]},
  {"id":1280,"x":-24,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"Zackes' Place, The Pit","descriptions":["The pit, as it is fondly called by the finest of warriors, is where the bravest grapple amongst taunts and cheers.  Water is often thrown over the encircling benches, clearing off excess mud.  Those daring enough to watch are often pulled in, to the amusement of all concerned."],"exits":[{"to":1279,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":1281,"x":-4,"y":436,"z":0,"title":"Zackes' Place, Baths","descriptions":["Warmth emanates from steaming hot tubs, giving off scents of musk and pine.  Small candles flicker against the dark wood walls from sconces placed in the corners.  Here is a quiet place that offers relaxation for those weary from the day's journey."],"exits":[{"to":1279,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1285,"exit":"go","move":"go porcelain tub"},{"to":1286,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden tub"}]},
  {"id":1282,"x":-144,"y":316,"z":0,"title":"The Dragon's Horde, Front Room","descriptions":["Intricately designed woven rugs line the floor of this spacious area.  Scents of jasmine and rose float through the air from candles lit on tall candelabras.  Highly polished counters and gilt inlaid racks hold various items for purchase with attentive clerks ready to assist those in need."],"exits":[{"to":1284,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1283,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1240,"exit":"go","move":"go tent flap"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Front Room"]},
  {"id":1283,"x":-154,"y":306,"z":0,"title":"The Dragon's Horde, Hunter's Room","descriptions":["Polished armor gleams on tables of yew and oak, with edged weapons and bows carefully displayed on heavy pine racks.  The smell of new leather and fragrant candles mix with the scents of the pungent shoppers that often come to glance at the merchandise."],"exits":[{"to":1282,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Hunter's Room"]},
  {"id":1284,"x":-134,"y":306,"z":0,"title":"The Dragon's Horde, Furniture Palace","descriptions":["Wooly rugs and ornate tapestries accent pieces of fine furniture that are orderly placed throughout the room.  Some clerks, wearing bright colorful smocks, assist shoppers with purchases while others wield cleaning rags and battle the dust that finds its way in."],"exits":[{"to":1282,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Furniture Palace"]},
  {"id":1285,"x":-4,"y":416,"z":0,"title":"Bath, Hot Porcelain Tub","descriptions":["Hot water caresses the senses and brings relief to aches and pains.  Inhaling the soapy scents can cause you to drift into a nap, while the extremely hot water can give even the hardiest Dwarf a nice pink tinge."],"exits":[{"to":1281,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1286,"x":-4,"y":456,"z":0,"title":"Bath, Hot Wooden Tub","descriptions":["Hot water caresses the senses and brings relief to aches and pains.  Inhaling the soapy scents can cause you to drift into a nap, while the extremely hot water can give even the hardiest Dwarf a nice pink tinge."],"exits":[{"to":1281,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":1287,"x":-104,"y":661,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Front Room","descriptions":["All who enter this small establishment are greeted by the smiling face of Rosealea or one of her many daughters.  Off to one side a spiral staircase leads to the rooms upstairs, while beyond a brightly polished wood arch is seen the main dining room.  Several seascapes line the walls, and its huge front window is outlined with rows of various seashells."],"exits":[{"to":1257,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1288,"exit":"climb","move":"climb staircase"},{"to":1289,"exit":"go","move":"go wood arch"}]},
  {"id":1288,"x":-104,"y":696,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Hallway","descriptions":["Whitewashed walls are covered with paintings of children and small sea mementos.  A corner shelf holds odd fragments of crystallized rocks, seemingly out of place in this otherwise sea-oriented room."],"exits":[{"to":1287,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":1290,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"},{"to":1291,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":1292,"exit":"go","move":"go cherrywood door"}]},
  {"id":1289,"x":-124,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Main Room","descriptions":["This room buzzes with activity, from harried servers bringing out steaming dishes to customers talking animatedly among themselves.  Red-checkered tablecloths atop wide oak tables have vases placed on them full of fragrant flowers.  Though crowded, the room fits everyone comfortably and offers a magnificent view of the river."],"exits":[{"to":1287,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1293,"exit":"go","move":"go arched doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":1290,"x":-84,"y":696,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Family Room","descriptions":["Neat and tidy, this room is made to accommodate those with children.  The huge bed in the middle of the room is covered with many colorful pillows and knitted blankets.  A sofa along one wall is big enough sleep a couple of children, and makes a nice setting for lace pillows and a cross-eyed teddy bear."],"exits":[{"to":1288,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}]},
  {"id":1291,"x":-104,"y":716,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Bard's Rest","descriptions":["Midnight silk covers the full-sized bed in this room while the fragrance of roses drifts from a vase full of the colorful blooms.  In the corner stands a gilded stool with a thickly cushioned seat.  A stand has been placed before the stool, offering a place to practice for any visiting bards."],"exits":[{"to":1288,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":1292,"x":-124,"y":696,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Honeymoon Suite","descriptions":["A four-poster cherrywood bed towers over the other furnishings, framed by dark plum silk draperies.  The scent of jasmine creates a romantic ambiance for the newly bonded.  From its elegant settee to the champagne chilling on the bedside table, no expense has been spared to offer the visiting couple their perfect holiday.  Lace draperies flutter in the window that looks out over the water, while a fragrant fire crackles in the fireplace."],"exits":[{"to":1288,"exit":"go","move":"go cherrywood door"}]},
  {"id":1293,"x":-144,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Dance Hall","descriptions":["Dark crystal sconces hold candles whose soft light seems to flicker in time with music being played by local bards congregating in the corner.  Several low couches surround the dark wood dance floor, offering a place to chat and relax."],"exits":[{"to":1289,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":1294,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded alcove"}]},
  {"id":1294,"x":-164,"y":681,"z":0,"title":"Rosealea's Inn, Rendezvous Room","descriptions":["Aptly named the Rendezvous Room, a smiling Human man stands behind a dark mahogany bar, ready to take orders for drinks or to offer advice to any would-be listener.  The windows, which are normally thrown wide open, are drawn closed and covered in dark plum silk."],"exits":[{"to":1293,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":1295,"x":649,"y":-569,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Foyer","descriptions":["The high ceiling and sand rose painted walls make this entry feel open and expansive.  A large round ironwood table is centered on a thickly-piled rug that covers the middle of the polished marble floor.  Large copper urns filled with preserved peacock feathers and fronds have been placed at each corner of a large listings board.  Rich brown leather couches line the opposite wall."],"exits":[{"to":1296,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1312,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"},{"to":1311,"exit":"go","move":"go office"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Foyer","listings board","board"]},
  {"id":1296,"x":649,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Sun Room","descriptions":["Painted a soft blue, the walls compliment the matching sunburst stained glass windows that are set in deep frames on each wall.  Low wicker benches with moss green cushions are positioned between the entries to the individual shops.  Shoppers move along leisurely, arms laden with baskets and bags overflowing with their latest finds."],"exits":[{"to":1297,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1304,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1295,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1307,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1303,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1300,"exit":"go","move":"go hallway"},{"to":1322,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"},{"to":1328,"exit":"go","move":"go spiral ramp"}],"aliases":["Sun Room"]},
  {"id":1297,"x":769,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Water Room","descriptions":["Rounded benches ring a small fountain in the middle of the room.  Light from a centralized chandelier reflects off polished glass pieces that have been strewn in the clear crystal water.  Small tables with decorated jars holding bamboo shoots are positioned between the entries to each shop."],"exits":[{"to":1298,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1296,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Water Room"]},
  {"id":1298,"x":829,"y":-699,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Grass Room","descriptions":["Intricately woven reeds are displayed in a starburst matting, the differing sized rays pointing to each shop, as if it direct shoppers to their destinations.  Baskets are piled artistically along the two long walls of this rectangular room.  Guards pass quietly among the shoppers, alert behind their relaxed facade."],"exits":[{"to":1297,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1299,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Grass Room"]},
  {"id":1299,"x":769,"y":-769,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Solarium","descriptions":["The night sky can be seen through the long panes of glass set along the walls near the ceiling.  Lantern light softens the edges of the two rows of topiary animals and intricately manicured miniature evergreens in large marble urns.  Gaps have been left to allow entry into the various shops.","Long panes of glass are set into the long walls near the ceiling.  Too high to provide a view of the outside, they allow sunlight for the two rows of topiary animals intermingled with intricately manicured miniature evergreens in large marble urns.  Gaps have been left to allow entry into the various shops."],"exits":[{"to":1298,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1300,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1310,"exit":"go","move":"go garden"}],"aliases":["Solarium"]},
  {"id":1300,"x":649,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Food Court","descriptions":["Small wrought-iron tables with two to four matching chairs are situated sporadically around this large room.  A young Elven maid moves quietly around the area filling a large bin with used glasses and cutlery.  A row of carts with large wheels line two opposite walls.  Soft music from a lyre player provides a comfortable background for the low conversations between diners and passing shoppers."],"exits":[{"to":1299,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1301,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1296,"exit":"go","move":"go hallway"}],"aliases":["Food Court"]},
  {"id":1301,"x":529,"y":-769,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Forest Room","descriptions":["Carved totems have been arranged in a casual snaking pattern down the length of the room.  With enough space between them for easy passage to the shop entries, shoppers pause and point out the animals and birds easily recognized in the wood."],"exits":[{"to":1300,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1302,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1310,"exit":"go","move":"go garden"}],"aliases":["Forest Room"]},
  {"id":1302,"x":469,"y":-699,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Dimly-Lit Storage","descriptions":["Defying gravity, crates, boxes and stacked tables are piled high along the walls to the ceiling.  With a wide cleared path running down the center, light from the entry way quickly diminishes down the length of the room, leaving the far end barely discernable.  A push cart holding a large box stands ready for the rest of the inventory to be loaded."],"exits":[{"to":1301,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1303,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Dimly-Lit Storage","Storage"]},
  {"id":1303,"x":529,"y":-629,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Meeting Room","descriptions":["Carpeting spans the room from wall to wall, muffling the footsteps of the few errant shoppers that have lost their way.  A long table with straight-backed chairs pushed tightly against it is the only furniture present.  A portrait of a dignified S'kra Mur gentleman hangs at the head."],"exits":[{"to":1296,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1302,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Meeting Room"]},
  {"id":1304,"x":669,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Moon Room","descriptions":["A mural of a horizon with a setting sun surrounds the room in variegated shades of rose and purple near the base, moving towards a brushing of silvery grey at the ceiling.  On three separate walls, the three moons of Elanthia are in various stages of rising or waning.  Constellations have been painted on the floor in splashes of white against the black marble."],"exits":[{"to":1305,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1306,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1296,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Moon Room"]},
  {"id":1305,"x":689,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Armor Room","descriptions":["Deep-set niches in the walls hold a variety of helms, armets and other head armor.  Placed centrally in the room, a tall mannequin fully bedecked in a set of ornamental heavy plate has been polished to a pristine shine.  Low chairs have been placed on each side of the shop entrances, the high backs formed from obsidian-bossed tower shields."],"exits":[{"to":1304,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Armor Room"]},
  {"id":1306,"x":669,"y":-589,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Lodge Room","descriptions":["Windows looking out over a snow-covered mountain terrain have been painted onto the walls.  Large game trophies on cherrywood bases are mounted above two lit fieldstone fireplaces on either side of the room.  Leather couches draped with snowbeast throws have been placed back to back in the center of the room, a place to rest in comfort before embarking on the next round of shops."],"exits":[{"to":1304,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Lodge Room"]},
  {"id":1307,"x":629,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Gladiolus Room","descriptions":["Hanging tight to the ceiling, gaethzen lamps in the shapes of large humming birds and butterflies in flight provide a bright light that flows over the enormous round marble planter in the center of the room.  Gladiolus in rich soil provides the room with a warm scent and a vivid display of color, ranging from white to shades of deep purple.  Elven ivy has been planted around the edge of the flowers and flows over the side to the floor."],"exits":[{"to":1296,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1309,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1308,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Gladiolus Room"]},
  {"id":1308,"x":609,"y":-609,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Fire Room","descriptions":["Passing shoppers stop to take in the vivid mural of the Greater Fist that covers two walls with the artistic rendition of lava flowing into swirls on the shining maple floor.  Prickly plants with bright crimson blooms line a burgundy runner laid down the center of the room.  Flickering torches in brass sconces are set on either side of the entrances to the trader shops along the walls."],"exits":[{"to":1307,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Fire Room"]},
  {"id":1309,"x":629,"y":-589,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Library","descriptions":["Bookcases filled with volumes of varying bindings and size line both lengths of the room, built even above the shop entrances to provide more space.  Two rows of benches with padded seats have been placed back to back in the center.  An attendant moves about quietly, picking up the stray volumes and at times stopping to climb a small ladder he carries to get a book for anyone interested."],"exits":[{"to":1307,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"aliases":["Library"]},
  {"id":1310,"x":649,"y":-769,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Garden","descriptions":["Tall shepherd's hooks hold oil lanterns that throw shadows over the hedges of varying heights that have been grown in amazing patterns throughout the garden.  In various corners small white tables, chairs and benches are set to provide a resting spot or a site for intimate conversations.  A bronzed statue of a man is in the center, its base ringed with candles.","Hedges of varying heights have been grown in amazing patterns throughout the garden.  In various corners small white tables, chairs and benches are set to provide a resting spot or a site for intimate conversations.  A bronzed statue of a man is in the center, its base ringed with vibrant roses and myrtle."],"exits":[{"to":1299,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1301,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Garden"]},
  {"id":1311,"x":649,"y":-549,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza, Office","descriptions":["Four desks are situated behind a long counter that spans across the busy room.  A clerk nods and rushes forward to swing open a half-door to allow entry for groups of traders usually in deep discussions with a vendor or other merchants.  A large cork board has various announcements and billings arranged meticulously in rows."],"exits":[{"to":1295,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Office"]},
  {"id":1312,"x":569,"y":-529,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Foyer","descriptions":["Masterful presentation skill is present in every aspect of the gallery foyer.  Neatly trimmed decor surrounds the ornate entrances leading in all directions, and helpful attendants stroll casually about, tending to the needs of their customers."],"exits":[{"to":1313,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1314,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1315,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1316,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1317,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1318,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":1295,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Furniture Gallery"]},
  {"id":1313,"x":569,"y":-569,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Tables","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged tables of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1319,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1312,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1320,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1321,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Tables"]},
  {"id":1314,"x":589,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Floors","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged panels of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1312,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Floors"]},
  {"id":1315,"x":569,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Walls","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged panels of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1312,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Walls"]},
  {"id":1316,"x":549,"y":-509,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Counters","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged counters of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1312,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Counters"]},
  {"id":1317,"x":549,"y":-529,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Entrances","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged entrances of various shapes and sizes fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1312,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Entrances"]},
  {"id":1318,"x":549,"y":-549,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Backroom Doors","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged doors of various shapes and sizes fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1312,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Backroom Doors","Doors"]},
  {"id":1319,"x":569,"y":-589,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Wall Hangings","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged racks of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1313,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Wall Hangings"]},
  {"id":1320,"x":549,"y":-569,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Trunks","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged trunks of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1313,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Trunks"]},
  {"id":1321,"x":549,"y":-589,"z":0,"title":"Furniture Gallery, Cabinets","descriptions":["Tastefully arranged cabinets of various materials fill the room, each cordoned off by a red velvet cord and lit with gaethzen orbs.  A sign stands on a prominent easel, summarizing what the furniture in this room can be used for."],"exits":[{"to":1313,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Cabinets"]},
  {"id":1322,"x":729,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Cellar, Tasting Room","descriptions":["Glossy mahogany wainscoting covers the lower halves of the stacked limestone walls.  Paintings depicting famous vineyards grace the upper halves, bracketed by the downward curves of the brick ceiling toward the pillars that support it.  Comfortable chairs and low tables are arranged companionably near a polished black marble bar containing wines to sample, and a conservatively-dressed male Prydaen stands by to assist."],"exits":[{"to":1323,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1296,"exit":"climb","move":"climb marble staircase"}],"aliases":["Cellar","Tasting Room"]},
  {"id":1323,"x":729,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Cellar, Bottle Room","descriptions":["Racks upon racks of wine bottles line the walls, and between them heavy square columns rise up to join the vaulted ceiling.  Each column bears a framed watercolor painting depicting a different wine variety."],"exits":[{"to":1324,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1322,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Bottle Room"]},
  {"id":1324,"x":729,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Cellar, Stomping Room","descriptions":["Arched brick ceilings converge from four different directions, forming a large double-vaulted room full of compound curves and lined with buttressing columns.  An assortment of grape-pressing equipment is lined up along one wall, leaving enough open space that several couples could dance here with room to spare."],"exits":[{"to":1325,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1327,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1323,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1326,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Stomping Room"]},
  {"id":1325,"x":729,"y":-709,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Cellar, Fermentation Room","descriptions":["Huge vats line a stacked limestone wall at the cellar's end.  An arched brick ceiling looms low overhead, supported by a double row of heavy stone columns that march back toward the center of the cellar on either side.  Shop entrances pierce the walls between the columns."],"exits":[{"to":1324,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Fermentation Room"]},
  {"id":1326,"x":709,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Cellar, Cooper Room","descriptions":["Broad square pillars rise up to support the barrel-vaulted brick ceiling, and shop entrances pierce the stacked stone walls in between.  This area also contains a working cooperage, and shoppers can pause a while to watch the coopers at hard at work on unfinished barrels with their tools, firepits and racks of supplies close at hand.","Broad square pillars rise up to support the barrel-vaulted brick ceiling, and shop entrances pierce the stacked stone walls in between.  This area also contains a working cooperage by day, and nighttime shoppers can pause a while to have a look at the neatly-stored tools and unfinished barrels."],"exits":[{"to":1324,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Cooper Room"]},
  {"id":1327,"x":749,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Cellar, Barrel Room","descriptions":["Arched openings line the room, formed by the pillars that hold up the low tunnel-vaulted ceiling.  Within the openings, the round faces of massive oaken casks protrude, each resting upon a sturdy brick cradle.  At the far end, smaller barrels are stacked against the wall, awaiting shipment to wholesale customers."],"exits":[{"to":1324,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Barrel Room"]},
  {"id":1328,"x":569,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Volcano Room","descriptions":["A model of the Greater Fist rests on a display table in the middle of this area, complete with tiny caravans and surrounding towns and villages.  The broad white walls between the shops exhibit a collection of fine paintings of volcanoes in varying stages of activity and dormancy."],"exits":[{"to":1329,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1335,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1296,"exit":"go","move":"go spiral ramp"}],"aliases":["Upstairs","Volcano Room"]},
  {"id":1329,"x":589,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Palm Room","descriptions":["An atrium of sorts, this room has a high glass ceiling, with tall palm trees in wide planters rising nearly to its peak.  A cluster of chairs and small tables underneath allow shoppers to relax and regroup while taking in a grand view of Crossing through the mostly-glass south and east walls.","An atrium of sorts, this room has a high glass ceiling currently darkened by night.  Palm trees rise up into the darkness out of wide planters underneath.  A cluster of chairs and small tables at the base of the trees allow shoppers to relax and regroup while taking in a the night lights of Crossing through the mostly-glass south and east walls."],"exits":[{"to":1330,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1328,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Palm Room"]},
  {"id":1330,"x":609,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Ocean Room","descriptions":["Reclaimed teak flooring and cypress woodwork, both heavily varnished, give this room a decidedly nautical air.  Broad white walls between each pair of shops display a collection of maritime antiques including a ship's bell.  The windows on the east wall look out over eastern Crossing, and far beyond that lies the dull blue-gray line of open water.","Reclaimed teak flooring and cypress woodwork, both heavily varnished, give this room a decidedly nautical air.  Broad white walls between each pair of shops display a collection of maritime antiques including a ship's bell.  The windows on the east wall look out over the nighttime lights of eastern Crossing."],"exits":[{"to":1329,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1331,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Ocean Room"]},
  {"id":1331,"x":589,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Tundra Room","descriptions":["A massive set of curved mammoth tusks has pride of place in the center of the broad corridor, mounted upon a large glass display.  More specimens of tundra life decorate the walls between the shops, allowing visitors to see and learn as they shop."],"exits":[{"to":1330,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1332,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Tundra Room"]},
  {"id":1332,"x":569,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Jungle Room","descriptions":["Stained glass windows with polished teak casements portray various lush jungle scenes, offering filtered light in jewel-like tones.  Shop entrances line up opposite, with vases of vibrant jungle flowers mounted on the walls between each set of doors.","Currently darkened by night, stained glass windows with polished teak casements grace the north side of the room.  Shop entrances line up opposite, with vases of vibrant jungle flowers mounted on the walls between each set of doors."],"exits":[{"to":1331,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1333,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Jungle Room"]},
  {"id":1333,"x":549,"y":-689,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Savannah Room","descriptions":["A framed panoramic painting of a savannah scene occupies the broad white wall between a pair of shop entrances, and glassy-eyed hunting trophies line each wall overhead.  Windows on the northern side of the room overlook the Crossing bazaar and the north end of town.","A framed panoramic painting of a savannah scene occupies the broad white wall between a pair of shop entrances, and glassy-eyed hunting trophies line each wall overhead.  Night-darkened windows on the northern side of the room overlook the torch-lit Crossing bazaar and the northern end of town."],"exits":[{"to":1332,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1334,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Savannah Room"]},
  {"id":1334,"x":529,"y":-669,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, Desert Room","descriptions":["Windows look out over western Crossing on one side, and shop entrances are spaced out along the wall opposite them.  An exhibit of desert artifacts dominates the center of the room, laid out in a long freestanding glass counter, with a tall potted cactus standing nearby.","Darkened windows look out over western Crossing's night lights on one side, and shop entrances are spaced out along the wall opposite.  An exhibit of desert artifacts dominates the center of the room, laid out in a long freestanding glass counter, with a tall potted cactus standing nearby."],"exits":[{"to":1333,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1335,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["Desert Room"]},
  {"id":1335,"x":549,"y":-649,"z":0,"title":"Market Plaza Upstairs, River Room","descriptions":["An exhibit of framed paintings depicting barges at work and other river scenes decorates the walls between the shops.  Windows to the southwest give a panoramic view of the joining of the Segoltha and Oxenwaithe, with the rest of Crossing sprawled around them.","An exhibit of framed paintings depicting barges at work and other river scenes decorates the walls between the shops.  Darkened windows to the southwest give a panoramic view of Crossing's city lights."],"exits":[{"to":1328,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1334,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["River Room"]},
  {"id":1336,"x":69,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Cobbled Path","descriptions":["Brown cobbles set in herringbone rows lead from the gate to the door of an elegant mansion resting against the town wall.  Borders of waxy green boxwood interspersed with pale yellow roses hem in either side of the path.  Close-cropped grass stretches away from the borders towards the stone fencing that separates the building and the rest of The Crossing."],"exits":[{"to":1337,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1340,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go lattice-work gate"},{"to":1341,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood door"}],"aliases":["door bell"]},
  {"id":1337,"x":109,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, East Lawn","descriptions":["The area here is larger than the west lawn, stretching east to the perimeter wall, and north along the side of the mansion.  Fragrant stems of gladiola and flamestalk, mixed with delicate milady's lace, frame a crescent-shaped group of stones with a large curved rock set at its tips.  A walkway winding around the garden leads northward to a gazebo and a heavy steel door almost completely covered in vines separating the mansion and the gazebo."],"exits":[{"to":1338,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1339,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1336,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1355,"exit":"go","move":"go quaint inn"},{"to":1354,"exit":"climb","move":"climb moonstone trellis"}],"aliases":["East Lawn","old man"]},
  {"id":1338,"x":109,"y":-657,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Gazebo","descriptions":["Several scarlet robins vie with a magpie for preening space atop a birdbath which resembles a gazebo.  A small path through the bellflowers around the little building leads carefully up chiseled steps to the interior.  The main walkway continues northward among clusters of columbine and foxglove, toward a honeysuckle-covered pergola.","A tiny, gazebo-shaped birdbath accentuates this lovely little path trimmed with bellflowers.  Chiseled steps lead carefully to the interior, while the main walkway continues northward, among columbine and foxgloves, toward a honeysuckle-covered pergola."],"exits":[{"to":1337,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1353,"exit":"go","move":"go pergola"}],"aliases":["Gazebo"]},
  {"id":1339,"x":129,"y":-657,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Redwood Ring","descriptions":["The short path leads to a small clearing surrounded by a ring of redwood trees.  A large fire pit is located in the center of ring, surrounded by some fallen logs.  Behind the ring is a stone building with smoke drifting from chimneys and steam emerging from vents.","The short path leads to a small clearing surrounded by a ring of redwood trees.  A large fire pit is located in the center of ring, surrounded by some fallen logs.  Behind the ring is a brightly lit stone building."],"exits":[{"to":1337,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Redwood Ring"]},
  {"id":1340,"x":49,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, West Lawn","descriptions":["Stepping westward from the cobbled path, the mansion's high stone outer wall encloses a small lawn dominated by an ancient mimosa tree.  A high-backed wrought iron chair sits sheltered beneath the delicate branches.  A semi-circle worn into the lush green grass around the chair bears witness to generations of students who have gathered here to learn.  Violet azaleas hug the building, clustering in the corner where house joins wall, then continue towards the gate."],"exits":[{"to":1336,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1364,"exit":"go","move":"go winding path"}],"aliases":["West Lawn"]},
  {"id":1341,"x":69,"y":-657,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Vestibule","descriptions":["An elegant concierge station punctuates this highly ornate vestibule decorated with expensive wares from every part of Elanthia.  Among the impressive appointments are splendid tapestries, delicate porcelain vases, a carved marble mantel, and gleaming rosewood paneling."],"exits":[{"to":1343,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1342,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1344,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doors"},{"to":1336,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwood door"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["donations chute"]},
  {"id":1342,"x":49,"y":-657,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Library","descriptions":["The vaulted travertine ceiling of the library dwarfs even the tallest Elothean.  The names of ancient mages, scholars and bards, chiseled into the stonework, form a neat border between the shelf-lined walls and the curvature of the ceiling.  Tall, leaded glass windows flood the room with brilliant light, making the oil lamps that hang from the groined support arches unnecessary.  A large oaken table, scarred from years of use, stands in the center of the room.","The vaulted travertine ceiling of the library dwarfs even the tallest Elothean.  The names of ancient mages, scholars and bards, chiseled into the stonework, form a neat border between the shelf-lined walls and the curvature of the ceiling.  Tall, leaded glass windows provide a spectacular view of the night sky, while pewter oil lamps glow brightly from their hanging points upon the groined arches overhead.  A large oaken table, scarred from years of use, stands in the center of the room."],"exits":[{"to":1341,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Library"]},
  {"id":1343,"x":89,"y":-657,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Sitting Room","descriptions":["Daylight streams in through tall arched windows swathed in plum-shaded damask drapes.  Elegant alabaster end tables flank each of the velvet sofas arranged in the center of the room, forming a cozy conversation area.  Beyond a rosewood harpsichord, the northern wall is covered with a large tapestry.  A blue-crested finch sings from its willow birdcage hung in the corner, teasing the small cat that watches it from below.","Firelight licks softly at an arched stone hearth, casting a shifting glow upon this comfortable room.  Elegant alabaster end tables flank each of the velvet sofas arranged cozily in the center of the floor.  Beyond a rosewood harpsichord, the northern wall is covered with a large tapestry.  A blue-crested finch sings from its willow birdcage hung in the corner, teasing the small cat that watches it from below."],"exits":[{"to":1341,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Sitting Room"]},
  {"id":1344,"x":69,"y":-677,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Grand Hall South","descriptions":["The Grand Hall soars up the entire height of two stories, impressively topped by a stained glass ceiling.  Poised on the wall, a large portrait of a distinguished gentleman watches over the comings and goings of the mansion.  An amber-inlaid door to the east and an ivory-trimmed door to the west lead to adjacent classrooms."],"exits":[{"to":1345,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1341,"exit":"go","move":"go ironwood doors"},{"to":1347,"exit":"go","move":"go amber door"},{"to":1348,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory-trimmed door"}]},
  {"id":1345,"x":69,"y":-697,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Grand Hall Central","descriptions":["The stained glass ceiling rises in a dome over the center of the Grand Hall in a glorious display of a larger-than-life glaysker flower on a multi-colored, geometrical background.  A much subtler mosaic of the same blossom is inlaid in the center of the marble floor.  A jade-inlaid door to the east and a gilded door to the west lead to lecture rooms.  People quietly walk along the balcony that wraps around the hall of the second floor."],"exits":[{"to":1346,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1344,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1349,"exit":"go","move":"go jade door"},{"to":1350,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded door"}]},
  {"id":1346,"x":69,"y":-717,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Grand Hall North","descriptions":["The wide Grand Staircase sweeps up the north end of the hall, dominating the area.  In a stroke of artful genius, the marble mosaic pattern continues up each of the steps, creating a feeling of spaciousness as the staircase opens onto the second floor landing.  A large table and several chairs are visible through a graceful archway to one side of the staircase."],"exits":[{"to":1345,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1352,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"},{"to":1351,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"},{"to":1359,"exit":"go","move":"go graceful archway"}]},
  {"id":1347,"x":89,"y":-677,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, The Amber Room","descriptions":["A brilliant gold chandelier set with amber dominates the room.  Candlelight plays off its surface to give everything an amber hue and a feeling of warmth.  A large oaken table stretches across the wooden floor in front of a massive stone fireplace.  Above the mantel is an aged, woven tapestry depicting scenes from long ago.  The molded ochre walls of the room are set with panels of pure amber interposed by small candle sconces.  Umber curtains hang from a cornice above a bay window."],"exits":[{"to":1344,"exit":"go","move":"go amber-inlaid door"}],"aliases":["Amber Room","fireplace"]},
  {"id":1348,"x":49,"y":-677,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, The Ivory Room","descriptions":["Six large ivory pillars of veined marble rise from the white marble floor to support the alabaster ceiling in what was once a grand ballroom.  A crystal chandelier causes light to dance about the highly polished floor in myriad colors.  Tiered seats of red velvet over limed oak line the north wall -- seating for a small lecture area.  Otherwise bare of furniture, a small desk sits in front of a tall bay window covered in flimsy pearl-white curtains."],"exits":[{"to":1344,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory-trimmed door"}],"aliases":["Ivory Room"]},
  {"id":1349,"x":89,"y":-697,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, The Jade Room","descriptions":["The gentle murmur of water and the smell of incense greet all who enter.  Once an indoor garden, the room still contains many exotic plants, and one wall is made of crystal-clear glass to capture sunlight.  A carved jade fountain serves as a focal point, its flowing waters in constant motion.  A dwarf copperwood tree spreads its branches across much of the room, rustled occasionally by a gentle draft.  The tinkling leaves and burbling fountain fill the air like an ethereal chorus."],"exits":[{"to":1345,"exit":"go","move":"go jade-inlaid door"}]},
  {"id":1350,"x":49,"y":-697,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, The Gilded Room","descriptions":["Polished silverwillow floors, vaulted mirrored ceilings and a gold-veined, white marble fireplace all speak of beauty and elegance.  Once the trophy room of the Jadewater family, all that remain are battle standards, a few weapons and shields upon the walls, and a suit of gilded full plate armor standing forever at attention opposite the lectern.  Across from the fireplace hangs a magnificent tapestry worked in fine Elothean silks."],"exits":[{"to":1345,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded door"}]},
  {"id":1351,"x":49,"y":-717,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, The Marble Room","descriptions":["Mirrors line one wall opposite a small stage that holds a couple of chairs and a table just large enough for two cups.  A vanity in one corner holds an assortment of theatrical make-up, and a pile of cushions leans against one of its legs.  A makeshift desk near the prop closet spills over with unrolled scrolls, half-empty cups of coffee, and someone's forgotten script."],"exits":[{"to":1346,"exit":"go","move":"go marble door"}],"aliases":["Marble Room"]},
  {"id":1352,"x":89,"y":-717,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, The Ebony Room","descriptions":["Perfectly round and domed, this room seems to whisper of mysteries and powerful magic.  Faint carving is barely visible on the floor and the curving walls seem oddly textured.  The dome bears five enormous glowing rubies embedded at each of the cardinal point and at the exact center, providing the only illumination."],"exits":[{"to":1346,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony door"}],"aliases":["Ebony Room"]},
  {"id":1353,"x":109,"y":-677,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Rose Garden","descriptions":["The mansion's high stone fence joins the rough rock of the town wall to form a dead-end enclosure overrun with floral hues of interlocking color.  A stone fountain resembling a lion's head nestles among creeping roses at the junction of the fence and town wall.  Provocative perfumes dance among the blooms, which are neatly confined to hedge-lined flower beds."],"exits":[{"to":1338,"exit":"go","move":"go vine-covered pergola"}],"aliases":["Rose Garden"]},
  {"id":1354,"x":109,"y":-617,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Yavash's Garden","descriptions":["High above the bustling streets of Crossing, the peaceful quiet of this magnificent garden is broken only by sweet birdsongs and the murmur of scholarly discussions.  The lofty elevation, coupled with the absence of walls or ceiling, creates an atmosphere of walking through a garden in the clouds.  The flowering plants and vines are in perpetual bloom, as if sustained by something more than the sunlight which dances freely through the area.","Far above the lights and distractions of Crossing, only the chirping of crickets and the murmur of scholarly discussions break the peaceful quiet of this magnificent garden.  The lofty elevation, coupled with the absence of walls or ceiling, creates an atmosphere of walking through a garden in the clouds.  The flowering plants and vines seem to reach towards the moonlight in an attempt to absorb its magical energies."],"exits":[{"to":1337,"exit":"climb","move":"climb moonstone trellis"}],"aliases":["Yavash's Garden"]},
  {"id":1355,"x":189,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Tenderfoot Inn, Lobby","descriptions":["A worn fringed rug covers the clean plank floor of the lobby, stopping just at the base of the check-in desk.  The walls are bare, save one picture nailed to the west wall.  Faint noises of a bustling city drift through an open door."],"exits":[{"to":1358,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1356,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1337,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Tenderfoot Inn","mentor newsletter"]},
  {"id":1356,"x":189,"y":-617,"z":0,"title":"Tenderfoot Inn, Dining Room","descriptions":["Waiters bustle tiredly around long trestle tables, removing the piles of used plates and bowls accumulated as travelers eat.  Playful music fills the air, exploding in upbeat rhythms from the fiddle of a minstrel in the corner to mask the chattering murmur of the patrons."],"exits":[{"to":1355,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1357,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":1363,"exit":"go","move":"go swinging doors"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":1357,"x":209,"y":-617,"z":0,"title":"Tenderfoot Inn, Taproom","descriptions":["Shadows flicker along the dark walls of the taproom, telling ghost stories with light and air.  High stools belly up to a scarred wooden counter, which displays samples of the kitchen's wares."],"exits":[{"to":1356,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":1358,"x":209,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Tenderfoot Inn, Longroom","descriptions":["Rows of oilcloth cots provide cheap rest for the weary stranger.  Cotton screens between the bunks offer some privacy, but can't filter the musky scent of travelers' trail dust from every corner of Elanthia."],"exits":[{"to":1355,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["Longroom"]},
  {"id":1359,"x":69,"y":-737,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Dining Rotunda","descriptions":["Under a crystal cupola that reflects the brightness of several lit candelabras lies a long, low table awash in white linen.  Atop it are elegant pewter salvers heaped with steaming viands, their perfumes a mingling of rich scents in the air.  Beverages, sweet or bitter, soft or potent, reside within a mirrored glass case.  Desserts for everyone from the binge-heavy to the diet-conscious await perusal on a majestic gold side cart."],"exits":[{"to":1346,"exit":"go","move":"go graceful archway"},{"to":1360,"exit":"go","move":"go service entrance"}],"color":"#C0C0C0","aliases":["Dining Rotunda"]},
  {"id":1360,"x":89,"y":-737,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Kitchen","descriptions":["Bearing more resemblance to a magical workshop than a place to prepare meals, the kitchen has many oddities filling it.  Herbs overflow from oak shelves while a cart and counter have food and drink waiting to be served.  A small bronze dragon with gaping jaws serves as garbage disposal."],"exits":[{"to":1359,"exit":"go","move":"go service entrance"},{"to":1361,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"},{"to":1362,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy door"}],"color":"#C0C0C0","aliases":["Kitchen"]},
  {"id":1361,"x":109,"y":-737,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Wine Cellar","descriptions":["A small window near the ceiling floods the small basement with a thin stream of light.  Three floor-to-ceiling cases hold hundreds of dusty wine bottles.  The floor is littered with shards of glass and a pile of bottles lies in one corner."],"exits":[{"to":1360,"exit":"go","move":"go trapdoor"}],"color":"#C0C0C0","aliases":["Wine Cellar"]},
  {"id":1362,"x":89,"y":-757,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Rear Entrance","descriptions":["A single heavy iron door breaks the monotony of the massive town wall.  The triangular and flat rooftops of the north side of The Crossing rise above it, crowning the mansion directly beyond the wall in a dramatic cityscape.  A narrow trail winds its way through patches of weeds and grasses into the northern wilds.  There is a small window near the bottom of the wall, but the glass is covered in dirt."],"exits":[{"to":1360,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}],"aliases":["NTR"],"linksTo":"Map7_NTR.xml"},
  {"id":1363,"x":169,"y":-617,"z":0,"title":"Tenderfoot Inn, Kitchen","descriptions":["The dusty wooden floor of this tiny kitchen has been worn smooth by the constant tread of waiters' feet in and out of the dining room.  A row of cluttered wooden cabinets and shelves display a wide array of well-used common culinary equipment, and the spacious countertops are covered in flour, breadcrumbs, and other bits of tempting dishes in the making."],"exits":[{"to":1356,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["old Halfling cook","Halfling cook","cook"]},
  {"id":1364,"x":29,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Shady Path","descriptions":["A carefully tended, cobbled path wraps around the exterior of the mansion.  Sheltering branches of large trees along the path dapple the cobblestones with light in warm weather, and with dry patches of stone during rain.  A simple bench is placed slightly to the side of the path next to a stone birdbath."],"exits":[{"to":1340,"exit":"go","move":"go winding path"},{"to":1365,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"}]},
  {"id":1365,"x":9,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Sloping Lawn","descriptions":["Plush and manicured, the sloping green lawn gracefully descends to a low stone wall, beyond which can be seen the seats and the stage of the Performance Center itself.  Colorful blankets are placed here and there on the lawn to provide comfortable seating for those who choose to observe at a distance."],"exits":[{"to":1364,"exit":"go","move":"go iron gate"},{"to":1366,"exit":"go","move":"go golden arch"}]},
  {"id":1366,"x":-11,"y":-637,"z":0,"title":"Jadewater Mansion, Gallery","descriptions":["With the exception of the low wall at the rear of the Performance Center, this area is entirely enclosed.  Wooden seats with green velvet cushions form rows that wrap around the viewing area in a near perfect circle.  Curtains of green and gold hang from the ceiling, hiding the back of the stage from the audience, while walls on either side contain tapestries that depict favorite performances of years past."],"exits":[{"to":1365,"exit":"go","move":"go golden arch"}],"aliases":["Performance Center"]}
 ],
